            "wiki_body": "Inklings are a [[squid humanoid]] species from [i][[Splatoon]][/i].\r\n\r\nInklings have the ability of making ink that correspond to the color of their clothing and hair. They can also transform into their [[inkling_(squid_form)|squid forms]] to swim though patches of ink sprayed on the ground.\r\n\r\nHowever, if they try to walk across or get shot by ink that don't match their color, they start losing their health or die (or get splatted as the game calls it)."
