            "wiki_body": "The [b]beaver[/b] (genus Castor) is a large, primarily nocturnal, semiaquatic rodent. Beavers are known for building dams, canals, and lodges (homes). They are the second-largest rodent in the world (after the capybara).\r\n\r\nThe beaver is the national animal of [[Canada]] and is commonly associated with the country. \r\n\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[rodent]]\r\n*** beaver"
