              "wiki_body": "thumb #231522 thumb #1097420 thumb #146088\r\n\r\nOwls are [[bird|birds]] which include about two hundred species of mostly solitary and nocturnal birds of prey typified by an upright stance, a large, broad head, binocular vision, binaural hearing, sharp [[talons]], and [[feathers]] adapted for silent flight.\r\n\r\nThey have large, forward facing eyes, ear holes, as well as a facial disc, to focus sharply on sounds. They possess [[hawk]]-like [[beak|beaks]], flat faces and binocular vision capabilities.\r\n\r\nThey are well known for their exceptional head turning abilities, being able to rotate their heads nearly 300 degrees, thanks to extra neck vertebrae.\r\n\r\nh3. Species\r\n\r\n* [[barn_owl]]\r\n* [[burrowing_owl]]\r\n* [[horned_owl]]\r\n** [[eurasian_eagle-owl]]\r\n** [[great_horned_owl]]\r\n* [[northern_white-faced_owl]]\r\n* [[scops_owl]]\r\n* [[screech_owl]]\r\n** [[whiskered_screech_owl]]\r\n* [[snowy_owl]]\r\n* [[sooty_owl]]\r\n* [[tawny_owl]]\r\n\r\nh4. Fictional\r\n\r\n* d-pad_studio\r\n** [[owlboy]]\r\n*** [[bonacci_(owlboy)|bonacci]]\r\n*** [[fib_(owlboy)|fib]]\r\n*** [[solus_(owlboy)|solus]]\r\n*** [[strix_(owlboy)|strix]]\r\n* [[disney]]\r\n** [[bambi_(film)|bambi]]\r\n*** [[friend_owl]]\r\n** [[winnie_the_pooh_(franchise)|winnie_the_pooh]]\r\n*** [[owl_(winnie_the_pooh)|owl]]\r\n* [[dungeons_&_dragons]]\r\n** [[owlbear]]\r\n* [[guardians_of_ga'hoole]]\r\n** [[digger_(ga'hoole)|digger]]\r\n** [[twilight_(ga'hoole)|twilight]]\r\n* [[kemono_friends]]\r\n** [[assistant_mimi-chan_(kemono_friends)|assistant_mimi-chan]]\r\n** [[professor_konoha_(kemono_friends)|professor_konoha]]\r\n* [[meme|memes]]\r\n** [[o_rly]]\r\n* [[my_little_pony]]\r\n** [[friendship_is_magic]]\r\n*** [[owlowiscious_(mlp)|owlowiscious]]\r\n* [[nintendo]]\r\n** [[animal_crossing]]\r\n*** [[celeste_(animal_crossing)|celeste]]\r\n*** [[blathers]]\r\n** [[the_legend_of_zelda]]\r\n*** [[kaepora_gaebora]]\r\n*** [[kaneli_(character)|kaneli]]\r\n* [[owl_human