            "wiki_body": "thumb #1432858\r\n\r\nPenguins are [[marine|aquatic]], flightless [[avian|birds]]. They live almost exclusively in the southern hemisphere, with the [[galapagos penguin]] being the only exception. They are adapted to life mostly in water, and have dark [[countershading|countershaded]] [[feathers|plumage]]. Their [[wings]] have evolved into [[flippers]] to allow for better swimming. Though native to the southern hemisphere, not all are found in cold climates.\r\n\r\nh3. Species\r\n\r\n* [[Adelie Penguin]]\r\n* [[African Penguin]]\r\n* [[Chinstrap Penguin]]\r\n* [[Crested Penguin]]\r\n** [[Erect-crested Penguin]]\r\n** [[Fiordland Penguin]]\r\n** [[Macaroni Penguin]]\r\n** [[Rockhopper Penguin]]\r\n*** [[Northern Rockhopper Penguin]]\r\n*** [[Southern Rockhopper Penguin]]\r\n** [[Royal Penguin]]\r\n** [[Snares Penguin]]\r\n* [[Emperor Penguin]]\r\n* [[Galapagos Penguin]]\r\n* [[Gentoo Penguin]]\r\n* [[Humboldt Penguin]]\r\n* [[King Penguin]]\r\n* [[Little Penguin|Little Penguin/Little Blue Penguin]]\r\n* [[Magellanic Penguin]]\r\n* [[Yellow-eyed Penguin]]\r\n\r\nh4. Fictional\r\n\r\n* [[Animal Crossing]]\r\n** [[Aurora (Animal Crossing)|Aurora]]\r\n** [[Flo (Animal Crossing)|Flo]]\r\n** [[Friga (Animal Crossing)|Friga]]\r\n** [[Gwen (Animal Crossing)|Gwen]]\r\n** [[Hopper (Animal Crossing)|Hopper]]\r\n** [[Puck (Animal Crossing)|Puck]]\r\n** [[Roald (Animal Crossing)|Roald]]\r\n** [[Sprinkle (Animal Crossing)|Sprinkle]]\r\n** [[Tex (Animal Crossing)|Tex]]\r\n* [[Club Penguin]]\r\n** [[DJ Cadence]]\r\n* [[Kaio: King of Pirates]]\r\n** [[Sangokushi]]\r\n* [[Kemono Friends]]\r\n** [[Hululu (Kemono Friends)|Hululu]]\r\n* [[Linux]]\r\n** [[Tux the Penguin]]\r\n* [[Mario Bros]]\r\n** [[Coach (Mario)|Coach]]\r\n** [[Mother Penguin]]\r\n** [[Paper Mario]]\r\n*** [[Bumpty (Paper Mario)|Bumpty]]\r\n** [[Tuxie (Mario)|Tuxie]]\r\n* [[Mawaru Penguindrum]]\r\n* [[Mega Man (Series)]]\r\n** [[Megaman X]]\r\n*** [[Chill Penguin]]\r\n* [[Penguin Land]]\r\n** [