            "wiki_body": "thumb #128539 thumb #4103388 thumb #3461296 thumb #4306315 thumb #2580303 thumb #2580736 thumb #4428520\n\nAn avian taur is a [[taur]] that is some kind of [[avian]], such as a [[bird taur]], [[avali taur]], [[chocobo taur]], and more. Avian taurs are often [[bipedal_taur|bipedal taurs]], except for [[gryphon_taur|gryphon taurs]] who are [[quadruped|quadrupedal]] taurs.\n\nReal:\n* [[bird_taur|Bird taur]], based on real [[bird|birds]].\nFictional:\n* [[avali_taur|Avali taur]], based on [[avali|avalis]].\n* [[chocobo_taur|Chocobo taur]], based on [[chocobo|chocobos]] from the [[Final Fantasy]] series.\n* [[kenku_taur|Kenku taur]], based on [[kenku|kenkus]], a [[corvid]]-like race from [[dungeons_and_dragons|Dungeons & Dragons]].\n* [[rito_taur|Rito taur]], based on [[rito|ritos]] from [[The Legend of Zelda]] series.\nMythological:\n* [[cockatrice_taur|Cockatrice taur]], based on [[cockatrice|cockatrices]] from [[European mythology]].\n* [[gryphon_taur|Gryphon taur]], based on [[gryphon|gryphons]] from [[mythological_avian|general mythology]].\n* [[harpy_taur|Harpy taur]], based on [[harpy|harpies]] from [[Greek mythology]].\n* [[hippogryph_taur|Hippogryph taur]], based on [[hippogriff|hippogriffs]] from [[Greek mythology]].\n* [[phoenix_taur|Phoenix taur]], based on [[phoenix|phoenixes]] from [[Greek mythology]].\n* [[ubumetori_taur|Ubumetori taur]], based on [[ubumetori|ubumetoris]] from [[Japanese mythology]]."
