                "wiki_body": "thumb #1138955 thumb #1681445 thumb #2402233 thumb #1285437\r\n\r\nThe subfamily of caninae, which contains all extant [[canid]] species and most recent fossil relatives.  \"Canine\" refers specifically to members of the caninae subfamily.  Therefore, use `canid` to search the entire dog family and `canine` to search for the caninae subfamily.\r\n\r\nNote that there are several animals called \"wolf\" and \"fox\" but are not related to wolves or foxes, such as the maned wolf, ethiopian wolf, bat-eared fox, and grey fox.  Please keep this in mind when tagging and searching.\r\n\r\nh4. Genera and species:\r\n* [[canid]]\r\n** [b]canine[/b]\r\n*** [[canis]] \r\n**** [[wolf]]\r\n***** [[eurasian_wolf]]\r\n***** [[arabian_wolf]]\r\n***** [[iberian_wolf]]\r\n***** [[mexican_wolf]]\r\n***** [[japanese_wolf]]\r\n***** [[alaskan_tundra_wolf]]\r\n***** [[italian_wolf]]\r\n***** [[tundra_wolf]]\r\n***** [[arctic_wolf]]\r\n***** [[eastern_wolf]]\r\n***** [[red_wolf]]\r\n***** [[mississippi_valley_wolf]]\r\n***** [[florida_black_wolf]]\r\n***** [[dingo]]\r\n***** [[domestic_dog]] (see wiki page for breeds)\r\n**** [[jackal]]\r\n***** [[black-backed_jackal]]\r\n***** [[golden_jackal]]\r\n***** [[side-striped_jackal]]\r\n**** [[african_golden_wolf]]\r\n***** [[egyptian_wolf]]\r\n**** [[coyote]]\r\n**** [[dire_wolf]]\r\n**** [[ethiopian_wolf]]\r\n*** atelocynus\r\n**** [[short-eared_dog]]\r\n*** chrysocyon\r\n**** [[maned_wolf]]\r\n*** cuon\r\n**** [[dhole]]\r\n*** lycaon\r\n**** [[african_wild_dog]]\r\n*** nyctereutes\r\n**** [[raccoon_dog]]\r\n***** [[tanuki]]\r\n*** speothos\r\n**** [[bush_dog]]\r\n*** cerdocyon\r\n**** [[crab-eating_fox]]\r\n*** otocyon\r\n**** [[bat-eared_fox]]\r\n*** [[lycalopex]] (false foxes)\r\n**** [[pampas_fox]]\r\n**** [[culpeo_fox]]\r\n**** [[darwin's_fox]]\r\n**** [[hoary_fox]]\r\n**** [[sechuran_fox]]\r\n**** [[south_american_grey_fox]]\r\n*** [[urocyon]] (basal living canids)\r\n**** [[grey_fox]]\r\n**** [[island_fox]]\