                        "wiki_body": "The [b]labrador retriever[/b] is one of the most popular dog breeds. As its name suggests, it was bred to retrieve fallen game for hunters. Labradors are categorized into three different coat colors: black, chocolate, and yellow, with the final category also including {{( ~orange_body ~yellow_body ~white_body ) labrador|orange and cream colorations}}. Yellow labs may be hard to distinguish from [[golden_retriever|golden retrievers]], a similar, but separate breed from the labrador."
