                        "wiki_body": "A breed of [[domestic_dog|dog]] originating from Belarus and [[Russia]]. They strongly resemble the [[greyhound]], but with [[fur|longer coats]]. Originally bred for wolf hunting, Borzois are instantly recognizable due to their height, lanky build, and extremely long muzzles. \r\n\r\nAlso known as the Russian wolfhound.\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* Wikipedia: \"Borzoi\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borzoi\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[domestic_dog]]\r\n* [[greyhound]]\r\n* [[Russia]]\r\n\r\n"
