                        "wiki_body": "thumb #4344935 thumb #2008570 thumb #1753199\r\n\r\nThe [b]Bull Terrier[/b] is a breed of [[dog]] in the [[terrier]] family. There is also a miniature version of this breed which is officially known as the Miniature Bull Terrier.\r\n\r\nTheir most distinct features are their [[shark]]-like heads and their unique eyes. Said eyes are triangular; a feature not found on any other dog breed.\r\n\r\nThe breed has a long history, having been bred for both fighting and vermin control, and is often targeted with  breed-specific legislation. Despite this, a 2008 study in Germany didn't find them to be more aggressive than [[golden_retriever|Golden Retrievers]]. They are actually good family dogs."
