                    "wiki_body": "thumb #2494522 thumb #2775812 thumb #401628\r\n\r\nThe dalmatian is a breed of [[domestic dog]].\r\n\r\nThey have [[floppy ears]] and a [[blocky snout]]. They usually have [[short fur]], but a variety with [[long fur]] does exist. Dalmatians have a distinctive coloration being [[white_fur|white]] with typically [[black spots]].\r\n\r\nThey are sometimes associated with [[firefighter|firefighting]] and related symbols. The characters from [[Disney|Disney's]] [i][[101 Dalmatians]][/i] are well-known examples of the breed found in media.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Associated Tags]\r\nh6. Anatomy\r\n* [[canine_genitalia]]\r\n** [[canine_penis]]\r\n*** [[knot]]\r\n** [[canine_pussy]]\r\n* [[blocky_snout]]\r\n* [[floppy_ears]]\r\n* [[short_fur]]\r\n* [[digitigrade]]\r\n* [[curved_tail]]\r\n\r\nh6. Color and Markings\r\n* [[white_fur]]\r\n* [[spotted_fur]]\r\n* [[black_spots]]\r\n\r\nh6. Media\r\n* [[101 Dalmatians]]\r\n* [[101 Dalmatian Street]]\r\n[/section]\r\nh4. Implication Tree\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[canid]]\r\n*** [[canine]]\r\n**** [[canis]]\r\n***** [[domestic_dog]]\r\n****** dalmatian"
