                  "wiki_body": "thumb #289316 thumb #2704599 thumb #2662687 thumb #3211971 thumb #2529356\n\nA [b]fox[/b] is a small canid with a distinctive sharp face and bushy tail. \n\nThis is a polyphyletic grouping, for the formerly narrower meaning of this tag see [[true fox]].\n\nh4. Species:\n* [[true_fox]]\n** [[arctic_fox]]\n** [[bengal_fox]]\n** [[blanford's_fox]]\n** [[cape_fox]]\n** [[corsac_fox]]\n** [[fennec_fox]]\n** [[kit_fox]]\n** [[pale_fox]]\n** [[red_fox]]\n*** [[cross_fox]]\n*** [[silver_fox]]\n*** [[marble_fox]]\n*** [[platinum_fox]]\n*** [[pearl_fox]]\n** [[rüppell's_fox]]\n** [[swift_fox]]\n** [[tibetan_sand_fox]]\n* [[south_american_fox]]\n** [[culpeo_fox]]\n** [[darwin's_fox]]\n** [[hoary_fox]]\n** [[pampas_fox]]\n** [[sechuran_fox]]\n** [[south_american_grey_fox]]\n* [[urocyon]]\n** [[grey_fox]]\n** [[island_fox]]\n* [[bat-eared_fox]]\n* [[crab-eating_fox]]\n\nRelated:\n\n* [[fox_spirit]] (kitsune)\n* [[fox_humanoid]]\n* [[fox_taur]]\n\nh4. More information:\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fox"
