              "wiki_body": "thumb #155567 thumb #157405\r\n\r\n[b]Fionbri[/b] are a [[canid]] species created by [[Falvie]]. They are colorful, with their colors representing their \"aura\".\r\n\r\nFionbri always have at least three colors:\r\n* [b]Sensory/Aura[/b] - Present on their eyes, inner ear, nose, mouth, pawpads, and insignia markings. Represent the way the Fionbri sees and experiences the world. Never grey, and do not fade, but can be naturally black or white.\r\n* [b]Primary[/b] - Main coat color. Represents the Fionbri's present and conscious mental state, and their mind in general. This color can change over time, but extreme changes only occur under immense stress. This color can fade if depression/anxiety takes over, but the color can be restored.\r\n* [b]Secondary[/b] - Represents the Fionbri's subconscious mental state. In mentally healthy Fionbri, this is usually close in color to the primary coat. A mentally ill Fionbri will have radically different hues in their coats because their conscious and unconscious are struggling with each other.\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n* \"Fionbri Guide\":https://www.furaffinity.net/journal/5658917/"
