              "wiki_body": "thumb #661961 thumb #230029 thumb #179269 thumb #327607 thumb #1743577\r\n\r\nThe subfamily of Equinae, part of the [[equid|Equidae]] family.  All extant members of the family are part of this subfamily, consisting of only a single extant genus: Equus.  All other subfamilies and genera are extinct.\r\n\r\nThese odd-toed ungulates are part of the order Perissodactyla along with [[tapir|tapirs]] and [[rhinocerotid|rhinos]].  Equines are known for their size and strength along with their manes, tails, and uncloven hooves.  A summary of their taxonomy is listed below.\r\n\r\nh4. Subgenera and species:\r\n* [[equid|equidae]]\r\n** [[equine|equinae]]\r\n*** [[hipparion]]\r\n*** equus (genus)\r\n**** [[asinus]] (subgenus)\r\n***** [[stilt-legged_onager]] (E. calobatus, extinct)\r\n***** [[european_ass]] (E. hydruntinus, extinct)\r\n***** [[pygmy_onager]] (E. tau, extinct)\r\n***** [[african_wild_ass]] (E. africanus)\r\n****** [[nubian_wild_ass]] (E. a. africanus)\r\n****** [[somali_wild_ass]] (E. a. somaliensis)\r\n****** [[atlas_wild_ass]] (E. a. atlanticus, extinct)\r\n****** [[donkey]] (E. a. asinus)\r\n***** [[onager]] (E. hemionus)\r\n****** [[mongolian_wild_ass]] (E. h. hemionus)\r\n****** [[indian_wild_ass]] (E. h. khur)\r\n****** [[turkmenian_kulan]] (E. h. kulan)\r\n****** [[persian_onager]] (E. h. onager)\r\n****** [[syrian_wild_ass]] (E. h. hemippus, extinct)\r\n***** [[kiang]] (E. kiang)\r\n****** [[western_kiang]] (E. k. kiang)\r\n****** [[eastern_kiang]] (E. k. holdereri)\r\n****** [[southern_kiang]] (E. k. polyodon)\r\n****** [[northern_kiang]] (E. k. chu)\r\n**** equus (subgenus)\r\n***** [[wild_horse]] (E. ferus)\r\n****** [[tarpan]] (E. f. ferus)\r\n****** [[przewalski's_horse]] (E. f. przewalskii)\r\n****** [[horse|(domestic) horse]] (E. f. caballus)\r\n******* [[american_paint_horse]]\r\n******* [[appaloosa]]\r\n******* [[andalusian]]\r\n******* [[miniature_horse]]\r\n******* [[arabian_horse]]\r\n******* [[quarter_horse]]\r\n