            "wiki_body": "thumb #1714419 thumb #1549511 thumb #749525 thumb #690292\r\n\r\nh5.About\r\nTatzlpony is a fanmade species in the cartoon {{My Little Pony}}: {{Friendship is Magic}}. It is a cross between an average [[pony]] and the [[tatzlwurm]](sometimes spelled tatzlwyrm or tatzleworm), a large, [[snake]] like creature with three tongues. It is frequently used in images involving [[tentacles]] and/or [[vore]], with the most popular variation being {{Tatzljack}}.\r\n\r\nh5.Origin\r\nIn the climax of the 11th episode of season 4, {{Twilight Sparkle}} and {{Princess Cadence}} are attacked by a tatzlwurm as part of {{Discord}}'s scheme to make them all closer. After a short battle, they manage to subdue it and trap it in its burrow. Members of the fandom latched onto the tatzlwurm's strange design and combined it with a pony.\r\n\r\nThe first tatzlpony image was uploaded to [[Derpibooru]] on March 16, 2014, and consists of an edit of {{Applejack}} as a tatzlpony.\r\n\r\nthumb #456485"
