                "wiki_body": "thumb #2952871 thumb #347814 thumb #2317939 thumb #1555419\r\n\r\n[b]Pantherine[/b] refers to any member of the [i]Pantherinae[/i] subfamily, which includes the big cat genus [i]panthera[/i] ([[lion]], [[tiger]], [[leopard]], [[jaguar]], and [[snow leopard]]) and the [[clouded leopard]] genus [i]neofelis[/i]. For extinct species, this includes the [[cave_lion]], [[american_lion]], [[european_jaguar]], and [[longdan tiger]]. This tag serves as an umbrella tag for the aforementioned species and [b][u]has nothing to do with coloration.[/u][/b] Use a more specific tag if possible.\r\n\r\nNote: This tag should not be used with anything outside of the \"Pantherinae subfamily\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pantherinae, thus it [u]should not be used on or for [[cougar]][/u]. Cougar has its own tag for a reason.\r\n\r\nh4. Genera and species\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[felid|felidae]]\r\n*** [[pantherine|pantherinae]]\r\n**** ([i]Neofelis[/i])\r\n***** [[clouded_leopard]]\r\n***** [[sunda_clouded_leopard]]\r\n**** ([i]Panthera[/i])\r\n***** [[jaguar]]\r\n***** [[leopard]]\r\n****** [[african_leopard]]\r\n****** [[amur_leopard]]\r\n****** [[javan_leopard]]\r\n***** [[lion]]\r\n***** [[tiger]]\r\n****** [[bengal_tiger]]\r\n****** [[siberian_tiger]]\r\n***** [[snow_leopard]]\r\n***** Extinct Species\r\n****** [[american_lion]]\r\n****** [[cave_lion]]\r\n****** [[european_jaguar]]\r\n****** [[longdan tiger]]\r\n\r\nh4. Real-world hybrids\r\n\r\n* [[liger]]\r\n* [[tigon]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related hybrids\r\n\r\n* [[pumapard]]\r\n\r\nh4. More information\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pantherinae"
