              "wiki_body": "The domestic goat, [i]Capra aegagrus hircus[/i], is a subspecies of goat domesticated from the wild goat of southwest Asia and Eastern Europe. The goat is a member of the [i]Bovidae[/i] family and is closely related to the sheep as both are in the goat-antelope subfamily [i]Caprinae[/i]. There are over three hundred distinct breeds of goat.\r\n\r\nThe presence of a beard is characteristic in goats, while sheep do not possess them.\r\n\r\nThe popularity of goat characters increased with the release of [[Undertale]] in 2015, however, the species of the main caprine-like characters ([[Toriel]], [[Asriel]], and [[Asgore]]) should be tagged as [[boss monster]] and not goats."
