            "wiki_body": "thumb #108864\r\n\r\nA Mongoose is a member of the family [i]Herpestidae[/i], a family of small, cat-like carnivores native to Eurasia and mainland Africa. They are placed in suborder Feliformia, together with other species such as the [[hyena]], and [[viverrid]].\r\n\r\nSome species of mongoose are well known for being one of the few mammals with special mutations making them immune to [[snake]] venom. This makes several of them, such as the Indian grey mongoose, well known hunters of venomous snakes such as the [[cobra]].\r\n\r\nh4. Fictional species\r\n\r\n* [[weremongoose]]\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\n* [[Sonic (Series)|sonic]]\r\n** [[ash_mongoose]]\r\n** [[isabella_mongoose]]\r\n** [[melody_prower]]\r\n** [[mina_mongoose]]\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[euplerid]]\r\n** [[vontsira]] [sub](formally named and referred to as mongeese)[/sub]\r\n*** [[broad-striped_vontsira]]\r\n*** brown-tailed_vontsira\r\n*** [[ring-tailed_vontsira]]\r\n* [[mustelid]]\r\n* [[viverrid]]\r\n\r\nh5. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[herpestid]]\r\n*** mongoose"
