            "wiki_body": "[b]Catrobis[/b] (\"/ˌkæ.tɹoʊ.bɪs/,\":https://curiouscat.me/rattiesteps/post/1242419832 [i]plural:[/i] [b]Catrobies[/b]) — an \"open species\":https://curiouscat.me/rattiesteps/post/1241969456 created by [[Maddeku]] (AKA RattieSteps or [[rattie_(artist)|Rattie]]).\r\n\r\n[b] \"Catrobies\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/20559897/ [/b] are an herbivorous, [[biped]]al [[alien]] species that is largely [[feline]] in exception to the \"small hooves\":https://retrospring.net/rattiesteps/a/108435734636456859 on their hind legs. Catrobies are exclusively [[female]] and can reproduce with each other or other [[mammal]]ian species to [[oviposition|lay eggs]] that spawn more near-identical catrobies. They are peaceful and friendly, have never been known to show any hostility, and have an attention span that is almost non-existent. \"They find humans to be adorable.\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/42282792/ Adults average \"a little over 2 meters in height,\":https://curiouscat.me/rattiesteps/post/1238205118 in part due to their [[long neck]]s. They are also notable for their ridiculously big, [[bottom_heavy|bottom heavy]] body proportions seen as a testament to their fertility; possessing sizeable [[belly|bellies]], [[breasts]], and [[butt]]s. It is \"scientifically proven\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/29278450/ that Catrobies have the softest butts in the entire galaxy. A catrobis often experiences severe [[weight gain]] and [[bloated|bloating]] due to the species' \"3 stomachs,\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/40471526/ \"poor self restraint regarding food,\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/31849441/ and \"allergic reactions to oxygen.\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/20568448/ The catrobis' herbivorous diet favors [[fruit]] above all, but they are willing to eat \"synthetic meat.\":https://curiouscat.me/rattiesteps/post/1242295806"
