            "wiki_body": "Cattiva is one of the [[pal_(species)|pal species]] featured in the video game [[Palworld]]. They are classified as No. #002 in the Paldeck, and are likely to be one of the first pals players can encounter.\r\n\r\nCattiva resembles a small bipedal pink cat, with bright blue eyes, four thick whiskers, a tuft of fur on their forehead, short and curly tail and cream-coloured underbelly. Cattivas are often seen with a confident expression.\r\n\r\n[quote][i]At a glance it appears confident, but it is in fact weak and cowardly. Being toyed with by Cattiva is in many ways the greatest of disgraces.[/i][/quote]"
