              "wiki_body": "thumb #155486 thumb #748454 thumb #1174688 thumb #1479965\n\n[b]Bats[/b] are a small flying mammal from the order [i]Chiroptera[/i]. They have small legs, and two webbed wings. They are the only mammals who are capable of true flight. \n\nBats are not rodents, despite appearances. Bats also are not blind. Large bats (\"mega bats\") actually have quite keen vision, while smaller bats have echolocation to guide them.\n\nh4. Species\n\n* [[Bechstein's bat]]\n* [[Brown long-eared bat]]\n* [[desert bat]]\n* [[Fang He tube-nosed bat]]\n* [[flying fox]]\n* [[free-tailed bat]]\n* [[pteropodid|fruit bat]]\n* [[honduran white bat]]\n* [[jamaican red bat]]\n* [[leaf-nosed bat]]\n* [[spotted bat]]\n* [[vampire bat]]\n\nh5. Fictional\n\n* [[aero the acro-bat (series)|aero the acro-bat]]\n** [[aero the acro-bat|aero]]\n* [[batman (series)|batman series]]\n** [[batgirl]]\n** [[batman]]\n* [[bloody roar]]\n** [[jenny the bat]]\n* [[daigasso band brothers]]\n** [[barbara the bat]]\n* [[disney]]\n** [[chip 'n dale rescue rangers]]\n*** [[foxglove (cdrr)|foxglove]]\n* [[ferngully]]\n** [[batty koda]]\n* [[silverwing (series)|silverwing series]]\n** [[marina brightwing]]\n* [[sonic (series)|sonic series]]\n** [[rouge the bat]]\n* [[yooka-laylee]]\n** [[laylee]]\n\nh6. Fictional species\n\n** [[my little pony]]\n*** [[friendship is magic]]\n**** [[bat pony]]\n***** [[flutterbat (mlp)|flutterbat]]\n**** [[fruit bat (mlp)|fruit bat]]\n* [[mythology]]\n** [[african mythology]]\n*** [[popobawa]]\n* [[ukimori]]\n\nh6. OCs\n\n* [[azureus (inintendork)|azureus]]\n* [[batgirl_(vimhomeless)|vimhomeless' batgirl]]\n* [[bloody bat]]\n* [[bossy the bat]]\n* [[chiros]]\n* [[demetria]]\n* [[dongbat]]\n* [[ellise the bat]]\n* [[fan character]]\n** [[cave story]]\n*** [[blue bat]]\n** [[sonic (series)|sonic series]]\n*** [[bessi the bat]]\n* [[jax (jax the bat)|jax the bat]]\n* [[mercy-bat]]\n* [[ruby the bat]]\n* [[stellaluna (satinsquid)|stellaluna]]\n* [[theglowingbat]]\n* [[tristandabat]]\n* [[turo of akesh|turo]]\n* [[vixiefoxbat]]\n* [[xavier the bat]]\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n\n* [[bat_(object)]]\n** [[baseball bat]]\n* [[mammal]]\n** [[rodent]]\n*** [[mouse]]\n*** [[rat]]\n\nh4. Themes\n\nInanimate representations of bats do not get a species tag.\n\n* [[bat_decoration]]\n* [[bat_plushie]] - Might not be populated\n* [[bat_(shape)]]\n** [[bat_symbol]]\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[animal humanoid]]\n** [[bat humanoid]]\n* [[bat wings]]\n* [[taur]]\n** [[bat taur]]\n* [[vampire]]\n* [[were]]\n** [[werebat]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* \"Wikipedia article on the bat\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat"
