            "wiki_body": "thumb #4077041 thumb #1885154 thumb #3713708\n\n[quote]The nu mou are a race in the [[Final Fantasy]] series, primarily found in games set in Ivalice.[/quote]\n\nThe nu mou possess distinct canine-like traits, including elongated faces and tails. Their ears, which are thick and long, with a hole near the end, are often adorned with earrings. While averaging 130–150 cm in height, their bent posture accentuates their small stature.\n\nThey live over three times longer than Humes, maintaining a consistent aged appearance throughout their lives that even young nu mou have an aged look, sporting white hair, and tails often featuring sandy-colored fur. Their skin tones vary, typically appearing either pale or muted.\n\nNu mou are poorly suited for physical combat but possess exceptional magical prowess. Their advanced intelligence allows them to surpass other races in this domain. Beyond their skill in magick, they can also harness the powers to control monsters for assistance."
