            "wiki_body": "thumb #504130 thumb #504132\r\n\r\n[b]Pidgeotto[/b] (ピジョン) is a Normal/Flying-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is the mid-evolution between [[Pidgey]] and [[Pidgeot]], and is in the [i]Flying[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nPidgeotto is a raptor-like [[avian]] Pokémon. It is covered with [[brown feathers]], and has a cream-colored face and underside. It has a crest of pinkish-red feathers on its head and black, angular markings behind its eyes. The plumage of its tail has alternating red and yellow feathers with ragged tips. Its beak and legs are pink, and it has powerful, sharp talons. \r\n\r\nShiny Pidgeotto has greenish feathers instead of brown.\r\n\r\nPidgeotto is [[feral]] in its canon form.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[beak]]\r\n* [[bird]]\r\n* [[brown_feathers]]\r\n* [[tail_feathers]]\r\n* [[talons]]\r\n* [[wings]]\r\n** [[feathered_wings]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[pidgey]]\r\n** [[pidgeot]]\r\n** [[mega_pidgeot]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Pidgeotto\":http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pidgeotto"
