            "wiki_body": "thumb #2111934   thumb #2113240   thumb #2156670   thumb #2330792   thumb #3310647   thumb #3890999   thumb #4864234\r\n\"[b]◀[u]Bulbapedia[/u]▶[/b]\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Cinderace_(Pokémon)?wprov=sfti1#\r\n\r\n[color=species][b]Gigantamax Cinderace[/b][/color] (Japanese: [color=species][b]キョダイマックス エースバーン [i]Kyodaimakkusu Ēsubān[/i], Kyodaimax Aceburn[/b][/color]) is a [color=#EE8130]Fire[/color]-type [[Gigantamax Pokémon]]. It is the Gigantamax of [[Cinderace]].\r\n\r\nGigantamax Cinderace is largely identical to is normal form — an [[anthro]] [[lagomorph]]-like [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] dressed like a [[soccer]] player — only now that its [[rabbit ears]] are far more pronounced. Once fluffy and perky, they have become excessively [[long]] [[lop ears]] twice the Cinderace's body length. The [[yellow inner ear]] has also changed from elliptical to a conjoined double-[[diamond (marking)|diamond marking]], like that found on their thighs. Additionally, their [[red hair]] has changed slightly, growing a bit longer with a [[fire]]-like fray at the end.\r\n\r\nAside from the body, Gigantamax Cinderace [[fire manipulation|manipulates]] and often [[riding|rides]] a giant [[fireball|flaming ball]] with [[white eye|white]]-hot [[empty eyes]] and [[white nose|nose]] mimicking its own face, which is utilized in their exclusive G-Max Fireball move. They also have three [[red clouds|red, cloudy]] [[hitodama]] swirling clockwise above the head; the signature of Dynamax and Gigantamax transformations.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** #0813 [[Scorbunny]]\r\n** #0814 [[Raboot]]\r\n** #0815 [[Cinderace]]\r\n*** [b]Gigantamax Cinderace[/b]"
