            "wiki_body": "thumb #429206\r\n\r\n[b]Vivillon[/b] is a [[butterfly]]-like [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]] with [[wings]] that come in a large variety of patterns. Vivillon's [[abdomen|thorax]] is an elliptical shape divided into three segments, each with a different shade of gray. Its legs are also elliptical which are black on the lower half and grayish on the upper half. Vivillon has two black, circular hands and no visible arms. It has a round, grayish head with large, black, pixelated [[compound eyes]] and a pair of skinny [[antennae|antenna]].\r\n\r\nIts wings' pattern is affected by the climate in which it lives, having 18 distinct forms from around the world. There are also 2 forms that are not found in any climate, and instead are event exclusive. The default, most common form seen in most media and official artwork tends to be the [[meadow vivillon|meadow form]], the form found in France and Spain, probably due to the fact that the region of Kalos Vivillon hails from is based upon France.\r\n\r\nh4. Forms\r\n\r\n* [[archipelago_vivillon]]\r\n* [[continental_vivillon]]\r\n* [[elegant_vivillon]]\r\n* [[fancy_vivillon]]\r\n* [[garden_vivillon]]\r\n* [[high_plains_vivillon]]\r\n* [[icy_snow_vivillon]]\r\n* [[jungle_vivillon]]\r\n* [[marine_vivillon]]\r\n* [[meadow_vivillon]]\r\n* [[modern_vivillon]]\r\n* [[monsoon_vivillon]]\r\n* [[ocean_vivillon]]\r\n* [[poké_ball_vivillon]]\r\n* [[polar_vivillon]]\r\n* [[river_vivillon]]\r\n* [[sandstorm_vivillon]]\r\n* [[savanna_vivillon]]\r\n* [[sun_vivillon]]\r\n* [[tundra_vivillon]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [[scatterbug]]\r\n*** [[spewpa]]\r\n**** vivillon"
