                "wiki_body": "thumb #541416 thumb #336883 thumb #366979\r\n\r\n[b]Spitz[/b] (pluralized [b]spitzes[/b] or [b]Spitzen[/b]) are a type of [[domestic dog]] as opposed to a specific breed. The exact origin of the Spitz type is unknown, though most originate from Siberia.\r\n\r\nSpitz types are thick [[fur|furred]] dogs, often carrying dense undercoats and incredibly [[fluffy tail|fluffy]], [[curled tail|curled]] (or drooping) tails. Their ears tend to be on the small side, though pointed and upright, and they often carry almond shaped eyes. Their [[snout|snouts]] also tend to be pointed, and hold strong jaws."
