                  "wiki_preview": "Tenrecs are small mammals, though they can come in a variety of body shapes. Although they may resem...",
                  "wiki_body": "Tenrecs are small mammals, though they can come in a variety of body shapes. Although they may resemble [[shrew|shrews]], [[hedgehog|hedgehogs]], or [[otter|otters]], they are not closely related to any of these groups.\r\n\r\nUnusual among placental mammals, the tenrec possesses a [[cloaca]]. They have a low body temperature, sufficiently so that they do not require a [[balls|scrotum]] to cool their [[sperm]]. Most species are nocturnal and have poor eyesight, however their other senses are heightened, such as their incredibly sensitive [[whiskers]]. Most have [[long snout|long snouts]] and prickly [[spines]].\r\n\r\nh4. Species\r\n\r\n* [[lesser_hedgehog_tenrec]]\r\n* [[potamogale]] (also known as \"otter shrews\")\r\n** [[giant_potamogale]]\r\n* [[streaked_tenrec]]\r\n** [[lowland_streaked_tenrec]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[afrosoricid]]\r\n*** tenrec"
