              "wiki_body": "thumb #1211300 thumb #3769764 thumb #1584611 thumb #4720284 thumb #3345456\r\n\r\n[b]Crocodilia[/b] (or [b]Crocodylia[/b]) is the grouping that [[alligator|Alligators]], [[crocodile|Crocodiles]], and [[caiman|Caimans]] belong to. They are [[reptile|reptilians]] known to live near [[water]], with long--but not tall--snouts with [[fangs]].\r\n\r\n* [[reptile]]\r\n** [b]crocodilian[/b]\r\n*** [[alligatorid]]\r\n**** [[alligator]]\r\n**** [[caiman]]\r\n**** [[deinosuchus]]\r\n*** [[crocodylid]]\r\n**** [[crocodile]]\r\n**** [[false_gharial]]\r\n**** [[gharial]]\r\n*** [[sarcosuchus]]\r\n\r\nh4. Fictional species\r\nh6.Original Characters\r\n* [[Cela]]\r\n* [[Cregon]]\r\n* [[Duncan (doginacafe)|Duncan]]\r\n* [[Reyak (xxsparcoxx)|Reyak]]\r\n\r\nh6.[i]The Amazing Digital Circus[/i] Characters\r\n* [[Chad (tadc)|Chad]]\r\n* [[Gummigoo (tadc)|Gummigoo]]\r\n* [[Max (tadc)|Max]]\r\n\r\nh6.Video Games Characters\r\n* [[Bea Santello]]\r\n* [[Croc]]\r\n* [[Dingodile]]\r\n* [[King K. Rool]]\r\n* [[Montgomery Gator]]\r\n* [[Renekton]]\r\n* [[Vector the Crocodile]]\r\n\r\nh6.Others\r\n* [[Sobek]]\r\n* [[Sobek (Kemokin Mania)]]\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon (species)]]\r\n* #0158 - [[Totodile]]\r\n** #0159 - [[Croconaw]]\r\n*** #0160 - [[Feraligatr]]\r\n* #0551 - [[Sandile]]\r\n** #0552 - [[Krokorok]]\r\n*** #0553 - [[Krookodile]]\r\n* #0909 - [[Fuecoco]]\r\n** #0910 - [[Crocalor]]\r\n*** #0911 - [[Skeledirge]]\r\n\r\nh4. See other rankings:\r\n\r\n* [[Avian]]\r\n* [[Bovine]]\r\n* [[Canine]]\r\n* [[Cervine]]\r\n* [[Cetacean]]\r\n* [[Equine]]\r\n* [[Feline]]\r\n* [[Hooves]]\r\n* [[Mammal]]\r\n* [[Marsupial]]\r\n* [[Mustelid]]\r\n* [[Primate]]\r\n* [[Rodent]]\r\n* [[Scalie]]"
