              "count": 3371,
              "wiki_preview": "Living latex or liquid latex is a substance that seems to be able to take almost every form or shape...",
              "wiki_body": "Living latex or liquid latex is a substance that seems to be able to take almost every form or shape, as well as cover objects or body parts for different uses like universal clothing, restraints or other objects, as well as resemble a living sentient being.\r\n\r\nLiving latex is most used in reference to \"latex fetishes\".\r\n\r\nLiving latex can be distinguished from most other types of [[goo creature]] by being completely opaque, very [[shiny]], and for its tendency for a creature coated in it to specifically appear like a skin-tight [[rubber suit]] or an [[inflatable]].\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[latex_suit]] \r\n* [[bodysuit]] \r\n* [[latex]] \r\n"
            }
