              "wiki_body": "thumb #3982580 thumb #4204993 thumb #4182376 thumb #3790735\r\n\r\nAny living creature which appears to be made from a [[latex]] material or mass of latex that exhibits independent movement. This species tag is usually applied alongside other species tags. \r\n\r\nIf the creature is made of liquid or goo-like latex then also add [[liquid_latex]]. \r\n\r\nLiving latex can be distinguished from most other types of [[goo creature]] by being completely opaque, very [[shiny]], and for its tendency for a creature coated in it to specifically appear like a [[latex_skinsuit]] or an [[inflatable]]."
