                "wiki_body": "\"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock_dove\r\n\r\nThe rock dove, rock pigeon, or common pigeon (/ˈpɪdʒ.ən/ also /ˈpɪdʒ.ɪn/; Columba livia) is a member of the bird family Columbidae (doves and pigeons). In common usage, it is often simply referred to as the \"pigeon\", although this is the wild form of the bird; the pigeons most familiar to people are the domesticated form of the wild rock dove. "
