            "wiki_body": "thumb #1000046 thumb #1471577 thumb #744362\r\n[b]Gardevoir[/b] is one of the species of [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]] creatures from the [i][[Pokémon]][/i] media franchise—a collection of video games, anime, manga, books, trading cards, and other media created by Satoshi Tajiri. As do all Pokémon, Gardevoir fight other Pokémon in battles central to the anime, manga, and games of the series.\r\n\r\nGardevoir is a [[humanoid]] Pokémon with [[red eyes]], resembling a five-foot tall thin and frail [[elf]] with green skin wearing a flowing white [[dress]]. A red horn juts out from the front and back of their torso. [[Shiny Pokémon|Shiny Gardevoir]] have blue skin rather than green.\r\n\r\nGardevoir's appearance has made it a common subject for art.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[humanoid]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[ralts]]\r\n*** [[kirlia]]\r\n**** [[gallade]]\r\n***** [[mega_gallade]]\r\n**** gardevoir\r\n***** [[mega_gardevoir]]"
