            "wiki_body": "thumb #836011 thumb #481344 thumb #415952\r\n\r\n[b]Sylveon[/b] is a Fairy-type Pokémon introduced in the Sixth Generation of Pokémon. It evolves from [[Eevee]] when leveled up while knowing a Fairy-type move and having at least two hearts of affection in Pokémon-Amie.\r\n\r\nh4. Anatomy tags\r\n\r\nColors tags assume character is using on model colorations. Actual colors may vary.\r\n- TODO: Include shiny fur coloration tags \r\n\r\n* Fur: [[white_fur]] [[pink_fur]] [[two_tone_fur]]\r\n* Ears: [[pink_ears]] [[blue_inner_ear]] [[monotone_ears]]\r\n* Tail: [[pink_tail]] [[monotone_tail]]\r\n* Markings: [[socks_(marking)]]\r\n\r\nh6. Ribbon tagging\r\n\r\n* [[bow_(anatomy)]] - The bow itself does not count as a ribbon.\r\n** [[hair_bow_(anatomy)]] - Tag only if it is visible.\r\n** [[neck_bow_(anatomy)]] - Tag only if it is visible.\r\n* [[ribbons_(anatomy)]] \r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[eevee]]\r\n*** [[eeveelution]]\r\n*** [[all eight eeveelutions]]\r\n**** [[vaporeon]]\r\n**** [[jolteon]]\r\n**** [[flareon]]\r\n**** [[espeon]]\r\n**** [[glaceon]]\r\n**** [[leafeon]]\r\n**** [[umbreon]]\r\n**** [b]sylveon[/b]"
