            "wiki_body": "thumb #200618 thumb #534937 thumb #1827336\r\n\r\n[b]Food creatures[/b], often referred to as [b]living food[/b] or [b]anthropomorphic food[/b], are creatures in media that, as the title implies, are made of [[food]]. They can come in a variety of forms, such as [[food humanoid|humanoid food]] or simple [[feral]] animals that happen to be living food or [[hybrid|hybridized]] with other edible objects.\r\n\r\nThis type of creature is incredibly common in advertising, often used as product [[mascot|mascots]] or the active participants in the advertisements themselves. Food creatures, while not always, commonly consist of highly processed foods, such as [[hot dog|hot dogs]] or [[pizza]].\r\n\r\nh4. Types:\r\n* [[food_humanoid]]\r\n* [[living_candy]]\r\n* [[living_fruit]]\r\n** [[fruit_humanoid]]\r\n* [[living_vegetable]]\r\n** [[vegetable_humanoid]]\r\n* [[meat_creature]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[animate_inanimate]]\r\n* [[flora_fauna]]\r\n* [[food]]\r\n** [b]food_creature[/b]"
