            "wiki_body": "thumb #2069204   thumb #2836637   thumb #2096680   thumb #3125706   thumb #3598270   thumb #3762963   thumb #5187474\n\"[b]◀[u]Bulbapedia[/u]▶[/b]\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Cinderace_(Pokémon)?wprov=sfti1#\n\n[color=species][b]Cinderace[/b][/color] (Japanese: [color=species][b]エースバーン [i]Ēsubān[/i], Aceburn[/b][/color]) is a [color=#EE8130]Fire[/color]-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_8_pokemon|Generation VIII]] via [i]Pokémon Sword[/i] and [i]Pokémon Shield[/i]. It is the final form of [[Scorbunny]], having evolved from [[Raboot]] at level 35. It does also have a temporary [[gigantamax pokemon|Gigantamax form]], [[Gigantamax Cinderace]].\n\nCinderace is a [[biped|bipedal]] Pokémon resembling an [[anthro|anthropomorphic]] [[rabbit]]. They are primarily covered in [[white fur]], with [[red fur]] and some [[blue markings|blue]] and [[yellow markings]] that gives the appearance of [[pseudo clothing]] befitting of a [[soccer]] player (outside of canon, this may be treated as actual [[clothing]]).\n\nThe head is topped by a wispy plume of [[red hair]] and a similarly-shaped pair of [[big ears|large]], [[white ears|white]] [[rabbit ears]] with [[yellow inner ear|yellow interiors]]. They also have sizable [[cheek tufts]]. Their eyes are [[red eyes|red]] with [[white pupils]] and navy-blue [[eye markings]] like [[mascara]] and [[eyelashes]]. The mouth has a [[pink tongue]] and a single, triangular [[buckteeth|bucktooth]]. At the bridge of Cinderace's [[red nose]] are [[yellow eyebrows]], or rather a [[unibrow]], but their three-pronged shape and lack of expression may incline one to believe they are a [[tiara]] of sorts.\n\nThe \"[[jersey]]\" is [[white jersey|white]] with blue hems, the notable features being the [[blue tuft|blue tufts]] at the [[shoulder tuft|shoulders]], and the [[chevron (marking)|chevron]] over the [[collarbone]]. Their arms are somewhat puffy and undefined, and end in small, [[3 fingers|three-fingered]] [[handpaw|handpaws]].\n\nThe \"[[shorts]]\" are [[red shorts|red]] with a yellow [[fur trim (clothing)|fur trim]] at the knees and conjoined double-[[diamond (marking)|diamond marking]] on the thighs. The [[furgonomic bottomwear]] lets out from the back a tufty, [[white tail|white]], [[cotton tail]].\n\nBelow the knee, Cinderace's [[blue legs|legs are blue]] with a [[red toes|red]] [[toeless (marking)|toeless pattern]], giving the appearance of [[blue stockings|blue]] [[toeless stockings]]. They stand flat on [[plantigrade]] [[3 toes|three-toed]] feet, whose [[soles]] are marked by three round [[yellow pawpads]], which [[fire manipulation|generates flames]] when it hits an object; this is Cinderace's signature attack, [[Pyro Ball]]. Cinderace also have a signature status move, Court Change.\n\nIn its [[shiny pokemon|shiny]] coloration, Cinderace's white fur is instead a greyish-tan; the blue markings are inversely white; and the red hair and shorts are orange.\n\n\nh4. See also:\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\n** #0813 [[Scorbunny]]\n** #0814 [[Raboot]]\n** [b]#0815 Cinderace[/b]\n*** [[Gigantamax Cinderace]]\n** #0812 [[Rillaboom]]\n** #0818 [[Inteleon]]"
