            "wiki_body": "thumb #91549 thumb #748325\r\n\r\n[b]Luxray[/b] (レントラー) is a Electric-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is the final evolution of [[Shinx]] and [[Luxio]], and is in the [i]Field[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nShiny Luxray is orange/black instead of blue/black.\r\n\r\nLuxray is [[feral]] in its canon form, but often depicted as an [[anthro]] [[pokémorph]].\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[lion]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[black_fur]]\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[shinx]]\r\n** [[luxio]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Luxray\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Luxray"
