            "wiki_body": "thumb #1275115 thumb #1864620 thumb #1428888\r\n\r\nThe [b]Octarians[/b] are a species from the [[Splatoon]] series. They descend from [[octopus|octopuses]] and serve as a parallel to the [[inkling|Inklings]], who descend from [[squid|squids]].\r\nWhile they generally serve as the main antagonists of the series, some, such as [[marina_(splatoon)|Marina]] and [[Agent 8]], are allies to the player.\r\n\r\nOctarians come in different forms, some appear as [[cephalopod humanoid|Cephalopod Humanoids]] which are known as [[octoling|Octolings]], but there exist many other types with all kinds of non-humanoid appearances, most of which are akin to octopus tentacles, such as [[octotrooper|Octotroopers]].\r\n\r\nSome have undergone a process of \"sanitization\" to become [[sanitized octarian|Sanitized Octarians]], losing their life's energy and taking a different, green-ish coloration.\r\n\r\nh4. External Links:\r\n* \"[b][u]Octarian[/u][/b] on Inkipedia\":https://splatoonwiki.org/wiki/Octarian"
