            "wiki_body": "thumb #533432 thumb #191510 thumb #309583\r\n\r\n[b]Machoke[/b] (ゴーリキー) is a Fighting-type Pokémon. It is a mid-evolution between [[Machop]] and [[Machamp]], and is in the [i]Human-Like[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nMachoke is a bipedal Pokémon. Its skin color ranges from grey to purple, depending on the generation. It has a vaguely reptilian face with a short snout, narrow red eyes, and four pointed teeth visible inside its mouth. Two of these teeth are in the upper jaw, while two are in the lower jaw. On top of its head are three, light brown ridges. Its arms are muscular with dark red, vertical stripes on them. It possesses large pectoral muscles that protrude slightly over its belt. It wears tight black shorts, and a golden belt with a buckle that has a red \"P\" design.\r\n\r\nShiny Machoke is green.\r\n\r\nDepending on the artstyle, Machoke can look vaguely reptilian. As the result, this tag tends to be evenly split between [[anthro]] and [[humanoid]]. Despite the lack of typical anthro features such as a tail, [[anthro]] tends to be the better fit if the Machoke is depicted with a clearly animal-like snout.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[muscles]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[machop]]\r\n** [[machamp]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Machoke\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Machoke"
