            "wiki_body": "[b]Midday Lycanroc[/b] is the form of [[Lycanroc]] that is achieved when [[Rockruff]] evolves during the day, starting at level 25, in Pokémon Sun and Ultra Sun. \r\n\r\nthumb #994389 thumb #994205\r\n\r\nIn its Midday Form, it resembles a wolf, with a body covered mostly in brown fur. Its lower legs are white, and each foot ends in three black claws. It has a long, bushy, white tail, as well as a white mane around its neck, protruding from which are four spikes of black rock around its neck. Its face is mostly framed in brown fur, with tufts of fur sticking out from its cheeks making its head appear wider and a brown stripe running between its eyes. Its pointy ears stand on top of its head, tipped in black and with pink insides. Its muzzle and its face around its eyes are white. It has blue eyes, a black nose at the tip of its pointy snout, and four sharp fangs can be seen when it opens its mouth.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Rockruff]]\r\n*** [[Lycanroc]]\r\n**** Midday Lycanroc\r\n**** [[Midnight Lycanroc]]\r\n**** [[Dusk Lycanroc]]\r\n\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/lycanroc-midday-form/\r\nhttp://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Lycanroc_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          },
