            "wiki_preview": "thumb #837775 thumb #1319590 thumb #692361\r\n\r\nLapras is one of the species of [[Pokémon]] creatures ...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #837775 thumb #1319590 thumb #692361\r\n\r\nLapras is one of the species of [[Pokémon]] creatures from the Pokémon media franchise—a collection of video games, anime, manga, books, trading cards, and other media created by Satoshi Tajiri. As do all Pokémon, Lapras fight other Pokémon in battles central to the anime, manga, and games of the series.\r\n\r\nLapras resembles a [[shell|shelled]] [[plesiosaur|plesiosaurid]], blue with a cream underbelly, as well as visible [[ear|ears]] and a [[horn]] jutting from the middle of its forehead. [[Shiny pokémon|Shiny Lapras]] are purple.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** lapras\r\n"
