            "wiki_preview": "thumb #1529276 thumb #1300437 thumb #2115534\r\n\r\n[b]Chao[/b] are a humanoid species of small animal f...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1529276 thumb #1300437 thumb #2115534\r\n\r\n[b]Chao[/b] are a humanoid species of small animal from the [i][[sonic_the_hedgehog_(series)|Sonic the Hedgehog series]][/i], often raised as pets such as in the Chao Gardens from the [i]Sonic Adventure[/i] games.\r\n\r\nTheir appearances can vary heavily depending how they're raised, coming in three alignments with four base typings and for sub-typings. Each alignments share certain defining characteristics, such as [[hero chao]] having their iconic [[halo|halos]] and [[dark chao]] having [[angry]] expressions.\r\n\r\nCertain special kinds of chao drastically differ in appearance from others, such as the immortal [[chaos chao]] and the chao that [[character chao|visually resemble other sonic characters]].\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\n* [[Cheese the Chao]]\r\n* [[Chocola the Chao]]\r\n* [[Omochao]]\r\n\r\nh4. Species\r\n\r\n* [[Chaos Chao]]\r\n** [[Angel Chaos Chao]]\r\n** [[Dark Chaos Chao]]\r\n* [[Character Chao]]\r\n** [[Amy Chao]]\r\n** [[Blaze Chao]]\r\n** [[Knuckles Chao]]\r\n** [[Nights Chao]]\r\n** [[Reala Chao]]\r\n** [[Shadow Chao]]\r\n** [[Sonic Chao]]\r\n** [[Tails Chao]]\r\n* [[Dark Chao]]\r\n* [[Hero Chao]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Chaos (Sonic)|Chaos]]\r\n* [[Tikal the Echidna]]"
