            "wiki_body": "thumb #49686 thumb #747979\r\n\r\n[b]Smeargle[/b] (ドーブル) is a Normal-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It does not evolve, and it is in the [i]Field[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nShiny Smeargle's fur has yellow tint, and it has red tail tip instead of green.\r\n\r\nSmeargle is [[anthro]] in its canon form, and is rarely depicted in any other form.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[holding_tail]]\r\n* [[tongue_out]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Smeargle\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Smeargle"
