            "wiki_body": "thumb #2069207   thumb #2075267   thumb #2100274\r\n\"[b]◀[u]Bulbapedia[/u]▶[/b]\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Raboot_(Pokémon)?wprov=sfti1#\r\n\r\n[color=species][b][/b][/color] (Japanese: [color=species][b]ラビフット [i]Rabifutto[/i], Rabbifoot[/b][/color]) is a [color=#EE8130]Fire[/color]-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]. It is the mid-evolution between [[Scorbunny]] and [[Cinderace]], and is in the `Field` and `Human-Like` \"egg groups\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Egg_Group. It is the Fire [[starter_trio|starter Pokémon]] of the \"Galar region\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Galar.\r\n\r\n[b]Raboot[/b] is an [[anthro]] [[lagomorph]]-like Pokémon with a [[two_tone_body|grayish-white body]] and [[red eyes]]. The [[fur]] on its upper body is [[red_fur|red]] and rises over its face in a [[neckerchief]] that covers its mouth, while its lower body is [[black_body|black]] with a tuft of fur in the middle of its [[belly]].\r\nThe front half of its hind legs is red and it has a small yellow pad on the arch of its [[feet|foot]]. This Pokémon has a yellow [[headband]] on its forehead and a small gray tail.\r\n\r\nShiny [b]Raboot[/b] has a white torso and grey head.\r\n\r\nRaboot is [[anthro]] in its canon form.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n* [[rabbit]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[long_ears]]\r\n* [[red_eyes]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** #0813 [[Scorbunny]]\r\n** [b]#0814 Raboot[/b]\r\n** #0815 [[Cinderace]]\r\n*** [[Gigantamax Cinderace]]\r\n** #0811 [[Thwackey]]\r\n** #0817 [[Drizzile]]"
