            "count": 1637,
            "wiki_preview": "The Kig-Yar (Forerunner designation, translated into Latin: [i]Perosus latrunculus[/i], or \"Hateful ...",
            "wiki_body": "The Kig-Yar (Forerunner designation, translated into Latin: [i]Perosus latrunculus[/i], or \"Hateful Bandit,\" human designation: [i]Covenant secundarium carnivora prœdonis[/i], or \"Covenant secondary carnivorous combatant\") are an avian/reptilian species from Eayn, a moon of the planet Chu'ot in the Y'deio system, which served the Covenant as mercenaries and privateers. There are two distinct subgroups of Kig-Yar, which Humans have termed Jackals and Skirmishers. In combat, Kig-Yar typically serve as snipers, shock troopers, defensive fighters, and scouts within the Covenant due to their excellent senses of sight, smell, and hearing."
