            "count": 1584,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #916650\r\n\r\n[b]Rockruff[/b] (イワンコ) is a Rock-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. Depending on t...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #916650\r\n\r\n[b]Rockruff[/b] (イワンコ) is a Rock-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. Depending on the time of evolution, it evolves into either [[Midday Lycanroc]], [[Midnight Lycanroc]], or [[Dusk Lycanroc]]. It is in the [i]Field[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nRockruff is a [[quadruped]], [[canine]] Pokémon. It is primarily [[brown_fur|light brown]] with a [[muzzle_(marking)|darker brown muzzle]], paws, and ear tips. It has large [[blue eyes]], [[button ears]], a short [[snout|muzzle]] with a triangular [[pink nose]], and a short tuft of fur on each cheek. Around its neck is a [[neck_tuft|ruff]] of grayish-white fur stubbed with dark brown pebbles. The dark brown markings on its paws extend to a thin point on each wrist and ankle. It has a grayish-white tail that curls tightly over its back and is covered in [[fluffy fur]].\r\n\r\nShiny Rockruff has blue fur.\r\n\r\nRockruff is [[feral]] in its canon form.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[domestic_dog]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[brown_fur]]\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[dusk_lycanroc]]\r\n** [[midday_lycanroc]]\r\n** [[midnight_lycanroc]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Rockruff\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Rockruff"
