            "wiki_body": "thumb #2529119 thumb #2509524 thumb #2278263\r\n\r\nA [b]gull[/b] (or colloquially [b]\"seagull\"[/b]) is a small [[bird]]. There are several subspecies of gulls, such as \"Pacific gull\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_gull or \"Belcher's gull\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belcher%27s_gull, however, they are all very similar.\r\n\r\nThe most famous gull has white feathers with gray and black wings. It also has yellow or red legs.\r\n\r\nHowever, gulls can have different colors. Like all other species, these must be accompanied by the appropriate colored feather tags.\r\n\r\nh4.Species:\r\n* [[avian]]\r\n** [[bird]]\r\n*** [[gull]]\r\n\r\nh4.More information:\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gull"
