            "wiki_body": "thumb #4153743\r\n\r\nThe Zonai are a species existing in the [i][[the_legend_of_zelda|Legend of Zelda]][/i] universe. They are a prehistoric civilization whose existence is first alluded to through ancient ruins seen in [i][[breath_of_the_wild|Breath of the Wild]][/i], and in its sequel, [i][[tears_of_the_kingdom|Tears of the Kingdom]][/i], they are revealed to have co-founded the kingdom of Hyrule, were technologically advanced, and once resided in the skies. They are [[anthro|anthropomorphic]] [[mammal|mammals]] characterized by [[big_ears|large ears]], a [[caprine]] or [[dragon]]-like facial structure, and a [[3_eyes|third eye]], which is usually closed.\r\n\r\nThey are believed to have gone extinct, with [[rauru_(tears_of_the_kingdom)|Rauru]] and [[Mineru]], the only Zonai seen in [i]Tears of the Kingdom[/i], being the last of their kind."
