            "wiki_body": "A species created By: \"Daemonlady\":https://www.furaffinity.net/user/daemonlady\n\nThe [u]current owner[/u] of the species is \"Pinewarden\":https://linktr.ee/pinewarden \nWickerbeast website for all your wicker info needs: http://www.wickercave.net/\n\n[section=Canon Wickerbeast Traits]\nJagged lips & boxy muzzle\n4 clawed fingers (the fingers themselves are claws)\nBackwards facing ears\nSome sort of mane unless it has sphinx syndrome\nPupil-less eyes with no iris\n\"Incapable of using magic\":https://www.wickercave.net/primal\n[/section]\nAny wicker that doesn't have these traits isn't considered canon to the story Pinewarden is telling, but is absolutely still welcome to be made and participate in the community or use the world's lore as a base for their own wicker lore.\nAs stated on their \"website\":https://www.wickercave.net/rules:\n[quote]It is entirely at your discretion to determine whether your wicker is part of the canon lore that belongs to the world of Osova, or if it is from your own unrelated lore.[/quote]\n\n[section=Wickerbeast Subtypes]\n\"Standard\":https://www.wickercave.net/standard\n\"King\":https://www.wickercave.net/king\n\"Swamp\":https://www.wickercave.net/swamp\n\"Rogue\":https://www.wickercave.net/rogue\n\"Pelagic\":https://www.wickercave.net/pelagic\n\"Dweller\":https://www.wickercave.net/dweller\n\"Aerion\":https://www.wickercave.net/aerion\n\"Hybrids\":https://www.wickercave.net/hybrid\nRobowickers (no website page yet)\n[/section]"
