            "wiki_body": "thumb #2991009 thumb #3936562\r\n\r\nThis tag should be used for [[human|humans]] from the [[My Hero Academia]] franchise that have notable non-human features to the point that they appear to be a separate species from baseline humans. Examples include mutations such as [[Ippan Josei]] and [[Fumikage Tokoyami]] and transformations such as [[Eijiro Kirishima|Eijiro Kirishima’s]] unbreakable form and [[Ryuko Tatsuma|Ryuko Tatsuma’s]] dragon form.\r\n\r\nExamples that do [b]NOT[/b] receive this tag are characters who have quirks but still appear fully human such as [[Izuku Midoriya]], characters that only have additions or slight changes from a baseline human such as [[Kyoka Jiro]] or [[Ryuko Tatsuma|Ryuko Tatsuma’s]] base form, characters identified as [[Nomu]], and non-human quirked characters such as [[Nedzu]]."
