            "wiki_body": "thumb #1685781 thumb #4537082\r\n\r\nPlusle (Japanese: プラスル Prasle) is an Electric-Type Pokémon introduced in Generation III. It is [[minun|Minun]]'s partner.\r\n\r\nPlusle is a small rodent-like Pokémon. It bears a remarkable resemblance to [[pichu|Pichu]] and [[pikachu|Pikachu]]. Plusle's body is mainly pale yellow in color, with red patches on its ears, paws, cheeks, and tail. They have long rabbit-like ears and short tails with flat red plus signs on the end of them, while their cheeks and the tips of their ears are red, and have plus signs voided in the middle.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** plusle"
