            "wiki_body": "thumb #2285704 thumb #16945\r\n\r\n[b]Skitty[/b] (エネコ) is a Normal-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves into [[Delcatty]], and is in the [i]Field[/i] and [i]Fairy[/i] egg groups.\r\n\r\nShiny Skitty has slight red tint, which is difficult to tell apart from the normal color.\r\n\r\nSkitty is [[feral]] in its canon form, but the species is often depicted as an [[anthro]] [[pokémorph]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[big_ears]]\r\n* [[big_tail]]\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[delcatty]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Skitty\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Skitty"
