            "count": 1133,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #258775 thumb #378288 thumb #222272\r\n\r\nMeloetta is an normal/psychic-type [[legendary Pokémon]...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #258775 thumb #378288 thumb #222272\r\n\r\nMeloetta is an normal/psychic-type [[legendary Pokémon]]. Meloetta is a feminine humanoid musical bar-style streaks in its hair, quarter notes for its arms and hands and pupil-less eyes resembling whole notes (semibreves). It has a jewel on its forehead and a black headpiece that seems to be shaped like a treble clef which doubles as an attached microphone.\r\n\r\nMeloetta is able to change forms when it uses the move Relic Song, which changes its form from [[meloetta (aria form)|Aria]] to [[meloetta (pirouette form)|Pirouette]], or vice versa. In its Pirouette form, it is a dual-type Normal/Fighting-type Pokémon. In its Aria form, it has light blue eyes and flowing, green hair with light-blue ovals that resemble whole notes. In its Pirouette form, it has orange or red hair that seems to be stylized in a high bun and red eyes.\r\n\r\nSee: [i]\"Bulbapedia's article on Meloetta\":http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Meloetta_(Pok%C3%A9mon)[/i]\r\n\r\nh4. Related:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Legendary Pokémon]]\r\n*** Meloetta\r\n**** [[Meloetta (Aria form)]]\r\n**** [[Meloetta (Pirouette form)]]"
