            "count": 1120,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #2188221 thumb #1949684 thumb #3212442 \r\n[b]From Bulbapedia:[/b]\r\nCelebi (セレビィ Celebi) is a du...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2188221 thumb #1949684 thumb #3212442 \r\n[b]From Bulbapedia:[/b]\r\nCelebi (セレビィ Celebi) is a dual-type Psychic/Grass Mythical Pokémon introduced in Generation II.\r\n\r\nCelebi is a green, fairy-like Pokémon. It has round toeless feet, three-fingered hands, and clear wings on its back. It has a round head that comes to a curved point. It has large baby-blue eyes with thick black rings around them, and a pair of green antennae with blue tips.\r\n\r\nOften found in forests, Celebi is a Mythical Pokémon, known in legend as the \"Voice of the Forest.\" It is able to travel through time and exist simultaneously throughout time, and plant life flourishes wherever it has been. As seen in the anime, it is able to bring deceased Celebi back to life and restore plants to perfect health. Celebi also has the ability to heal wounds. It was shown in [i]Pokémon Colosseum[/i] that Celebi has the power to instantly cause the Purification of any [[Shadow Pokémon]] and can be summoned at Relic Forest with the melody of a Time Flute.\r\n\r\nh4. Tagging notes\r\n\r\nCelebi doesn't really have a [[feral]] form. It's on model form is that of a [[winged humanoid]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[antennae_(anatomy)]]\r\n* [[insect_wings]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n*** [b]Generation II[/b]\r\n**** Legendary beasts\r\n***** [[raikou]]\r\n***** [[entei]]\r\n***** [[suicune]]\r\n**** Tower duo\r\n***** [[lugia]]\r\n***** [[ho-oh]]\r\n**** celebi\r\n\r\nIf you have trouble remembering how to spell this Pokemon's name, try and remember, [b]Cele[/b]bi is a [b]Cele[/b]brity"
