            "wiki_body": "thumb #392708 thumb #178802\r\n\r\n[b]Roserade[/b] (Dex # 407) is a Grass/Poison Pokémon first seen in the Sinnoh region. It evolves from Roselia when exposed to a Shiny Stone, and is the final evolution of Budew. Appearing to wear a cape and a mask, it resembles a masquerade dancer. It also has bouquets for hands.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[budew]]\r\n*** [[roselia]]\r\n**** roserade"
