            "wiki_body": "thumb #806021 thumb #757757 thumb #3136959 thumb #1375894\r\n\"[b]◀[u]Bulbapedia[/u]▶[/b]\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Charizard_(Pokémon)?wprov=sfti1#\r\n\r\n[color=species][b]Mega Charizard X[/b][/color] (Japanese: [color=species][b]メガ リザードン X [i]Mega Rizādon Ekkusu[/i] \"Mega Lizardon X\"[/b][/color]) is a dual-type [color=#EE8130]Fire[/color]/[color=#6F35FC]Dragon[/color] Mega Pokémon. It is one of the [[mega_evolution|Mega evolutions]] of [[Charizard]].\r\n\r\nMega Charizard X looks like a black Charizard, with a blue belly and red eyes. The dark blue membrane of its wings is sharp, and a large claw ends each wing. Its horns are more tapered, with blue tips. Blue claws protrude from each side of its shoulders (one forward, one backward), and spikes also emerge from the back of his neck. The flame at the end of its tail is blue, as are the two jets of flame that emerge from either side of its mouth. The blue color of the flames indicates an extraordinarily high and powerful temperature.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** #0004 [[Charmander]]\r\n** #0005 [[Charmeleon]]\r\n** #0006 [[Charizard]]\r\n*** [[Mega Charizard]]\r\n**** [b]Mega Charizard X[/b]\r\n**** [[Mega Charizard Y]]\r\n*** [[Gigantamax Charizard]]"
