            "wiki_body": "thumb #1021721 thumb #1021815 thumb #1023750 thumb #1023849\r\n\r\n[b]Tsareena[/b] (アマージョ) is a grass-type [[Pokémon]]. It evolves from [[Steenee]], and is in the [i]Grass[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nTsareena is a bipedal, plant-like Pokémon with a feminine humanoid appearance. Its torso, arms, and legs are dark purple, while its hips and head are white. Its wide white hip region resembles a rounded skirt, made up of six segments. On top of its head is a light green calyx. The shortest leaf of the calyx extends slightly forward and then curves to the right, similar to bangs. The other three leaves resemble long hair extending nearly to the ground. On top of the calyx is a growth resembling a small, purple crown. It has heavy-lidded, dark purple eyes with purple eyelids and long eyelashes, but has no visible mouth or nose. The lower part of its face is hidden behind a short ruff extending up from its body. The upper portions of its legs have three pointed projections just before the hips, creating the impression of long boots. The lower portion tapers to its small, pointed feet.\r\n\r\nShiny Tsareena has purple 'hair' and a green torso.\r\n\r\nTsareena is almost always depicted as [[humanoid]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[flora_fauna]]\r\n* [[not_furry]]\r\n* [[wide_hips]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[bounsweet]]\r\n** [[steenee]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Tsareena\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Tsareena"
