            "wiki_body": "Refers to species in the \"cucujiformia\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cucujiformia - an infraorder of [[beetles]] that includes most beetle families that feed on plants, including [[weevil]]s, bark beetles and [[ladybug]]s.\r\n\r\nh2. Families:\r\n* Chrysomeloidea\r\n** Long-horned beetles (Cerambycidae)\r\n** Leaf beetles (Chrysomelidae)\r\n* Cleroidea\r\n** False skin beetle (biphyllidae)\r\n* Coccinelloidea\r\n** Minute bark beetle (Cerylonidae)\r\n** [[Ladybug]] (Coccinellidae)\r\n** Handsome fungus beetle (Endomychidae)\r\n* Cucujoidea\r\n** Flat bark beetle (Cucujidae)\r\n** [[Pleasing fungus beetle]] (Erotylidae)\r\n** Short-winged flower beetle (Kateretidae)\r\n** Lined flat bark beetle (Laemophloeidae)\r\n** Sap beetle (Nitidulidae)\r\n** Shining flower beetle (Phalacridae)\r\n** Silvanids (Silvanidae)\r\n* [[Weevil]]s (Curculionoidea)\r\n* Ship-timber beetles (Lymexylidae)\r\n* Tenebrionoidea\r\n** Blister beetle (Meloidae)\r\n** Fire-coloured beetle (Pyrochroidae)\r\n** Darkling beetle (Tenebrionidae)"
