            "wiki_body": "thumb #909052\r\n\r\n[b]Solgaleo[/b] (ソルガレオ) is a Psychic/Steel-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is one of the two final evolutions of [[Cosmog]] and [[Cosmoem]], and is not in any known egg group.\r\nSolgaleo is a [[Legendary Pokémon]].\r\n\r\nShiny Solgaleo is red instead of white.\r\n\r\nSolgaleo is [[feral]] in its canon form, but the species is frequently [[anthrofied]].\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[lion]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n* [[white_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[cosmog]]\r\n** [[cosmoem]]\r\n** [[lunala]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Solgaleo\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Solgaleo\r\n"
