            "wiki_body": "thumb #806022 thumb #581329 thumb #3695569 thumb #948486\r\n\"[b]◀[u]Bulbapedia[/u]▶[/b]\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Charizard_(Pokémon)?wprov=sfti1#\r\n\r\n[color=species][b]Mega Charizard Y[/b][/color] (Japanese: [color=species][b]メガ リザードン Y [i]Mega Rizādon Wai[/i] \"Mega Lizardon Y\"[/b][/color]) is a dual-type [color=#EE8130]Fire[/color]/[color=#A98FF3]Flying[/color] Mega Pokémon. It is one of the [[mega_evolution|Mega evolutions]] of [[Charizard]].\r\n\r\nMega Charizard Y looks more bestial than Charizard. It has three horns on its head, the middle one being larger than the other two, and spikes protrude from the end of its tail. It has a larger flame and its torn-looking wings are wide-spread. It has small wings on its arms and a fin on its tail.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** #0004 [[Charmander]]\r\n** #0005 [[Charmeleon]]\r\n** #0006 [[Charizard]]\r\n*** [[Mega Charizard]]\r\n**** [[Mega Charizard X]]\r\n**** [b]Mega Charizard Y[/b]\r\n*** [[Gigantamax Charizard]]"
