            "wiki_body": "thumb #16849 thumb #1674318\r\n\r\n[b]Sandshrew[/b] (サンド) is a Ground-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves into [[Sandslash]], and is in the [i]Field[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nSandshrew is a bipedal Pokémon. Its yellow hide is dry, tough, blends in with desert sand, and has a brick pattern, but its underbelly and muzzle are tan. Sandshrew has blue, almond-shaped eyes, a pointed snout, and triangular ears with tan insides. Its tail is thick and conical. It has two long claws on each foot and three sharp claws on its forepaws, which are used to burrow. \r\n\r\nShiny Sandshrew is green.\r\n\r\nSandshrew is [[feral]] in its canon form, but it doesn't take many changes to push it into [[anthro]] instead. The [[semi-anthro]] subtag often applies.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[alolan_sandshrew]]\r\n* [[pangolin]]\r\n* [[shrew]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n* [[yellow_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[sandslash]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Sandshrew\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sandshrew"
