            "wiki_body": "thumb #270492 thumb #2143728\r\n\r\n[b]Zigzagoon[/b] (ジグザグマ) is a Normal-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves into [[Linoone]], and is in the [i]Field[/i] egg group.\r\nIt's its fur consists of brown and beige layers in the shape of a zigzag pattern. And it's overall appearance is similar to that of a japanese raccoon dog, also known as [[tanuki|tanukis]].\r\n\r\nShiny Zigzagoon has orange fur [sup](rust red in earlier generations)[/sup] instead of brown.\r\n\r\nZigzagoon is [[feral]] in its canon form.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[galarian_zigzagoon]]\r\n* [[raccoon]]\r\n* [[raccoon_dog]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[brown_eyes]]\r\n* [[brown_fur]]\r\n* [[fluffy_tail]]\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[linoone]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Zigzagoon\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Zigzagoon\r\n* \"PokemonDatabase: Zigzagoon\":https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zigzagoon"
