            "wiki_body": "thumb #1420536\r\n\r\n[i]Carcharhinus[/i] - the type genus for the family Carcharhinidae ([[requiem_shark|requiem sharks]]).  By comparison this genus is rather large, containing 35 extant species and 8 extinct species, and also contains over half of the species of its family.\r\n\r\nh4. Species:\r\n* [[requiem_shark|Carcharhinidae]]\r\n** [i][[Carcharhinus]][/i]\r\n*** [[caribbean_reef_shark]]\r\n*** [[oceanic_whitetip_shark]]\r\n*** [[blacktip_shark]]\r\n*** [[silvertip_shark]]\r\n*** [[bull_shark]]\r\n*** [[blacktip_reef_shark]]\r\n\r\nh4. More information:\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carcharhinus"
