            "wiki_body": "thumb #2132859\r\n\r\nSingle Strike Style Urshifu (Japanese: いちげきのかた Single Strike Form) is one of the forms of [[Urshifu]]. It is a dual-type Fighting/Dark [[Legendary Pokémon]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n** [b]Generation VIII[/b]\r\n*** [[zacian]]\r\n**** [[hero_of_many_battles_zacian]]\r\n**** [[crowned_sword_zacian]]\r\n*** [[zamazenta]]\r\n**** [[hero_of_many_battles_zamazenta]]\r\n**** [[crowned_shield_zamazenta]]\r\n*** [[eternatus]]\r\n**** [[eternamax eternatus]]\r\n*** [b]The Isle of Armor[/b]\r\n**** [[kubfu]]\r\n***** [[urshifu]]\r\n****** single_strike_style_urshifu\r\n****** [[rapid_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n****** [[gigantamax_urshifu]]\r\n******* [[gigantamax_single_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n******* [[gigantamax_rapid_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n*** [b]The Crown Tundra[/b]\r\n**** [[calyrex]]\r\n**** Galar legendary titans\r\n***** [[regieleki]]\r\n***** [[regidrago]]\r\n**** Galarian legendary birds\r\n***** [[galarian_articuno]]\r\n***** [[galarian_zapdos]]\r\n***** [[galarian_moltres]]"
