            "wiki_preview": "Nokuri are a fan-made species in the Star Wars universe created by Furball. They are half-mammal and...",
            "wiki_body": "Nokuri are a fan-made species in the Star Wars universe created by Furball. They are half-mammal and half-plant, driven home by the fact that all Nokuri have some form of a floral growth from their head. This can range from any type of flower found on their planet or off, or any arrangement of petals or leaves. They do not have hair, but instead what appears to be an arrangement of vines, varying in length anywhere from shoulder length to down to their buttocks.\r\n\r\nNokuri use the frequently use the following tags:\r\nPlant Humanoid, Alien, Mammal\r\nGlowing_Eyes, Flower, Horn, Vines, 4_Fingers, Forehead_Gem, Gloves_(marking) \r\nBreast_Expansion, Lactating, Long_Nipples, Puffy_Areola\r\n\r\nAll Nokuri are considered female in lore. However, functionally they are unisexual; they require two parents for offspring and any Nokuri can act as 'male' or 'female'. Nokuri are able to grow chlorophyll appendages and typically will grow a penis in order to mate. However when they mate it is possible for both the 'male' and 'female' to become pregnant. Accordingly use the following tags for sexuality, when you can see them:\r\n'Female' Form: Female, Multi_Clitoris\r\n'Male' Form: Intersex, Herm, Female_(Lore), Gender_Transformation, Multi_Clitoris, Translucent_Penis, Translucent_Balls, Vaginapenis, Penile_Spines\r\n\r\nNokuri have a long tail with a bulbous portion at the end which contains five lobes. This feature is in a grey area between a Maw and a Pussy. Functionally it is a part of the reproductive cycle of Nokuri. The exterior resembles a maw but the interior resembles a vagina. Use either or both the Tail_Maw and Tail_Pussy tags as appropriate."
