            "wiki_body": "thumb #1894780 thumb #2108531 thumb #3253834\r\n[b]Corviknight[/b] (Japanese: アーマーガア Āmāgā) is a dual-type Flying/Steel Pokémon introduced in Generation VIII, revealed on February 5th, 2019.\r\n\r\nCorviknight is a large [[avian]] [[Pokémon]] that resembles a [[raven]]. Most of its body is lustrous black, but its lower beak and legs have a matte color. Its feathers are tempered with steel. \r\n\r\nIts wings, back, torso, flanks, and scapular feathers are smooth and resemble plate armor. \r\n\r\nCorviknight's talons, head, and upper beak are similarly armored. It has a crest above its eyes that resembles a crown, and a ruff of feathers on its throat that resemble a beard. Its eyes have white pupils, red irises, and black sclerae.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** corviknight\r\n*** [[gigantamax corviknight]]"
