            "wiki_body": "[b]Teddiursa[/b] (Japanese: ヒメグマ Himeguma) is a Normal-type Pokémon. It evolves into [[Ursaring]] starting at level 30.\r\n\r\nTeddiursa is a bipedal, [[ursid|ursine]] Pokémon covered in short, orange-brown fur. Its muzzle is a light tan color with a small black nose and black eyes with white irises. There is a slightly paler tan crescent marking on its face, and it has round ears. It has three claws on its forepaws as well as two claws and yellow paw pads on its hind paws. Its tail is short, round, and puffy.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** teddiursa\r\n*** [[ursaring]]\r\n**** [[ursaluna]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia article on Teddiursa\":https://m.bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Teddiursa"
