            "wiki_body": "thumb #1182074 thumb #1182077 thumb #1527776\r\n\r\nA will-o'-the-wisp, also known as a will-o'-wisp or ignis fatuus (Latin for \"giddy flame\"), is a small, sentient flame or similar object that flies/floats in the air. They are known to flicker about abandoned locations such as shipwrecks, or to follow around those who bear spiritual power like a [[yokai]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[Fire_creature]]\r\n* [[Hitodama]]"
