            "wiki_body": "The Fallen, or Eliksni in their native language, are a nomadic race of four-armed bipedal humanoids. They are a species of pirates and mercenaries located on Earth, the Moon, Venus, and The Reef (later on Mars), and are one of the primary antagonist races in the Destiny series."
