            "wiki_body": "thumb #621635 thumb #191284 thumb #403514\r\n\r\nGyarados is one of the species of [[Pokémon]] creatures from the Pokémon media franchise—a collection of video games, anime, manga, books, trading cards, and other media created by Satoshi Tajiri. As do all Pokémon, Gyarados fight other Pokémon in battles central to the anime, manga, and games of the series.\r\n\r\nGyarados is a [[marine|sea]] [[serpent]]-like Pokémon, resembling an armored blue [[Eastern dragon]]. They are usually depicted as furious, both in temper and in combat ability. [[Shiny pokémon|Shiny Gyarados]] are red.\r\n\r\nIronically, Gyarados evolves from a Pokémon that is widely treated as a punchline due to it being so weak, [[Magikarp]].\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[magikarp]]\r\n*** gyarados\r\n**** [[mega_gyarados]]"
