            "wiki_body": "(\"Tailclops\" is considered a race of itself. See [[tailclops_(race)|here]] for Tailclops as a race.)\r\n\r\nTailclops are humanoid creatures with a single eye, large tails, shark-like teeth, and [[two_tone_skin|skin that changes color]] (typically darkening) towards the end of any extremities. (Originally created by \"Anaid\":http://anaids-tailclops.tumblr.com/)\r\n\r\nThere are races of Tailclops with their own unique features, such as [[longtailclops|Longtailclops]] and [[horned_tailclops|Horned Tailclops]]. (Though offspring produced inter-racially may receive eye coloration from either parent.)\r\n\r\nh4. Races\r\n* [[tailclops_(race)|Tailclops]]\r\n* [[Longtailclops]] \r\n* [[horned_tailclops|Horned Tailclops]]\r\n* [[Huntailclops]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[Cyclops]]\r\n* [[Humanoid]]"
