            "wiki_body": "thumb #2363505 thumb #2358167\r\n\r\nThe [b]gyroid[/b] is an item in the [[Animal Crossing]] series that makes any one of a variety of sounds, as well as a species in the form of Lloid. [[coco (animal crossing)|Coco]] is a [[rabbit]] that looks like a gyroid.\r\n\r\nIncidentally, the same name describes \"a minimal surface\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gyroid discovered by Alan Schoen in 1970 that is useful as a strong and lightweight filling structure."
