            "wiki_body": "thumb #177943 thumb #98234\r\n\r\n[b]Bidoof[/b] (ビッパ) is a Normal-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves into [[Bibarel]], and is in the [i]Water 1[/i] and [i]Field[/i] egg groups.\r\n\r\nShiny Bifood is lighter brown than normal.\r\n\r\nBidoof is [[feral]] in its normal form, but occasionally depicted as [[anthro]] [[pokémorph]].\r\n\r\nBidoof is Gen IV's entry in the tradition of featuring a small Normal-type Pokemon with a two-stage evolution that appear commonly in the area around the starting town of the game (other such Pokemon include [[Rattata]] and [[Zigzagoon]]). Bidoof tends to be disliked among the Pokemon fanbase, largely due to the fact that it appears frequently all over Sinnoh.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[beaver]]\r\n* [[gopher]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[brown_fur]]\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[bibarel]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Bidoof\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Bidoof"
