            "wiki_preview": "thumb #515946   thumb #858274   thumb #1212680   thumb #4377436   thumb #4875147\n\nAn [color=species]...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #515946   thumb #858274   thumb #1212680   thumb #4377436   thumb #4875147\n\nAn [color=species][b]eye creature[/b][/color] is an [[organ creature]] whose body [i]OR[/i] [[for_a_head|head]] consists predominantly of one or more [[eyes]].\n\nh4.Variants\n* A creature whose body mass is distributed mostly on their eyes.\n* A sentient disembodied eye.\n* A gestalt creature made up of several eyeballs.\n* A creature covered head-to-toe in eyes.\n* An [b]eyehead[/b]; An [[object head]] with an eyeball [[for a head]].\n\nh4.Not to be confused with\n* [[cyclops]]\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[eyes]]\n** [[eyeball]]\n** [[1_eye]]\n** [[triclops]]\n** [[multi_eye]]\n* [[monster]]\n* [[not_furry]]"
