            "wiki_body": "thumb #1663885\r\n\r\n[b]Cacturne[/b] (ノクタス) is a Grass/Dark-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It has no known evolutions, and is in the [i]Grass[/i] and [i]Human-Like[/i] egg groups.\r\n\r\nShiny Cacturne is tan colored instead of green.\r\n\r\nCacturne is almost always [[humanoid]], and frequently depicted as a [[pokémorph]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[flora_fauna]]\r\n** [[plant_humanoid]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[spikes]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Cacturne\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Cacturne"
