            "wiki_body": "\"Ferrin species document\":https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iIR8H-WZYaszB4E9PuW8LCpD9MIl_E9L3uyLNGrcY-A/\r\n\r\nFerrin is a creation of \"Demu\":https://e621.net/artist/show?name=demu. They are recognised by a fluffy-ended tail, a stout figure, [[digitigrade]] legs and [[fennec]]-like ears.\r\n\r\nFerrin are not typically [[mammal]]ian, though are often [[anthrofied|depicted with additional humanoid features.]]"
