            "wiki_body": "thumb #1437217 thumb #80140\r\n\r\n[b]Sharpedo[/b] (サメハダー) is a Water/Dark-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves from [[Carvanha]], and is in the [i]Water 2[/i] egg group. It can mega-evolve into [[Mega Sharpedo]].\r\n\r\nIt has a large mouth filled with triangular, [[sharp teeth]]. Its eyes are a deep red color and glow in the dark. It has two gill slits situated directly behind each eye. It is mostly dark blue with a white underbelly. There is a yellow star-shaped marking on its snout, and another star marking on its rear. It has a tall dorsal fin with two notches cut into it, with a pelvic fin directly opposite it.\r\n\r\nShiny Sharpedo is purple instead of blue.\r\n\r\nSharpedo is [[feral]] in its canon form, but the species is often [[anthrofied]].\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[mega_sharpedo]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[fin]]\r\n* [[marine]]\r\n* [[sharp_teeth]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[carvanha]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Sharpedo\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sharpedo"
