            "count": 253,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #1619999 thumb #366926\r\n\r\nElectabuzz (エレブー) is an Electric-type Pokémon. It is mid-evolution b...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1619999 thumb #366926\r\n\r\nElectabuzz (エレブー) is an Electric-type Pokémon. It is mid-evolution between [[elekid]] and [[electivire]], and is in the `Human-like` egg group.\r\n\r\nElectabuzz is a bipedal creature with a few feline traits. It is covered in [[yellow fur]] with [[black stripes]]; a large stripe on its chest is shaped like a lightning bolt. It has a long tail. There are three, clawed toes on its feet; two in front and one in back, while it has five fingers on each hand. Electabuzz has two sharp fangs and a pair of antennae with bulbous ends.\r\n\r\nShiny electabuzz has orange fur instead of yellow.\r\n\r\nElectabuzz is usually depicted as an [[anthro]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[bipedal]]\r\n* [[black_stripes]]\r\n* [[yellow_fur]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[elekid]]\r\n** [[electivire]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Electabuzz\":http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Electabuzz_%28Pok%C3%A9mon%29\r\n"
          },
