            "count": 252,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #284853   thumb #1117378   thumb #2078400   thumb #3908672   thumb #4305395   thumb #4579963  ...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #284853   thumb #1117378   thumb #2078400   thumb #3908672   thumb #4305395   thumb #4579963   thumb #5133762\n\nAn [color=species][b]organ creature[/b][/color] is a creature whose body [i]OR[/i] [[for_a_head|head]] consists predominantly of a [i]OR[/i] multiple of a single [[organs|organ]]. It may have the appearance of a [[severed body part]], depending on anatomical accuracy.\n\nh4.Example of organ creatures \n* [[brain]] — [[brain creature]]\n* [[breasts]] — [[breast creature]]\n** [[boobipede]]\n* ears — [[ear creature]]\n* eyes — [[eye creature]]\n* [[heart_(organ)|heart]] — [[heart creature]]\n* mouth — [[mouth creature]]\n* nose — [[nose creature]]\n* [[penis]] — [[penis creature]]\n* [[pussy]] — [[pussy creature]]\n* skin — [[skin creature]]\n* [[teeth]] — [[tooth creature]]\n* [[tongue]] — [[tongue creature]]\n* [[womb]] — [[womb creature]]\n\nh4.See also\n* [[animate inanimate]]\n* [[animated skeleton]]\n** [[skull creature]]\n* [[blood creature]]\n* [[hair creature]]\n* [[limb creature]]\n* [[living hair]]\n** [[snake hair]]\n* [[living tail]]\n* [[waddling head]]"
