            "wiki_body": "thumb #85204 thumb #1822169\r\n\r\n[b]Sunflora[/b] (キマワリ) is a Grass-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves from [[Sunkern]], and is in the [i]Grass[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nShiny Sunflora is olive green.\r\n\r\nSunflora is usually depicted as a [[flower humanoid]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[flora_fauna]]\r\n** [[flower_(anatomy)]]\r\n** [[flower_creature]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[not_furry]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[sunkern]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Sunflora\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sunflora"
