            "wiki_preview": "[quote]Compact, yet sturdy. Always eager for adventure beyond their scope. Changs come from a myster...",
            "wiki_body": "[quote]Compact, yet sturdy. Always eager for adventure beyond their scope. Changs come from a mysterious advanced civilization, but were often outcasts and seen as troublemakers.[/quote]\n\nOne of the five playable races in [[Atlyss]]. The Change are a race with similar features to rodents, with the character creation allowing Chang to take on features from many different rodent species like mice, squirrels, and possums. Their initial skill is Sturdy. They are also currently the only race that can run and sit on all fours. \n\nThe Chang originate from another game from [[Kiseff]] titled: \"CHANGkaBANG\":https://kiseff.itch.io/changkabang"
