            "wiki_body": "thumb #104266\r\n\r\nBlitzle (シママ) is a Electric-type Pokémon. It evolves into [[zebstrika]], and is in the `Field` egg group.\r\n\r\nShiny blitzle is dark blue instead of black.\r\n\r\nBlitzle is [[feral]] in the canon, but the species is often [[anthrofied]].\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[zebra]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[black_body]]\r\n* [[hooves]]\r\n* [[quadruped]]\r\n* [[white_markings]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[zebstrika]]"
