            "wiki_body": "thumb #1032861 thumb #1033306 thumb #1049950\r\n\r\nThe Guardian [[Deity]] of Akala Island, Tapu Lele is a psychic/fairy-type [[legendary Pokémon]]. Its arms are thin, and its digitless hands are separated by thick pink \"bracelets\". Its shell has markings similar to a face and have small, butterfly-like wings at the back. The top is cone-shaped and resembles a hat of some sort. When closed, the shell resembles a [[insect|bug]] with a [[proboscis|curled mouth]] at the bottom.\r\n\r\nThe guardian of Akala Island is known to scatter glowing scales, affecting others with their healing abilities; however, these scales are also dangerous in high numbers. For this, some consider it cruel as it scatters too many scales for its own amusement. \r\n\r\nSee: [i]\"Bulbapedia's article on Tapu Lele\":http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Tapu_Lele_(Pok%C3%A9mon)[/i]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Legendary Pokémon]]\r\n*** Guardian deities\r\n**** [[Tapu Bulu]]\r\n**** [[Tapu Fini]]\r\n**** [[Tapu Koko]]\r\n**** Tapu Lele"
