            "wiki_body": "Source: https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pyroar_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\n\r\n[b]Nihilego[/b] (Japanese: ウツロイド Uturoid) is a dual-type Rock/Poison Pokémon. \r\n\r\nIt is one of the Ultra Beasts and is known by the code name [b]UB-01 Symbiont[/b].\r\n\r\n\r\nNihilego is an [[Ultra Beast]] that resembles a [[jellyfish]]. The bell is semi-translucent and encircled with several white, star-shaped [[markings]]. The wavy rim of the bell flares outward and is bright blue. Its [[tentacles]] appear gelatinous and give it a vaguely humanoid shape. Several tentacles mesh together forming the appearance of long hair or a cape, while four shorter tentacles resemble shorter hair and arms. Two long tentacles make up the legs of the human-shape. In addition to its shape, it is sometimes seen acting like a young girl.\r\n\r\nNihilego has the ability Beast Boost, which boosts the bearer's highest non-HP stat by one stage upon knocking out a Pokémon. It shares this ability with the other Ultra Beasts.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Ultra Beast]]\r\n*** Nihilego\r\n*** [[Buzzwole]]\r\n*** [[Pheromosa]]\r\n*** [[Xurkitree]]\r\n*** [[Kartana]]\r\n*** [[Celesteela]]\r\n*** [[Guzzlord]]\r\n*** [[Poipole]]\r\n**** [[Naganadel]]\r\n*** [[Stakataka]]\r\n*** [[Blacephalon]]"
