            "wiki_preview": "[b][color=species]Posthumans[/color][/b] are any kind of [[species]] that are descended from [[human...",
            "wiki_body": "[b][color=species]Posthumans[/color][/b] are any kind of [[species]] that are descended from [[human]]s that have gone through extensive biological changes due to years of natural evolution or extensive genetic engineering. As such most would probably be still [[humanoid]]s though some posthuman species have anatomically diverged so far from their ancestors that they can be considered as another body type (like [[feral]]s or even [[serpentine]] for example).\n\n[section,expanded=List of posthumans]\n\n[section=All Tomorrows]\nLineage of posthumans from [i][[All Tomorrows]][/i] ([[C.M. Koseman]])\n* [[Martian (All Tomorrows)|Martian]]\n** [[star person (All Tomorrows)|star person]]\n*** [[blind folk (All Tomorrows)|blink folk]]\n*** [[bone crusher (All Tomorrows)|bone crusher]]\n*** [[colonial (All Tomorrows)|colonial]]\n**** [[modular people]]\n*** [[finger fisher]]\n**** [[sail person (All Tomorrows)|sail person]]\n*** [[flyer (All Tomorrows)|flyer]]\n**** [[pterosapien (All Tomorrows)|pterosapien]]\n*** [[hand flapper]]\n*** [[hedonist (All Tomorrows)|hedonist]]\n**** [[satyriac]]\n*** [[insectophagus]]\n**** [[bug facer]]\n***** [[subject (All Tomorrows)|subject]]\n*** [[lizard herder (All Tomorrows)|lizard herder]]\n*** [[mantelope (All Tomorrows)|mantelope]]\n*** [[lopsider (All Tomorrows)|lopsider]]\n**** [[asymmetric person (All Tomorrows)|asymmetric person]]\n*** [[parasite (All Tomorrows)|parasite]]\n**** [[symbiote (All Tomorrows)|symbiote]]\n*** [[predator (All Tomorrows)|predator]]\n**** [[killer folk (All Tomorrows)|killer folk]]\n*** [[prey (All Tomorrows)|prey]]\n*** [[ruin haunter (All Tomorrows)|ruin haunter]]\n**** [[gravital]]\n***** [[new machine (All Tomorrows)|new machine]]\n*** [[spacer (All Tomorrows)|spacer]]\n**** [[asteromorph (All Tomorrows)|asteromorph]]\n***** [[terrestrial (All Tomorrows)|terrestrial]]\n*** [[strider (All Tomorrows)|strider]]\n*** [[swimmer (All Tomorrows)|swimmer]]\n**** [[tool breeder]]\n*** [[temptor (All Tomorrows)|temptor]]\n*** [[titan (All Tomorrows)|titan]]\n*** [[worm (All Tomorrows)|worm]]\n**** [[snake people (All Tomorrows)|snake people]]\n[/section]\n\nh4. [i][[Fallout]][/i]\n* [[ghoul_(fallout)|ghoul]]\n\nh4. [i][[Kilmandy 8 (MD34)|Kilmandy 8]][/i] ([[MD34]])\n* [[materi]]\n* [[tenebra]]\n\nh4. [i][[Man After Man]][/i] ([[Dougal Dixon]])\n* [[plains dweller (species)|plains dweller]]\n\nh4. [i][[My Hero Academia]][/i] ([[Horikoshi Kohei]])\n* [[quirked_human_(my_hero_academia)|quirked human]]\n\nh4. [i][[SCP Foundation]][/i]\n* [[SCP-1788]] (\"[i]The Adults[/i]\":https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-1788, [color=author]TedlyAnderson[/color])\n* [[SCP-3288]] ([i]Homo anthropophagus[/i]) (\"[i]The Aristocrats[/i]\":https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3288, [color=author]Metaphysician[/color])\n[/section]\n\nh4.See also\n* [[cybernetics]] — Introduction to transhumanism.\n* [[evolution]]\n** [[archaic human]] — The opposite of this tag.\n* [[speculative evolution]] — A genre of fiction.\n** [[speculative species]] — A made up descendant species.\n*** [b]posthuman[/b]\n\nh4.External links\n* \"Posthuman - From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Posthuman"
