            "wiki_body": "(\"Tailclops\" is considered a race of itself. See [[tailclops_(species)|here]] for Tailclops as a species.)\r\n\r\nA race of [[tailclops_(species)|Tailclops]].\r\n\r\nTraits unique to Tailclops (as a race) include: purple eyes and blonde hair. Non-unique traits include: normal sclera, white pupils and average tail length.\r\n\r\n(Offspring produced interracially may receive eye coloration from either parent.)\r\n\r\nh4. Tailclops\r\n* [[tailclops_(species)|Tailclops (Species)]]\r\n** [[Longtailclops]]\r\n** [[horned_tailclops|Horned Tailclops]]\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[Cyclops]]\r\n* [[Humanoid]]"
