            "wiki_preview": "Galarian Meowth ([i]Jp. ニャースガラルのすがた Nyarth Galar form[/i]) is a Steel-type [[Pokémon]]. It is the [[...",
            "wiki_body": "Galarian Meowth ([i]Jp. ニャースガラルのすがた Nyarth Galar form[/i]) is a Steel-type [[Pokémon]]. It is the [[Galarian form]] of [[Meowth]] introduced in [i]Pokémon Sword and Shield[/i]. It evolves into Perrserker.\r\n\r\nLike all Meowth, it is a small, bipedal, [[feline]] Pokémon. Galarian Meowth have shaggy, greyish-brown fur resembling a beard, yellow eyes and a sharp, toothy grin. It has fur on its head resembling viking horns, and the coin on its head is black. It also has black claws that are much longer than those of other Meowth. Galarian Meowth's body has partially turned to iron as a result of many years of living with a race of savage seafarers.\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)]]\r\n** [[Meowth]]\r\n*** [[Gigantamax Meowth]]\r\n*** [[Persian]]\r\n** [[Alolan Meowth]]\r\n*** [[Alolan Persian]]\r\n** [b] Galarian Meowth[/b]\r\n*** [[Perrserker]]"
