            "wiki_body": "thumb #91546 thumb #1553394\r\n\r\n[b]Ludicolo[/b] (ルンパッパ) is a Water/Grass-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is the final evolution of [[Lotad]] and [[Lombre]], and is in the [i]Water 1[/i] and [i]Grass[/i] egg groups.\r\n\r\nShiny Ludicolo has blue body instead of green.\r\n\r\nLudicolo is [[anthro]] (with [[semi-anthro]] subtag) in its canon form. The species is often depicted as a [[pokémorph]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[flora_fauna]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[lotad]]\r\n** [[lombre]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Ludicolo\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Ludicolo"
