            "wiki_body": "thumb #966832 thumb #1339420 thumb #971403\r\n\r\nPyukumuku is a sea cucumber [[Pokémon]] with an ovoid, black body. Its face has two beady, pink eyes and a white mouth shaped roughly like a star or Daimonji. This Pokémon is capable of spitting its organs out through its mouth. The white organs typically take the shape of a fist or stay in the same shape as its mouth. Two lines of three pink spikes run down each side of its back. A fluffy white puff forms its tail.\r\n\r\nSee:\r\n\r\nhttp://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pyukumuku_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/pyukumuku"
