            "wiki_body": "Source: https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Deoxys_(Pokémon)\r\n\r\n[b]Normal Forme Deoxys[/b] is the Forme of [[Deoxys]] that is its most commonly seen Forme. In Gen III, it appears in this form in [i]Pokémon Ruby[/i], [i]Sapphire[/i], [i]Colosseum[/i] and [i]XD[/i].\r\n\r\nIn its Normal Forme, Deoxys has tapering legs with a segmented, vertical, blue stripe on the upper portion. The abdomen is black with vertical lines, while the majority of its skin is reddish-orange. The arms are capable of taking different forms, usually a pair of [[tentacles]] coiled in a double helix. One tentacle is the primary skin color, while the other is light blue. Alternately, it can form more humanoid arms with a red top and blue underside and a [[5_fingers|five-fingered]] hand. This Forme has a blunt protrusion with a single blue stripe on either side of its head and stubby tail.\r\n\r\nAlthough Normal Forme's stats are rather polarised towards attacking and speed, it has less Attack and Special Attack, and more Defense and Special Defense, than its [[deoxys_(attack_form)|Attack Forme]], while having less Speed than the [[deoxys_(speed_form)|Speed Forme]].\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n*** [b]Generation III[/b]\r\n**** [[legendary_titans]]\r\n***** [[regirock]]\r\n***** [[regice]]\r\n***** [[registeel]]\r\n**** [[eon_duo]]\r\n***** [[latias]]\r\n****** [[mega_latias]]\r\n***** [[latios]]\r\n****** [[mega_latios]]\r\n**** [[weather_trio]]\r\n***** [[kyogre]]\r\n***** [[groudon]]\r\n***** [[rayquaza]]\r\n****** [[mega_rayquaza]]\r\n**** [[jirachi]]\r\n**** [[deoxys]]\r\n***** [b]normal_forme_deoxys[/b]\r\n***** [[attack_forme_deoxys]]\r\n***** [[defense_forme_deoxys]]\r\n***** [[speed_forme_deoxys]]"
