            "wiki_body": "thumb #1656270 thumb #84245\r\n\r\n[b]Poliwhirl[/b] (ニョロゾ) is a Water-type Pokémon. It evolves from [[Poliwag]], and can evolve into [[Poliwrath]] or [[Politoed]]. It is in the [i]Water 1[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nPoliwhirl is a blue, bipedal Pokémon with a spherical body. It has bulbous eyes that protrude from the top of its head. A black and white swirl covers its belly, which are actually its organs showing through its thin skin. It appears to have white gloves on its hands and rounded, digit-less feet. \r\n\r\nShiny Poliwhirl is light blue.\r\n\r\nPoliwhirl is one of the Pokémon that do not fit well into any body type category. It should not be tagged as [[feral]] (unless [[feralized]]), as it does not bear any resemblance to real animals. In most cases either [[waddling head]] or [[anthro]] is the best fit.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[frog]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[blue_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[poliwag]]\r\n** [[politoed]]\r\n** [[poliwrath]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Poliwhirl\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Poliwhirl"
