            "wiki_body": "thumb #1664097\r\n\r\nSource: https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Munchlax_(Pokémon)\r\n\r\nMunchlax (Japanese: ゴンベ Gonbe) is a Normal-type Baby Pokémon of the fourth generation.\r\n\r\nMunchlax is a small, stout bipedal Pokémon with a thick, dark green coat. Its lower head, belly, and feet are light yellow. It has two thick arms with five short fingers. It has two large eyes with small black pupils and two large erect ears. Its feet have three claws and a dark yellow pad but are often obscured by the Pokémon's long, disheveled fur.\r\n\r\nLike its evolution Snorlax, Munchlax spends most of its time eating and sleeping, but to a lesser degree. It can move around more easily than its evolution.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** munchlax\r\n*** [[snorlax]]"
