            "wiki_body": "thumb #1664141 thumb #16896\r\n\r\n[b]Magnezone[/b] (ジバコイル) is a Electric/Steel-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is the final evolution of [[Magnemite]] and [[Magneton]], and is in the [i]Mineral[/i] egg group.\r\n\r\nShiny Magnezone is silvery white and has a blue eye.\r\n\r\nMagnezone does not fit well into any of the main body type categories, but the species can usually be tagged as [[living machine]]. In some cases [[robot]] may also apply.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[animate_inanimate]], as Magnezone does not resemble any inanimate object\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[floating]]\r\n* [[magnet]]\r\n* [[metallic_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[magnemite]]\r\n** [[magneton]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Magnezone\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Magnezone\r\n"
