            "wiki_preview": "[b]Abnormalities[/b] (Hangul: 환상체, [i]Hwansangche[/i]) are entities within [[Project Moon]]'s settin...",
            "wiki_body": "[b]Abnormalities[/b] (Hangul: 환상체, [i]Hwansangche[/i]) are entities within [[Project Moon]]'s setting that manifest from the mind of humans, and, as such, reflect an aspect of desires or fears of people. \n\nThey are a central focus of [i][[Lobotomy Corporation]][/i] as a means of acquiring energy to advance the game, and are also prominent in [i]Library of Ruina[/i] as allegories for aspects of the setting and the game's main characters. In [i]Limbus Company[/i] they are boss fights within the game's Cantos (chapters), some of which are variants from alternate dimensions."
