              "wiki_body": "thumb #289261 thumb #57087 thumb #239762\r\n\r\nAmphibians are cold-blooded animals that begin their life in water, then metamorphose for life on land. \r\n\r\nAlmost all amphibians have thin, moist skin that helps them breathe. \r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* amphibian\r\n** [[frog]]\r\n** [[newt]]\r\n** [[salamander]]\r\n** [[toad]]"
