            "wiki_preview": "thumb #2178085\r\n\r\nThe [[skaven|Skaven]] are a race of [[anthro]] [[rat|rat-men]], who inhabit the ca...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2178085\r\n\r\nThe [[skaven|Skaven]] are a race of [[anthro]] [[rat|rat-men]], who inhabit the caves, tunnels, mines, and sewers of the [[Warhammer Fantasy]] world. They control a vast Under-Empire which reaches from the Southlands to Kislev and from Estalia to the Far East.\r\n\r\nThe god of the Skaven is the Horned Rat, whose high priests form the Council of Thirteen. The direct agents of the Council are an order called the [[grey_seer|Grey Seers]]. Most of [[skaven|Skaven]] society is organised into innumerable clans, all of which are ruled by the Council. The four Great clans mercilessly dominate the weaker Warlord clans.\r\n\r\n[[skaven|Skaven]] are usually around four to five feet tall when they stand up straight, although the largest can reach six feet tall. Fur covers their bodies except for their ears, muzzles, hands and fleshy rat tails. Female [[skaven|Skaven]] are rare and, at most, semi-intelligent but are capable of giving birth to huge litters very frequently.\r\n\r\nFur colour indicates a [[skaven|Skaven]]'s role in society. Most [[skaven|Skaven]] are brown or piebald. White or grey is rare and indicates [[grey_seer|leadership]], [[mad_scientist|intelligence]] and especially [[magic_user|sorcerous]] ability. Those with black or dark brown fur tend to be the largest and the colour is considered the mark of a born killer, and most dark furred [[skaven|Skaven]] become elite [[warrior|warriors]] or [[assassin|assassins]].\r\n\r\nFrom \"[i]Lexicanum Maximus Imperialis[/i]\":http://whfb.lexicanum.com/wiki/Skaven.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=List of Skaven characters]\r\n* [[The Horned Rat]] - God of the Skaven.\r\n* [[Thanquol]] and [[Boneripper]] - A powerful (but incompetent) Grey Seer and his Rat Ogre bodyguard.\r\n* [[Queek Headtaker]] - Warlord of Clan Mors.\r\n* [[Ikit Claw]] - Chief Warlock Engineer of Clan Skryre.\r\n* [[Deathmaster Snikch]] - Nightlord of Clan Eshin.\r\n* [[Tretch Craventail]] - Chieftain of Clan Rictus.\r\n* [[Ska Bloodtail]] - Second-in-command of Queek Headtaker and leader of Queek's Crimson Guard.\r\n* Lord [[Skrolk]] - Plague Monk and one of the legendary disciples of decay. Also known as \"Disease-That-Walks\" \r\n[/section]"
