            "wiki_body": "[b]Chinchillas[/b] are two species of crepuscular rodents, slightly larger and more robust than ground squirrels. They are native to the Andes mountains in South America and live in colonies called \"herds\" at high elevations up to 4,270 m.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[rodent]]\r\n*** chinchilla"
