            "wiki_body": "[b]Urshifu[/b] (Japanese: ウーラオス Wulaosu) is a Fighting-type Legendary Pokémon introduced in Generation VIII; it will make its debut in Pokémon Sword and Shield's Isle of Armor expansion. It evolves from Kubfu. Urshifu is also the game mascot of the Isle of Armor.\r\n\r\nUrshifu has two distinct forms, each with their own Gigantamax Form. Urshifu is therefore the only Legendary Pokémon capable of Gigantamaxing and also the only Pokémon with more than one Gigantamax form.\r\n\r\nWhich secondary type and form Urshifu becomes depends on how Kubfu was raised and what choices the player made on their journey. Urshifu's Single Strike Style is Fighting/Dark, and its Rapid Strike Style is Fighting/Water.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n** [b]Generation VIII[/b]\r\n*** [[zacian]]\r\n**** [[hero_of_many_battles_zacian]]\r\n**** [[crowned_sword_zacian]]\r\n*** [[zamazenta]]\r\n**** [[hero_of_many_battles_zamazenta]]\r\n**** [[crowned_shield_zamazenta]]\r\n*** [[eternatus]]\r\n**** [[eternamax eternatus]]\r\n*** [b]The Isle of Armor[/b]\r\n**** [[kubfu]]\r\n***** urshifu\r\n****** [[single_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n****** [[rapid_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n****** [[gigantamax_urshifu]]\r\n******* [[gigantamax_single_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n******* [[gigantamax_rapid_strike_style_urshifu]]\r\n*** [b]The Crown Tundra[/b]\r\n**** Galarian legendary birds\r\n***** [[galarian_articuno]]\r\n***** [[galarian_zapdos]]\r\n***** [[galarian_moltres]]\r\n**** Galar legendary titans\r\n***** [[regieleki]]\r\n***** [[regidrago]] \r\n**** [[glastrier]] \r\n**** [[spectrier]] \r\n**** [[calyrex]] \r\n***** [[ice_rider_calyrex]] \r\n***** [[shadow_rider_calyrex]] "
