              "wiki_body": "A tag specifically for actual [[Digimon]] that ignores things like symbols and paraphernalia.  \r\n\r\nUse this tag for things like:\r\n\r\n* a picture of a [[Renamon]]\r\n* a picture of a Digimon [[fan character]] or [[Digimorph]] \r\n\r\nThis tag [b]should not[/b] be used for images that don't depict Digimon, such as:\r\n\r\n* a picture of an original character with a [[Digivice]] that does not depict actual Digimon\r\n* a picture of an original character with a vague symbol associated with the Digimon series but no actual Digimon species being used as an item or symbol. Major symbols often used in the series include:\r\n** [[digimon_crest]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_courage]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_destiny]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_friendship]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_hope]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_kindness]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_knowledge]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_light]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_love]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_miracles]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_reliability]]\r\n*** [[crest_of_sincerity]]\r\n** [[digital_hazard]]\r\n** [[mark_of_evil]]\r\n** [[zero_unit]]\r\n*** [[inverted_zero_unit]]\r\n* an original character dressed up as a human character such as [[Takato Matsuki]] or other kind of [[cosplay]] that doesn't involve a species of Digimon.\r\n\r\nIn short, don't put this on posts that show only vague symbols from the franchise, use it only when Digimon themselves are depicted.  For symbols, human character cosplay, and so on, use the umbrella [[Digimon]] tag.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[digimon]]"
