              "wiki_body": "\"Flamedramon\":http://digimon.wikia.com/wiki/Flamedramon is a [[Dragon]] [[Man]] [[Digimon]].\r\n\r\nFlamedramon is a [[biped|bipedal]] creature with [[blue skin]] that looks like a grown version of [[Veemon]]. It wears [[armor]] on its face, chest, thighs, hands, and feet, with a [[spikes|spike]] protruding from its face, and [[claws]] from its hands. The armor is covered with [[fire|flame]]-like designs. The forehead spike and the armor's flame design are references to the Digi-[[Egg]] of Courage, with which it is intimately associated. It wears [[belt|belts]] on its upper arms.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4.See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[DemiVeemon]]\r\n** [[Veemon]]\r\n** Flamedramon\r\n** [[Raidramon]]\r\n** [[Magnamon]]\r\n*** [[ExVeemon]]\r\n**** [[Paildramon]]\r\n***** [[Imperialdramon]]"
