                "wiki_body": "X-digimon are species of [[digimon (species)|Digimon]] mutated by a vaccine. Originally injected to gain immunization from the X-program, a termination program made to eliminate Digimon, many Digimon become more powerful than their original counterparts. They are often differentiated by their \"X\" suffix, though some Digimon are natural carriers of this vaccine and don't have an \"original\", unaltered form.\n\nThose who have the X-antibody tend to have similar markings, often having the letter X or an X-like marking placed upon their bodies.\n\nh4. Species\n\nh6. Natural X-Digimon\n\n* [[dodomon]]\n** [[dorimon]]\n*** [[dorumon]]\n**** [[dorugamon]]\n***** [[dorugreymon]]\n****** [[dorugoramon]]\n* [[alphamon]]\n\nh6. Created (\"vaccined\") X-Digimon\n\n[section=Agumon and Gabumon lines]\nh5.Regular\n\n* [[agumon_x]], alteration of [[agumon]]\n** [[greymon_x]], alteration of [[greymon]]\n*** [[metalgreymon_x]], alteration of [[metalgreymon]]\n**** [[wargreymon_x]], alteration of [[wargreymon]]\n\n* [[gabumon_x]], alteration of [[gabumon]]\n** [[garurumon_x]], alteration of [[garurumon]]\n*** [[weregarurumon_x]], alteration of [[weregarurumon]]\n**** [[metalgarurumon_x]], alteration of [[metalgarurumon]]\n\n* [[omnimon_x]], alteration of [[omnimon]]\n\nh5.Black variants\n\n* [[black_agumon_x]], alteration of [[black_agumon]]\n[/section]\n[section=Lopmon and Terriermon lines]\n* [[lopmon_x]], alteration of [[lopmon]]\n\n* [[terriermon_x]], alteration of [[terriermon]]\n\n* [[cherubimon_(good)_x]], alteration of [[cherubimon_(good)]]\n* [[cherubimon_(evil)_x]], alternation of [[cherubimon_(evil)]]\n[/section]\n* [[betamon_x]], alteration of [[betamon]]\n* [[gazimon_x]], alteration of [[gazimon]]\n* [[gomamon_x]], alteration of [[gomamon]]\n* [[guilmon_x]], alteration of [[guilmon]]\n** [[growlmon_x]], alteration of [[growlmon]]\n*** [[wargrowlmon_x]], alteration of [[wargrowlmon]]\n**** [[gallantmon_x]], alteration of [[gallantmon]]\n* [[leomon_x]], alteration of [[leomon]]\n* [[renamon_x]], alteration of [[renamon]]\n* [[rosemon_x]], alteration of [[rosemon]]\n* [[salamon_x]], alteration of [[salamon]]\n** [[gatomon_x]], alteration of [[gatomon]]\n* [[tokomon_x]], alteration of [[tokomon]]\n\nh4. Links\nhttps://digimon.fandom.com/wiki/X-Antibody\nhttps://wikimon.net/X-Antibody\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[digimon]]\n** [[digimon_(species)]]"
