              "wiki_preview": "\"Lopmon\":http://digimon.wikia.com/wiki/Lopmon_(Tamers) is a Rookie-level Animal [[Digimon]], and is ...",
              "wiki_body": "\"Lopmon\":http://digimon.wikia.com/wiki/Lopmon_(Tamers) is a Rookie-level Animal [[Digimon]], and is very similar in appearance to [[Terriermon]].\r\n\r\nLopmon resembles a lop-eared [[rabbit]]. Her \"twin sibling\" Terriermon is very similar in appearance, as both are considered to be \"bunny-like\". While Terriermon is an over-confident sort, with the personality of a terrier-like [[dog]], and tends to make sarcastic remarks, Lopmon is shy and polite.\r\n\r\nh4.See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Kokomon]]\r\n** Lopmon\r\n*** [[Turuiemon]]\r\n**** [[Antylamon]]\r\n***** [[Cherubimon (Good)]]\r\n***** [[Cherubimon (Evil)]]"
