ers]] or [[long_ears]]/[[pointy_ears]]\n* Lore based species classifications that use terms such as \"dragon type\" from franchises such as [[pokemon]] or [[digimon]]. Many such species do not resemble dragons at all.\n\nh4. Related:\n\n* [[ambient_dragon]]\n* [[flesh_whiskers]]\n* [[lizard]]\n* [[mane]]\n* [[orb]]\n* [[serpentine]]\n* [[snake]]\n* [[tail_tuft]]\n\n\nh4. See also:\n\n* [[amphisbaena]]\n* [[chimera]]\n* [[deity]]\n* [[draconcopode]]\n* [[mythological_creature]]\n* [[scalie]]\n\n* [[Tag Group:Fictional Species]]"
