            "wiki_body": "thumb #536013 thumb #451402\r\n\r\n[b]Dragonair[/b] (ハクリュー) is a Dragon-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is a mid-evolution between [[Dratini]] and [[Dragonite]], and is in the [i]Water 1[/i] and [i]Dragon[/i] egg groups.\r\n\r\nDragonair is a long, [[serpentine]] Pokémon with sky blue scales and a white underside. Its violet eyes are dark and glossy. It has a smooth, rounded snout and a small, white [[horn]] on its forehead. Its head is flanked by two small, stylized wings, which are white and curve into a swirl at the base. Three blue, crystal orbs, one on its neck and two on its tail, adorn its body. \r\n\r\nShiny Dragonair is pink instead of blue.\r\n\r\nDragonair is a [[serpentine]] [[feral]] in its canon form.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[head_wings]]\r\n* [[horn]]\r\n* [[white_belly]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[dratini]]\r\n** [[dragonite]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Dragonair\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Dragonair"
