            "tag": "airplane_dragon",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 184,
            "wiki_preview": "Characters with a draconic body shape with features of an aircraft (eg: airplane wings, [[propeller|...",
            "wiki_body": "Characters with a draconic body shape with features of an aircraft (eg: airplane wings, [[propeller|propellers]], [[visor|visors]], [[tail_fin|tail fins]], etc), often furred, cybernetic, and/or synthetic, but can be biological as well. Created by \"SCPKid\":[https://x.com/scpkidd], but does not claim to own the idea or be the creator of anthro planes or dragon airplane hybrids. Though the species is called \"Airplane dragon\", it is not limited to airplanes specifically. Helicopters, space shuttles, and the like still count.\n\n[b]Must[/b] have at least some [[dragon]]-like features as well, like claws, paws, snout, body shape, head/face/snout shape, etc. If it has no draconic qualities, it is likely an [[animate_inanimate|animate inanimate]] or a [[dire_machine|dire machine]]. For more information on what qualifies as 'dragon-like', see [[dragon]]. It may not use wings as arms, though the inverse is allowed. For example: thumb #5453037 has both wings and arms, so is an airplane dragon. thumb #5438079 uses arms as wings, which qualifies. The wings may also come off of the arms as in thumb #866906. All while thumb #5167510 does not.\n\n[section=SCPKid's original description]\n[quote]\n[b]Airplane Dragons[/b], also known as plane dragons! plane dragons live in an peaceful society where they live on and eat clouds, so they have infinite resources and share it all! (airplane fuel and rainbows are treats) their origin is unknown, and it is up to you to imagine if your airplane is orgainic, mechanical, or both! they often visit the ground of Earth, but many spend most of their life in the skies. they also have a love for racing.\n\nplane dragons can be designed in anyway you want. they are designed as a free and open species, meaning you can make as many as you would like without permission, and to fit your preferences! they can be any colors, markings, body type, or size, from the size of a person to a real life airplane. they can be based on a real life aircraft or made completely from scratch. you can use them in art, stories, roleplay, fursuits, merch, etc. you may take commissions of them, sell adopts, ychs, sell merch, create nsfw content. all i ask is for credit (scpkid) when it feels fair, and for you to avoid any designs that are hateful/offensive.\n\nart & species by scpkid. feel free to save and repost/share this image. please do not remove the credit\n[/quote]\n[quote]\nthey can have any style of claws/paws. draw whatever you like best\n[/quote]\n[quote]\nairplane dragons have a wide variety of head shapes! they can be jagged cartoony mouths or actual teeth, they can wear visors (or built in). hairstyles, and ears! they don't have to be just airliners or jets. they can be space shuttles and helicopters even\n[/quote]\n[quote]\nany body type/shape! any wing shape as well\n[/quote]\n[quote]\nnot always fluffy. can be completely mechanical or robotic\n[/quote]\n[/section]\n\n[section=More Examples]\nthumb #5190928 thumb #4695654 thumb #5358061 thumb #4677090 thumb #4661073\n[/section]\n\nh4. See also\n\n[[animate_inanimate]]\n[[dire_machine]]\n[[dragon]]\n[[furred_dragon]]\n\nh4. Links\n\n\"SCPKid's page on the species\":[https://toyhou.se/4551241.airplane-dragons]"
