            "count": 173,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #3106369 thumb #3106372\r\n\r\nFlute Dragons are an open species by [[input-command]]. They tend t...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3106369 thumb #3106372\r\n\r\nFlute Dragons are an open species by [[input-command]]. They tend to have an [[eastern dragon]] body with two toes on their hind feet and three toes/fingers on their fore feet/hands. They have no mouth, instead using flute-like holes on their neck to breath, and feed off emotions (especially negative, such as fear).\r\n\r\nSee: \r\n* \"Tumblr ref\":https://input-command.tumblr.com/post/190370599262/\r\n* \"Twitter ref\":https://twitter.com/inputcommand/status/1310490926721064963"
