            "tag": "fatalis",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 163,
            "wiki_preview": "Source: http://monsterhunter.wikia.com/wiki/Fatalis\r\n\r\nFatalis is a [[Elder_Dragon]] introduced in M...",
            "wiki_body": "Source: http://monsterhunter.wikia.com/wiki/Fatalis\r\n\r\nFatalis is a [[Elder_Dragon]] introduced in Monster Hunter.\r\n\r\nFatalis is a traditional black dragon, with a long, serpentine neck and tail, along with a pair of large wings. Its body is covered in rigid black scales and lined with white spines. Its head features four backwards-facing horns and a row of enlarged bottom teeth.\r\n\r\nFatalis is an extremely powerful monster, able to wipe out entire hunting parties with relative ease. Its primary means of defense is its ability to breathe a stream of fire and launch flaming projectiles, which explode upon impact. It is also able to release a cloud of flammable dust, similar to Teostra, and set it alight. It is known to use its whip-like tail to batter enemies, and its powerful bone crushing jaws to bite at nearby attackers.\r\n\r\nFatalis is extremely hostile to all living creatures, especially humans.\r\n\r\nFatalis has only been observed at the ruins of Castle Schrade, and the natural environment from whence it came is completely unknown."
