            "count": 162,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #4059799 thumb #1848504 thumb #3820724\r\n\r\n[[Dragons]] in the [[Warcraft]] universe possess the...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #4059799 thumb #1848504 thumb #3820724\r\n\r\n[[Dragons]] in the [[Warcraft]] universe possess the ability to shapeshift into different forms, typically those of the mortal races. This form is referred to as one's [i]visage[/i]. It is possible to have multiple visages. [[Onyxia_(Warcraft)|Onyxia]] and [[Deathwing]] used different forms to manipulate the Kingdom of Stormwind. Some dragonkin, such as the [[Dracthyr]], also have this ability.\r\n\r\nVisages often, but not always, have features that allude to their draconic nature such as horns or glowing eyes. Dracthyr visages may be slightly different with scales and unusual pointed ears.\r\n\r\nNotable characters with visage forms include [[Alexstrasza]] (left) and [[Ysera]] (right).\r\n\r\nthumb #1821370 thumb #1430169 \r\n\r\n[b]Note:[/b] [[demon_hunter_(warcraft)|Demon hunters]] may have horns and scaled skin, but these are distinct from visage forms."
