            "count": 158,
            "wiki_preview": "The [b]qunari[/b] are a [[humanoid]] fantasy race featured in the [[Dragon Age]] series. Qunari is t...",
            "wiki_body": "The [b]qunari[/b] are a [[humanoid]] fantasy race featured in the [[Dragon Age]] series. Qunari is technically the term for followers of the philosophy/religion known as Qun, but it is more commonly used to describe the otherwise unnamed species that makes up most of Qun's adherents. Qunari are taller and more muscular than humans, and have [[white hair]] and skin tones in various shades of [[brown_skin|brown]], [[grey_skin|grey]], and [[silver_skin|silver]]. Many qunari have at least two [[horn|horns]], but a small amount are born without or have them removed."
