            "wiki_body": "One of the [[Neopet]] species, resembling a cross between a [[lagomorph|lop]] and a [[Eastern dragon|Chinese dragon]]. Depicted as bipeds, Zafara possess long ears (usually drooping), powerful legs with large feet, a long tail ending in a fin, a svelte form, and cream- or yellow-colored fur on their front from their crotch to their chin.\r\n\r\nThe species was originally created by a [i]Neopets[/i] player for a create-a-pet contest early in the game's life."
