              "wiki_body": "thumb #1857408 thumb #2206289 thumb #2039683 thumb #2578234 thumb #3654329 thumb #4420727 thumb #5061769 thumb #5366855\n\nA [b]demon[/b] is a spiritual creature, either beneficent or maleficent, present in many beliefs, influencing [[human|humans]] while escaping their control when [[summoning|summoned]] or otherwise.\n\nThese entities in mythology are very often [i](if not all the time represented as)[/i] evil, they are endowed with reason and can emanate from places or people (e.g. the [[Yokai|Yōkai]] in Japan), being able to influence human [[soul|souls]] or the places they pass through and being able to [[body control|control bodies]].\n\nh5. In the context of this tag\n[b]Demons[/b] are evil hellspawns that tend to have at least one or two of the following traits:\n* Having either a bestial or [[monster|monstrous]] shape.\n* Having a discolored skin (typically [[red skin|red]]).\n* Having [[horn|horns]].\n* Having [[claws]].\n* Having [[wings]].\n* Having a [[spade tail]].\n\nh6. They typically possess some form of [[supernatural]] [[magic|power(s)]].\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[demon_humanoid]] - For when a demon mainly resembles a [[human]] with demonic traits and/or colored skin.\n* [[monstrous_demon]] - demon with very monstrous appearance\n* [[demonic]]\n* [[shoulder_devil]]\n* [[caprine_demon]]"
