                "wiki_preview": "Reptiles are animals in the class Reptilia. They are characterized by breathing air, laying shelled ...",
                "wiki_body": "Reptiles are animals in the class Reptilia. They are characterized by breathing air, laying shelled eggs, and having skin covered in scales and/or scutes. Reptiles are classically viewed as having a \"cold-blooded\" metabolism. They are tetrapods, either having four limbs or being descended from four-limbed ancestors. \r\n\r\nGeneral tag [b][[Scalie]][/b]\r\n\r\nh4. See other rankings:\r\n\r\n* [[Avian]]\r\n* [[Bovine]]\r\n* [[Canine]]\r\n* [[Cervine]]\r\n* [[Cetacean]]\r\n* [[Equine]]\r\n* [[Feline]]\r\n* [[Hooves]]\r\n* [[Mammal]]\r\n* [[Marsupial]]\r\n* [[Mustelid]]\r\n* [[Primate]]\r\n* [[Rodent]]\r\n* [[Scalie]]\r\n"
