              "wiki_preview": "thumb #930025 thumb #1861458 thumb #2776447 thumb #1728147 thumb #664203\n\nThe [[tag_group:body_types...",
              "wiki_body": "thumb #930025 thumb #1861458 thumb #2776447 thumb #1728147 thumb #664203\n\nThe [[tag_group:body_types|body type]] of a character that closely resembles a human in anatomy and/or form but also has some added visible features that are strictly non-human.\nHumanoids are generally [[not furry]], with the exception of [[animal humanoid|animal humanoids]] and [[animal head]] characters.\n\nHumanoids are always upright, usually have a featherless/ furless/ scaleless upper body, have at least one set of hands or arms that articulate like a human's, and will usually have a flat more or less vaguely [[human]] facial shape with the exception of [[for_a_head|object & animal head]] characters.\n\nTypically what counts as humanoid, but is not limited to:\n* Fantasy species such as [[dwarf|dwarves]], [[elf|elves]], [[fairy|fairies]], [[goblin|goblins]], and [[orc|orcs]].\n* Human-like [[alien|aliens]], [[angel|angels]], [[demon|demons]], [[gargoyle|gargoyles]], [[monster|monsters]], [[robot|robots]], and [[undead]].\n* Human-like Pokémon like [[Jynx]], [[Gardevoir]], and [[Meloetta]].\n* [[animal_humanoid|animal humanoids]], [[monster_girl_(genre)|monster girls]], and other forms of moe-esque anthropomorphism.\n* [[animal_head|Animal head]], [[object_head|object head]], and other creatures with non-human heads on human bodies.\n* Legless human-like [[genie|genies]], [[ghost|ghosts]], and [[lamia]].\n\nh4. Not to be confused with:\n\n* [[anthro]]\n* [[biped]]\n* [[human]]\n\n[quote]\nh4. Note that for tagging purposes, a character cannot be both [[anthro]] and humanoid.\n* With the exception of [[transformation_sequence|transformation sequences]] where a character transforms from anthro to humanoid, or vice versa.\n[/quote]\n\n\nh4. Tags About Humanoids\n\n[section=Types of humanoid]\n\n* [[animal_humanoid]]\n** [[animal_head]]\n** [[animal_legs|animal_legged_humanoid]]\n* [[elemental_humanoid]]\n** [[air_humanoid]]\n** [[fire_humanoid]]\n** [[fungi_hum