              "wiki_body": "thumb #1793312 thumb #1398224 thumb #120053 thumb #48549 thumb #1753205\r\n\r\nOtherwise known as the horse family, Equidae comprises all species of equid as well as extinct species and fictional ones.  Equids are members of the order Perissodactyla, or odd-toed ungulates, along with [[tapir|tapirs]] and [[rhinocerotid|rhinoceroses]].  This family first arose about 54 million years ago during the early Eocene epoch.  Most members of this family are extinct, with all extant members belonging to the [[equine|equinae]] subfamily and, more specifically, the [i]Equus[/i] genus.  Notable members of the Equidae family include the domestic [[horse]], [[donkey]], and various species of [[zebra]], though the [[unicorn]] and derivatives tend to look very horselike.  A summary of their taxonomy is listed below.\r\n\r\nh4. Subfamilies, genera, and species:\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[equid|equidae]]\r\n*** [[eohippus]]\r\n*** anchitheriinae\r\n**** [[mesohippus]]\r\n*** [[equine|equinae]]\r\n**** [[hipparion]]\r\n**** equus (genus)\r\n***** [[asinus]] (subgenus)\r\n****** [[stilt-legged_onager]] (E. calobatus, extinct)\r\n****** [[european_ass]] (E. hydruntinus, extinct)\r\n****** [[pygmy_onager]] (E. tau, extinct)\r\n****** [[african_wild_ass]] (E. africanus)\r\n******* [[nubian_wild_ass]] (E. a. africanus)\r\n******* [[somali_wild_ass]] (E. a. somaliensis)\r\n******* [[atlas_wild_ass]] (E. a. atlanticus, extinct)\r\n******* [[donkey]] (E. a. asinus)\r\n****** [[onager]] (E. hemionus)\r\n******* [[mongolian_wild_ass]] (E. h. hemionus)\r\n******* [[indian_wild_ass]] (E. h. khur)\r\n******* [[turkmenian_kulan]] (E. h. kulan)\r\n******* [[persian_onager]] (E. h. onager)\r\n******* [[syrian_wild_ass]] (E. h. hemippus, extinct)\r\n****** [[kiang]] (E. kiang)\r\n******* [[western_kiang]] (E. k. kiang)\r\n******* [[eastern_kiang]] (E. k. holdereri)\r\n******* [[southern_kiang]] (E. k. polyodon)\r\n******* [[northern_kiang]] (E. k. chu)\r\n***** equus (subgenus)\r\n****** [[wild_horse]] (E. ferus)\r\n******* [[tarpan]] (E. f. ferus)\r\n******* [[przewalski's_horse]] (E. f. przewalskii)\r\n******* [[horse|(domestic) horse]] (E. f. caballus)\r\n******** [[american_paint_horse]]\r\n******** [[appaloosa]]\r\n******** [[andalusian]]\r\n******** [[miniature_horse]]\r\n******** [[arabian_horse]]\r\n******** [[quarter_horse]]\r\n******** [[morgan_horse]]\r\n******** [[pony]]\r\n********* [[shetland_pony]]\r\n******** [[draft_horse]]\r\n********* [[north_swedish_horse]]\r\n********* [[fjord_horse]]\r\n********* [[belgian_draft_horse]]\r\n********* [[friesian]]\r\n********* [[clydesdale]]\r\n********* [[shire]]\r\n********* [[vladimir_heavy_draft_horse]]\r\n********* [[soviet_heavy_draft_horse]]\r\n********* [[russian_heavy_draft_horse]]\r\n********* [[italian_heavy_draft_horse]]\r\n****** hippotigris (subgenus)\r\n******* [[plains_zebra]] (E. quagga)\r\n******** [[quagga]] (E. q. quagga, extinct)\r\n******** [[burchell's_zebra]] (E. q. burchellii)\r\n******** [[grant's_zebra]] (E. q. boehmi)\r\n******** [[selous'_zebra]] (E. q. selousi)\r\n******** [[maneless_zebra]] (E. q. borensis)\r\n******** [[chapman's_zebra]] (E. q. chapmani)\r\n******** [[crawshay's_zebra]] (E. q. crawshayi)\r\n******* [[mountain_zebra]] (E. zebra)\r\n******** [[cape_mountain_zebra]] (E. z. zebra)\r\n******** [[hartmann's_mountain_zebra]] (E. z. hartmannae)\r\n****** dolichohippus (subgenus)\r\n******* [[grévy's_zebra]] (E. grevyi)\r\n\r\nh4. Hybrids:\r\n* [[mule]]\r\n* [[zebroid]]\r\n** [[zorse]]\r\n** [[zonkey]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related:\r\n* [[bat_pony]]\r\n* [[nightmare_(species)]]\r\n* [[unicorn]]\r\n* [[winged_unicorn]]\r\n* [[earth_pony]]\r\n* [[centaur]]\r\n* [[pterippus]] / [[pegasus]]\r\n\r\nh4. Equid equipment:\r\n* [[blinders]] (aka blinkers)\r\n** [[blinker_hood]]\r\n* [[halter]]\r\n** [[bridle]]\r\n* [[reins]]\r\n* [[saddle]]\r\n* [[tail_wraps]]\r\n\r\nh4. Notable characters:\r\n* [[pegasus_(greek_mythology)]]\r\n* [[sleipnir]]\r\n\r\nh4. More inform