                "wiki_body": "thumb #1658142 thumb #3755 thumb #1242844\r\n\r\nVombatiformes, a suborder of diprodont [[marsupial|marsupials]].  These animals are characterized by their compact body and being otherwise \"wombat-shaped\" as the name describes.  Most of the members of this suborder are extinct, though the [[koala]] and three species of [[wombat]] are still around today.\r\n\r\nh4. Families, genera, and species:\r\n* [[marsupial]]\r\n** diprodontia (order)\r\n*** [[vombatiform|vombatiformes]] (suborder)\r\n**** [[koala]]\r\n**** [[wombat]]\r\n**** thylacoleonidae\r\n***** [[thylacoleo]]\r\n\r\nh4. More information:\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vombatiformes"
