              "wiki_preview": "thumb #840696 thumb #831616 thumb #2463144 thumb #3431648\r\n\r\nA monster is any fictional creature -- ...",
              "wiki_body": "thumb #840696 thumb #831616 thumb #2463144 thumb #3431648\r\n\r\nA monster is any fictional creature -- usually found in myths, legends, or most types of fiction -- that's often depicted in-universe as having an eldritch/hideous appearance, and is capable of producing physical harm through its actions or mental fear through just its looks.\r\n\r\nAdd this tag only if the creature's appearance is at least somewhat monstrous (e.g., a [[skull_head|skull-headed]] [[demon]] counts but not a [[demon humanoid]]). For example, most [i][[Undertale]][/i] characters and [[kaiju]] do not belong under this tag despite being called \"monsters\" in the game and translated name, respectively.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n* [[monstrous_humanoid]] - Monsters who more resemble humans than anything but.\r\n* [[tentacle_monster]] - Exactly what it says on the tin.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n* [[monster_energy]] - The energy drink.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[nightmare_fuel]]\r\n* [[teratophilia]]\r\n* [[undead]]\r\n* [[where_is_your_god_now]]"
            }
