              "wiki_preview": "thumb #2666821 thumb #2633836 thumb #1593080 thumb #2135248 thumb #3052224 thumb #3717922\r\n\r\n[b]Feli...",
              "wiki_body": "thumb #2666821 thumb #2633836 thumb #1593080 thumb #2135248 thumb #3052224 thumb #3717922\r\n\r\n[b]Felid humanoids[/b] (colloquially known as nekomimi, or catgirls/catboys) are [[animal humanoid]] characters who possess features of species from the cat family, this almost always includes a pair of feline ears and a feline tail. In addition to ears and tails, they may have other feline features, such as [[whiskers]], [[sharp teeth]], [[fangs]], [[slit pupils]], and/or [[claws]]. They may also have paw-like hands, patches of fur on their skin, hair patterned after feline fur, they may have markings on their skin (such as stripes or spots), or they may even appear to have a thin layer of fur covering their entire body.\r\n\r\n[quote]h5. Tagging Notes\r\n\r\n* If a character has full-body markings or appears to be covered in fur, and [b]has an animal-like nose[/b], they should be tagged as [[anthro]], [b]not [/b]as animal humanoid\r\n** A character with a snout and/or animal shaped head should always be tagged as [[anthro]], not [[animal humanoid]]\r\n* Animal humanoids should never be tagged [[anthro]] or [[human]]\r\n* If the character appears to be in costume use [[fake cat ears]] and/or [[fake cat tail]] instead[/quote]\r\n\r\nWhile most commonly these characters have ambiguous feline or [[domestic cat]] features, this is an umbrella tag, and includes any animal humanoid that has features of species that fall under [i]Felidae[/i], this includes big cats ([i]Pantherinae[/i]) and small cats ([i]Felinae[/i]), as well as fictional felid-humanoid species and mythological creatures, see the section below.\r\n\r\nh4. Types of Felid Humanoids\r\n\r\nh6. [b][[Feline Humanoid]] - \"Small Cats\"[/b]\r\n* [[cat humanoid]]\r\n* [[caracal humanoid]]\r\n* [[cheetah humanoid]]\r\n* [[cougar humanoid]]\r\n* [[sand cat humanoid]]\r\n* [[serval humanoid]]\r\n* [[lynx humanoid]]\r\n* [[leopardus humanoid]] (not to be confused with \"leopard humanoid\")\r\n** [[ocelot humanoid]]\r\n** [[margay humanoid]]\r\n\r\nh6. [b][[Pantherine Humanoid]] - \"Big Cats\"[/b]\r\n* [[jaguar humanoid]]\r\n* [[lion humanoid]]\r\n* [[leopard humanoid]]\r\n** [[snow leopard humanoid]]\r\n** [[clouded leopard humanoid]]\r\n* [[tiger humanoid]]\r\n* [[jaguar humanoid]]\r\n\r\n* [b]Fictional/Mythological[/b]\r\n** [[ctarl-ctarl]] - felid-humanoid species from the anime [[Outlaw Star]]\r\n** [[fellpool]] - felid-humanoid species from the game [[Star Ocean]]\r\n** [[manticore humanoid]]\r\n** [[sphinx humanoid]]\r\n\r\nh6. Related Tags\r\n* [[animal humanoid]]\r\n** [[mammal humanoid]]\r\n* [[felid]]\r\n** [[feline]]\r\n** [[pantherine]]\r\n\r\nh4.See Also\r\n\r\n* [[humanoid]]\r\n* [[anthro]]\r\n* [[feral]]\r\n* [[human]]\r\n* [[not furry]]\r\n* [[taur]]"
