              "wiki_preview": "A nekomata (猫股 or 猫又) is a creature from Japanese mythology that resembles a cat with two tails inst...",
              "wiki_body": "A nekomata (猫股 or 猫又) is a creature from Japanese mythology that resembles a cat with two tails instead of one. Its name means \"forked cat\".\r\n\r\nUse this tag for cats ([[feral]] or [[anthro|otherwise]]) shown with two tails.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[kitsune]] (defunct tag)\r\n* [[meowstic]]\r\n* [[multi_tail]]\r\n* [[tag group:species]]\r\n** [[tag group:fictional species]]\r\n* Wikipedia: \"Nekomata\":https://secure.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/wiki/Nekomata\r\n"
