            "wiki_body": "thumb #152414 thumb #595017 thumb #231544\r\n\r\nTag [b]ambiguous_species[/b] when not enough of a character is visible to identify their species. This tag can still be combined with generic species tags like [[mammal]], [[scalie]], [[avian]], and [[marine]].\r\n\r\nh4.Reasons\r\n\r\n[section,expanded]\r\n\r\nh6. Non-focal character:\r\n\r\n* \"disembodied_[body_part]\":/tags?commit=Search&search%5Bhide_empty%5D=1&search%5Bname_matches%5D=disembodied_%2A&search%5Border%5D=count\r\n** [[disembodied_hand]]\r\n** [[disembodied_foot]]\r\n** [[disembodied_penis]]\r\n** [[disembodied_tongue]]\r\n* [[mostly_offscreen_character]]\r\n\r\nh6. Obstructions:\r\n\r\n* [[clothing]] that obscures the body and/or head\r\n** full-body [[costume]]\r\n** [[full armor|fully armored]]\r\n** [[mask]], especially for [[headshot_portrait|headshot]] and [[bust_portrait|bust portraits]]\r\n** thick or baggy clothing\r\n* environmental conditions\r\n** heavy [[raining|rain]]\r\n** pitch [[dark|darkness]]\r\n** thick [[fog]] or [[steam]]\r\n* partially obscured by other elements of the scene\r\n\r\nh6. Perspective:\r\n\r\n* extreme [[close-up]]\r\n** \"[body_part]_shot\":/tags?commit=Search&search%5Bhide_empty%5D=1&search%5Bname_matches%5D=%2A_shot&search%5Border%5D=count\r\n*** [[butt_shot]]\r\n*** [[crotch_shot]]\r\n*** [[foot_shot]]\r\n*** [[penis_shot]]\r\n*** [[torso_shot]]\r\n* [[first_person_view|first person perspective]] from a [[faceless_character|character's face within the post]]\r\n* too far away from the viewer\r\n\r\nh6. Style:\r\n\r\n* [[anon]] - a type of generic placeholder character\r\n* blurred or distorted body\r\n* [[silhouette]] - a simplified outline of a character with solid coloring and little if any inner details\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Do no confuse with:\r\n\r\n* [[offscreen_character]] - do not tag the species of characters outside the field of view at all\r\n* [[unknown_species]] - tag this instead if you do not recognize a character's species despite seeing their identifying features\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[ambiguous_form]]\r\n* [[ambiguous_gender]]"
