            "wiki_body": "thumb #812759 thumb #311064 thumb #908675 thumb #1479516 thumb #3550623\r\n\r\nSource: <https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Blaziken_(Pokémon)>\r\n\r\n[b]Blaziken[/b] (Japanese: バシャーモ Bursyamo) is a dual-type Fire/Fighting Pokémon introduced in [[generation_3_pokemon|Generation III]].\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Combusken]] starting at level 36. It is the final form of [[Torchic]].\r\n\r\n[b]Blaziken[/b] can [[mega_evolution|Mega Evolve]] into [[Mega Blaziken]] using the Blazikenite.\r\n\r\n[b]Blaziken[/b] is a bipedal, chicken-like [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]. The majority of this Pokémon's body is red with accents of beige, yellow, and gray. Behind its head, there are beige, hair-like feathers that continue downward and surround its chest and abdomen. It has a small red face with a V-shaped crest on its head.\r\n\r\n[b]Blaziken[/b]'s blue eyes are semicircular with yellow sclerae, and its mouth is similar to a hooked beak. It has featherless, gray hands with three fingers each, and three clawed toes that are not normally visible due to the shaggy, yellow feathers on the bottom of its legs.\r\nA [[female]] has a shorter mask and hair than a [[male]]... [i](Although on E621, females have the same hair size as males - as seen in the examples above -).[/i]\r\n\r\nThis species has strong, muscular legs that give it great lower body strength. [quote][i]\"Blaziken is able to easily leap over 30-story buildings with its great lower body strength\"[/i] - According to \"Pokédex\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pokédex entries[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[torchic]]\r\n*** [[combusken]]\r\n**** blaziken\r\n***** [[mega_blaziken]]"
