            "wiki_body": "thumb #3807484 thumb #3679680 thumb #3686752 thumb #3701053\r\n\r\n[b]Meowscarada[/b] (Japanese: [b]マスカーニャ[/b] [i]Masquernya[/i]) is a dual-type Grass/Dark [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX]]. This Pokémon is classified as the `Magician Pokémon`.\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Floragato]] (starting at level 36) and it is the final form of [[Sprigatito]].\r\n\r\nh4.Physical appearance:\r\n\r\n[b]Meowscarada[/b] looks like a [[bipedal]] green [[feline]], with a very dark green [[mask]] on its face. It has [[red eyes]] and a [[ruff]] in the shape of a [[flower]]. It also wears a [[cape]] made of [[leaf|leaves]], and the shape of its body gives the impression that this Pokémon is wearing a [[skirt]]. \r\n\r\nIts legs are the same dark green color as its mask, and the way they reflect the light is reminiscent of a pair of [[tights]]. Around the cat floats a small green flower whose stem is camouflaged by the [[sun]]'s reverberation. \r\n\r\n[b]Meowscarada[/b] seems to have been inspired by the \"Iberian lynx\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iberian_lynx, but also by the [[magician]].\r\n\r\n[b]Meowscarada[/b] is a Pokémon that loves to put on a show. It is also extremely loyal and affectionate towards its Trainer, to the point where it can quickly become jealous if the latter gives its attention to another Pokémon...\r\n\r\nh4.Related tags:\r\n* [[anthro]]\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[cape]]\r\n* [[cheek_tuft]]\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n* [[facial_markings]]\r\n* [[facial_tuft]]\r\n* [[fangs]]\r\n* [[felid]]\r\n* [[feline]]\r\n* [[finger_claws]]\r\n* [[flower]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[green_fur]]\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n* [[markings]]\r\n* [[mask_(marking)]]\r\n* [[pink_eyes]] / [[red_eyes]]\r\n* [[tuft]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [[Sprigatito]]\r\n*** [[Floragato]]\r\n**** Meowscarada"
