            "wiki_body": "thumb #87933 thumb #180590 thumb #751865 thumb #709662\r\n\r\nAbsol (Japanese: アブソル Absol) is a [[mammal]] and a Dark-type [[Pokémon]]. It is probably based off Bai Ze of Chinese mythology.\r\n\r\nAbsol is commonly covered in white fur with a dark blue, sometimes black, face and skin color. Its most notable feature is the single, sickle-shaped horn protruding from its head that allows it to sense subtle changes in its environment. Its shiny variation has a different skin-tone varying between shades of deep orange and bright red. Traditionally, Absol is a quadruped [[feral]], although it is often drawn [[anthrofied]] or as a [[humanoid]].\r\n\r\n[section=Pokédex Entry]It can predict disasters. When it arrives, it tries to warn people of disasters, but sometimes it is blamed for causing them, giving it a bad reputation. It can live for 100 years.[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** absol\r\n*** [[mega_absol]]"
