            "wiki_body": "[b]Yoshi[/b] (Japanese: ヨッシー, Yosshī) is an [[anthropomorphic]] [[dinosaur]] character from the [[Mario Bros]] video game series. He was created by Japanese artist Shigefumi Hino. In most [[Mario Bros]] games, he is used as a mount, and allows [[Mario]] or [[Luigi]] to propel himself through the air.\r\n\r\nHe first appeared in 1990 in the game Super Mario World. After that, he will appear in several other Super Mario games including several spin-off series. He also has his video game series called Yoshi Island.\r\n\r\nYoshis come in many different colors and are known for their love of [[fruit]], using their long tongues to consume almost anything, and weaponizing whatever they swallow into [[yoshi egg|an egg]] for throwing.\r\n\r\nh4. Species:\r\n\r\n* [[black Yoshi]]\r\n* [[blue Yoshi]]\r\n* [[brown Yoshi]]\r\n* [[cyan Yoshi|cyan/light blue Yoshi]]\r\n* [[green Yoshi]]\r\n* [[orange Yoshi]]\r\n* [[pink Yoshi]]\r\n* [[purple Yoshi]]\r\n* [[red Yoshi]]\r\n* [[white Yoshi]]\r\n* [[winged Yoshi]]\r\n* [[yarn Yoshi]]\r\n* [[yellow Yoshi]]\r\n\r\nh4. Characters:\r\n\r\n* [[Boshi]]\r\n* [[The Great Gonzales Jr]]\r\n* [[Yoshi]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[egg]]\r\n** [[Yoshi egg]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also: \r\n\r\n* [[video games]]\r\n** [[nintendo]]\r\n*** [[mario bros]]\r\n**** yoshi"
