            "wiki_body": "[b]Midnight Lycanroc[/b] is the form of [[Lycanroc]] that is achieved when [[Rockruff]] evolves at night, starting at level 25, in Pokémon Moon and Ultra Moon.\r\n\r\nthumb #994391 thumb #994298\r\n\r\nIn its Midnight Form, Lycanroc resembles a slouched bipedal canine, with werewolf inspirations. Its body is primarily covered in short red fur, with a white streak running up its underside and continuing up its neck to include most of its muzzle. It has a tuft of white fur on its chest, and a short, bushy, white tail. Its lower legs are white, forming a zigzag border with the red fur, and each foot is tipped with three black claws. Its arms are long and thin, with the top side of the lower arms turning white, and each hand is large, white, and has three black claws. A large mane of white fur runs in a line up its back and curls over its head, with a large spike of black rock protruding over its face. Red tufts of fur make its head seem wider, and a strip of red fur runs between its eyes, which glow red. Its ears bend forward and are tipped in black, resembling horns. Its mouth is lined with many sharp teeth.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Rockruff]]\r\n*** [[Lycanroc]]\r\n**** [[Midday Lycanroc]]\r\n**** Midnight Lycanroc\r\n**** [[Dusk Lycanroc]]\r\n\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/lycanroc-midnight-form/\r\nhttp://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Lycanroc_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
