            "wiki_body": "thumb #1695084 thumb #1025472 thumb #1025899 thumb #1696482\r\n\r\n[b]Incineroar[/b] (Japanese: ガオガエン Gaogaen) is a dual-type Fire/Dark [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation 7 pokemon|Generation VII]].\r\n\r\n[b]Incineroar[/b] is a [[bipedal]], [[muscular]]-looking [[feline]] [[Pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. It has a short muzzle with a small [[red nose]], large [[green eyes]] with a [[yellow sclera]] and small pointed ears. Large [[tuft]]s of [[red fur]] protrude from its cheeks.\r\n\r\nIts face is predominantly [[red face|red]], except for the top of its muzzle and head and the nape of its neck, which are black. A fine red stripe runs down from its head to its muzzle, where it diverges to form a V above its eyes.\r\n\r\nThis Pokémon's torso is gray with several black stripes and resembles a [[wrestler]]'s [[tank top]]; both front and back have a vertical stripe running down the middle, intersected by two horizontal stripes. Around its waist, it has a [[belt]] made of flames with a small [[colored fire|yellow flame]] in the middle, which looks like a wrestling [[championship belt]]. \r\n\r\nIts arms, legs and tail are red with black stripes. Its arms have three stripes, spiky tufts of [[black tuft|black fur]] on the shoulders and large hands with [[5 fingers|five fingers]], [[white claws]] and a red pad on the palm. Its legs have only two stripes and [[3 toes|three-toed paws]]. Its [[tail]] has a band and a black bristly tuft at the tip.\r\n\r\nThis final evolution of [[Litten]] was leaked early in development, and may have some other (false) aliases associated with that.\r\n\r\nthumb #1472695\r\n\r\nh4.External links:\r\n* <http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Incineroar_(Pokémon)>\r\n* <http://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/incineroar>\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Litten]]\r\n*** [[Torracat]]\r\n**** [b]Incineroar[/b]"
