            "wiki_body": "thumb #1802915   thumb #1804555   thumb #1811360\r\n\"[b]◀[u]Bulbapedia[/u]▶[/b]\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Scorbunny_(Pokémon)?wprov=sfti1#\r\n\r\n[color=species][b]Scorbunny[/b][/color] (Japanese: [color=species][b]ヒバニー [i]Hibanī[/i], Hibunny[/b][/color]) is a [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_8_pokemon|Generation VIII]], announced on February 27, 2019, as the [color=#EE8130]Fire[/color]-type member of the [[starter trio]] featured in [i]Pokémon Sword[/i] and [i]Shield[/i].\r\n\r\n[b]Scorbunny[/b] is a [[semi-anthro]], [[biped|bipedal]] [[lagomorph]]-like Pokémon. It has [[buckteeth]] and [[beady eyes|beady]], [[orange eyes]] with a [[pink nose]]. Its [[fur]] is [[white fur|white]] with [[red fur|red]] [[red markings|markings]], with [[whiskers|whisker]]-like [[cheek tuft|tufts of fur on its cheeks]] and has a pair of [[long ears|long]], [[dipstick ears]]. On its body are [[bandage|bandages]], or bandage-like appendages, with one [[bandage on nose|right above its nose]] and one on the [[soles|sole]] of each foot, giving it the appearance of an active [[sport|sports]] player, such as a [[soccer]] or [[rugby]] player.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [b]#0813 Scorbunny[/b]\r\n** #0814 [[Raboot]]\r\n** #0815 [[Cinderace]]\r\n*** [[Gigantamax Cinderace]]\r\n** #0810 [[Grookey]]\r\n** #0816 [[Sobble]]"
