            "wiki_body": "thumb #3539545 thumb #3223051 thumb #3237847\n\n[b]Sprigatito[/b] ([b]ニャオハ [/b][i]Nyaoha[/i]) is a Grass-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]], and along with [[Fuecoco]] and [[Quaxly]] is one of the three [[starter_trio|starter Pokémon]] from [i]Pokémon Scarlet[/i] and [i]Pokémon Violet[/i]. Classified as the `Grass Cat Pokémon`, [b]Sprigatito[/b] has a capricious and attention-seeking personality.\n\n[b]Sprigatito[/b] was first revealed to the public as one of the first [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX Pokémon]] during the \"Pokémon Presents\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pokémon_Presents \"video presentation on February 27, 2022\":https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xoiwcdqMlCA.\n\nh4.Physical appearance:\n[b]Sprigatito[/b] is a small [[quadruped]] Pokémon who looks like a kitten. Its body is predominantly thin, with four wiry, clawless legs. Apart from a few specific areas, the entire coat covering this Pokémon's body is light [[green_body|green]]. \nThis color is also found on its thick, [[fluffy_tail|fluffy]] [[green_tail|tail]]. \n\nA large tuft of [[grass]]-[[green fur]] takes the shape of a [[leaf]], turned downwards, on its neck and torso. [b]Sprigatito[/b]'s head is slightly oval and a large dark-green leaf [[markings|mark]] is visible on its face...\n\nOn each of its two cheeks, it has three wild, outward-facing locks that seem to represent a [[fleur-de-lis]]. \n\nOn its face, [b]Sprigatito[/b] has a [[small mouth]] with two [[small fangs]], a short dark-[[pink muzzle]] in the shape of a downward-pointing triangle (▽); and two large eyes with ruby-red irises and [[black pupils]]. \n\nFinally, on the top of this Pokémon's head, two large [[green ears]], rounded at the tip, with a [[light_inner_ear|light interior]] and dark [[outline]].\n\nh4.Related tags:\n* [[cheek_tuft]]\n* [[cute_fangs]]\n* [[felid]]\n* [[feline]]\n* [[green_body]]\n* [[green_fur]]\n* [[mammal]]\n* [[markings]]\n* [[red_eyes]]\n* [[tail_markings]]\n* [[tuft]]\n* [[two_tone_body]]\n* [[two_tone_fur]]\n\nh4.See also:\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon_(species)]]\n** [b]Sprigatito[/b]\n*** [[Floragato]]\n**** [[Meowscarada]]"
