            "wiki_body": "thumb #958955 thumb #958961 thumb #958926\r\n\r\nSee: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Vulpix_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/alolan-vulpix/\r\n\r\nAlolan Vulpix is a Ice type variant on \"normal\" [[Vulpix]], a Fire-type Pokémon. \r\n\r\nIt is said that Vulpix came to the Alola region together with humans, but the Fox Pokémon moved to the snowy mountain peaks to avoid the normal habitats of other Pokémon, and thus it ended up taking on this form.\r\n\r\nAlolan Vulpix is a small, quadruped, fox-like Pokémon. It has white pelt, blue pupil-less eyes, large pointed ears, and six white tails with fluffy curled tips.  Alolan Vulpix also has fluffy curly locks of white fur with bangs on top of its head.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[vulpix]]\r\n*** [[alolan ninetales]]\r\n\r\nh4. Tagging and Search Tips\r\n\r\nThe Alolan Vulpix and regular [[Vulpix]] are two different species -- as such, neither tag should implicate the other. An image should only be tagged with both species if that image visibly includes both species.\r\n\r\nYou can make a search for both species by using a wildcard, such as \"*vulpix\":https://e621.net/post/index/1/*vulpix, or by using the inclusive syntax, such as \"~alolan_vulpix ~vulpix\":https://e621.net/post/index/1/~alolan_vulpix%20~vulpix."
