            "count": 3147,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #1032857 thumb #940426 thumb #1029504 thumb #960115 thumb #3182620 thumb #1071067\r\n\r\n[b]Primar...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1032857 thumb #940426 thumb #1029504 thumb #960115 thumb #3182620 thumb #1071067\r\n\r\n[b]Primarina[/b] (Japanese: アシレーヌ [i]Ashirene[/i]) is a dual-type Water and Fairy [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]] from [[generation 7 pokemon|Gen VII]].\r\n\r\n[b]Primarina[/b] is a [[marine]] [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]], with a mainly [[white body]] and a long [[fish tail]]. It has a long snout with a round, [[pink nose]], large [[blue eyes]] with long white [[lashes]], and long, light-[[blue hair]] that floats in the air, styled into a [[ponytail]] with two \"pearl\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pearl rings. \r\nThis ponytail can be undone when [b]Primarina[/b] uses certain attacks. On its forehead, this Pokémon has a [[tiara]] consisting of a line of pearls with a pink [[starfish]] at each end, and a light-blue [[veil]] that rises over its [[hair]].\r\n\r\nAll along its body, it has [[fin]]s that resemble the veil it wears on its head... It has long front fins with [[3 fingers|three fingers]]. Its fish tail is bright blue with small pink fins and dots around the hips. The fin at the end of its tail is white, and enables this Pokémon to stand upright.\r\n\r\n[b]Primarina[/b] is inspired by a [[sea lion]], but shares similarities with [[merfolk|mermaid]]s, [[selkie]]s and [[siren]]s.\r\nIt has evolved from [[Brionne]], and it sings beautifully.\r\n\r\nThis final evolution of [[Popplio]] was leaked early in development, and may have some other (false) aliases associated with that, like Entermaid.\r\nthumb #1472694\r\n\r\nh4.External links: \r\n* <http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Primarina_(Pokémon)>\r\n* <http://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/primarina>\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Popplio]]\r\n*** [[Brionne]]\r\n**** [b]Primarina[/b]"
