            "wiki_body": "thumb #3344140 thumb #1269963\r\nThe [b]caracal[/b] is a medium-sized wild cat native to Africa, the Middle East, Central Asia, and arid areas of Pakistan and northwestern India. It is characterised by a robust build, long legs, a short face, long tufted ears, relatively short tail, and long canine teeth.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[feline]]\r\n*** caracal\r\n\r\n* [[big_floppa]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n* https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caracal"
