            "wiki_body": "thumb #767472 thumb #2540002 thumb #4780204\r\n\r\n[b]Flygon[/b] (Japanese: [b]フライゴン[/b] [i]Flygon[/i]) is a dual-type Ground/Dragon [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation 3 pokemon|Generation III]].\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Vibrava]] starting at level 45 and it is the final form of [[Trapinch]].\r\n\r\n[b]Flygon[/b] is a Pokémon that resembles a slightly [[insect|insectoid]], [[biped]] [[dragon]]. Its body is primarily [[green body|light green]] and it has a pair of large rhombus-shaped [[wings]] with red trim, [[featureless feet|toeless]] hind legs, and [[skinny]] arms with [[3 fingers|three]] [[claws|clawed]] [[fingers]].\r\n\r\n[b]Flygon[/b]'s [[tail]] has several dark [[green stripes]] and three small green rhombus shapes with red trims at the end. It also has [[big eyes|large eyes]] and a pair of green [[antennae (anatomy)|antennae]] that point back.\r\n\r\nFinally, its eyes have red covers that prevent [[sand]] from getting into them.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[dragon]]\r\n* [[featureless_feet]]\r\n* [[tail_markings]]\r\n* [[wings]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[trapinch]]\r\n*** [[vibrava]]\r\n**** [b]flygon[/b]"
