            "wiki_body": "thumb #152332 thumb #1579768 thumb #190401 thumb #2110419 thumb #2716343\r\n\r\nGnolls are a race of [[anthro]] [[hyena|hyenas]]. They first originated in [i][[Dungeons and Dragons]][/i] and have since appeared in other fantasy settings such as [i][[Warcraft]][/i] and [i][[Pathfinder]][/i]. They are often portrayed as a savage, tribal species with [[digitigrade]] feet, but either or both of these aspects are not always the case."
