            "wiki_body": "Source: http://monsterhunter.wikia.com/wiki/Felyne\r\n\r\nFelynes are one of three cat-like, humanoid subspecies of the Lynian race, the other being the [[melynx]] and the [[grimalkyne]].\r\n\r\nFelynes are recognized by their tan fur and have the ability to talk in human language, and can be found both in human villages and in the wild. \r\n\r\nFelynes perform a small variety of jobs in villages, from shopkeeping to farm maintenance, but most notably they may work under a hunter as Felyne Chefs or as a [[palico]]. Felyne Chefs cook food for their hunters to support them in their adventures by temporarily bestowing them with beneficial status effects, while Palicos assist their hunters on quests by using various skills and attacks. They also supply an additional reward at the end of a Quest.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[airou]]\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[felid]]\r\n*** [b]felyne[/b]\r\n*** [[melynx]]\r\n*** [[grimalkyne]]\r\n** [[canid]]\r\n*** [[palamute]]"
