            "wiki_body": "thumb #2069202 thumb #2082403 thumb #2065560\r\n\r\n[b]Inteleon[/b] (Japanese: [b]インテレオン[/b] [i]Intereon[/i]) is a [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_8_pokemon|Generation VIII]], in [i]Pokémon Sword[/i] and [i]Shield[/i]. It evolves from [[Drizzile]] at level 35. It is the final form of [[Sobble]], the Water-type [[starter_trio|starter]].\r\n\r\n[b]Inteleon[/b] is a [[biped|bipedal]] Pokémon with a [[reptilian]] appearance. It is [[tall]] and [[slim|skinny]] with a sleek figure. Its head, [[tail]] and slender arms are light [[blue_arms|blue]]; its tail has a thin, darker line running vertically through it, and its hides a sharp blade in it. The [[crest]] on its head and torso are a darker blue, a color that runs down its legs to the back of its [[feet]].\r\n\r\nThe front of its [[black_legs|legs]] and feet are [[black_feet|black]], and its feet end in three hooked [[toes]]. Its hands are also [[black_hands|black]], with [[5_fingers|five fingers]]. Its eyes are [[yellow_eyes|yellow]], with a black lower lid and a yellow half-moon upper lid that covers almost the entire eye. \r\n\r\nIt has black nictitating [[membranes]] that fold over its eyes when it uses an attack. The [[fin]] on its head is also yellow; it runs down its neck to its back, where it becomes a kind of [[cape]]. Finally, [b]Inteleon[/b] has a white checkered [[markings|marking]] on its belly.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis Pokémon's name comes from \"intelligence\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intelligence, as [b]Inteleon[/b] is modeled after [[spy|spies]], and from [b]\"[[chameleon]]\"[/b].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [[Sobble]]\r\n*** [[Drizzile]]\r\n**** [b]Inteleon[/b]\r\n***** [[Gigantamax Inteleon]]\r\n* [[Rillaboom]]\r\n* [[Cinderace]]"
