            "wiki_body": "An ambient creature that appears to be [[flying]].\r\n\r\nh4. Tagging notes\r\n\r\nNot all flying creatures are classified as birds: dragons, bats, flying insects fall outside of the avian circle of species. This tag is especially useful for any species that shouldn't get the [[bird]] tag.\r\n\r\nh4. Flying species\r\n\r\n* [[ambient_bat]]\r\n* [[ambient_bee]]\r\n* [[ambient_butterfly]]\r\n* [[ambient_bird]]\r\n* [[ambient_dragon]]\r\n* [[ambient_dragonfly]]\r\n* [[ambient_fly]]\r\n* [[ambient_moth]]"
