            "wiki_body": "h4. For the character, use [[wolverine_(marvel)]] instead.\r\n\r\nThe [b]wolverine[/b] ([i]Gulo gulo[/i]) is a carnivorous [[mustelid]] with a dark coat and a bushy tail. It resembles a small [[bear]] closer than it does other mustelids. \r\n\r\nThe wolverine is famous for its ferocity and strength out of proportion to its size, and ability to not only kill prey many times larger than itself, but fend off and dominate larger predators. They generally avoid [[brown bear|brown bears]], but cases of wolverines fending them off have been recorded.\r\n\r\nThe aforementioned [[Marvel]] character shares many traits with the animal, such as a small stature, ferocious nature, incredible strength, and a Canadian origin.\r\n\r\nh4. Taxonomy\r\n\r\n* [[mustelid|mustelidae]]\r\n** [[gulonine|guloninae]]\r\n*** ([i]Gulo[/i])\r\n**** wolverine\r\n***** [[north_american_wolverine]] ([i]G. g. gulo[/i])\r\n***** [[european_wolverine]] ([i]G. g. luscus[/i])\r\n\r\nh4. More information\r\n\r\n* https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wolverine"
