            "wiki_body": "thumb #541831 thumb #1076242\r\n\r\n[b]Milotic[/b] (ミロカロス) is a Water-type [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It evolves from [[Feebas]], and is in the [i]Water 1[/i] and [i]Dragon[/i] egg groups.\r\n\r\nShiny Milotic's tail has yellow base color instead of blue, and it's 'hair' is violet intead of pink.\r\n\r\nMilotic is [[feral]] in its normal form, but the species is often depicted as an [[anthro]] [[pokémorph]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[marine]]\r\n* [[serpentine]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[feebas]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Milotic\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Milotic"
