            "count": 1839,
            "wiki_preview": "One of the playable races in the popular MMORPG [[Warcraft|World of Warcraft]]. Formerly known as Hi...",
            "wiki_body": "One of the playable races in the popular MMORPG [[Warcraft|World of Warcraft]]. Formerly known as High Elves, the self-proclaimed Blood Elves are the survivors of an attempt at genocide on their people by an army of the undead. They live in Quel'thalas, their partially rebuilt capital city, and, while previously aligned with the Alliance faction, have turned their backs on their former [[Human]] and [[Dwarf]] allies and aligned themselves with the Horde faction, making them allies to [[Orc]]'s and the [[Tauren]]. \r\n\r\nEver since the tainting of the Sunwell, the Blood Elves have become addicted to magic due to taint severing their source of power. However, following Warcraft expansion packs has seen the Sunwell restored. "
