            "wiki_body": "thumb #2063408 thumb #3326881 thumb #2205034 thumb #2384844 thumb #3848841\r\n\r\nAn umbrella tag of [[regional_form_(pokemon)|regional forms]] attributed to the \"Galar region\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Galar introduced in [[generation 8 pokemon|Generation VIII]] of the [i][[pokemon|Pokémon]][/i] franchise.\r\n\r\n[section=List of Pokémon Galarian forms]\r\nh5. Base game\r\n* [[Galarian Meowth]] (Evolves into [[Perrserker]])\r\n* [[Galarian Ponyta]]\r\n** [[Galarian Rapidash]]\r\n* [[Galarian Farfetch'd]] (Evolves into [[Sirfetch'd]])\r\n* [[Galarian Weezing]]\r\n* [[Galarian Mr. Mime]] (Evolves into [[Mr. Rime]])\r\n* [[Galarian Corsola]] (Evolves into [[Cursola]])\r\n* [[Galarian Zigzagoon]]\r\n** [[Galarian Linoone]] (Evolves into [[Obstagoon]])\r\n* [[Galarian Darumaka]]\r\n** [[Galarian Darmanitan]]\r\n* [[Galarian Yamask]] (Evolves into [[Runerigus]])\r\n* [[Galarian Stunfisk]]\r\n\r\nh5. [i]The Isle of Armor[/i]\r\n* [[Galarian Slowpoke]]\r\n** [[Galarian Slowbro]]\r\n\r\nh5. [i]The Crown Tundra[/i]\r\n* [[Galarian Slowking]]\r\n* [[Galarian Articuno]]\r\n* [[Galarian Zapdos]]\r\n* [[Galarian Moltres]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon|pokémon]]\r\n** [[regional_form_(pokémon)]]\r\n*** [[alolan_form]]\r\n*** [b]galarian_form[/b]\r\n*** [[hisuian_form]]\r\n*** [[paldean_form]]"
