            "count": 1600,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #1032850 thumb #3324865 thumb #939593 thumb #939536\r\n\r\n[b]Decidueye[/b] is a grass-type and gh...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1032850 thumb #3324865 thumb #939593 thumb #939536\r\n\r\n[b]Decidueye[/b] is a grass-type and ghost-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]], designed after an [[owl]] and an [[archer]]. It has large light [[brown_wings|brown]][[feathered wings|-feathered wings]], a [[white_body|white-feathered body]], and a tail and [[hood]] made of [[leaf|leaves]]. Not to mention owl-like talons and beak.  Round markings around its eyes resemble [[goggles]] or [[glasses]].\r\n\r\nWith two small [[vines]] that sprout just below its neck, [b]Decidueye[/b] combines its large wings to form a makeshift bow.  Combined with a feathery arrow quill, it makes an excellent archer.\r\n\r\nThis final evolution of [[Rowlet]] was leaked early in development, and may have some other (false) aliases associated with that, like Robinroot.\r\nthumb #1472696\r\n\r\nh4.External links:\r\n* <http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Decidueye_(Pokémon)>\r\n* <http://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/decidueye>\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Rowlet]]\r\n*** [[Dartrix]]\r\n**** [b]Decidueye[/b]"
