            "wiki_preview": "thumb #98423 thumb #434835 thumb #1046105\r\n\r\nKaka are a species/tribe of [[feline]] in [[Blazblue]],...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #98423 thumb #434835 thumb #1046105\r\n\r\nKaka are a species/tribe of [[feline]] in [[Blazblue]], created from the genes of of the original, [[Jubei]]. Most, though not all, are genetically engineered clones of Jubei and are [[cat humanoid|humanoid, hybrid cat people]]. However, some are the original [[anthro|anthropomorphic]] form, such as Jubei himself. They were originally intended to be used as weapons. Male Kaka are extremely rare, to the point where kaka are on the verge of extinction.\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\n* [[jubei]]\r\n* [[kokonoe]]\r\n* [[taokaka]]\r\n* [[torakaka]]\r\n* [[totokaka]]\r\n* [[chachakaka]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[video_games]]\r\n** [[blazblue]]\r\n*** kaka_(blazblue)"
