            "wiki_body": "thumb #2523136 thumb #2523145\r\n\r\n[color=species][b]Skulldogs[/b][/color] are a [[spirit]] [[canid]] species created by the artist [[skulldog (artist)|Skulldog]] in 2010. While they otherwise resemble typical canines, they are distinguished by their [[skull head]]. The skull will always resemble that of a canine, although aspects of other species' skulls may be added so long as they don't overshadow the canine appearance.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[MalO]], a variant of this species created by author LurkD for the [i][[SCP Foundation]][/i] character [[SCP-1471-A]]."
