            "wiki_preview": "thumb #507780 thumb #759157 thumb #875068\r\n\r\nArbok (アーボック) is a Poison-type Pokémon. It evolves from...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #507780 thumb #759157 thumb #875068\r\n\r\nArbok (アーボック) is a Poison-type Pokémon. It evolves from [[ekans]], and is in the `Field` and `Dragon` egg groups.\r\n\r\nArbok is a serpentine Pokémon with purple scales over most of its body. It has a large hood just below its head. On its hood, it has a design much like an angry face, which can come in six variations. The pattern typically has red and yellow eyespot outlined it black, a wide black streak resembling a mouth, and a V-shaped stripe about the face pattern. \r\n\r\nGeneration I arbok had W-shaped stripes on the back, the later generations lack this marking.\r\n\r\nShiny arbok is yellow.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n* [[cobra]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n* [[serpentine]]\r\n* [[snake_hood]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[ekans]]"
