            "wiki_body": "thumb #958956 thumb #963661 thumb #959550\r\n\r\nSee: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Ninetales_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/alolan-ninetales/\r\n\r\nAlolan Ninetales is a dual-type Ice/Fairy Pokémon. It is a [[regional variant]] of the Fire-type Pokémon, [[Ninetales]]. \r\n\r\nAlolan Ninetales live on a snowy peak that is revered in the Alola region as a holy mountain.\r\n\r\nThis fox-like, quadruped Pokémon is covered with a thick, luxurious blue and white fur. It has nine long tails. There is a fluffy crest atop its head, and a small mane around its neck.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[vulpix]]\r\n*** [[ninetales]]\r\n** [[alolan_vulpix]]\r\n*** alolan_ninetales\r\n"
