            "wiki_body": "thumb #3807478 thumb #3684629 thumb #3681101\r\n\r\n[b]Floragato[/b] (Japanese: [b]ニャローテ[/b] [i]Nyarote[/i]) is a Grass-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX]]. This Pokémon is classified as the `Grass Cat Pokémon`.\r\n\r\nIt is the first evolution of [[Sprigatito]] (starting at level 16) and it evolves into [[Meowscarada]] (starting at level 36).\r\n\r\nh4.Physical appearance:\r\n\r\n[b]Floragato[/b] is a [[biped|bipedal]] Pokémon with a [[feline]] appearance. This Pokémon's body is mainly covered with long, light-[[green fur]]. The green fur grows over its ears and around its neck, and falls down its [[belly]] and back to its hips, giving it the appearance of a [[poncho]].\r\n\r\nDark green fur can be seen on its [[feet]], but also on its [[paws]] and face, giving the impression that this [[domestic_cat|cat]]'s wearing a [[mask]]. Its irises and muzzle are pink.\r\n\r\n[b]Floragato[/b] has [[3_toes|three toes]] and a [[pink_pawpads|pink pad]] on each paw, and visible [[claws]] on its front paws. Hidden in [b]Floragato[/b]'s [[fur]] is a [[vines|vine]] with a pink [[flower]] bud attached. When this Pokémon's not using it to fight, it keeps the bud on its [[chest]], close to its neck.\r\n\r\nGenerally, this Pokémon should be tagged as \"[[anthro]]\". Depending on the art style, the \"[[semi-anthro]]\" subtag may occasionally apply.\r\n\r\nh4.Related tags:\r\n* [[anthro]]\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n* [[digitigrade]]\r\n* [[felid]]\r\n* [[feline]]\r\n* [[fur]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[green_fur]]\r\n* [[markings]]\r\n* [[short_tail]]\r\n* [[socks_(marking)]]\r\n* [[tuft]]\r\n* [[two_tone_body]]\r\n* [[two_tone_fur]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [[Sprigatito]]\r\n*** [b]Floragato[/b]\r\n**** [[Meowscarada]]"
