            "wiki_preview": "thumb #843002 thumb #3331391 thumb #3088122 thumb #1122914\r\n\r\n[b]Sceptile[/b] (Japanese: ジュカイン Jukai...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #843002 thumb #3331391 thumb #3088122 thumb #1122914\r\n\r\n[b]Sceptile[/b] (Japanese: ジュカイン Jukain) is a Grass-type [[Pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[Generation_3_pokemon|Generation III]].\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Grovyle]] starting at level 36. It is the final form of [[Treecko]].\r\n\r\n[b]Sceptile[/b] can [[Mega_evolution|Mega Evolve]] into [[Mega Sceptile]] using the Sceptilite.\r\n\r\n[b]Sceptile[/b] is a reptilian, bipedal Pokémon. Its neck is somewhat long, and it has two crests on its head. It has semicircular, yellow eyes with red rims. Its lower jaw and a belt-like band across its waist are also red. Along its back, it has two lines running down the middle and two rows of yellow nodules that are described as seeds. Its tail is shaped similar to that of a palm tree's branch. Both of its long arms have two sharp, elongated leaves and three claws.\r\n\r\nIt's is a jungle Pokémon. The seeds on its back contain nutrients, which are said to be able to revitalize trees. It is capable of leaping freely from branch to branch. While it has the ability to slice down thick trees, it is known to care lovingly for the plants in the forest. This Pokémon regulates its body temperature by basking in the sunlight.\r\n\r\n[[Shiny_pokemon|Shiny Sceptile]] has a bluish tint and yellow belly instead of red.\r\n\r\n[b]Sceptile [/b] is one of the several Pokémon that are very close to the [[anthro]]/[[feral]] split. The [[semi-anthro]] subtag often applies and this species is usually more anthro than feral, but can sometimes be difficult to pigeonhole into either of the main categories. Use your best judgment when tagging this species.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[mega_sceptile]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[flora_fauna]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[treecko]]\r\n*** [[grovyle]]\r\n**** sceptile\r\n***** [[mega_sceptile]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Sceptile\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sceptile"
