            "wiki_preview": "thumb #1012960 thumb #1643333 thumb #1878880\r\n\r\n[b]Torracat[/b] (Japanese: ニャヒート Nyaheat) is a [[gen...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1012960 thumb #1643333 thumb #1878880\r\n\r\n[b]Torracat[/b] (Japanese: ニャヒート Nyaheat) is a [[generation_7_pokemon|Gen VII]] Fire-type [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]].\r\n\r\n[b]Torracat[/b] is a [[quadruped|four-legged]] [[feline]] Pokémon. The upper part of its body is mainly black, while the lower part is mainly orange-red. The black part has numerous orange-red stripes: one that runs up its head to form a small ridge with a small horizontal stripe in the center and a slightly V-shaped band above the eyes, a stripe running down its spine, marked by two horizontal stripes, and two bands around its tail.\r\nThe orange-red part simply has two black stripes on each leg. Its front legs are more developed than its hind legs.\r\n\r\nEach leg has three toes, and the front legs have three black claws. It has several tufts of fur at the end of its tail. \r\nIt has large eyes surrounded by black with black and red pupils and yellow sclera. \r\nThis Pokémon has two tufts of fur on each cheek and a third, smaller tuft that runs down its lower jaw...\r\n\r\nIt has evolved from [[Litten]], gaining a [[flame]] sack attached to its neck, resembling the [[bell]] on a [[collar]].\r\n\r\nh4.External links:\r\n<http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Torracat_(Pokémon)>\r\n<http://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/torracat>\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[Pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Litten]]\r\n*** [b]Torracat[/b]\r\n**** [[Incineroar]]"
