            "wiki_body": "Solarians are a fictional species of [[feline]]-like humanoids from the video game [i][[Nine Sols]][/i]. They come in a wide variety of sizes and shapes, often inspired by real life cat breeds/species, though a notable difference from many other humanoid cat-like species is that they lack tails."
