            "wiki_body": "thumb #1012961 thumb #1022699 thumb #1015916 thumb #1013354 thumb #1015913 thumb #3586883\r\n\r\n[b]Brionne[/b] (Japanese: オシャマリ [i]Osyamari[/i]) is a [[sea lion]] [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]] with a predominantly light-[[blue body]] covered with three ruffle-like growths. The first is just below its pectoral [[fin]]s, while the third is just before its [[tail]]. Their color alternates between white and pale blue.\r\n\r\nIts ears are made up of three parts which, from base to tip, increase in size and become lighter; the first segment is ovoid while the others are spherical. It has a long conical snout with a white tip, a round [[pink nose]] and large [[black eyes]] with pink pupils.\r\n\r\nIts pectoral fins are much longer than its caudal fin, although they all have white tips. Its pectoral fins have [[3 fingers|three fingers]].\r\n\r\nIt has evolved from [[Popplio]], its ears changing in the process, white frills appearing around its midsection.\r\n\r\nh4.External links:\r\n<http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Brionne_(Pokémon)>\r\n<http://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/brionne>\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Popplio]]\r\n*** [b]Brionne[/b]\r\n**** [[Primarina]]"
