            "wiki_body": "thumb #3851712 thumb #104015\r\n\r\n[b]Creepers[/b] are a fictional species from [[Minecraft]]. They are hostile entities with four legs and a green body, that spawn during the night. They explode when the player gets too close, and are generally silent until that point, when they begin to make a hissing sound.\r\n\r\nCreepers are afraid of [[domestic_cat|cats]] and will actively avoid them. If struck by lightning, they will become a [[charged creeper]].\r\n\r\nBy default, creepers are [[feral]], but are commonly [[anthrofied]] or depicted as [[taur]]s instead.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[creeper_face]] - Please use this tag instead if only the creeper face design is present.\r\n* [[creeper_taur]]"
