            "wiki_body": "thumb #996590  thumb #898485 thumb #941683\r\n\r\n[b]Popplio[/b] (アシマリ Ashimari) is a water-type [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. This Pokémon was announced on May 10, 2016 as a part of the new group of [[Starter trio]] featured in the [i]Pokémon Sun[/i] and [i]Moon[/i] [[Video games|games]].\r\n\r\n[b]Popplio[/b] is a [[pinniped]], based on a [[sea lion]] [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]] with a mainly [[blue body]]. It has large eyes, a long white muzzle with [[black whiskers]] and a round, [[pink nose]]. \r\nIt has small ears on either side of its head. It has a sky-blue ruff around its neck that extends over its shoulders. Its pectoral [[fin]]s are more developed than its caudal fin, with two [[white markings]] outlining its [[toes]].\r\n\r\n\r\nh4.External links:\r\n<http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Popplio_(Pokémon)>\r\n<http://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/popplio>\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [b]Popplio[/b]\r\n*** [[Brionne]]\r\n**** [[Primarina]]"
