            "wiki_body": "A (traditionally [[herm]]) character with the body of a [[feral]] [[cat]] and upper body of an [[anthro]]. Based on the [[centaur]], a creature from Greek mythology. Typically found in stories set in Bernard Doove's [[Chakona Space]] universe.\r\n\r\n* This should not be tagged with [[feral]] or [[human]]\r\n* Do not tag any random [[felid taur]] as Chakat. It is a very specific species belonging to the [[Chakona Space]] mythos and has a specific body configuration. Chakat is not a replacement for [[felid_taur]].\r\n* Although the species as a whole are [[herm|herms]], remember to \"tag what you see\":/wiki/show/e621:tag_what_you_see_(explained%29 in regards to genitals that are visible. Most pictures fall into the [[female]] or [[gynomorph]] tags, depending on the angle. You can, however, tag with [[herm_(lore)]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[taur]]\r\n** [[equine_taur]] - Equine taur\r\n*** [[centaur]] - Humanoid/equine taur\r\n** [[felid_taur]]\r\n*** [[feline_taur]]\r\n**** [[cat_taur]] - Cat taur\r\n*** [b]chakat[/b] - A feline based taur species from the Chakona Space universe.\r\n** [[fox_taur]] - Fox taur"
