            "wiki_body": "thumb #1792669 thumb #312659 thumb #942695 thumb #2922192\r\n\r\n[b]Twi'lek[/b] (/'twilɛk/ [i]or[/i] /'twaɪlɛk/, [i]plural:[/i] [b]Twi'leks[/b]) — a Near-Human [[alien]] species from the [i][[Star Wars]][/i] franchise.\r\n\r\nThe Twi'lek are a [[biped|bipedal]] [[mammal|mammalian]] species from Ryloth, a tumultuous planet in the Outer Rim's Gaulus sector with hot, humid climate; deadly fauna; and a history of [[slavery|subjugation]]. They're generally similar to [[human|humans]] (even being able to crossbreed with them) in exception to their highly-varying complexions and \"head-tails\" in place of [[hair]]. \r\n\r\nCalled \"[[lekku (anatomy)|lekku]]\" in Ryl, these head-tails are long, sensitive, poseable tendrils used by Twi'leks to convey emotion and nonverbal communication. Most Twi'leks have two lekku (with the left and right referred to as the \"tchun\" and \"tchin\" in Legends), however rarely there are some who possess an addition pair of lekku.  [[Dismemberment]] of a lek without immediate medical aid is almost invariably [[death|fatal]].\r\n\r\nTwi'lek [[skin]] comes in a plethora of colors, varying from [[pale skin|pale]] to [[dark skin|dark]] shades of [[white skin|white]]; [[red skin|red]]; [[green skin|green]]; [[purple skin|purple]]; [[yellow skin|yellow]]; [[pink skin|pink]]; [[black skin|black]]; etc, with the term \"[[Rutian]]\" denoting Twi'leks with some tone of [[blue skin]]. Some Twi'leks have [[markings]] over their bodies or just their lekku, either natural or done through [[tattoo|tattoos]]. \r\n\r\n[[Sexual dimorphism]] in the species leads Twi'lek [[male|males]] to have [[humanoid ears]] and flat [[pecs]], and Twi'lek [[female|females]] to have cone-shaped hearing organs and human-like [[breasts]]. Males often style their lekku by wrapping one or both around their neck, while females generally let theirs dangle. Some males even file their [[teeth]], creating a mouth full of [[sharp teeth]] to intimidate others with."
