            "wiki_body": "thumb #1802916 thumb #1804560 thumb #1802964\r\n\r\n[b]Sobble[/b] ([b]メッソン[/b], [i]Messon[/i]) is a [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_8_pokemon|Generation VIII]], announced on February 27, 2019, as the water type member of the [[starter trio]] featured in [i]Pokémon Sword[/i] and [i]Shield[/i].\r\n\r\n[b]Sobble[/b] is a [[quadruped|quadrupedal]], [[reptile|reptilian]] or [[amphibian]]-like Pokémon. It has [[featureless feet]] with [[2 toes|2 toed]] \"clasper\" appendages, similar to that of a [[chameleon|chameleon's]]. [[blue skin|Its skin]] as well as its [[blue eyes|eyes]], [[blue cheeks|blue]] [[cheek spots]], and [[blue tail|tail]] are blue, the tail being [[curled tail|curled]] as well. Adorning its head is a membranous [[head frill]], or possibly a membranous [[crest]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [b]Sobble[/b]\r\n*** [[Drizzile]]\r\n**** [[Inteleon]]\r\n***** [[Gigantamax Inteleon]]\r\n** [[Grookey]]\r\n** [[Scorbunny]]"
