            "wiki_body": "thumb #99810 thumb #1086734\r\n\r\nLarvitar (ヨーギラス) is a Rock/Ground-type Pokémon. It evolves into Pupitar, and is in the Monster egg group.\r\n\r\nIt is a green [[biped|bipedal]] reptilian pokemon with black markings and red scales on the belly.\r\n\r\nLarvitar is hard to fit into any form category. They are vaguely dinosaurian and are sometimes depicted as [[feral]], but more often than not, are drawn as [[anthro]]. The [[semi-anthro]] subtag frequently applies.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[scalie]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[pupitar]]\r\n** [[tyranitar]]\r\n** [[mega_tyranitar]]"
