            "wiki_body": "thumb #604735 thumb #816970 thumb #572163\r\n\r\nSource: <https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Emboar_(Pokémon)>\r\n\r\n[b]Emboar[/b] (Japanese: エンブオー Enbuoh) is a dual-type Fire/Fighting [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_5_pokemon|Generation V]].\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Pignite]] starting at level 36. It is the final form of [[Tepig]].\r\n\r\n[b]Emboar[/b] is a bulky, bipedal Pokémon with [[porcine|pig]]-like features. It has a red nose, large bushy black eyebrows, and two tusks protruding from its lower jaw. Constantly burning flames cover the front of its neck and shoulders. The [[fire]] [[beard]] comes from the body flame within its body.\r\nIt has short legs and thick arms. \r\n\r\nIts arms have orange upper portions while the legs have red upper portions. All of its limbs have black lower portions with thin yellow lines where the upper and lower colors meet. These lines are straight on the arms and spiked on the legs. The arms have red lines around the wrists and tufts of fur on the elbows.\r\nThe hands are tipped with three claws, while the feet have two claws. \r\n\r\nA large, dark horizontal stripe on the chest of [b]Emboar[/b] has swirled yellow markings and its small tail ends in a tuft of hair.\r\n\r\nUsing the wreath of flames on its neck and shoulders, [b]Emboar[/b] will set its hands on fire. It uses its power and speed to master fighting moves.\r\nThis power can be increased when its neck flame intensifies. The more dire the situation is, the more excited this Pokémon becomes to the point of enjoying itself. Though very tough and relentless when fighting, it shows deep affection for those it considers friends.\r\n\r\nh4.Related Tags:\r\n* [[big belly]]\r\n** [[overweight]]\r\n* [[orange body]]\r\n* [[red body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[tepig]]\r\n*** [[pignite]]\r\n**** emboar"
