            "wiki_body": "Level \tRookie\r\n\r\nType\tBeast\r\n\r\nAttribute\tData\r\n\r\nFamily\tNature Spirits\r\n\r\nPrior forms\tWanyamon[1]\r\n\r\nNext forms\tGaogamon[2]\r\n\r\nBlackGaogamon[1]\r\n\r\nPartners:\tThomas H. Norstein\r\nYu Inui\r\nNikorai \"Niko\" Yakovich Petorofu\r\nNatasha\r\nTsubasa\r\nVeteran Businessman\r\n\r\nVoice actors\r\n\r\n\t(Ja:) Kazuya Nakai (Savers)\r\n\r\n(En:) Skip Stellrecht (Data Squad)\r\n\r\nVariations\r\n\r\n• Dot-Gaomon\r\nGroups\r\n\r\n• Gazimon-species\r\n\r\nGaomon is a Beast Digimon. It is thought to be a subspecies of the Gazimon-species that grew pointed claws. With its keen movements, it specializes in \"Hit and Away\" attacks. The gloves on its hands appear to protect its claws until they are fully grown."
