            "wiki_body": "[b]New world monkeys[/b], monkeys in the superfamily [i]Ceboidea[/i], are families of monkeys found in the tropical regions of the Americas. These monkeys are mostly herbivorous and live mainly in the trees, often being small to medium in size. New world monkeys have characteristic, broad noses, as well as wide septums and outwards facing nostrils\r\n\r\nh4. Families\r\n\r\n* [[aotid]]\r\n* [[atelid]]\r\n* [[callitrichid]]\r\n* [[cebid]]\r\n* [[pitheciid]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[primate]]\r\n** [[haplorhine]]\r\n*** [[monkey]]\r\n**** new_world_monkey\r\n**** [[old_world_monkey]]"
