            "wiki_body": "thumb #3243757 thumb #3243704 thumb #3875142\r\n\r\nSource: <https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Servine_(Pokémon)>\r\n\r\n[b]Servine[/b] (Japanese: ジャノビー Janovy) is a Grass-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in Generation V.\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Snivy]] starting at level 17 and evolves into [[Serperior]] starting at level 36.\r\n\r\n[b]Servine[/b] is a slim bipedal Pokémon that is primarily green with a cream underside, and narrow red eyes. It has a yellow V-shaped structure that starts at the chest and extends behind the shoulders.\r\n[b]Servine[/b] has short limbs and a small crest protruding from the back of its head. Three palmate leaves grow along its back and tail.\r\n\r\nThese leaves are capable of performing photosynthesis, but only while they are clean. This Pokémon will go to great lengths to stay dirt-free for this reason.\r\nThis swift Pokémon hides in thick foliage or shadows to avoid attacks before retaliating. [b]Servine[/b] will mercilessly pummel its target by whipping them with its vines. It has an inflated sense of pride, which is one of its weaknesses. Due to this pride, [b]Servine[/b] will be unable to cooperate with other Pokémon for a long while.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[snivy]]\r\n*** servine\r\n**** [[serperior]]"
