            "wiki_body": "Thumb #887247 Thumb #986762 Thumb #805125 Thumb #1247643\r\nA type of creature from the game [[Bloodborne]] .\r\nBeasts are generally characterized as being hairy, werewolf-like creatures that were once human or creatures that have been fully transformed by the scourge plague. Depending on the severity of the infection these beasts might also be mutated into an [[eldritch abomination]] that escape conventional descriptions.\r\n\r\nThe most well known representatives of this species are the \"cleric beast\":https://e621.net/posts?tags=cleric_beast_%28bloodborne%29 , which serves as the first possible boss of the game and [[Vicar Amelia]] , who is well known to this side."
