            "wiki_body": "Palamutes are wolf-like Buddies (companion) introduced in Monster Hunter Rise (MHR or MHRise). These Palamutes are canines that have received special training in Kamura Village to become a faithful hunting companion. They'll let you ride on their back, and even participate in coordinated attacks. They're a must-have ally for any hunter."
