            "wiki_body": "thumb #1802914 thumb #1804552 thumb #1805127\r\n\r\n[b]Grookey[/b] ([b]サルノリ[/b] [i]Sarunori[/i]) is a Pokémon introduced in [[generation 8 pokemon|Generation VIII]], announced on February 27, 2019, as the grass type member of the [[starter trio]] featured in [i]Pokémon Sword[/i] and [i]Shield[/i].\r\n\r\n[b]Grookey[/b] is a [[quadruped|quadrupedal]], [[primate]]-like Pokémon. Its body is [[brown body|brown]], [[green body|green]], [[orange body|orange]], and [[yellow body|yellow]], with a [[brown tail]] and [[brown ears|ears]], orange [[muzzle (marking)|upon its mouth]] and [[socks (marking)|tipping its limbs]], and a yellow [[mask (marking)|facial disc]] surrounding its eyes. Atop its head are a pair of [[leaf|leaves]], which holds a [[stick]] it seems to use as both [[hair sticks|a form of accessory]] and as a [[tool]] or possible [[improvised weapon]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [b]grookey[/b]\r\n*** [[thwackey]]\r\n**** [[rillaboom]]\r\n** [[scorbunny]]\r\n** [[sobble]]"
