            "count": 543,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #2069205 thumb #2054213 thumb #3498648\r\n\r\n[b]Drizzile[/b] ([b]ジメレオン[/b] [i]Jimereon[/i]) is a ...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2069205 thumb #2054213 thumb #3498648\r\n\r\n[b]Drizzile[/b] ([b]ジメレオン[/b] [i]Jimereon[/i]) is a Water-type [[Pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is a mid-evolution between [[Sobble]] and [[Inteleon]], and is in the `Water 1` and `Field` \"egg groups\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Egg_group.\r\n\r\n[b]Drizzile[/b] is a [[biped|bipedal]] Pokémon with a slender, [[reptile]]-like build. Its body is mainly [[blue body|blue]], with a [[white belly]] topped by darker [[blue markings]]. It has [[green hands]] and [[green feet|feet]], each with [[2 fingers|two fingers]]. This Pokémon has a [[small nose|small muzzle]], dark [[blue cheeks]] and large, [[half-closed eyes]] with a line connecting them.\r\nIt also has three [[hair]]s on top of its head; two blue strands, one of which curls upwards, and one pink strand.\r\nFinally, its [[tail]] is [[curled tail|curled]] inwards with a [[dark tail tip|darker tip]].\r\n\r\n[b]Drizzile[/b] is inspired by the [[chameleon]].\r\n\r\n[b]Drizzile[/b] uses the pores of its sweaty palms to create [[water]] [[ball]]s for attacking. Although highly smart, it is also extremely lazy and prefers to do nothing until it has something urgent to do...\r\n\r\n[[shiny_pokemon|Shiny]] [b]Drizzile[/b] is darker shade of blue and has [[pink hands]] and [[pink feet|feet]] instead of green.\r\n\r\nDrizzile is [[anthro]] (with [[semi-anthro]] subtag) in its canon form.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[blue_body]]\r\n* [[white_belly]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Sobble]]\r\n*** [b]Drizzile[/b]\r\n**** [[Inteleon]]\r\n***** [[Gigantamax Inteleon]]\r\n* [[Thwackey]]\r\n* [[Raboot]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Drizzile\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Drizzile"
