            "wiki_body": "thumb #678447 thumb #4192370\r\n\r\nThe [b]indominus rex[/b] is a fictional species of [[dinosaur]] that debuted in the [i][[Jurassic Park]][/i] film [i][[Jurassic World]][/i]. It is a hybrid of various types of dinosaurs, including the [[tyrannosaurus rex]], [[velociraptor]], and others. It has grey-white scales and red eyes, high intellect, and a malevolent personality."
