            "wiki_preview": "thumb #868757 thumb #818178 thumb #2068722\r\n\r\nA [b]Stand[/b] is a power unique to the [i][[JoJo's Bi...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #868757 thumb #818178 thumb #2068722\r\n\r\nA [b]Stand[/b] is a power unique to the [i][[JoJo's Bizarre Adventure]][/i] series and is a physical manifestation of a person's \"life energy\" and fighting spirit. It is an entity psychically generated by its owner, referred to as a Stand User, and generally presents itself as an ethereal figure hovering over or near them. Stands possess abilities beyond those of ordinary humans, which, depending on the User, can be wielded for good or evil.\r\n\r\nThis tag applies to both, Stands that appear in [i]JoJo's Bizarre Adventure[/i] as well as fanmade ones."
