            "wiki_preview": "Golems are animated constructs originating from Jewish folklore. Typical golems are created from ina...",
            "wiki_body": "Golems are animated constructs originating from Jewish folklore. Typical golems are created from inanimate matter such as clay or stone, and tend to be [[humanoid]] in shape. \r\n\r\nGolems were popularized by [[Dungeons & Dragons]] and are now common in fantasy literature and games. \r\n\r\nthumb #360061\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[golem_(monster_rancher)]]\r\n* [[golem_(pokémon)]]\r\n* [[golem_princess]]\r\n"
