            "wiki_body": "Lunala is a psychic/ghost-type legendary [[Pokémon]]. It is a huge [[bat]] with the motif of a moon and night sky.  Lunala as a character was announced as a part of the new group of Pokémon featured in the [i]Sun[/i] and [i]Moon[/i] [[Video games|games]].\r\n\r\nthumb #891486\r\n\r\nSee: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Lunala_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/lunala/\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[cosmog]]\r\n*** [[cosmoem]]\r\n**** [[solgaleo]]\r\n**** lunala"
