            "wiki_body": "Sea lions are aquatic mammals characterized by external ear flaps, long foreflippers, the ability to walk on all fours, short, thick hair, and a big chest and belly.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Species\r\n\r\n* [[australian_sea_lion]]\r\n* [[california_sea_lion]]\r\n* [[hooker's_sea_lion]]\r\n* [[steller_sea_lion]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[mammal]]\r\n** [[pinniped]]\r\n*** sea_lion\r\n*** [[seal]]\r\n*** [[walrus]]"
