            "wiki_preview": "thumb #1698416 thumb #996237 thumb #1160323 thumb #2231473\r\n\r\nThe [b]dodo[/b] is an extinct flightle...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1698416 thumb #996237 thumb #1160323 thumb #2231473\r\n\r\nThe [b]dodo[/b] is an extinct flightless bird from the island nation of Mauritius that is related to [[pigeon|pigeons]] and [[dove|doves]]. It was wiped out by the Dutch and alien species like [[cat|cats]] and [[dog|dogs]] and became extinct by 1662. Today, the dodo bird stands for extinction and obsolescence, it has also appeared in popular culture such as in [i][[Alice in Wonderland]][/i]. \r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[avian]]\r\n** [[bird]]\r\n*** [[columbid]]\r\n**** dodo"
