            "wiki_body": "The [b]bangaa[/b] are a fictional race of [[lizardman|lizardmen]], though they hate being called lizards ironically, who inhabit the land of Ivalice (commonly known for being a part of [i][[Final Fantasy XII]][/i] and the [i]Ivalice Alliance[/i] subseries in general). The main characteristics of a bangaa are their long snouts and floppy ears. They tend to be  muscled, but not overly bulky. "
