            "wiki_preview": "Cecaelia (also known as octomaid, sea witch or octopus person) is a creature characterized by having...",
            "wiki_body": "Cecaelia (also known as octomaid, sea witch or octopus person) is a creature characterized by having an anthro/humanoid top half and cephalopod [[tentacles]] instead of legs. Note that a 2 legged or [[biped]]-like anthro cephalopod whose two legs happen to be tentacles is not a cecaelia; the bottom half must be multiple tentacles, essentially the bottom half of a feral cephalopod.\r\n\r\nWhat cecaelia applies to:\r\n\r\nthumb #642428 thumb #30753 thumb #864362\r\n\r\nWhat cecaelia does [b]NOT[/b] apply to:\r\n\r\nthumb #1602704 thumb #10042 thumb #1546529\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[Animal humanoid]]\r\n** [[Cephalopod humanoid]]\r\n* [[monster girl (genre)|Monster girl]]\r\n* [[Multi leg]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n\r\n* [[Lamia]]\r\n* [[Merfolk]]\r\n* [[Satyr]]\r\n* [[Taur]]"
