            "wiki_body": "thumb #3389348 thumb #3901181 thumb #3232892\r\n\r\n[b]Hisuian Samurott[/b] (Japanese: [b]ヒスイのダイケンキ[/b] [i]Hisui no Daikenki[/i]) is a Water/Dark-type [[Pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. It was first introduced in [i][[pokemon legends arceus|Pokémon Legends: Arceus]][/i] as a [[regional form (pokemon)|regional form]] of [[Samurott]].\r\n\r\nJust like [[Samurott|original Samurott]], the [[Hisuian form]] is canonically [[quadruped]] ([[feral]]) and mostly blue. But among its differences, its [[shell]] [[armor]] is black with red accents, its [[mustache]]/[[whiskers]] are wavier, the [[horn]] on its head is crooked, and its [[red_claws|claws are red]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Oshawott]]\r\n*** [[Dewott]]\r\n**** [[Samurott]]\r\n**** [b]Hisuian Samurott[/b]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Samurott\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Samurott"
