            "wiki_body": "thumb #1619997 thumb #2287153\r\n\r\n[b]Marshadow[/b] (マーシャドー) is a Fighting/Ghost-type Mythical [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]]. It does not evolve, and is not in any egg group.\r\n\r\nShiny Marshadow looks identical to the normal, and only shows difference in its Zenith form.\r\n\r\nMarshadow is normally depicted as a [[humanoid]], and can usually be tagged as an [[elemental humanoid]]. In some cases [[shadow creature]] may be applicable.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[black_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n** [[marshadow_(zenith_form)]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Marshadow\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Marshadow"
