            "wiki_body": "thumb #3539536 thumb #3207268 thumb #3302073 thumb #3208345\r\n\r\n[b]Fuecoco[/b] ([b]ホゲータ[/b] [i]Hogator[/i]) is a Fire-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]], and along with [[Sprigatito]] and [[Quaxly]] is one of the three [[starter_trio|starter Pokémon]] from [i]Pokémon Scarlet[/i] and [i]Pokémon Violet[/i]. Classified as the `Fire Croc Pokémon`, [b]Fuecoco[/b] is known to be laid-back and generally does things at its own pace.\r\n\r\n[b]Fuecoco[/b] was first revealed to the public as the second [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX Pokémon]] starter during the \"Pokémon Presents\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pokémon_Presents \"video presentation on February 27, 2022\":https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xoiwcdqMlCA.\r\n\r\nh4.Physical appearance:\r\n\r\n[b]Fuecoco[/b] is a [[bipedal]] Pokémon with an animal-like appearance, resembling a small [[crocodile]]. Its body is mostly chili-red, except for its face and belly, which are off-white. It has two large hind legs, each with a pair of triangular [[black claws]].\r\n\r\nThis Pokémon's [[tail]] is fairly [[short_tail|short]] and [[pointed_tail|pointed]], while the top of its [[skull]] features \"[[tuft]]s of [[flame]]\" oscillating between yellow and orange. \r\n\r\nOn its face, it has an elongated, U-shaped [[jaw]] with three [[teeth]]; the single-toothed upper part of the mouth is notably larger than the two-toothed lower part... \r\nAt the end of the [[snout]], its two black [[nostrills]] are shaped like triangles pointing to the sides (▼▼). \r\n\r\nBoth eyes have black irises and are medium-sized. Finally, this little crocodile sports five rectangular [[yellow scales]] on its body: one straddling its red [[torso]] and the beginning of its [[white belly]]; two more on its back, just before the tip of its tail and then in the middle of its back; and finally, one under each of its [[feet]].\r\n\r\n[b]Fuecoco[/b] draws its inspiration from animals of the [[crocodilian]] family, particularly the crocodile and the [[alligator]]. In addition, its body shape and range of colors are reminiscent of the red \"chili pepper\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chili_pepper.\r\n\r\nh4.Related tags:\r\n* [[black_claws]]\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n* [[crocodilian]]\r\n* [[cute_fangs]]\r\n* [[red_body]]\r\n* [[red_scales]]\r\n* [[reptile]]\r\n* [[scalie]]\r\n* [[two_tone_body]]\r\n* [[two_tone_scales]]\r\n* [[white_body]]\r\n* [[white_scales]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon_(species)]]\r\n** [b]Fuecoco[/b]\r\n*** [[Crocalor]]\r\n**** [[Skeledirge]]"
