            "wiki_body": "thumb #4225985 thumb #4406553\r\n\r\n[b]Neco Spirits[/b] are a [[feline humanoid]] species that appear in the [i][[Tsukihime]][/i] series and related spin-off media. They are short, cartoonish representations of [i]Tsukihime[/i] characters with cat ears and a tail. Neco Spirit characters appear in situations involving comic relief and meta humor, and inhabit an alternate dimension known as the \"Great Cat's Village.\":https://antifandom.com/typemoon/wiki/Great_Cat%27s_Village\r\n\r\nThey prominently feature in the OVA series \"[i]Carnival Phantasm[/i]\":https://antifandom.com/typemoon/wiki/Carnival_Phantasm where they staff the Ahnenerbe, a coffee shop where parallel worlds can converge and meet.\r\n\r\nh4. Notable members (and the character they are based on)\r\n* [[Neco-Arc]] (Arcueid Brunestud)\r\n* [[Neco-Arc Chaos]] (NRVNQSR Chaos)\r\n* [[Neco-Arc Bubbles]] (original)\r\n* [[Neco-Arc Destiny]] (original)\r\n* [[Neco-Arc Evolution]] (original)"
