            "wiki_body": "thumb #188653\r\n\r\nScraggy (ズルッグ) is a Dark/Fighting-type Pokémon. It evolves into [[Scrafty]], and is in the `Field` and `Dragon` egg groups.\r\n\r\nShiny Scraggy has darker, golden coloring, which is difficult to tell apart from the normal coloring.\r\n\r\nScraggy is usually drawn as [[anthro]], though the [[semi-anthro]] subtag may occasionally apply.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[big_eyes]]\r\n* [[big_head]]\r\n* [[yellow_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[scrafty]]"
