            "wiki_preview": "thumb #4700540 thumb #574481 thumb #2205109\r\n\r\n[b]Gogoat[/b] (Japanese: [b]ゴーゴート[/b] [i]Gogoat[/i]) ...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #4700540 thumb #574481 thumb #2205109\r\n\r\n[b]Gogoat[/b] (Japanese: [b]ゴーゴート[/b] [i]Gogoat[/i]) is a Grass-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_6_pokemon|Generation VI]]. This Pokémon is classified as the `Mount Pokémon`.\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Skiddo]] at level 32.\r\n\r\nJust like its sub-evolution, [b]Gogoat[/b] is a [[quadruped]] Pokémon that looks like a [[goat]]. The fur on its face is colored in [[white_fur|white]] and ruffled on its chin, while the back of its head is [[brown_head|brown]]. It has a [[black nose]], [[red eyes]] encircled by [[black markings]], a brown stripe down the middle of its face, and round ears. \r\n\r\nIt has a pair of large [[black horn]]s curved backward on the top of its head. Its body is mainly covered with darker brown fur on its back than around its belly and legs. This Pokémon has a thick mane of [[leaf|leaves]] around its neck, extending over its back and ending in a bushy [[tail]]. \r\n\r\n[b]Gogoat[/b]'s fur on its legs is shorter than on the rest of its body, brown on top and white on the bottom. Each leg ends in a [[orange_hooves|orange hoof]].\r\n\r\n[b]Gogoat[/b] is known for its empathic abilities, which enable this goat Pokémon to sense the emotions of anyone clutching its horns, sensing the slightest changes in the position of the person's hands... \r\nAlso, horn [[battle]]s determine the [[leader]] of the [[herd]].\r\n\r\nIn [i]Pokémon X and Y[/i], [b]Gogoat[/b] can be used as a \"Poké Ride\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Poké_Ride.\r\n\r\nh4.Related Tags:\r\n* [[brown_fur]]\r\n* [[hooves]]\r\n* [[horn]]\r\n* [[quadruped]] - In its [[feral]] version; but if it is [[anthro]] use: [[biped]] \r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[skiddo]]\r\n*** [b]gogoat[/b]"
