            "wiki_body": "thumb #387906 thumb #1029131 thumb #2623018\r\n\r\n[b]Mega Blaziken[/b] (Japanese: メガ バシャーモ Mega Bursyamo) is a dual-type Fire/Fighting Mega Pokémon. It is the [[mega_evolution|Mega Evolution]] of [[Blaziken]].\r\n\r\nSince [[generation_6_pokemon|Generation VI]], Blaziken can Mega Evolve into [b]Mega Blaziken[/b] if it holds a Blazikenite.\r\n\r\nWhen Mega Evolving, its usually yellow markings turn black on its upper legs and torso. The small ridges on its head are a single horn extending backwards. The sprays of flame coming from its wrists are longer. This Pokémon's beige feathers are also longer, forming an X around its head.\r\n\r\n[b]Mega Blaziken[/b]'s pawing power increases, giving this Pokémon a deep sense of pride. When it launches into a series of kicks, its legs sometimes catch fire from friction in the atmosphere. As its body temperature rises, so does its power and speed.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[torchic]]\r\n*** [[combusken]]\r\n**** [[blaziken]]\r\n***** mega_blaziken"
