            "wiki_body": "A character that has their body shaped in such a way to suggest that their primary function is to be used as a single entry [[penetrable sex toy]]. In many cases this suggests that the character is a sentient sex toy similar to a [[sex doll]]. The difference between an onahole and a sex doll is that an onahole has a single large entry point on one end, and a sex doll may have multiple entry points where a character's mouth, anus, and vaginal openings would normally be.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[quadruple_amputee]] - Although the tag may also apply, and is a common trait for this tag, having no limbs by itself doesn't suggest that a character's only function is to be used like an onahole / fleshlight.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[living_condom]] - A character being used as a cocksleeve, or similar device.\r\n* Size tags\r\n** [[large_penetration]] / [[huge_penetration]] / [[extreme_penetration]] / [[ridiculous_fit]]\r\n** [[size_difference]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[sex_doll]]\r\n** [[living_sex_doll]]"
