            "wiki_body": "(Fictional species)\r\nFormerly addressed as \"Class zero\":https://e621.net/wiki_pages/20307, Zerian(s) are self reffered as a species of alien demons with various sizes and forms, with barely any similarities between each singular individual of the species, given their ability to shapeshift into their desired body.\r\nSpecies was created/belongs to the artist: \"E-01\":https://e621.net/users/211339\r\nsome example of the characters of this species are \"zero\":https://e621.net/posts?tags=zero_one , \"zade\":https://e621.net/posts?tags=zade_%28code01%29 , \"blue queen\":https://e621.net/posts?tags=queen_of_blue_hearts .Exemplifying the previous statement of no physical correlation despite being all zerians, as one is a wolf, a cat, a fox, etc."
