            "wiki_preview": "[b]Pure faradens[/b] are species from [[Legacy]], a world which follows and tells the stories of a v...",
            "wiki_body": "[b]Pure faradens[/b] are species from [[Legacy]], a world which follows and tells the stories of a variety of characters. \r\n\r\nPure faradens consist of six mammal orders which existed before the mid-Eocene epoch. Those include:\r\n\r\nrodentians - rodent faradens\r\nchiropterans - megabat faradens\r\nlagomorphans - rabbit and pika faradens\r\nprimates - primate faradens\r\neulipotyphlan - shrew, mole, and hedgehog faradens\r\npilosan - anteater and sloth faradens\r\n\r\nPure faraden males:\r\naverage height: 5'5\"\r\naverage weight: 130lbs\r\ncolors are the same range as males\r\n\r\nPure faraden females:\r\naverage height: 5'1\"\r\naverage weight: 115lbs\r\ncolors are the same range as males\r\n\r\nthumb #749635 thumb #1504986 thumb #2069639\r\n\r\nh6.See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Legacy]]\r\n[[Faraden]]\r\n** [[New_Faraden]]\r\n* [[Qaywa]]\r\n[[Ratteguhn]]\r\n[[Ramiotran]]\r\n[[Cyavian]]\r\n[[Psycrhen]]\r\n[[Onene]]\r\n"
