            "wiki_body": "thumb #1528059 thumb #3071521 thumb #1562369\r\n\r\n[b]Turtwig[/b] (Japanese: ナエトル Naetle) is a Grass-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] from [[generation_4_pokemon|Generation IV]].\r\n\r\nIt evolves into [[Grotle]] starting at level 18, which evolves into [[Torterra]] starting at level 32.\r\n\r\nAlong with [[Chimchar]] and [[Piplup]], [b]Turtwig[/b] is one of three [[starter_trio|starter Pokémon]] of Sinnoh available at the beginning of [i]Pokémon Diamond, Pearl, Platinum, Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl[/i].\r\n\r\n[b]Turtwig[/b] is a small, mainly light-green quadruped Pokémon that resembles a turtle, and more specifically a tortoise. Its eyes, feet and lower jaw are yellow. Its body is covered by a small brown carapace made from earth. Its carapace is bordered by a black stripe and crossed by another stripe, also black.\r\n\r\nA young plant is growing on the top of its head, this plant is brown. The plant on its head weakens as the Pokémon becomes thirsty. \r\n\r\nThey are also classified as the Tiny Leaf Pokémon.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** turtwig\r\n*** [[grotle]]\r\n**** [[torterra]]"
