            "wiki_body": "[b]New faradens[/b] are species from [[Legacy_(ratte)]], a world which follows and tells the stories of a variety of characters. \r\n\r\nNew faradens consist of eight mammal orders which existed from or after the mid-Eocene epoch. Those include:\r\n\r\ncarnivoran - faradens associated with the carnivora order\r\ndiprotodontian - an order of several marsupials\r\ndidelphimorphian - opossum faradens\r\ndasyuromorphian - another order of marsupials\r\nafrosoricidan - otter shrews, tenrecs, etc\r\nperamelemorphian - marsupial omnivores\r\nscandentian - treeshrew faradens\r\nmacroscelidean - sengi faradens\r\n\r\nNew faraden males:\r\naverage height: 6'0\"\r\naverage weight: 155lbs\r\ncolors are the same range as males\r\nNew faraden females:\r\naverage height: 5'6\"\r\naverage weight: 140lbs\r\ncolors are the same range as males\r\n\r\nthumb #1720792 thumb #2007338 thumb #1930909\r\n\r\nh6.See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Legacy]]\r\n* [[Faraden]]\r\n* [[Pure_Faraden]]\r\n* [[Qaywa]]\r\n* [[Ratteguhn]]\r\n* [[Ramiotran]]\r\n* [[Cyavian]]\r\n* [[Psycrhen]]\r\n* [[Onene]]\r\n"
