            "wiki_preview": "thumb #2119196\r\n\r\nWisps are tentacled creatures that appear in the [[sonic_the_hedgehog_(series)|Son...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2119196\r\n\r\nWisps are tentacled creatures that appear in the [[sonic_the_hedgehog_(series)|Sonic the Hedgehog]] series. They are a diminutive, yet powerful alien species from Planet Wisp, although they can be found on many other planets across the universe.  \r\n\r\nWisps were kidnapped and enslaved by [[Dr. Eggman]], who drained them of their \"Hyper-go-on\":https://antifandom.com/sonic/wiki/Hyper-go-on energy to fuel a [[mind control]] ray under the guise of operating an amusement park, until [[Sonic the Hedgehog]] freed them. While most of the Wisps went home after that, some of them decided to stay on Sonic's world after taking a liking to it. Now, in remembrance of Sonic's deeds, the Wisps are ready to offer him and his allies help whenever needed.\r\n\r\nThere are numerous breeds of Wisps, each with its own special ability and personality traits. When a Wisp enters a person, they bestow upon them a certain Color Power that grant them new and powerful abilities.\r\n\r\nh6.Types of Wisp:\r\n* [[indigo_wisp_(sonic)|Indigo Wisp]] - Asteroid\r\n* [[black_wisp_(sonic)|Black Wisp]] - Bomb\r\n* [[white_wisp_(sonic)|White Wisp]] - Boost\r\n* [[red_wisp_(sonic)|Red Wisp]] - Burst\r\n* [[blue_wisp_(sonic)|Blue Wisp]] - Cube\r\n* [[yellow_wisp_(sonic)|Yellow Wisp]] - Drill\r\n* [[crimson_wisp_(sonic)|Crimson Wisp]] - Eagle\r\n* [[purple_wisp_(sonic)|Purple Wisp]] - Frenzy (Nega-Wisp)\r\n* [[jade_wisp_(sonic)|Jade Wisp]] - Ghost\r\n* [[green_wisp_(sonic)|Green Wisp]] - Hover\r\n* [[cyan_wisp_(sonic)|Cyan Wisp]] - Laser\r\n* [[ivory_wisp_(sonic)|Ivory Wisp]] - Lightning\r\n* [[gray_wisp_(sonic)|Gray Wisp]] - Quake\r\n* [[magenta_wisp_(sonic)|Magenta Wisp]] - Rhythm\r\n* [[orange_wisp_(sonic)|Orange Wisp]] - Rocket\r\n* [[pink_wisp_(sonic)|Pink Wisp]] - Spikes\r\n* [[violet_wisp_(sonic)|Violet Wisp]] - Void (Nega-Wisp)\r\n\r\nh6. Named Wisp characters\r\n* [[Yacker]] (White Wisp)\r\n* [[maggie_(sonic)|Maggie]] (Magenta Wisp)\r\n* [[Mother Wisp]]\r\n** [[Nega-Mother Wisp]]\r\n\r\nh6.See also:\r\n* [[Sonic Colors]]\r\n* [[Wispon]]"
