            "wiki_body": "thumb #984696\r\n\r\nSee: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Rattata_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/alolan-rattata/\r\n\r\nAlolan Rattata is an Dark/Normal type variant on \"normal\" [[Rattata]], a Normal-type Pokémon. \r\n\r\nAlolan Rattata is a small, quadruped rat Pokémon. It has dark gray fur. There are two tufts of fur on each ear and near the tip of its tail, which curves tightly at the end. Its long, thin whiskers are replaced by shorter, thicker tufts of fur as well.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[rattata]]\r\n*** [[alolan raticate]]\r\n"
