            "wiki_body": "thumb #3700050 thumb #3718736 thumb #3701736\r\n#1006 [b]Iron Valiant[/b] (テツノブジン, [i]Tetsunobujin[/i]) is a Fairy/Fighting-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX]]. It is one of the [[future_pokemon|Future]] [[paradox_pokemon|Paradox Pokémon]] and is exclusive to [i]Pokémon Violet[/i].\r\n\r\nIron Valiant is a robotic Pokémon that resembles a cross between [[Mega Gardevoir]] and [[Mega Gallade]], containing traits of both of its contemporary equivalents. It is genderless, does not evolve, and is part of the No Eggs Discovered egg group (i.e. it cannot breed).\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[robot_humanoid]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Pokémon\r\n* [[gardevoir]]\r\n** [[mega_gardevoir]] \r\n* [[gallade]]\r\n** [[mega_gallade]] \r\n* [[paradox_pokemon]]\r\n** [[future_pokemon]]\r\n*** [[iron_treads]]\r\n*** [[iron_moth]]\r\n*** [[iron_hands]]\r\n*** [[iron_jugulis]]\r\n*** [[iron_thorns]]\r\n*** [[iron_bundle]]\r\n*** [b]iron_valiant[/b]\r\n*** [[miraidon]]\r\n*** [[iron_leaves]]\r\n*** [[iron_boulder]] \r\n*** [[iron_crown]]"
