            "wiki_body": "thumb #3819743 thumb #3712862 thumb #3745575\r\n\r\n#1002 [b]Chien-Pao[/b] (パオジアン, [i]Paojian[/i]) is a [[legendary_pokemon|Legendary Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX]]. It is a member of the Treasures of Ruin quartet.\r\n\r\nChien-Pao resembles a [[least weasel]] in winter coat, with traits from the [[snow leopard]] and [[smilodon]]. It has bright white fur and crystals covering its body that look like spots. It was created from an artifact called the Sword of Ruin, given life by the hatred of those slain by its wielders. The split halves of the Sword form its two long fangs.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[pantherine]]\r\n* [[white_fur]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Pokémon\r\n* [[legendary_pokemon]]\r\n** [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX]] \r\n*** Paldea\r\n**** [[treasures_of_ruin]] \r\n***** [[ting-lu]] \r\n***** [b]chien-pao[/b]\r\n***** [[wo-chien]] \r\n***** [[chi-yu]] \r\n**** [[koraidon]] \r\n**** [[miraidon]]\r\n**** [[terapagos]] \r\n*** Kitakami\r\n**** [[the_loyal_three]] \r\n***** [[okidogi]] \r\n***** [[munkidori]]\r\n***** [[fezandipiti]] \r\n**** [[ogerpon]]"
