            "wiki_body": "thumb #966829 thumb #1479454 thumb #1260175\r\n\r\nSee: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Marowak_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/alolan-marowak/\r\n\r\nAlolan Marowak is a Fire/Ghost type variant on \"normal\" [[Marowak]], a Ground-type Pokémon. \r\n\r\nAlolan Marowak is a bipedal Pokémon. On its stomach, Alolan Marowak is very light brown in color, as opposed to most its body, which is a dark purple - nearly black.  Alolan Marowak’s head is composed of the skull it once wore as a mask, when it was a [[Cubone]]. It can no longer remove the skull, as it became a part of its body. \r\n\r\nThe Marowak in the Alola region take bones and light both ends on fire by rubbing them against their skull foreheads. The fire takes on a ghostly blue-green hue.  Then they spin the bones around!  Alolan Marowak’s rarity and its fearsome appearance when it dances with its bone led the people of Alola to dub it a conjurer and regard it with fear.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[marowak]]"
