            "wiki_body": "thumb #1576939 thumb #958952 thumb #959420 \r\n\r\nSee: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Exeggutor_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\nhttp://www.pokemon-sunmoon.com/en-us/pokemon/alolan-exeggutor/\r\n\r\nAlolan Exeggutor is a Grass/Dragon type variant on \"normal\" [[Exeggutor]], a Grass/Psychic-type Pokémon. \r\n\r\nThe environment of the Alola region, where strong sunlight pours down all year round, brought about this change in Exeggutor's form. The people of Alola boast that the Alolan Exeggutor is the true form of Exeggutor.\r\n\r\nAlolan Exeggutor is an extremely tall, bipedal Pokémon that strongly resembles a palm tree. Its legs, body, and neck resemble a tree trunk.  It has leaves sprouting from its top, and Exeggutor has three round, light-yellow heads that resemble coconuts, each with differing facial expressions.  Unlike normal Exeggutor, the Alolan Exeggutor has a fourth head — on its tail!\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[Exeggutor]]"
