            "wiki_body": "The \"Amalgamates\":http://undertale.wikia.com/wiki/Category%3AAmalgamates are a group of [[monster|monsters]] from [[Undertale]].\r\n\r\nThere are five canon amalgamates: [[Endogeny]], [[Lemon_Bread]], [[Reaper_Bird]], [[Memoryhead]], and an unnamed one, referred to in tags as [[Snowdrake's_mother]].\r\n\r\nThe character [[Everyman]] is sometimes associated with this tag, as it only exists as part of Reaper Bird's attacks."
