            "wiki_body": "[b]Lunastra[/b] are [[quadruped|quadrupedal]] [[pantherine|pantherine-]]/[[lion|lion-like]], [[elder dragon]], [[dragon|draconic]] creatures found in [[Monster Hunter]]\r\n\r\nThey possess large and fluffy [[mane|manes]] as well as a [[horn|pair of horns]]. They posses [[scales]], [[glowing eyes]], [[membranous wings]], [[tail tuft|tufted tails]], as well as large and sharp [[fangs]] and [[claws]]. They also possess the ability to [[fire breathing|breath fire]].\r\n\r\nLike [[Rathalos]] and [[Rathian]], Lunastra display obvious [[sexual dimorphism]], and are referred to by differing names depending on the gender, with [[male|males]] being called [[Teostra]] whereas [[female]] Teostra are known as [b]Lunastra[/b]. The male Teostra have [[warm colors|warm color schemes]] with [[brown scales]] and [[orange mane|orange manes]], whereas Lunastra have [[cool colors|cooler colors]] with [[blue scales]] and [[blue mane|blue manes]]. Their horn structures are also very distinct, with Teostra having [[ridged horn|ridged]] and [[curved horn|curved horns]] that face backwards, while Lunastra horns are incredibly thick and form a [[crown]]-shaped [[crest]] of sorts.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[dragon]]\r\n* [[monster_hunter]]\r\n** [[elder_dragon]]\r\n*** [[teostra]]\r\n**** [[toa_tesukatora]]\r\n*** lunastra"
