            "wiki_body": "The [b]adepti[/b] are a group of entities in [[Genshin Impact]] primarily consisting of \"illuminated beasts\", creatures with supernatural abilities and the ability to speak human language.\r\n\r\nIlluminated beasts are capable of reproducing with humans, as we see two half-adepti characters in [[ganyu_(genshin_impact)|Ganyu]] and [[yanfei_(genshin_impact)|Yanfei]].\r\n\r\nThey are bound by a contract to protect Liyue from evil gods and spirits, working under the Geo [[archon_(genshin_impact)|Archon]] [[Rex Lapis]]."
