            "wiki_body": "[b]Wookiees[/b] are a fictional species of large, furred, [[humanoid]] creatures from the [i][[Star Wars]][/i] universe. There are strong and intelligent creatures who live on the planet Kashyyyk. The most famous Wookiee is [[Chewbacca]], the co-pilot of the [i][[Millennium Falcon]][/i] who debuted in the original [i]Star Wars[/i] film, [i]Star Wars: Episode IV – A New Hope[/i] (1977)."
