            "wiki_preview": "Wraith is a playable Monster from the video game Evolve. \r\n\r\nThe Monster is described as a gigantic ...",
            "wiki_body": "Wraith is a playable Monster from the video game Evolve. \r\n\r\nThe Monster is described as a gigantic levitating six-limbed alien-like humanoid with no eyes. Its unearthly features include a split bottom jaw with tusks, a top pair of arms that resemble scythes, a bottom pair of arms with four-digits hands that bare claws, a tail and legs that terminate into tentacles, and long protrusions on its back.    \r\n\r\nWraith is commonly considered female due to its distinctively feminine figure that include a narrow waist, wide hips, and featureless breasts.\r\n\r\nDespite the resemblance, \"she\" is not associated with the [[xenomorph]] species. "
