            "wiki_body": "thumb #3389349 thumb #3759853 thumb #3471788\r\n\r\n[b]Hisuian Decidueye[/b] (Japanese: [b]ヒスイのジュナイパー[/b] [i]Hisui no Junaiper[/i]) is a dual-type Grass/Fighting [[regional_form_(pokemon)|regional form]] introduced in [[generation_8_pokemon|Generation VIII]]. It evolves from [[Dartrix]] starting at level 36 and it is the final form of [[Rowlet]] in the \"Hisui region\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Hisui.\r\n\r\nCompared to its [[Decidueye|Alola counterpart]], [b]Hisuian Decidueye[/b] has distinctly shorter light-brown and [[brown wings]] and massive [[white legs]], a reference to the \"Stilt owls\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stilt-owl from which it takes its inspiration.\r\n\r\nThe tips of its legs are equipped with imposing [[black claws]]. On its head and neck, its [[feathers]] form a sort of [[hat]], the top of which is orange with a white [b]\"[[spikes|spike]]\"[/b] and a [[collar]] tied with two large, [[leaf_wings|leaf-like feathers]] [i](these feathers are covered with smaller, orange feathers)[/i]. \r\n\r\n[b]Hisuian Decidueye[/b]'s face is [[white_face|white]] and [[black_face|black]] at the top. It has large, [[round eyes]] with orange rims and two [[stripes]] extending from them. Overall, this [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]]'s appearance seems reminiscent of the outfit worn when practicing \"Yabusame\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yabusame.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[Rowlet]]\r\n*** [[Dartrix]]\r\n**** [[Decidueye]]\r\n**** [b]Hisuian Decidueye[/b]\r\n* [[regional_form_(pokemon)]]"
