            "wiki_body": "thumb #1656251 thumb #4907803 thumb #460580\r\n\r\nSource: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Venomoth_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\n\r\n[b]Venomoth[/b] (Japanese: [b]モルフォン[/b] [i]Morphon[/i]) is a dual-type Bug/Poison [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. \r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Venonat]] starting at level 31. \r\n\r\n[b]Venomoth[/b] is an [[insect]]oid creature with a light [[purple body]]. It has bulbous, round eyes with large pupils and a small mandible.\r\nIts thorax is paler with several black, zigzagging [[stripes]] running across the horizontal length. \r\n\r\nIt has [[multi limb|six]] [[short legs]] and a three-point crest on its head. Its two pairs of [[wings]] are covered in dust-like, [[purple scales]] that vary in color depending on their toxic capability.\r\n[[Dark scales]] are [[poison]]ous, while [[light scales|lighter scales]] can cause [[paralysis]]. These [[scales]] are released when [b]Venomoth[/b] flutters its wings. \r\n\r\n[b]Venomoth[/b] live in dense [[forest]]s with much undergrowth and little [[light]]. As a nocturnal Pokémon, [b]Venomoth[/b] comes out at [[night]] to [[hunting|hunt]] of its favorite prey. It prefers to feed on insects that gather around light, and [b]Venomoth[/b] is attracted to bright lights itself. \r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[venonat]]\r\n*** [b]venomoth[/b]"
