            "wiki_body": "thumb #1656250 thumb #621178 thumb #16872\r\n\r\nSource: http://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Venonat_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\r\n\r\n[b]Venonat[/b] (Japanese: [b]コンパン[/b] [i]Kongpang[/i]) is a dual-type Bug/Poison [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. \r\n\r\nIt evolves into [[Venomoth]] starting at level 31. \r\n\r\n[b]Venonat[/b] has a round body covered in [[purple fur]]. Its has a pincer-like mouth, [[red eyes|red]] [[compound eyes]] and a pair of white [[antennae_(anatomy)|antennas]]. It has a pair of clodhopper [[feet]] and stubby fore[[paws]].\r\n\r\nIts highly developed eyes help it find suitable prey and can shoot powerful beams. Additionally, [[poison]] oozes from all over this Pokémon's body. \r\n\r\n[b]Venonat[/b] can be found in dense [[forest]]s, where it will [[sleeping|sleep]] in the hole of a [[tree]] until [[night]]fall. It sleeps throughout the [[day]] because the small [[insect]]s it feeds on appear only at night. Both [b]Venonat[/b] and its prey are attracted to bright [[light]]s. \r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokemon (species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [b]venonat[/b]\r\n*** [[venomoth]]"
