            "wiki_body": "thumb #568490 thumb #378610 thumb #4395465\r\n\r\n[b]Quilladin[/b] (Japanese: ハリボーグ Hariborg) is a Grass-type [[Pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] that appeared in the [[generation_6_pokemon|Generation VI]].\r\n\r\nIt evolves from [[Chespin]] starting at level 16 and evolves into [[Chesnaught]] starting at level 36.\r\n\r\nh4.Biology\r\n[b]Quilladin[/b] is a bipedal, mammal-like Pokémon that shares similarities with plants. Its body is mainly covered by a carapace that serves as chestnut-like armor, except for its face, lower body, legs and underarms, which remain bare. The visible parts of its body are brown, except for its face, which is lighter.\r\n\r\nLike its evolution, it has oval brown eyes, a pointed muzzle with a small orange nose, triangular brown markings on each cheek, rodent-like incisors and a tuft of brown fur on its forehead. However, this Pokémon has a large ear-like spine on each side of its head with a orange tip. Its tail is similar to its ears. \r\n\r\nIts carapace is striated on its arms and back. The fur on its lower body creates a pointed marking on its belly. It has three white claws on its front legs and only two on its hind legs.\r\n\r\nLike its evolution, [b]Quilladin[/b] was inspired by the [[hedgehog]] and a \"chestnut\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chestnut\r\nIt was probably also inspired by other \"armored\" mammals such as: the pangolin, the armadillo and glyptodon. Its stocky, round appearance is reminiscent of the cup that protects chestnuts.\r\n\r\nIt's a peaceful Pokémon that never starts a fight. \r\n\r\n[[Shiny_pokemon|Shiny]] Quilladin is dark brown and the [[official_art|Canon]] Quilladin is an [[anthro]] (with [[semi-anthro]] subtag). The species is often depicted as further [[anthrofied]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[brown_body]]\r\n* [[green_body]]\r\n* [[facial_hair]] / [[facial_tuft]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[chespin]]\r\n*** quilladin\r\n**** [[chesnaught]]\r\n* \"Bulbapedia: Quilladin\":https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Quilladin"
