            "wiki_body": "A [[felid|felinoid]] race from the [[Master of Orion]] [[videogame]] series.\r\n\r\nIn the first game, they are an aggressive matriarchal society, with soldiers and empress having busty [[humanoid]] figures, and the males relegated to the scientists seen when a new technology is developed.\r\n\r\nThe second game has the society as a patriarchial one, with the characters depicted with more feline attributes. The general aggressiveness towards other races remains, however.\r\n\r\nThe third game almost completely eliminates the species in the manual's backstory and removes them as a playable race, leaving only a few random survivors encountered on occasion when exploring planets.\r\n\r\nThe fourth game, developed after buying the rights from Infogrammes, returns to the matriarchial society and a distinctly female appearance."
