            "wiki_body": "thumb #3747261 thumb #3742784 thumb #3742728\r\n\r\n#0988 [b]Slither Wing[/b] (チヲハウハネ, [i]Chiwohauhane[/i]) is a Bug/Fighting-type [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] introduced in [[generation_9_pokemon|Generation IX]]. It is one of the [[ancient_pokemon|Ancient]] [[paradox_pokemon|Paradox Pokémon]] and is exclusive to [i]Pokémon Scarlet[/i].\r\n\r\nSlither Wing is an insectoid Pokémon with strong similarities to its contemporary relative [[Volcarona]]. Like Volcarona's prior evolution [[Larvesta]], it is [[quadruped|quadrupedal]]. Though it has wings extending off of its back, they are not strong enough to allow it to fly. It is genderless, does not evolve, and is part of the No Eggs Discovered egg group.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[arthropod]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Pokémon\r\n* [[larvesta]]\r\n** [[volcarona]]\r\n* [[paradox_pokemon]]\r\n** [[ancient_pokemon]] \r\n*** [[great_tusk]]\r\n*** [[brute_bonnet]]\r\n*** [[sandy_shocks]]\r\n*** [[scream_tail]]\r\n*** [[flutter_mane]]\r\n*** [b]slither_wing[/b]\r\n*** [[roaring_moon]]\r\n*** [[koraidon]]\r\n*** [[walking_wake]]\r\n*** [[raging_bolt]]\r\n** [[future_pokemon]]\r\n*** [[iron_moth]]"
