            "wiki_preview": "thumb #91695 thumb #4535127 thumb #963828\n\n[b]Vibrava[/b] (Japanese: [b]ビブラーバ[/b] [i]Vibrava[/i]) is...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #91695 thumb #4535127 thumb #963828\n\n[b]Vibrava[/b] (Japanese: [b]ビブラーバ[/b] [i]Vibrava[/i]) is a Ground/Dragon-type [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]. It is a mid-evolution between [[Trapinch]] and [[Flygon]], and is in the `Bug` and `Dragon` [i](new in Gen VII)[/i] egg groups.\n\n[b]Vibrava[/b] was inspired by the [[dragonfly]], whose [[larva]] have the particularity of digging conical [[trap|traps]].\n\nThis Pokémon is an [[insect]] with a [[small head]] with two yellow [[antennae (anatomy)|antennae]] and green [[bulging eyes]] with black oval-shaped [[black pupils|pupils]]. Its mouth has two large white [[teeth]] protruding from each side.\n\nIt has a [[skinny]] [[yellow body]], four skinny [[black legs]] with [[small feet|slender feet]], and four [[green wings|green]], rhombus-shaped [[wings]] with [[black wings|black edges]].\nAt the end of its body are two similar wings.\n\n[[shiny Pokemon|Shiny]] [b]Vibrava[/b] has [[orange wings]] and [[orange eyes|eyes]] instead of [[green eyes|green]].\n\nh4. Related Tags:\n\n* [[arthropod]]\n* [[big_eyes]]\n* [[wings]]\n** [[black_wings]]\n** [[green_wings]]\n** [[two_tone_wings]]\n\nh4. See Also:\n\n* [[Pokemon (species)|pokémon]]\n** [[trapinch]]\n*** [b]vibrana[/b]\n**** [[flygon]]"
