            "wiki_body": "\"Froggit\":http://undertale.wikia.com/wiki/Froggit (/ˈfɹɔː.gɪt/) is a species of [[monster]] encountered in the Ruins. Froggits also appear as NPCs throughout the Ruins. Its Hard Mode and CORE counterpart is Final Froggit.\r\n\r\nFroggit's overall appearance is that of a white [[frog]]. Only its two front [[feet]] are visible, with three black dots on its chest. Between its two front feet is what appears to be some small creature with a rounded mouth and eyes that excessively blink. What exactly this creature is is unknown, as it is never mentioned in Flavor Text or by any Froggits. "
