            "wiki_body": "[b]Leprechauns[/b] are a type of [[fairy]] featured in [[Irish Folklore]]. They are supernatural beings often depicted as short little bearded men, wearing a coat and hat, often having red hair and green clothing.\r\n\r\nAs a form a Fae, Leprechauns are known to be mischievous tricksters known to help or harm humans based on their whims. Leprechauns love to play pranks on humans and repair shoes, but if you manage to capture one, then they may grant wishes, favors, or a large sum of gold in exchange for their freedom. Leprechauns are known to store their wealth within pots found at the end of a rainbow."
