            "wiki_body": "The Asar is a fictional mammalian species created by the late James \"Jim\" Hardiman.\r\n\r\n\"An Asar is not a Gremlin\":https://www.furaffinity.net/view/3719866/\r\nAvg. Height 3-4ft.\r\nPupil shape, Oval.\r\n4 Fingers, 3 Toes\r\nSmooth, hairless skin.\r\nPlantigrade \r\nHave long prehensile tails\r\nOmnivores\r\nReproduce sexually, don't have issues with drinking or reproducing with/in water.\r\nEnjoy the sun\r\nKind, playful, and friendly attitudes\r\nHighly intelligent and talkative\r\nBody temperature, 45°C (114°F)."
