                "wiki_preview": "thumb #863566 thumb #876324 thumb #678943\n\n[b]Eevee[/b] (イーブイ Ībui?, Eievui) is a [[Pokemon (species...",
                "wiki_body": "thumb #863566 thumb #876324 thumb #678943\n\n[b]Eevee[/b] (イーブイ Ībui?, Eievui) is a [[Pokemon (species)|Pokémon species]] in [[Nintendo]] and Game Freak's [i][[Pokémon]][/i] franchise. Created by Ken Sugimori, Eevee first appeared in the video games [i]Pokémon Red[/i] and [i]Blue[/i] and subsequent sequels. They have later appeared in various merchandise, spinoff titles and animated and printed adaptations of the franchise.\n\nKnown as the Evolution Pokémon, Eevee is a fennec-like Pokémon with an unstable genetic code, which allows it to evolve into eight different Pokémon.\n\n[i][b]Notice:[/b] Please do not tag something with the [[eevee]] tag unless there is actually an unevolved eevee in it. Otherwise, use [[eeveelution]] instead.[/i]\n\nh4. See Also:\n\n* [[pokemon (species)]]\n** eevee\n*** [[eeveelution]]\n*** [[all eight eeveelutions]]\n**** [[vaporeon]]\n**** [[jolteon]]\n**** [[flareon]]\n**** [[espeon]]\n**** [[glaceon]]\n**** [[leafeon]]\n**** [[umbreon]]\n**** [[sylveon]]"
