                "wiki_body": "thumb #1571907 thumb #1017437 thumb #1676456 thumb #794931\r\n\r\n[b]Lucario[/b] (ルカリオ [i]Rukario[/i]) is a Fighting/Steel type Pokémon that specializes in the mystical energy of Aura. #448 in the National Pokédex, it is classified as the Aura Pokémon. Lucario first appeared as a central character in the film [i]Pokémon: Lucario and the Mystery of Mew[/i].\r\n\r\nLucario are anthro canine Pokémon with blue and yellow fur, with black markings and a spike adorned on each paw and on the center of their chest.\r\n\r\nLucario is normally based on a canine, though there are hybridization forms of them with other animals, from feline to even kangaroos to some. It's very important to check how they are portrayed in the artwork.\r\n\r\nLucario should generally be tagged as [[anthro]], unless drawn [[feralized]] or [[humanoidized]]. Depending on the art style, the [[semi-anthro]] subtag may apply.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[blue_fur]]\r\n* [[chest_spike]]\r\n* [[mask_(marking)]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[riolu]]\r\n** [[mega_lucario]]"
