                "wiki_preview": "thumb #1499396 thumb #1422202\r\n\r\nSalazzle is a Poison/Fire-type [[generation 7 pokemon|generation 7]...",
                "wiki_body": "thumb #1499396 thumb #1422202\r\n\r\nSalazzle is a Poison/Fire-type [[generation 7 pokemon|generation 7]] [[Pokemon]]. It is a black, lizard-like Pokemon with a purple underbelly and pink flame-like markings. Its [[shiny pokemon|shiny]] color changes the black to white. It evolves from [[female]] [[Salandit]]; male Salandit cannot evolve.\r\n\r\nA Salazzle will create a harem of male Salandit that serve it diligently, and Salazzles compete with each other over who has the biggest harem. It uses its poisonous pheromones to brainwash its opponents, then seduces them with captivating movements into becoming loyal servants."
              }
            ],
            "salandit": [
              {
                "tag": "salandit",
