              "wiki_body": "\"Image's link showing 9G Pokémon\":https://i.pinimg.com/originals/2d/98/5a/2d985aab5a3ec135fd244b7d6ec42542.jpg\n\nThe tag \"[b]Generation 9 Pokémon[/b]\" refers to all the [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon species]] that appeared in the [i]Pokémon Scarlet[/i] and [i]Pokémon Violet[/i] Versions (in Japanese: ポケットモンスタースカーレット・バイオレット [i]Poketto Monsutā SUKĀRETTO・BAIORETTO[/i]).\n\nThe games were released on the Nintendo Switch worldwide on November 18, 2022.\n\nThis tag refers to all Pokémon species spanning from #0906 ([[Sprigatito]]) to #1025 ([[Pecharunt]]). [The very last Pokémon to date]\n* This generation introduces Pokémon from Paldea and also introduces [[Paradox pokemon|Paradox Pokémon]], group made of [[ancient_pokemon|Ancient Pokémon]] and [[future_pokemon|Future Pokémon]].\n\n* The Paldea region is based on Spain, Portugal, and Andorra.\n** Also, this generation includes The Land of Kitakami (for DLCs) [This land is inspired by the Tōhoku region; in Japan].\n\nh4.Fun Fact:\nIt is that generation that brought the number of Pokémon to 1000 species.\n\n[section,expanded=List of Pokémon (9G)]\n* #0906 - [[Sprigatito]]\n* #0907 - [[Floragato]]\n* #0908 - [[Meowscarada]]\n* #0909 - [[Fuecoco]]\n* #0910 - [[Crocalor]]\n* #0911 - [[Skeledirge]]\n* #0912 - [[Quaxly]]\n* #0913 - [[Quaxwell]]\n* #0914 - [[Quaquaval]]\n* #0915 - [[Lechonk]]\n* #0916 - [[Oinkologne]]\n* #0917 - [[Tarountula]]\n* #0918 - [[Spidops]]\n* #0919 - [[Nymble]]\n* #0920 - [[Lokix]]\n* #0921 - [[Pawmi]]\n* #0922 - [[Pawmo]]\n* #0923 - [[Pawmot]]\n* #0924 - [[Tandemaus]]\n* #0925 - [[Maushold]]\n* #0926 - [[Fidough]]\n* #0927 - [[Dachsbun]]\n* #0928 - [[Smoliv]]\n* #0929 - [[Dolliv]]\n* #0930 - [[Arboliva]]\n* #0931 - [[Squawkabilly]]\n* #0932 - [[Nacli]]\n* #0933 - [[Naclstack]]\n* #0934 - [[Garganacl]]\n* #0935 - [[Charcadet]]\n* #0936 - [[Armarouge]]\n* #0937 - [[Ceruledge]]\t\n* #0938 - [[Tadbulb]]\n* #0939 - [[Bellibolt]]\n* #0940 - [[Wattrel]]\n* #0941 - [[Kilowattrel