                "wiki_body": "[b]Future Pokémon[/b] are a category of [[paradox_pokemon|Paradox Pokémon]] introduced in [i]Pokémon Violet[/i]. They are future relatives of present-day Pokémon brought to the current time by [[Professor Turo]]'s time machine. Future Pokémon are universally cybernetic in appearance, featuring metallic bodies with no visible organic parts. Unlike [[ancient_pokemon|Ancient Pokémon]], the names of all Future Pokémon begin with the word \"Iron\" (except for Miraidon). \r\n\r\nThough they appear to be alternate forms of existing Pokémon, they are considered to be distinct Pokémon within the Pokédex and should not be tagged as the species of their present-day relative.\r\n\r\nh3. List of Future Pokémon\r\n* [[Iron Treads]] ([[Donphan]])\r\n* [[Iron Moth]] ([[Volcarona]])\r\n* [[Iron Hands]] ([[Hariyama]])\r\n* [[Iron Jugulis]] ([[Hydreigon]])\r\n* [[Iron Thorns]] ([[Tyranitar]])\r\n* [[Iron Bundle]] ([[Delibird]])\r\n* [[Iron Valiant]] ([[Mega Gardevoir]]/[[Mega Gallade]])\r\n* [[Miraidon]] aka \"Iron Serpent\" ([[Cyclizar]])\r\n* [[Iron Leaves]] ([[Virizion]])\r\n* [[Iron Boulder]] ([[Terrakion]])\r\n* [[Iron Crown]] ([[Cobalion]])"
