              "wiki_body": "thumb #238091 thumb #1084961 thumb #1045350\r\n\r\nA [b]Pokémon humanoid[/b] is a [[Pokémon]] being portrayed as a [[humanoid]] rather than their original forms, often (though not always) in an [[animal humanoid]] fashion with the Pokémon's ears or general features attached to a humanoid body.\r\n\r\nNote however, just like [[animal humanoid|animal humanoids]] in general, they should not be confused with [[anthro|anthros]]/[[human|humans]]/[[humanoid|humanoids]] wearing [[fake ears|fake Pokémon ears]] or [[fake tail|tails]], and/or being in a [[Pokémon costume]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related\r\n\r\n* [[pokemorph]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[alternate_species]]\r\n** [[humanoidized]]\r\n** [[taurification]]\r\n* [[digimorph]]\r\n* [[humanoid]]\r\n** [[animal_humanoid]]\r\n* [[pokémon_costume]]"
