            "wiki_body": "thumb #3158250 thumb #3170862 thumb #3555107\r\n\r\nAn [b]Alpha Pokémon[/b] (Japanese: オヤブン boss) is a variety of [[pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] found in [[pokemon_legends_arceus|Pokémon Legends: Arceus]]. \r\nThey are larger-than-normal Pokémon that appear in Hisui with increased combat capabilities. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, wild alpha Pokémon have [[glowing_eyes|glowing]] [[red_eyes|red]] eyes.\r\n\r\n[b]Source:[/b]\r\nhttps://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Alpha_Pok%C3%A9mon"
