              "wiki_preview": "The stereotypical Grey-skinned [[Alien]] (although they might also be green), with big, [[Empty_eyes...",
              "wiki_body": "The stereotypical Grey-skinned [[Alien]] (although they might also be green), with big, [[Empty_eyes|solidly black]], almond-shaped eyes, scrawny body, and disproportionately big, teardrop-shaped bald head. Thought to hail from Zeta Reticuli in U.F.O. conspiracy circles.\nIn 1947, there was a crash-landing of an Unidentified Flying Object in Roswell, New Mexico. While the government stated the craft to be a weather balloon, some people beleive it was an Honest-to-God [[flying_saucer|flying saucer]] piloted by an Honest-to-God little green man. The craft and pilot were supposedly taken to Groom Lake Air Force base in Nevada, also known as Area 51.\nGreys are usually depicted [[Alien_Abduction|abducting]] people (and/or [[Cattle]]) and giving them [[Anal_Probe|an unscheduled and forceful colonoscopy]] and/or exploratory surgery."
