          "metroid_(species)": [
            {
              "tag": "metroid_(species)",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 441,
              "wiki_preview": "Metroids are the titular alien species of [[Metroid]], bioweapons created by the [[Chozo]] to destro...",
              "wiki_body": "Metroids are the titular alien species of [[Metroid]], bioweapons created by the [[Chozo]] to destroy [[X Parasite|X Parasites]]. Valued due to their combat applications, they are cloned and weaponized by other species across the galaxy, primarily the [[Space Pirate|Space Pirates]].\r\n\r\nOn their homeworld of SR388, Metroids grow past their iconic larval form through a number of more mature ones, starting with the [[Alpha Metroid]] and going through [[Gamma Metroid|Gamma]], [[Zeta Metroid|Zeta]], and [[Omega Metroid|Omega]] before becoming a [[Metroid Queen]]."
            }
