            "wiki_preview": "thumb #2841334 thumb #3948651 thumb #1831985 thumb #4876610\n\n[b]Protogen[/b] are a [[cyborg]] [[alie...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2841334 thumb #3948651 thumb #1831985 thumb #4876610\n\n[b]Protogen[/b] are a [[cyborg]] [[alien]] species created by [[Malice-Risu]] in 2015. They are an open species, but have guidelines on \"proper\" design (see Guidelines section). \n\nProtogen's most identifiable non-biological feature are their face, which is a short, rounded, wedge shaped muzzle, entirely covered in a [[screen face|LED-like \"visor\"]] which typically displays a pair of large simplified eyes, a mouth, and frequently a pair of nostrils. These visors may also display eyebrows, blush/blush lines, sweat drops and even text or symbols. This visor can split open, creating a mouth for the protogen to eat food. Protogen are covered in fur, typically with a mane of fur around their neck, and have 1-3 sets of furred, triangular, canine-like ears. Broadly speaking, Protogen tend to be superficially similar to a canine anthro, or [[furred dragon]] anthro in most respects beyond the features above. \n\nProtogen can have other synthetic parts, such as robotic limbs, an artificial tail, panels (typically on the outer thighs), and a chest plate. While these elements are all part of the \"standard design\" set by Malice-Risu, other artists may give Protogen more human-like anatomy, or omit the \"secondary\" synthetic features. \n\nh5. Official Protogen Reference\nthumb #4880914\n\n[sup]See this post for more information.[/sup]\n\n[section=Guidelines]\n[b][u]Note:[/u][/b] While it's generally considered good practice to do so, it's not required for an artist to follow these rules.\n\n\n\n[b]Protogen exist in three variants:[/b]\n* Common: The standard Protogen. These have two ears. Free to make.\n* Uncommon: These Protogen have two pairs of ears and a pair of horns horns (five variants available). Free to make.\n* Rare: These Protogen have three pairs of ears and can have multiple additional limbs, including extra tails and wings. Must be bought (citation needed).\n\n[b]When creating a Protogen, the following rules must be observed:[/b]\n* Protogen must not have any dinosaur traits/anatomy.\n* Protogen must have biological ears.\n* Protogen must have the short, round visor.\n* Protogen can only be bipedal with no feral forms allowed.\n* Protogen are not allowed to have wings unless they are of the rare variant.[/section]\n\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[primagen]] - a similar species also created by Malice-Risu\n* [[mamagen]] - a fan spin-off species \n\nh4. See Also\n\n[b]Other popular open species:[/b]\n* [[sergal]]\n* [[chakat]]\n* [[synth (vader-san)]]\n"
