            "wiki_body": "A humanoid alien race from the [[Mass_Effect|Mass Effect]] video game universe.\r\n\r\nTurians were the third race to join the Citadel council after defeating the [[Krogan]] during the Krogan Rebellions.  Turians have a highly disciplined and militaristic culture, they serve as the Citadel Councils foremost defense against any threat and possess a vast military fleet with allotments for more Dreadnought class ships than any other race.  The Turian homeworld of Palaven was metal poor and as such had a weak magnetic field.  This meant that more solar radiation was able to pass through the atmosphere, the result was that Turians (and native life on Palaven) adopted a mechanism to create metallic exoskeletons as a form of protection from the harsher environment.  Turian exoskeletons contain small amounts of thulium.\r\n\r\nh1.Related Tags\r\n\r\n* {{alien}}\r\n* {{mass_effect}}\r\n* {{garrus_vakarian}}"
