            "wiki_preview": "Puwas, or pure water, are an [[alien]] species created by the artist [[Sqoon]] (or \"SkoonBoom\":/user...",
            "wiki_body": "Puwas, or pure water, are an [[alien]] species created by the artist [[Sqoon]] (or \"SkoonBoom\":/user/show/SkoonBoom/ ). They've been described to have big squishy butts and collect tiny bits of objects or people they touch to get their genes. [[Sqoon]] has also said one of the reasons for making the species was to have them as a friend to hang around with you.\r\n\r\nMore of the puwa lore is discussed on \"Sqoon's discord\":https://discord.gg/qGDhVW2 in the \"#lore\":https://discordapp.com/channels/304111743599116288/473581683489374221 channel."
