            "count": 730,
            "wiki_preview": "The Mamagen is a fanmade design/species/morph based off of the [[protogen]]. Changes to the standard...",
            "wiki_body": "The Mamagen is a fanmade design/species/morph based off of the [[protogen]]. Changes to the standard protogen include them always being female, being given larger breasts, thicker thighs, less robotics with the ability to take them off, and being larger than the average protogen.\r\nThe name Mamagen is portmanteau of \"Mama\" and \"Protogen\" together.\r\n\r\nThe model and species was made by \"Ghostly_Shark\":https://twitter.com/Ghostly_Shark/status/1404916130615947270 and you can download it on their \"Gumroad\":https://ghostly.gumroad.com/l/mamagen.\r\nThe species is often seen as a playermodel on the video game [[vrchat|VR Chat]].\r\n\r\nTags most seen with this sub-species are:\r\n* [[large_breasts]]\r\n* [[thick_thighs]]\r\n* [[big_butt]]\r\n* [[curvy_figure]]"
