            "count": 729,
            "wiki_preview": "The Chua are a race of small, hamsterlike and sociopathic aliens aligned to the dominion faction of ...",
            "wiki_body": "The Chua are a race of small, hamsterlike and sociopathic aliens aligned to the dominion faction of the game \"Wildstar\":http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WildStar_(video_game). They serve as the dominion as inventors (mainly on weapons), and are one of the four playable dominion races. They are a sexless race, though appear predominantly male, and they have thick facial hair in the way of beards, mustaches, and even eyebrows; they also use masculine pronouns when speaking casually. They are stated to have good relations with the warlike Drakken due to a mutual love of war, carnage and destruction. "
          },
