            "tag": "biomechanical",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 563,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #4610388 thumb #1976402 thumb #918447\r\n\r\nA creature that is a fusion of biological and [[cybor...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #4610388 thumb #1976402 thumb #918447\r\n\r\nA creature that is a fusion of biological and [[cyborg|mechanical]] traits. What sets them apart from a [[cyborg]] are their biological and mechanical components appear to blend seamlessly from one another blurring the line between a [[robot]] and an organic creature.\r\n\r\nh4.As an Aesthetic\r\n\"Biomechanical\" also refers to the aesthetic itself. A seemless blend of the organic and the artificial. Things such as [[scenery]], [[building|architecture]], [[furniture]], [[vehicle|vehicles]], flora and fauna can also have biomechanical traits.\r\n\r\nh4.Examples\r\n* The [[xenomorph|xenomorphs]] from the [i][[alien_(franchise)|Alien]][/i] franchise.\r\n* The [[warframe_(species)|warframes]] from [i][[Warframe]][/i].\r\n* The guyvers from [i][[guyver|Guyver]][/i].\r\n\r\nh4.See also\r\n* [[biopunk]]"
