            "wiki_preview": "Badniks are robots produced by [[Dr. Eggman]]. They are typically mass-produced, and are often used ...",
            "wiki_body": "Badniks are robots produced by [[Dr. Eggman]]. They are typically mass-produced, and are often used to carry out assaults against [[sonic_the_hedgehog|Sonic]] and his allies. Badniks are commonly powered by [[flicky|flickies]], [[chaos_drive|chaos drives]], or [[ring_(sonic)|rings]], though some models have unique power sources or no apparent power source at all.\n\nBadniks tend to have quite artistic designs. They can resemble common animals, insects, plants, other kinds of machinery, or even Eggman himself. Characters like [[Metal Sonic]], [[Belle the Tinkerer]], and [[heavy_(sonic)|Heavy]] are considered badniks even though they are not mass-produced and display higher intelligence."
