            "count": 334,
            "wiki_preview": "thumb #3652064 thumb #3630612 thumb #3638708\nA [b]BellaBot[/b] is a smart delivery [[robot]] manufac...",
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3652064 thumb #3630612 thumb #3638708\nA [b]BellaBot[/b] is a smart delivery [[robot]] manufactured by [i][[Pudu Robotics]][/i]. It is a wheeled white robot with shelves on its sides and a top-mounted touchscreen display with [[domestic cat|cat]]-like \"ears\". Said display will often render an expressive cat face when idle.\n\nh4.Anthrofication of BellaBot\nDue to their cute feline traits the robot has been subject to fan art, often depicting them as [[anthrofied]] feline [[robot|robots]] with a white body and a black [[screen face]]. Variants of the BellaBots have surfaced throughout the years such as [i][[Kerfus]][/i] and [i][[Jollibot]][/i], each variant sporting the color schemes and characteristics of their associated organizations.\n[section,expanded=Examples]\nthumb #3886327 thumb #3638277 thumb #3889485 thumb #3863258 thumb #3638959\n[/section]\n\nh4.See Also\n* [[Kerfus]]\n** [[kerfur_(votv)|Kerfur]] - A fictional [[robot]] from the video game [i][[Voices of the Void]][/i]. Its appearance and name is inspired by Kerfuś.\n* [[Jollibot]]\n\nh4.External Link\n* https://www.pudurobotics.com/product/detail/bellabot"
