            "wiki_body": "A [b]Hocotatian[/b] is an [[alien]] [[humanoid]] race originating from Planet Hocotate, the homeworld of several protagonists from the [i][[Pikmin]][/i] series (2001–present).\r\n\r\nHocotations are an extremely diminutive species growing less than an inch tall, but may be depicted larger in non-canonical works for clarity (especially for appearances in the [i][[Super Smash Bros.]][/i] series, starting in [i]Super Smash Bros. Melee[/i] (2001) and onwards). Have a mostly [[human]] morphology with exception to a round head with [[pointy humanoid ears]], [[big nose|big]] [[bulbous nose|bulbous noses]], and often have [[short hair]] and [[eyes always closed]] as a resting expression. As a consequence of originating from a world with an unoxygenated atmosphere, oxygen is highly toxic for them. The species is highly technologically advanced, processing interplanetary travel via [[spacecraft|spacecraft]] and has colonized several other planets such as Giya and Karut.\r\n\r\nAny character belonging to this race that is not part of the games should be considered as a [[fan character]] of the series.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Koppaite]] - a [[humanoid]] race associated with the main characters of [i][[Pikmin 3]][/i] and similar to Hocotatians."
