            "wiki_body": "Zanburgs ( ザンブルグ, ZANBURUGU). An [[alien]] race devised by the artist [[Petaroh]], capable of shape shifting, and have a larval stage when younger. They are naturally [[herm|hermaphrodites]]. The feature two mouths and typically have stripes. The sexual dimorphism in the species is still unclear. They are voracious eaters, and have two mouths capable of dislocating their jaws. The species goes through several stages of metamorphosis as they age, starting as an egg, then pupae, nymph, and then finally mature. They are commonly seen as a female like biped with tentacles for hair. The tentacles themselves contain a penis or a vagina inside the tips.\r\n\r\nh5. Confusion with [[Sea Angel|Sea Angels]]\r\n\r\nOn 4chan, the species was nicknamed with the term [[sea angel]] due to their sleek, aquatic appearance. However, real sea angels are a markedly different creature bearing little resemblance to the Zanburg.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Alien]]\r\n* [[Sea Angel]]"
