            "wiki_body": "The Daemons of Chaos (also known as the \"Neverborn\") are malevolent entities that exist in a hellish dimension known as the \"Realm of Chaos\" (also known as \"The Warp/The Immaterium\" in Warhammer 40,000).\r\n\r\nThey are present in the universes of [[warhammer_40k|Warhammer 40,000]], [[warhammer_fantasy|Warhammer Fantasy Battle]] and [[warhammer age of sigmar|warhammer: Age of Sigmar ]].\r\n\r\nh5. Gods of Chaos\r\n\r\nThe Chaos Gods (also known as the \"Dark Gods\" or \"The Ruinous Powers\") are powerful, daemonic deities who rule the Realm of Chaos. They feed on the emotions and beliefs of mortal beings of the material plane, and have sought to spread their dark power and dominion over all of reality.\r\n\r\nIt should be noted that the Four Gods of Chaos (Khorne, Nurgle, Tzeentch and Slaanesh) exist in the universes of Warhammer Fantasy, Warhammer 40k and Age of Sigmar.\r\n\r\n* [[Khorne]] - The Chaos God of War, Rage and Bloodshed\r\n* [[Nurgle]] - The Chaos God of Pestilence and Decay\r\n* [[Tzeentch]] - The Chaos God of Change, Mutation and Sorcery \r\n* [[Slaanesh]] - The Chaos God of Hedonism and Excess\r\n* [[the_horned_rat|The Horned Rat]] - The God of the Skaven (who exists only in Warhammer Fantasy and Warhammer: Age of Sigmar)\r\n\r\nh5. [[Daemon_of_Nurgle|Daemons of Nurgle]]\r\n* Great Unclean One\r\n* [[Plaguebearer]]\r\n* Beast of Nurgle\r\n* [[Nurgling]]\r\n\r\nh5. [[Daemon_of_khorne|Daemons of Khorne]]\r\n* Bloodthirster\r\n* [[Bloodletter]]\r\n* [[Juggernaut_of_Khorne|Juggernaut of Khorne]]\r\n* Flesh Hound\r\n\r\nh5. [[Daemon_of_Tzeentch|Daemons of Tzeentch]]\r\n* [[Lord_of_Change|Lord of Change]]\r\n* [[pink_horror|Pink Horror]]\r\n* Blue Horror\r\n* Flamer of Tzeentch\r\n* Screamer of Tzeentch\r\n\r\nh5. [[Daemon_of_Slaanesh|Daemons of Slaanesh]]\r\n* [[Keeper_of_secrets|Keeper of Secrets]]\r\n* [[Daemonette_(warhammer)|Daemonette]]\r\n* [[Fiend_of_slaanesh|Fiend of Slaanesh]]\r\n* [[Steed_of_slaanesh|Steed of Slaanesh]]\r\n\r\nh5. Daemons of the Horned Rat\r\n* [[Verminlord]]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=List of Daemons of Chaos characters]\r\n* [[Skarbrand]] - Mightiest of the Bloodthirsters and once the most favored of Khorne before Skarbrand's betrayal.\r\n* [[Kairos_Fateweaver|Kairos Fateweaver]] - Most powerful of the Lords of Change and the Oracle of Tzeentch.\r\n* [[N'kari]] - Vilest of the Keepers of Secrets and the Chosen of Slaanesh.\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n\r\n"
          }
        ],
