          "wiki_preview": "A darkner is any of the members or creatures that live in the Dark World in the video game [[Deltaru...",
          "wiki_body": "A darkner is any of the members or creatures that live in the Dark World in the video game [[Deltarune]], as opposed to members of the Light World, aka the regular world. Generally speaking, darkners are animated objects, but their level of resemblance to their object forms can vary, so not all of them qualify as [[animate_inanimate]]. As of now, there are four regions in the Dark World that they inhabit, the Card Kingdom, Cyber World, [spoiler]TV World[/spoiler], and [spoiler]Dark Sanctuaries[/spoiler], with each introduced in their respective chapter of the game, but there will likely be more regions as new chapters are added.\n\nh3. List of Darkners, from their original location:\nh5. Card Kingdom (Chapter 1):\n* bloxer\n* [[clover_(deltarune)]]\n* [[hathy]]\n* head hathy\n* [[jevil_(deltarune)]]\n* jigsaw joe\n* [[jigsawry]]\n* [[king_round]]\n* [[king_spade]]\n* [[lancer_(deltarune)]]\n* malius\n* [[maus_(deltarune)]]\n* [[mr._elegance]]\n* mr. society\n* [[pippins_(deltarune)]]\n* [[rabbick_(deltarune)]]\n* [[ralsei]]\n* [[rouxls_kaard]]\n* [[rudinn]]\n* rudinn ranger\n* [[seam_(deltarune)]]\n* [[the_original_starwalker]]\n* [[topchef_(deltarune)]]\nh5. Cyber World (Chapter 2):\n* [[addison_(deltarune)]]\n* [[ambyu-lance]]\n* [[cake_(deltarune)]]\n* [[cap'n_(deltarune)]]\n* [[hacker_(deltarune)]]\n* [[nubert]]\n* [[plugboy]]\n* [[poppup_(deltarune)]]\n* [[queen_(deltarune)]]\n* [[spamton_g._spamton]]\n* [[swatch_(deltarune)]]\n* [[swatchling_(deltarune)]]\n* [[sweet_(deltarune)]]\n* [[tasque]]\n* [[tasque_manager]]\n* [[virovirokun]]\n* [[werewire]]\n* [[werewerewire]]\nh5. [spoiler]TV World[/spoiler] (Chapter 3):\n* [spoiler][[elnina_(deltarune)]][/spoiler]\n* [spoiler][[lanino_(deltarune)]][/spoiler]\n* [spoiler][[pippins_(deltarune)]][/spoiler]\n* [spoiler][[ramb_(deltarune)]][/spoiler]\n* [spoiler]ribbick[/spoiler]\n* [spoiler][[shadowguy_(deltarune)]][/spoiler]\n* [spoiler][[shadow_mantle_(deltarune)]][/spoiler]\n* [spoiler][[shutt