          "tag": "draenei",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 3889,
          "wiki_preview": "The Draenei are a race of Eredar from the MMORPG [i]World of Warcraft[/i].  The Draenei originally f...",
          "wiki_body": "The Draenei are a race of Eredar from the MMORPG [i]World of Warcraft[/i].  The Draenei originally fled their homeworld of Argus and then Draenor following the corruption of the orcs as part of Kil'Jaedan's plot to wipe out the Draenei.  The Draenei came to Azeroth when their ship, The Exodar, crashed in Kalimdor during the game's \"The Burning Crusade\" expansion.\r\n\r\nh1.Appearance\r\n\r\nDraenei are large (generally around 7 feet tall) bipedal creatures with digitigrade legs that end in cloven hooves.  The males of the species have plate-like bone structure over their foreheads and atop the base of their tails, and both genders typically sport horns.  Both genders posess facial tendrils, though the female's tendrils tend to be smaller and thinner. Both genders have muscular tails though the male tail is generally much stouter and larger overall.  Draenei skin color varies from a light pinkish or bluish white to a deep blue or dark violet color.\r\n\r\n[b]Related Tags[/b]\r\n\r\n* {{Warcraft}}"
