          "wiki_body": "From the works and manga series of Akihito Tsukushi ([[made_in_abyss]])\n\n[b]Narehates[/b] (or [i]\"hollows\"[/i]) are beings who have survived the [i]6th layer's curse[/i] and whose bodies have become deformed as a result. They can take many different forms depending on the circumstances of their transformation. Their exact properties as a species are [u]unknown[/u].\n\nWhile many of the narehate at [b]Ilblu[/b] seem to be somewhat amorphous, most of them retain at least some sense of their humanity and are able to communicate with one another using [i]Ilblu's language or gesticulation[/i] compared of those abandoned in the [b]Miniature Garden Of the Dawn[/b] on the 6[sup]th[/sup] layer.\n\nThe word [i]\"narehate\"[/i] comes from the term [i]\"nare no hate\" (成れの果て)[/i] which means [i]\"the shadow of one's former self\"[/i].\nSource: https://madeinabyss.fandom.com/wiki/Narehate\n\nh4.Examples:\nthumb #2142843  thumb #1335641  thumb #1821240  thumb #1867572\n\nh4.See also:\n* {{nanachi}}\n* {{mitty}}\n* {{bondrewd}}\n* {{faputa}}"
