          "wiki_body": "One of the playable races from the MMORPG [[Warcraft|World of Warcraft]], the Night Elves are nature-loving dark-skinned elves who worship the moon goddess Elune and live on Teldrassil, an enormous tree forming its own island, and are aligned with the Alliance faction (meaning they are, for example, friendly to [[Human]]s but hostile to [[Orc]]s)."
