          "count": 2235,
          "wiki_preview": "Zoras (pronounced /ˈzɔːɹə/ ZAW-rə), or Sea Zoras, are a race of hospitable ocean-dwelling creatures ...",
          "wiki_body": "Zoras (pronounced /ˈzɔːɹə/ ZAW-rə), or Sea Zoras, are a race of hospitable ocean-dwelling creatures in The Legend of Zelda series, and are especially common in the 3D console Zelda games. \r\n\r\nPrior to their debut in Ocarina of Time, River Zoras were present in the older titles as an enemy, and similarly also lived in a flooded domain. The name Zora was the original name of both races. Because the two races each have their own domain within the games they appear (the River Zoras almost exclusively appear in the 2D games, while the Sea Zoras almost solely appear in the 3D games), there was no need to distinguish between the two races by name. Oracle of Ages and Echoes of  Wisdom feature both Races along with their leaders Dradd of the river Zora and Kushara of the Sea Zora\r\n"
