          "wiki_preview": "thumb #1695082 thumb #1695117\r\n\r\nNot much is known about this dangerous and mysterious plant except ...",
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1695082 thumb #1695117\r\n\r\nNot much is known about this dangerous and mysterious plant except that it is a plumber's worst nightmare.\r\n\r\nIn [i]Super Mario Bros.[/i], they stick to appearing in pipes. However, over the years, they have developed the ability to breathe fire! In [i]Super Mario 64[/i], several Piranha Plants appeared outside of a pipe. In [i]Super Mario Sunshine[/i], a Piranha Plant named [[Petey Piranha]] was not only capable of moving freely outside of a pipe; it could fly! Let's hope that Piranha Plants stick to their original homes from now-\r\n\r\n-wait... [b]It's in [i][[Super Smash Bros|Smash]] [[Super Smash Bros. Ultimate|Ultimate]][/i]?![/b] Oh, [i]GOD NO![/i]\r\n\r\nh4. See also: \r\n\r\n* [[video_games]]\r\n** [[nintendo]]\r\n*** [[mario_bros]]\r\n**** species\r\n***** [[goomba]]\r\n***** [[koopa]]\r\n***** piranha_plant\r\n***** [[shyguy]]\r\n***** [[yoshi]]"
