          "tag": "shadow_creature",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1806,
          "wiki_preview": "[i]Dark, mysterious, sinister, unfathomable.[/i]\n\n[b]Shadow creatures[/b] come from literal [[shadow...",
          "wiki_body": "[i]Dark, mysterious, sinister, unfathomable.[/i]\n\n[b]Shadow creatures[/b] come from literal [[shadow|shadows]], darkness, and other negative spaces and anti-substances. They are darkly colored, usually with deep [[black_body|blacks]] and sometimes [[purple_body|purple]] highlighting, and often have just a few defining traits, such as [[empty_eyes|empty]], [[white eyes]], a mouth with white teeth, claw-like fingers, and may emit a dark, smoky energy.\n\nShadow creatures can take on a variety of appearances:\n\n* indistinct forms emerging from and spreading darkness\n\nthumb #1416543 thumb #4453881 thumb #2871397 thumb #3706240\n\n* forms with clear outlines but unusual or simple bodies\n\nthumb #2827056 thumb #4383344 thumb #4605433 thumb #5148892\n\n* darkly colored versions of normal, recognizable creatures\n\nthumb #3998079  thumb #3743111 thumb #4208935 thumb #3246628\n\nh4. Do not confuse with\n* [[disembodied_eyes]] - eyes without a body, they may indicate a [[being_watched|watching]] character who's otherwise completely shrouded in darkness. Shadow creatures do have a body of some sort, however indistinct that may be.\n* [[shadow_face]] - faces enshrouded in darkness, but usually with normally colored bodies. Shadow creatures should have uniformly dark bodies.\n* [[silhouette]] - a simple outline of what is usually a background character. They are often shadowy representations of characters but lack the otherworldly qualities of shadow creatures.\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[altered_shadow]]\n* [[elemental_creature]]\n* [[ghost]]\n* [[living_shadow]]\n* [[shadow_(lol)]]\n\nh4. See also\n* [[familiar]]\n* [[inkblot]]"
