          "wiki_body": "The Krogan are a race of large reptilian bipeds native to the planet of Tuchanka. \r\n\r\nKrogan are tall in height (usually 7 ft above) and powerful in physical strength. They are also highly resistant environmental hazards such as radiation, toxins or extreme heat or cold. They have multiple sets of major organs; IE they have two hearts and four lungs. So if the primary organs would cease to function, the secondary ones would serve as backup. Notably, they have two sets of testicles (Quad in Krogan slang). \r\n\r\nh4. Notable Krogan:\r\n\r\n* [[Urdnot_Wrex|Urdnot Wrex]]\r\n* [[Grunt]]"
