          "wiki_body": "thumb #1295569 thumb #1295301\r\n\r\n[b]Dusk Lycanroc[/b] is the third form of [[Lycanroc]], and was introduced in [i]Pokémon Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon[/i]. It evolves from special Rockruff with the ability Own Tempo.\r\n\r\n In its Dusk Form, Lycanroc resembles a combination of the [[midday_lycanroc|Midday]] and [[midnight_lycanroc|Midnight]] forms. It resembles a [[wolf]], mostly covered in [[orange fur]]. It has white fur on its [[paws]], each adorned with sharp claws.  It has a long, fluffy white tail. It has a white mane with spikes emerging from it. It also has black-tipped ears, and [[green eyes]] which [[glowing_eyes|glow]] [[red_eyes|red]] like those of Midnight Lycanroc when attacking. Due to only evolving at sunset, the Dusk Form is considered the rarest of the three forms in Alola.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[Pokémon]]\r\n** [[Rockruff]]\r\n*** [[Lycanroc]]\r\n**** [[Midday Lycanroc]]\r\n**** [[Midnight Lycanroc]]\r\n**** Dusk Lycanroc"
