          "kor": "",
          "count": 1257,
          "wiki_preview": "[b]Ambient butterflies[/b] are small subtle [[butterfly|butterflies]] found off in the background of...",
          "wiki_body": "[b]Ambient butterflies[/b] are small subtle [[butterfly|butterflies]] found off in the background of an image. Ambient butterflies usually behave in a manner consistent with feral butterflies, and contain no anthropomorphic traits. Removing an ambient butterfly would do little to change the feel of an image. They're mostly just there to make the world feel a little more alive. If the main character is interacting with or touching the butterfly in question, it's probably not an ambient butterfly.\n\nUnless a non-ambient butterfly is also depicted, [[butterfly]] [color=red]SHOULD NOT[/color] be tagged.\n\nIf a butterfly is a furry character, tag the image as [[butterfly furry]] to distinguish it from an ambient butterfly.\n\nh4. Common themes\n\n* [[ambient_flier]] - Use when an ambient butterfly is flying.\n* Contact tags\n** [[in_hair]]\n** [[on_arm]]\n** [[on_breasts]]\n** [[on_butt]]\n** [[on_ear]]\n** [[on_face]]\n*** [[on_beak]]\n*** [[on_nose]]\n** Fake objects\n*** [[on_fake_horn]]\n** [[on_foot]]\n** [[on_hand]]\n** [[on_head]]\n** [[on_horn]]\n** [[on_leg]]\n** [[on_penis]]\n** [[on_shoulder]]\n** [[on_tail]]\n*** [[riding_on_tail]] - `on_tail` by itself is a broad concept.\n* Scenery contact tags\n** [[on_fungus]]\n** [[on_plant]]\n*** [[in_tree]]\n*** [[on_flower]]\n*** [[on_leaf]]\n** [[on_rock]]\n\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[ambient_arthropod]]\n** [[ambient_arachnid]]\n*** [[ambient_spider]]\n** [[ambient_insect]]\n*** [[ambient_ant]]\n*** [[ambient_bee]]\n*** [[ambient_beetle]]\n*** [b]ambient_butterfly[/b]\n*** [[ambient_dragonfly]]\n*** [[ambient_firefly]]\n*** [[ambient_fly]]\n*** [[ambient_ladybug]]\n*** [[ambient_moth]]\n** [[ambient_myriapod]]\n* [[ambient_bat]]\n* [[ambient_bird]]\n** [[ambient_owl]]\n* [[ambient_fairy]]\n* [[ambient_sealife]]\n** [[ambient_barnacle]]\n** [[ambient_coral]]\n** [[ambient_crustacean]]\n** [[ambient_fish]]\n** [[ambient_jellyfish]]\n** [[ambient_starfish]]\n* [[ambient_wildlife]]\n** [[ambient_ce