          "wiki_body": "thumb #1194475 thumb #1752058 thumb #787082\r\n\r\n[b]Mega Lucario[/b] is the mega evolved form of [[Lucario]]. Lucario achieves mega evolution by using a Lucarionite.\r\n\r\nMega Lucario design changes upon Mega Evolution. The yellow fur extends and covers their tail, his black markings expand across their body, he obtains more spikes, and his aura sensors on the back of his head grow in size and obtain a red colored tip on two of them.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[riolu]]\r\n*** [[lucario]]\r\n**** mega_lucario"
