          "wiki_body": "Mesprit (Japanese: エムリット Emrit) is a Psychic-type Legendary Pokémon. \r\n\r\nIt is not known to evolve into or from any other Pokémon. \r\n\r\nAlong with {{Uxie}} and {{Azelf}}, Mesprit is a member of the lake guardians, the Sinnoh region's Psychic-type Legendary Pokémon trio. Mesprit is the bringer of emotion\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n*** [b]Generation IV[/b]\r\n**** Lake trio\r\n***** [[uxie]]\r\n***** mesprit\r\n***** [[azelf]]\r\n**** Creation trio\r\n***** [[dialga]]\r\n***** [[palkia]]\r\n***** [[giratina]]\r\n**** Lunar duo\r\n***** [[cresselia]]\r\n***** [[darkrai]]\r\n**** Sea Guardians\r\n***** [[manaphy]]\r\n***** [[phione]]\r\n**** [[arceus]]\r\n**** [[heatran]]\r\n**** [[regigigas]]\r\n**** [[shaymin]]"
