          "wiki_body": "thumb #16879\r\n\r\nGolduck (ゴルダック) is a Water-type Pokémon. It evolves from [[psyduck]], and is in the `Field` and `Water 1` egg groups.\r\n\r\nGolduck is a blue, bipedal, Pokémon. It has red eyes, a cream-colored beak, and four spikes on the back of its head. There is a small, red gem on its forehead. It has webbed hands and feet, which it uses to swim in rivers and lakes. Its body is especially adapted to have a hydrodynamic shape, and it has a long tail that it uses as a rudder to steer. \r\n\r\nShiny golduck is royal blue, and has an orange beak instead of yellow.\r\n\r\nGolduck is usually depicted as [[anthro]]. The [[semi-anthro]] subtag is often applicable.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[duck]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[beak]]\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[psyduck]]"
