          "wiki_body": "thumb #492892 thumb #1591479 thumb #3312204\r\n\r\n[b]Mega Swampert[/b] (Japanese: メガ ラグラージ Mega Laglarge) is a dual-type Water/Ground Mega Pokémon that appeared with the [i]Pokémon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire[/i] versions.\r\n[[Swampert]] can [[mega_evolution|mega evolve]] into [b]Mega Swampert[/b] if it holds a Swampertite.\r\n\r\n[b]Mega Swampert[/b]'s yellowish body parts are dark orange and it is much more imposing. Its hind legs are atrophied and have a more terrestrial appearance. [i](Its legs also lose the \"[[shell|shells]]\" that used to adorn them)[/i]\r\n\r\nIts [[gills]], divided into three branches, are much longer, and it has more \"shells\" on its arms and shoulders. The large shell on each forearm seems to be a kind of propeller that makes it swim faster underwater.\r\n[b]Mega Swampert[/b]'s black fingers are thicker and better defined. It has three fin-like ridges running from its head to its back that are more tapered, especially the one in the center.\r\n\r\nh4.See Also:\r\n* [[pokemon_(species)|pokémon]]\r\n** [[mudkip]]\r\n*** [[marshtomp]]\r\n**** [[swampert]]\r\n***** mega_swampert"
        },
