          "wiki_body": "thumb #1188095\r\n\r\nGolisopod (グソクムシャ) is a Bug/Water-type Pokémon. It evolves from [[Wimpod]], and is in the `Bug` and `Water 3` egg groups.\r\n\r\nIt is a bipedal [[isopod]], with plating that resembles samurai armor. Shiny golisopod has paler silvery tint, hard to tell apart from normal.\r\n\r\nGolisopod has an unusual body structure which makes it difficult to fit into tag categories, but [[anthro]] is usually the best fit.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[biped]]\r\n* [[body_plates]]\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n* [[isopod]]\r\n* [[metallic_body]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[wimpod]]"
