              "wiki_body": "thumb #2533315 thumb #1527818 thumb #2897297 thumb #2891976\r\n\r\n[b]Tears[/b] are fluid secreted by the lacrimal glands. These secretions are salty and overflows from the eye(s).\r\n\r\n[b]Tears[/b] appear in the form of drops that run down the cheeks: the verb used to describe the production of tears is \"[[crying]]\".\r\n\r\nThis tag is used to refer to images or animations in which at least one character has [b]tears[/b] on their face/around their eye(s), but may not be actively crying. This includes a single tear drop in the corner of each eye. Example below:\r\n\r\nthumb #687917   \r\n\r\nSometimes shedding tears may occur when anyone is cutting up onions when cooking.\r\n\r\nh4. Forms\r\n\r\n* [[bloody_tears]]\r\n* [[flying_tears]]\r\n* [[teardrop]]\r\n* [[tears_of_pleasure]]\r\n** [[happy_tears]]\r\n* [[waterfall_tears]]\r\n* [[watery_eyes]]\r\n* [[welling_tears]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[crying]]\r\n* [[crying_laughing]][s][/s]"
