              "wiki_body": "thumb #1571100 thumb #2586668 thumb #690720\r\n\r\nA specific form of [[multi ear]], often seen in [[animal humanoid|animal humanoids]] in [[Japanese]] media, in which a character has multiple ears with a pair of both [[pointy and animal ears|pointed humanoid ears]] and animal-like ears.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[human_and_animal_ears]], a similar form of multi ear but with [[human]]-like ears.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[animal_humanoid]]\r\n* [[multi_ear]]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Animal anatomy tags]\r\n\r\n** [[animal_anus]]\r\n** animal_ears\r\n*** [[human_and_animal_ears]]\r\n*** [b]pointy_and_animal_ears[/b]\r\n** [[animal_head]]\r\n** [[animal_genitalia]]\r\n*** [[animal_penis]]\r\n*** [[animal_pussy]]\r\n** [[animal_legs]]\r\n\r\n[/section]"
