            "wiki_body": "thumb #4076505\r\n\r\n[[frill_(anatomy)|Frills]] that are on the sides of the head and take the place of ears. \r\nCommonly seen on reptilian characters, some [[pokémon]] and can sometimes appear on [[dragon|dragons]].\r\n\r\nh4. To not confuse with:\r\n* [[head_wings]] - [[membranous_wing|wings]] on the head, usually at the place of ears\r\n\r\nh4.Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[frill_(anatomy)]]\r\n** [[dorsal_frill]]\r\n** [b]ear_frill[/b]\r\n** [[fin_frill]]\r\n** [[head_frill]]\r\n** [[neck_frill]]\r\n* [[membranous_frill]] - to precise that the frill is membranous and not [[bone_frill|made of bones]].\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[fin]]\r\n** [[fin_frill]]"
