            "kor": "",
            "count": 2121,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #956049 thumb #1393228 thumb #2597979 thumb #277547\n\nThis tag is used when a character grips another by the ear (or ears). Note that this is not necessarily [[violence|violent]] (such as you'd see during [[rough sex]]) but could be done just to get someone's attention.\n\nFor a character gripping more than one ear of a single character, also use [[grabbing_both_ears]].\nFor a character gripping their own ear, use [[holding ear]] or the plural form [[holding_both_ears]] instead.\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[ear_pinch]]\n* [[ear_pull]]\n* [[ear_rub]]\n* [[hand_on_ear]] - A hand touching a single ear for any reason.\n* [[hand_on_ears]] - A hand touching more than one ear for any reason.\n* [[hands_on_ear]] - More than one hand touching a single ear for any reason.\n* [[hands_on_ears]] - A character with their ears being touched by more than one hand.\n* [[lifted_by_ears]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[tag_group:grab]]\n* [[tag_group:touching]]\n* [[head_grab]]\n** [[neck_grab]]\n** [[throat_grab]]\n* [[restrained]]"
          },
          {
            "tag": "ear_bite",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 2111,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2002251 thumb #2074309 thumb #2101907\r\n\r\nWhen a character is shown [[bite|biting]] their own, or another character's ear. \r\n\r\nThis may be done playfully or affectionately by another character, it can also be seen as a sign of possessiveness and/or dominance. When a character bites their own ear, it may be done as a cute or [[seductive]]/flirty pose, or done as a self-soothing mechanism. [[Feral]] characters may bite ears as a part of play fighting or grooming. \r\n\r\nAs the ear can be an erogenous zone, a character biting another's ear may be done to flirt, or as a part of foreplay, an ear bite might be done while also performing [[fingering]] or a [[handjob]] on the \"target\"; ear biting may be seen during sexual intercourse as well, sometimes indicating [[rough sex]].\r\n\r\n[quote]h5. Tagging Notes\r\n\r\n* [b]Not to be confused with a [i][[notched ear]][/i] even with a \"notch\" resembling (or even created by) a bite taken out of the ear.[/b]\r\n* If the character is biting their own ear(s), tag [[self bite]] as well\r\n* If the character is chewing or nibbling on the ear, use [[ear nibble]]\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[bite]]\r\n** [[self bite]] \r\n* [[ear lick]]\r\n* [[ear nibble]]"
