        "furniture": {
          "_Self (furniture)": [
            {
              "tag": "furniture",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 358831,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #257917 thumb #222870 thumb #833737 thumb #967093 thumb #829719\r\n\r\n[b]Furniture[/b] refers to movable objects intended to support various activities such as seating (e.g. [[chair|chairs]], [[stool|stools]], and [[sofa|sofas]]), or sleeping (e.g. [[bed|beds]]); furniture is also used to hold objects at a convenient height for work (as horizontal surfaces above the ground, such as tables and desks), or to store things (e.g., cupboards and shelves). \r\n\r\nh4. Furniture by Purpose:\r\n[i]Note: this list is incomplete[/i]\r\n\r\nh5. Sitting/Resting\r\n* [[bed]]\r\n* [[chair]]\r\n** [[armchair]]\r\n* [[chaise_lounge]]\r\n* [[fainting couch]]\r\n* [[footstool]]\r\n** [[ottoman]]\r\n* [[seat]]\r\n* [[sofa]]\r\n* [[stool]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh5. Storage/Surfaces\r\n* [[bookshelf]]\r\n* [[cabinet]]\r\n** [[cupboard]]\r\n* [[counter]]\r\n* [[desk]]\r\n* [[dresser]]\r\n* [[nightstand]]\r\n* [[shelf]]\r\n* [[table]]\r\n** [[coffee table]]\r\n** [[glass table]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. External: \r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Furniture\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[forniphilia]]\r\n* [[living_furniture]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
            }
          ],
          "chair": {
            "_Self (chair)": [
              {
                "tag": "chair",
                "kor": "",
                "count": 52037,
                "wiki_body": "A [b]chair[/b] is a stable, raised surface used to [[sitting|sit]] on, commonly for use by one person. Chairs are most often supported by four legs and have a back; however, a chair can have three legs (in a triangle shape) or could have a different shape depending on the criteria of the chair specifications. It is also the solution to the riddle \"What do you sit on, but can't take with you?\".\r\n\r\n...Okay, really. You're likely [i]sitting[/i] on one right now.\r\n\r\nh4.Chair types:\r\n* [[armchair]]\r\n* [[bondage_chair]]\r\n* [[beach_chair]]\r\n* [[lawn_chair]]\r\n* [[lounge_chair]]\r\n* [[office_chair]]\r\n* [[recliner]]\r\n* [[rocking_chair]]\r\n* [[throne]]\r\n* [[wheelchair]]\r\n* [[wooden_chair]]\r\n\r\nh4.Chair-related tags:\r\n* [[chair_bondage]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[furniture]]\r\n** [[stool]]"
              }
            ],
            "on_chair": {
              "_Self (on_chair)": [
                {
                  "tag": "on_chair",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 9219,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #2852385 thumb #3579448 thumb #2044308\nA character that is sitting, standing, kneeling, or laying on a [[chair]] in any way.\n\n\nh3. Related tags\n\nh5. Related furniture\n* [[chair]]\n** [[gaming_chair]]\n* [[wheelchair]]\n\nh5. Positions\n* [[sitting on chair]] - [[sitting]] on a chair\n** [[sitting backwards]]\n* [[reclining]]\n* [[kneeling on chair]] - [[kneeling]] on a chair\n* [[lying]]\n** [[on front]]\n** [[on back]]\n* [[standing on chair]] - [[standing]] on a chair\n\n* [[tied_to_chair]] - a character is being tied (bound) to a chair\n\n\nh3. See also\n\nh5. Character on\n* [[on_ground]]\n** [[on_grass]]\n* [[on_rock]]\n* on_fourniture\n** [[on_bed]]\n** [[on_sofa]]\n** [b]on_chair[/b]\n\nh5. Adjacent subjects\n* [[tag_group:pose]]\n* [[tag_group:settings]] - list of places where the scene can be"
                }
