                  "count": 7271,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #3350094 thumb #2852385 thumb #3109237 thumb #3441209\r\n\r\nA character [[sitting]] on any kind of [[chair]]. If a character is sitting facing the back of the chair, use [[sitting backwards]] as well.\r\n\r\nNot to be applied to a character sitting on a stool, bench, or sofa.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Sitting on... Tags\r\n* [[sitting on bench]]\r\n* [[sitting on branch]]\r\n* [[sitting on log]]\r\n* [[sitting on sofa]]\r\n* [[sitting on stool]]\r\n* [[sitting on stump]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[Sitting]]\r\n* [[Chair]]\r\n** [[Furniture]]"
