            "office_chair": [
              {
                "tag": "office_chair",
                "kor": "",
                "count": 4236,
                "wiki_body": "thumb #987510 thumb #583108\r\n\r\nAn [b]office chair[/b], [b]computer chair[/b] or [b]desk chair[/b], is a type of [[chair]] that is designed for use at a [[desk]] in an office. It is usually a [[swivel chair]], with a set of wheels for mobility and adjustable height, although there are non-swiveling office chairs available. May have arm rests.\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Office chair\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Office_chair"
