                "count": 252,
                "wiki_body": "thumb #2278400\r\n\r\nA [b]swivel chair[/b], [b]spinny chair[/b], or [b]revolving chair[/b] is a [[chair]] with a seat that can rotate 360 degrees left or right on a central leg. They often have wheels or casters on the base to allow a seated person to move along the floor without getting up. Many [[office chair|office chairs]] and [[gaming chair|gaming chairs]] are swivel chairs, but not all of them.\r\n\r\nh4.See also\r\n\r\n* [[chair]]\r\n** [[deck chair]]\r\n** [[electric chair]]\r\n** [[gaming chair]]\r\n** [[office chair]]\r\n** [b]swivel chair[/b]"
