              "count": 100400,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #1631549 thumb #4513433 thumb #2688806 thumb #267694 thumb #4814574 thumb #2921021 thumb #1348601 thumb #4238004\r\n\r\n[b]Facial hair[/b] is a word used to describe the [[hair]] that grows on the lower part of the face (\"cheeks\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheek, around the \"mouth\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mouth, \"chin\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chin etc…)\r\nIt's a \"secondary sexual characteristic\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secondary_sex_characteristic found mainly in [[male|males]].\r\n\r\n[b]Facial hair[/b] appears late in \"puberty\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puberty:\r\n* On the lower \"lip\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lip, around age 15 [i](in human years)[/i]\r\n* On the cheeks and chin, around age 16 [i](in human years)[/i]\r\n\r\nh4. For Tagging Purposes\r\n① This tag is used to describe [b]ALL[/b] types of facial hair [i]([[beard]], [[goatee]], [[mustache]] etc…)[/i]\r\n② [[Eyebrows]] and [[eyelashes]] are [b][u]NOT[/u][/b] considered to be included as “[b]facial hair[/b]”\r\n③ [[Fur]] and [[mane|manes]] (usually) only apply with “[b]facial hair[/b]” when they are [b]emulating human growth patterns[/b]\r\nh4.Example\r\nthumb #59186\r\n\r\nh4. Tags About Facial Hair\r\n\r\n* [b]facial_hair[/b]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Tags About Facial Hair]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Colors of Facial Hair]\r\nh4. [[tag_group:colors|Colors]] of Facial Hair\r\n\r\n* [[black_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[blonde_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[blue_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[brown_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[green_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[grey_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[orange_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[pink_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[purple_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[red_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[white_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[yellow_facial_hair]]\r\n\r\n* [[monotone_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[multicolored_facial_hair]]\r\n** [[two_tone_facial_hair]]\r\n\r\n* [[dark_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[light_facial_hair]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[section,expanded=Types of Facial Hair]\r\n\r\n* [[beard]]\r\n* [[goatee]]\r\n* [[mustache]]\r\n* [[sideburns]]\r\n* [[soul_patch]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Actions\r\n* [[brushing_facial_hair]]\r\n* [[facial_hair_trimming]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with \r\n* [[hair]] – Which are threadlike strands on the head\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[body_hair]]\r\n* [[hairy]]\r\n* [[pubes]]"
            }
