              "wiki_body": "thumb #1245389 thumb #1255032 thumb #1419322\r\n\r\n[b]Hair accessory[/b] refers to one of two things:\r\n\r\n* A type of fashion [[accessory]] designed to be placed on top of a character's head, or in their [[hair]] / [[pseudo hair]].\r\n\r\n* An object serving as a fashion accessory, but not necessarily designed to be one. Accessories of this type are placed in a region where a character's hair would naturally be. Accessories may be attached to [[fur]], [[feathers]], metal, or even ambiguous body textures. Artist liberties make it possible to fix anything to a location where hair should be without the need for a character to have hair.\r\n\r\nSometimes accessories are depicted over [[headwear]] in a way that mimics the usage of hair accessories. This is more common with characters that are recognized for always wearing a certain outfit, and the outfit is usually tied in with the identity of that character. \r\n\r\nThis tag doesn't require a character to have [[hair]] to be used.\r\nThis tag also applies to objects that resemble characters ([[doll]], [[plushie]]).\r\n\r\nh4. Tags About Hair\r\n\r\n* [[hair]]\r\n\r\n[section=Tags About Hair]\r\n\r\n[section=Colors of Hair]\r\nh4. [[tag_group:colors|Colors]] of Hair\r\n\r\n* [[auburn_hair]]\r\n* [[black_hair]]\r\n* [[blonde_hair]]\r\n* [[blue_hair]]\r\n* [[brown_hair]]\r\n* [[cream_hair]]\r\n* [[green_hair]]\r\n* [[grey_hair]]\r\n* [[orange_hair]]\r\n* [[pink_hair]]\r\n* [[purple_hair]]\r\n* [[red_hair]]\r\n* [[silver_hair]]\r\n* [[tan_hair]]\r\n* [[teal_hair]]\r\n* [[white_hair]]\r\n\r\n* [[monotone_hair]]\r\n* [[multicolored_hair]]\r\n** [[rainbow_hair]]\r\n** [[two_tone_hair]]\r\n\r\n* [[dark_hair]]\r\n* [[light_hair]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Hair Accessories]\r\n* [b]hair_accessory[/b]\r\n** [[feather_in_hair]]\r\n** [[flower_in_hair]]\r\n** [[hair_beads]]\r\n** [[hair_bell]]\r\n** [[hair_ribbon]]\r\n*** [[hair_bow]]\r\n** [[hair_ring]]\r\n** [[hair_sticks]]\r\n** [[hair_tie]