              "wiki_body": "thumb #1277034 thumb #1273553 thumb #1261717\n\nA colored cosmetic, typically in powder form, applied to the eyelids or to the skin around the eyes to accentuate them.\n\nNote that eyeshadow is [i]not[/i] the same as eyeliner: eyeshadow is more often than not used upon the whole upper eyelid, whereas eyeliner is used very close to the lashline and can also be used to encircle the whole eye as well, commonly seen in things like [[goth]] aesthetics.\n\nh4.Related\n\n* [[Blue eyeshadow]]\n* [[Black eyeshadow]]\n* [[Gold eyeshadow]]\n* [[Green eyeshadow]]\n* [[Orange eyeshadow]]\n* [[Pink eyeshadow]]\n* [[Purple eyeshadow]]\n* [[Red eyeshadow]]\n\nh4.See also\n\n* [[Colored nails]]\n* [[Makeup]]\n** [[Eyeliner]]\n** Eyeshadow\n** [[Lipstick]]\n** [[Mascara]]"
