              "tag": "furgonomics",
              "kor": "furgonomics",
              "count": 62704,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #2001661 thumb #2001663 thumb #2433641\n\n[b]Furgonomics[/b] is the modification of a functional object for furry features like ears, tails, wings, paws, and hooves. Examples include modified clothing, objects, furniture, and architecture. \n\nThe name \"furgonomics\" is a portmanteau of the words \"fur\" and \"ergonomics.\"\n\nh6. Furgonomic subtags\n* [[furgonomic_bottomwear]]\n* [[furgonomic_eyewear]]\n* [[furgonomic_footwear]]\n* [[furgonomic_headwear]]\n** [[furgonomic_hat]]\n*** [[furgonomic_baseball_cap]]\n* [[furgonomic_hood]]\n* [[furgonomic_swimwear]]\n* [[furgonomic_topwear]]\n* [[furgonomic_underwear]]\n** [[furgonomic_panties]]\n\nIf the lack of furgonomics actively restricts the user, then the item is [[non-furgonomic]].\n\nh5. See also\n* [[furry_bodymod]]\n* [[furry-specific_piercing]]\n* [[tail accessory]]\n** [[tail_garter]]\n* [[tail_clothing]]\n** [[tail_button_bottoms]]\n** [[tail_warmer]]"
            }
          ],
