            {
              "tag": "empty_eyes",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 14997,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #860327 thumb #2724593 thumb #2389700\r\n\r\nPosts depicting one or more characters that possess eyes that are uniformly one color or a gradient of it.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n* [[blank_stare]] - Where a character's eyes are totally unfocused, causing an \"empty\" expression indicating a lack of emotion.\r\n* [[empty_eye_sockets]] - Where a character's [[eyeball|eyeballs]] are missing from their eye sockets.\r\n* [[no_pupils]] - Where a character does have both a sclera and an iris, but no visible pupils.\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n* [[stylized_empty_eyes]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[beady_eyes]]\r\n* [[no_pupils]]\r\n* [[no_sclera]]"
