          "stylized_empty_eyes": [
            {
              "tag": "stylized_empty_eyes",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 249,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #2584753 thumb #2562574 thumb #2390827\r\n\r\n[b]Stylized empty eyes[/b] refers to [[empty eyes]] that have other facial features ([[eyebrows]], [[eyelashes]]), or things such as [[tears]] shown as part of the shaping of the eyes. Other examples of stylized empty eyes may involve eyes that have a particularly unusual shape, a [[watery eyes]] variant may show the border as wavy instead of smooth for example.\r\n\r\n[sup]Note: Black empty eyes are particularly susceptible to feature combination due to black on black blending.[/sup]"
