              "tag": "object_in_mouth",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 13291,
              "wiki_body": "An object that is inside of, or being supported by a mouth.\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\n\r\n[b]This tag applies when...[/b]\r\n\r\n- An object is being held using the mouth ([[mouth_hold]])\r\n- An object is being bitten. [[Food]] qualifies as an object when it isn't considered a creature.\r\n- An [[sex toy]] penetrating the mouth probably counts ([[sex_toy_in_mouth]], [[dildo_fellatio]])\r\n- [[animate_inanimate|Living objects]] probably count as both `object_in_mouth`, and [[body_in_mouth]], but only if they are small enough to be supported by the mouth, and is being carried in a manner similar to how an object would be carried.\r\n\r\n[b]This tag does not apply to...[/b]\r\n\r\n- Most types of [[gag]] should use [[gagged]] instead. An exception is when the gag resembles some other object, or utilizes improvised objects ([[bone_gag]], [[stuff_gag]], [[panties_in_mouth]])\r\n- Creatures being held in the mouth that aren't living objects ([[body_in_mouth]])\r\n- Creatures being consumed that aren't living objects ([[vore]])\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. Specific Objects \r\n\r\n* [[bone_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[condom_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[cigarette_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[cigar_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[flower_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[food_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[leash_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[lollipop_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[pacifier_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[popsicle_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[thermometer_in_mouth]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[eating]] - Consuming an edible substance\r\n* [[mouth_hold]]\r\n* [[object_ingestion]] - Consuming an inedible object\r\n* [[object in throat]]\r\n* [[object in stomach]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n\r\n* [[body_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[oral_penetration]]"
