            "tag": "furrification",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 9290,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #111991 thumb #122673 thumb #1658105 thumb #2190938 thumb #2800517 thumb #4645569\r\n\r\n[b]Furrification[/b] is the depiction of things (such as characters, objects, and concepts) with no animal traits in their original forms portrayed as [[anthro|anthros]].\r\n\r\nIt is similar in concept to [i]personification[/i], but skewed towards bestial anthropomorphism.\r\n\r\nh4. These include\r\n* [[Human]]\r\n** Real people ([[Barack Obama]], [[Bill Nye]], etc.)\r\n** Fictional characters ([[The Doctor]], [[Link]], etc.)\r\n* Anything with no animal traits\r\n** Non-animal [[humanoid|humanoids]] ([[elf|elves]], [[goblin|goblins]], [[troll|trolls]], etc.)\r\n** Non-animal living things (bacteria, [[fungi]], [[tree|trees]], etc.)\r\n** Non-animal constructs ([[digital_creature|digital creatures]], [[mythological_golem|golems]], [[robot|robots]], etc.)\r\n** Non-animal [[animate_inanimate|animate inanimates]] ([[living_costume|living_costumes]], [[living_doll|living dolls]], etc.)\r\n** Non-animal [[inanimate_object|inanimate objects]] ([[appliance|appliances]], [[furniture]], [[toy|toys]], etc.)\r\n** Non-animal, non-humanoid [[mythological_creature|mythological creatures]]\r\n* Concepts (nature, countries, [[death_(personification)|Death]], etc.)\r\n\r\nh4. These do not include\r\n* [[Feral|Ferals]]\r\n* Anything with animal traits\r\n** Anthros\r\n** [[animal_humanoid|Animal humanoids]]\r\n** Animalistic constructs (bull golems, animal-like [[digimon_(species)|Digimon]], robot dogs, etc.)\r\n** Animalistic animate inanimates\r\n** Animalistic inanimate objects (chairs with cat ears, [[rubber duck]]s, [[teddy bear]]s, etc.)\r\n** Animalistic mythological creatures ([[Cerberus]], [[dragon]]s, [[unicorn]]s, etc.)\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n* [[anthrofied]] - Anything with animal traits depicted as anthros or anthros depicted as even more anthro compared to their original forms.\r\n* [[feralized]] - Non-feral characters depicted as straight up animals (ferals).\r\n* [[cosplay]]\r\n** [[fursuit]] - Non-anthros wearing anthro costumes.\r\n* [[transformation]] - Characters transformed from their original forms into anthros.\r\n** [[human to anthro]]\r\n** [[humanoid to anthro]]\r\n* [[humanoidized]] - Characters depicted with minimal animal traits.\r\n** [[inanimate to anthro]]\r\n** [[taur to anthro]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n* [[alternate form]] - Depictions of a character as the same species but in a different body plan/form.\r\n** [[humanoid]]\r\n*** [[humanoidized]] - Depictions of a character as the same species but in a more humanoid form with minimal non-human traits.\r\n** [[anthro]]\r\n*** [[anthrofied]] - Depictions of a character as the same species but in a more anthropomorphic form.\r\n** [[feral]]\r\n*** [[feralized]] - Depictions of a character as the same species but in a more animalistic form.\r\n** [[taur]]\r\n*** [[taurification]] - Depictions of a character as the same species but with a secondary lower torso that is more feral.\r\n* [[alternate species]] - Depictions of a character as a different species.\r\n** [[humanized]]\r\n** [[dragonification]]\r\n** [[ponification]]"
