            "wiki_body": "thumb #3573827 thumb #2523569 thumb #3530162  thumb #3587292 thumb #1477005\r\n\r\nWhen the inside of a character's mouth is depicted with a [i]notable amount of detail,[/i] featuring intricate line art and/or complex rendering. \r\n\r\nMost detailed mouth images are [[mouth shot|mouth shots]] and [[headshot portrait|headshot portraits]], however, not all mouth shots feature a detailed mouth, and not all posts featuring a detailed mouth are mouth shots or headshot portraits. Detailed mouths are especially common in suggestive mouth related art, in content related to [[oral]] sex, and particularly in [[oral vore]]. A detailed mouth is particularly noticeable on characters who are otherwise heavily stylized or cartoonish.\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\nh5. What makes a mouth detailed?\r\n\r\nA detailed mouth will have some level of realistic anatomical features of the oral cavity that are often omitted in more stylized mouths. Tonsils, folds in the back of the throat, ridges in the roof of the mouth, creases, wrinkles, and taste buds or spines on the tongue, sometimes with species-correct oral/dental anatomy, and detailed, noticeable (even excessive) amounts of [[saliva]] are some realistic elements that define a \"detailed mouth\". \r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Tags about the Mouth and Details of the Mouth\r\n\r\n* [[open mouth]]\r\n** [[gaping mouth]]\r\n\r\nh6. Views of the Mouth\r\n\r\n* [[inside mouth]]\r\n* [[internal oral]]\r\n* [[mouth shot]]\r\n** [[reverse mouth shot]]\r\n\r\nh6. Parts of the Mouth\r\n\r\n* [[teeth]]\r\n** [[sharp teeth]]\r\n** [[buckteeth]]\r\n** [[fangs]]\r\n* [[throat]]\r\n* [[tongue]]\r\n** [[long tongue]]\r\n** [[forked tongue]]\r\n* [[uvula]]\r\n\r\nh6. Tags about [[Saliva]]\r\n\r\n* [[excessive saliva]]\r\n* [[saliva string]]\r\n* [[saliva on tongue]]\r\n* [[saliva drip]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[imminent oral vore]]\r\n* [[mouthplay]]\r\n* [[oral invitation]]\r\n* [[presenting mouth]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[d