        "feet": {
          "_Self (feet)": [
            {
              "tag": "feet",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 694045,
              "wiki_body": "The [b]foot[/b] is the lower part of a leg below the ankle that makes contact with the ground while standing, walking, and other physical activities. Most characters with legs will also have feet attached to them. The most common types of feet include [[humanoid feet]], [[paws]], and [[hooves]]. Although other types of feet exist such as [[webbed feet]] and [[avian_feet| the foot structure of birds]].\n\n[[Toes]] are appendages attached to the end of a foot. Common features of toes may include [[toenails]], [[claws]], and [[talons]]. The underside of the foot is referred to as a [[soles|sole]], and may feature a spongy like surface known as a [[pawpads|paw pad]].\n\nh4. Tagging guidelines\n\n* The tag is used when a character's foot is visible in the image.  If there is no clothing present on the foot and the character is otherwise [[clothed]], the [[barefoot]] tag should also be used.\n* [[Paws]], and [[hooves]] that function as feet should be tagged as feet. Those tags do not imply `feet`, but may apply to feet.\n\nh4. Tagging checklist\n\n[i]Not all designs may cleanly fit into one of these categories.[/i]\n\n[table]\n[thead]\n[tr][th]Types[/th][th]Features[/th][th]Anatomy forms[/th][th]Digit count[/th][th]Additional forms[/th][/tr]\n[/thead]\n[tbody]\n[tr][td][[avian_feet]][/td][td][[heel_claw]], [[scutes]], [[talons]][/td][td][[digitigrade]]\n[[plantigrade]][/td][td][[3_toes]], [[4 toes]] (most common), [[5_toes]][/td][td][[anisodactyl]], [[zygodactyl]][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][[featureless_feet]][/td][td]round or pointed stub[/td][td][[digitigrade]] (rarely)\n[[plantigrade]] (if it has a form, it is likely this one)[/td][td]None[/td][td]See also [[featureless_legs]][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][[hooves]][/td][td][[dewclaw_hooves]][/td]\n[td][[hooved_plantigrade]]\n[[unguligrade]][/td]\n[td][[2_toes]] (usually does not have toes)[/td][td][[cloven_hooves]][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][[humanoid_feet]][/td][td][[soles]], [[toenails]][/td][td][[plantigrade]] (always)[/td][td][[2_toes]], [[3_toes]], [[4 toes]], [[5_toes]] (most common)[/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][[paws]][/td][td][[dewclaw]], [[toe_claws]], [[pawpads]] (not exclusive to paws in fictionalized designs)[/td][td][[digitigrade]] (naturally)\n[[plantigrade]] (See [[bear]], [[lagomorph]], and [[rodent]] species)[/td][td][[2_toes]], [[3_toes]], [[4 toes]] (most common)[/td][td][[hindpaw]][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][[webbed_feet]][/td][td][/td][td][[digitigrade]]\n[[plantigrade]][/td][td][[2_toes]], [[3_toes]] (common), [[4 toes]] (common), [[5_toes]][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\nh4. Examples\n\n[section,expanded=Examples]\n\nh4. Ferals and taurs\n\nThe feral, or quadruped form will most likely have [[paws]], or [[hooves]].\n\n[table]\n\n[tbody]\n[tr]\n[td]\nthumb #1411310\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3775469\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3622034\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3881774\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3815959\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\nh4. Anthros\n\nThe anthro form may have any type of foot. Many will have [[paws]].\n\n[table]\n[tbody]\n[tr]\n[td]\nthumb #3389208\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #4030435\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #4044547\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #4024463\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3444262\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/tbody]\n\n[tbody]\n[tr]\n[td]\nthumb #3821618\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3718438\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3948591\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #1963534\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #1850245\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\nh4. Humans and humanoids\n\nThe humanoid form will usually have [[humanoid feet]].\n\n[table]\n[tbody]\n[tr]\n[td]\nthumb #2408173\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #3779105\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #2529611\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #2446871\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\nh4. Compare with\n\n* [[featureless_legs]]\n\n[table]\n[tbody]\n[tr]\n[td]\nthumb #3438925\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #1330500\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #4836229\n[/td]\n[td]\nthumb #4746709\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\n[/section]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[foot_focus]]\n* [[footprint]]\n** [[pawprint]]\n* [[humanoid_feet]]\n* [[1_toe]], [[2