              "wiki_body": "thumb #2809770 thumb #2317771  thumb #1824843 thumb #3138862\n\n[b]Foot focus[/b] describes when a character's feet are the focus of an image, but drawn along with other parts (or all) of the character's body. The most common approach to foot focused images has the feet drawn in perspective, and facing the viewer, so they appear large, close, and take up most of the frame. \n\nIn addition to drawing the feet in perspective - or as an alternative to perspective - the character's pose, added detail to the feet (such as wrinkles of the soles), and lighting of the feet, can be used to draw focus to the feet. Foot focused images can also involve a character doing something with their feet, interacting with their own feet, or interacting with another's feet. Foot focused images are heavily associated with [[foot fetish|foot fetishism]]; they can also be frequently seen in the context of [[macro]] content - where the giant character is about to step on the viewer. \n\n[i][b]Note: for images that [u]only[/u] show a character's feet, use [[foot shot]] instead[/b][/i]\n\nh5. Subcategories of Foot Focus:\n* [[Heel Focus]]\n* [[Hoof Focus]]\n\nh4. Related Tags:\n* [[barefoot]]\n* [[humanoid feet]]\n* [[pawpads]]\n* [[toes]]\n** [[spread toes]]\n\n* [[perspective]]\n* [[foreshortening]]\n* [[low-angle view]]\n** [[worm's-eye view]]\n\nh4. See Also:\n* [b]\"Focus\" Tags[/b]\n** [[Butt Focus]]\n*** [[Anus Focus]]\n** [[Genital Focus]]\n*** [[Balls Focus]]\n*** [[Penis Focus]]\n*** [[Pussy Focus]]\n** [[Breast Focus]]\n** [[Pecs Focus]]\n** [[Belly Focus]]\n** [[Face Focus]]\n*** [[Mouth Focus]]\n** [[Foot Focus]]\n*** [[Heel Focus]]\n*** [[Hoof Focus]]\n* [[crush]]\n** [[stomping]]\n* [[foot fetish]]"
