              "wiki_body": "thumb #2021 thumb #945558 thumb #2570746 thumb #357216\n\nAn appendage (either a hand or foot) that is similar to the [[feet]] of most quadrupedal [[mammal|mammals]] (including [[digitigrade]] species ([[fox]], [[wolf]], [[domestic_cat|cat]], [[leopard]], and [[plantigrade]] species ([[bear]], [[mouse]], [[rabbit]]). Many paws have [[claws]] and [[pawpads]] depending on the species. Some animals (like [[rabbit|rabbits]]) do not actually have [[pawpads]] but may be depicted with them. Walking with paws may leave [[pawprint|pawprints]].\n\nHands that resemble paws are called [[handpaw|handpaws]], and for feet they are called [[hindpaw|hindpaws]]. Characters featuring handpaws are sometimes associated with [[semi-anthro]] characters.\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n\n* [[paw_gloves]] - Clothing in the shape of paws should not be tagged as paws.\n\nh4. General guidelines\n\n* [[Hooves]] are not commonly referred to as paws.\n* The digits of a paw may be treated as [[toes]], if treated as a foot, and [[fingers]], if treated as a hand.\n\nh4. Interaction tagging\n\nDepending on the nature of the interaction, a concept may be tagged as either a hand action `hand_on_`, or a foot action `foot_on_`, and sometimes a forepaw action `forepaw_on_`.\n\nTo find hand actions involving paws, it is suggested to search using this format: {{handpaw hand_on_face}}.\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[claws]]\n* [[digitigrade]] - Such as the hindpaws of [[felid|felids]] (felid/feline), and [[canid|canids]] (canid/canine). [[Plantigrade]] hindpaws do exist in species such as [[ursid|bears]], and some artists may hybridize paws with humanoid feet. Those types of hybridized feet might be considered paws, especially if they have [[pawpads]], but some designs may be better described as only [[feet]].\n* [[pawpads]] - Spongy like surface on the underside of many paws. Pads on the fingers are know as [[fingerpads]].\n* [[pawprint]] - Also known as animal tracks, pawprints are the printed representation of paws.\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[feet]]\n** [[avian_feet]]\n** [[hindpaw]]\n** [[hooves]] (Ungulate feet)\n*** [[cloven_hooves]]\n** [[humanoid_feet]]\n** [[webbed_feet]]\n* hands\n** [[handpaw]]\n** [[hoof_hands]]\n** [[humanoid_hands]]\n** [[webbed_hands]]\n* [b]paws[/b]\n** [[handpaw]]\n** [[hindpaw]]\n** [[pawpads]]\n\nh6. Digit Features\n\n* [[fingers]]\n* [[toes]]\n\n* [[claws]]\n** [[finger_claws]]\n** [[toe_claws]]\n* [[talons]]"
            }
