              "wiki_body": "thumb #2669009 thumb #2148516 thumb #2486017 thumb #667475\r\n\r\n[b]Holding both legs[/b] is used when a character is holding both their legs. It should not be used to interact with another character's legs.\r\n\r\nFor a character supporting another character's raised legs, use [[grabbing raised legs]] instead.\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[holding_both_ankles]]\r\n* [[holding_both_knees]]\r\n* [[holding_both_thighs]]\r\n\r\n* [[holding_legs_back]] - Holding involving legs being held in a [[folded]] position.\r\n* [[holding_legs_up]] - Holding involving legs being held in a raised position.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[full_nelson]] - A grabbing based wrestling move.\r\n* [[grabbing_both_legs]]\r\n** [[grabbing_both_ankles]]\r\n** [[grabbing_both_knees]]\r\n** [[grabbing_both_thighs]]\r\n* [[grabbing_raised_legs]]\r\n* [[holding_leg]] - This refers to when only one leg is being held.\r\n* [[leg_grab]] - Grabbing another character's ankle, knee, or thigh.\r\n** [[ankle_grab]]\r\n** [[knee_grab]] - Grabbing another character's knee.\r\n** [[thigh_grab]] - Grabbing another character's thigh.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[curled_up]]\r\n* [[hand_on_leg]] - A hand making contact with a single leg regardless of context.\r\n** [[hand_on_knee]] - A hand making contact with a single knee regardless of context.\r\n** [[hand_on_thigh]] - A hand making contact with a single thigh regardless of context.\r\n* [[hands_on_leg]] - A character with multiple hands on a single leg or another character's leg.\r\n** [[hands_on_knee]] - A character with multiple hands on a single knee or another character's knee.\r\n** [[hands_on_thigh]] - A character with multiple hands on a single thigh or another character's thigh.\r\n* [[hands_on_legs]] - A character with multiple hands on their own legs or another character's legs.\r\n** [[hands_on_knees]] - A character with multiple hands on their own knees or another character's knees.\r\n** [[h