        "grabbing_both_legs": {
          "_Self (grabbing_both_legs)": [
            {
              "tag": "grabbing_both_legs",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 3004,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #2634571 thumb #2340559 thumb #2600327\r\n\r\nA character grabbing more than one leg of another character. Grabbing can be defined as applying pressure to something, usually while gripping it with their fingers. Although this tag also applies to characters who lack fingers that happen to be simulating a grabbing action.\r\n\r\nFor a character grabbing only one leg belonging to a single character, use [[leg grab]] instead.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=General guidelines]\r\n\r\nh5. Anatomy\r\n\r\n* The [[butt]] borders the underside of the thigh. Try not to confuse it with the leg region.\r\n* The pelvis/hip borders the thigh. This area may be recognized by the presence of [[crotch lines]]. These lines are sometimes misleading as fatty areas may be present on either side of the crease. Generally if the action is very high up (above the crotch), it may be part of the hips, and [[hip grab]] should be used instead. In some cases it may make sense to tag both.\r\n\r\nh5. Tagging\r\n\r\n* Should not be used for a character grabbing the leg of multiple characters.\r\n* The applicable plural grabbing tag ([[grabbing_both_thighs]], [[grabbing_both_knees]], etc) should be used if the same area of the leg is grabbed. Do not use singular grabbing tags in this situation.\r\n* The applicable singular grabbing tag ([[thigh_grab]], [[knee_grab]], etc) may be used in cases where the legs are grabbed in different areas.\r\n* This action is tagged individually per character. If two characters are each grabbing a single leg of the same character, singular grabbing tags should still be used.\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[grabbing_both_ankles]]\r\n* [[grabbing_both_knees]]\r\n* [[grabbing_both_thighs]]\r\n\r\n* [[grabbing_raised_legs]]\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[holding_both_legs]] - A character holding / grabbing more than one of their own legs.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[full_nelson]]\r\n* [[hands_on_legs]] - A character with multiple hands on their own legs or another character's legs.\r\n** [[hands_on_knees]] - A character with multiple hands on their own knees or another character's knees.\r\n** [[hands_on_thighs]] - A character with multiple hands on their own thighs or another character's thighs.\r\n* [[hand_under_leg]]\r\n* [[hands_under_legs]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:touching]]\r\n\r\n[section=Leg anatomy terms]\r\n\r\n* [b]Leg[/b] - A limb designed to support a character's weight.\r\n\r\n* [b]Fore leg[/b] - The front leg of a character with more than two legs, usually a [[quadruped]]. \r\n* [b]Hind leg[/b] - The rear leg of a character with more than two legs, usually a [[quadruped]].\r\n\r\n* [b]Joints[/b] - A flexible pivot point between two anatomical regions.\r\n** [b]Ankle[/b] - The joint between the lower leg, and the foot.\r\n** [b]Knee[/b] - The joint between the thigh and the lower leg.\r\n\r\n* [b]Upper leg[/b] - The part of the leg above the knee (if one exists).\r\n** [b]Thigh[/b] - The thigh represents the entire area of the upper leg.\r\n\r\n* [b]Lower leg[/b] - The part of the leg below the knee.\r\n** [b]Shin[/b] - The anterior (front) side of the lower leg.\r\n** [b]Calf / Calves[/b] - The posterior (rear) side of the lower leg.\r\n\r\nh5. [b]Related anatomy[/b]\r\n\r\n* [b]Foot / Feet[/b] - An anatomical structure that is attached to the end of the leg via the ankle joint.\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Singular tags]\r\n\r\n* [[leg_grab]]\r\n** Mid leg\r\n*** [[knee_grab]]\r\n** Upper leg\r\n*** [[thigh_grab]]\r\n** Lower leg\r\n*** [[ankle_grab]] - The area in between the leg and foot\r\n*** [[calf_grab]]\r\n*** [[shin_grab]]\r\n\r\nh5. Related anatomy\r\n\r\n* [[foot_grab]] - Currently used for both singular and plural grabs.\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Plural tags]\r\n\r\n* [b]grabbing_both_legs[/b]\r\n** Mid leg\r\n*** [[grabbing_both_knees]]\r\n** Upper leg\r\n*** [[grabbing_both_thighs]]\r\n** Lower leg\r\n*** [[grabbing_both_ankles]] - The area in between the leg and foot.\r\n*** [[grabbing_both_calves]]\r\n*** [[grabbing_both_shins]]\r\n\r\nh5. Related anatomy\r\n\r\n* [[foot_grab]] - Currently used for both singular and plural grabs.\r\n\r\n[/section]"
