            "kor": "",
            "count": 325,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2321324 thumb #63169 thumb #1999771 thumb #956524\r\n\r\nA character with more than one hand touching a single leg. This can involve hands belonging to the same character or another character. A hand in this context includes appendages (featureless stubs, paws, hooves) that take the place of hands.\r\n\r\nThis does not apply to situations where a character is touching their leg, while another character touches that same leg. It might apply to multiple different characters touching a single leg at the same time, but this use case is still being researched.\r\n\r\nh4. Combination tags\r\n\r\nThere are four possible hand / leg combination tags. Use the one that best fits what is happening in the image. If you can identify which part of the leg is being handled, tag that as well.\r\n\r\n[table]\r\n[thead]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th]Singular/Singular [/th][th] Singular/Plural [/th][th] Plural/Singular[/th][th]Plural/Plural[/th]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/thead]\r\n[tbody]\r\n[tr]\r\n[td] [[hand_on_leg]]   [/td][td]   [[hand_on_legs]] [/td][td] [b]hands_on_leg[/b] [/td][td] [[hands_on_legs]] [/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[td] [[hand_on_ankle]]   [/td][td]   [[hand_on_ankles]] [/td][td] [[hands_on_ankle]] [/td][td] [[hands_on_ankles]] [/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[td] [[hand_on_knee]]   [/td][td]   [[hand_on_knees]] [/td][td] [[hands_on_knee]] [/td][td] [[hands_on_knees]] [/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[td] [[hand_on_thigh]]   [/td][td]   [[hand_on_thighs]] [/td][td] [[hands_on_thigh]] [/td][td] [[hands_on_thighs]] [/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/tbody]\r\n[/table]\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[hands_on_own_leg]]\r\n\r\n* [[hands_on_ankle]]\r\n* [[hands_on_knee]]\r\n* [[hands_on_thigh]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[holding_leg]]\r\n* [[leg_grab]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:touching]]\r\n\r\n* [[hand_on_leg]]\r\n** [b]hands_on_leg[/b]\r\n* [[hand_on_legs]]\r\n* [[hands_on_legs]]"
