            "tag": "thigh_jiggle",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 325,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3256575 thumb #3217477 thumb #2434459\r\n\r\n[b]Thigh jiggle[/b] describes quick, subtle wobbling or rippling motions of the thighs, typically seen on characters with [[thick thighs]] or [[huge thighs]]. \r\n\r\nA characters thighs may jiggle while walking, jumping, or bouncing in place, thigh jiggling is also often seen when a character is [[twerking]] or [[shaking butt|shaking their butt]]; thigh jiggling may be a reaction to the butt (or rarely, the thighs themselves) being slapped or spanked, a character thrusting or being thrust into during sexual activities. Thighs are usually depicted as jiggling alongside the character's [[butt jiggle|butt jiggling]]; this tag is often overlooked for the more obvious jiggling of the butt, and is undertagged in general.\r\n\r\nIn still images - as with other examples of jiggling - \"echoing\" curved [[motion lines]] around the character's thighs imply the wobbling movements. \r\n\r\n[section= Animated Examples]\r\nThigh jiggling is most often seen in animated posts\r\n\r\nthumb #3189872 thumb #2739160 thumb #1862793 thumb #3162058\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* Thighs\r\n** [[Thick Thighs]]\r\n** [[Huge Thighs]]\r\n** [[Hyper Thighs]]\r\n* [[Shaking Butt]]\r\n* [[Twerking]]\r\n* [[Ass Clapping]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Jiggling]] \r\n** [[Belly Jiggle]]\r\n** [[Breast Jiggle]]\r\n** [[Butt Jiggle]]\r\n** [b]Thigh Jiggle[/b]\r\n* [[Bouncing]]"
