            "wiki_body": "thumb #1672977 thumb #1672978 thumb #1672979\r\n\r\n[b]Legendary birds[/b] is a collective term used to refer to the [[legendary trio]] of [[Articuno]], [[Zapdos]], and [[Moltres]]. They are also known as the [i]winged mirages[/i].\r\n\r\nBeing the first Legendary trio, they set the standards for future trios; they all share similar attributes and—in the case of most of the future trios—are considered equal among themselves. Like other trios later would, the Legendary birds share a master in [[Lugia]], as well as two common traits: their flying-type and their abilities.\r\n\r\nThey are all based on various legendary birds in [[mythology]]: Articuno is based upon the arctic-associated [[roc]] and/or simurgh, Zapdos is based upon the electricity-associated thunder bird, and Moltres is based upon the fire-associated  [[phoenix]] and/or various [[firebird (species)|firebirds]].\r\n\r\nThis tag requires the entirety of the trio in one post, interacting or not.\r\n\r\nh4. Members\r\n\r\n* [[articuno]]\r\n* [[zapdos]]\r\n* [[moltres]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[pokémon]]\r\n** [[pokémon_(species)]]\r\n*** [[legendary_pokémon]]\r\n**** [[legendary_trio]]\r\n***** legendary_birds"
