            "tag": "earth",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1953,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1690936 thumb #2202263 thumb #1184526 thumb #1970787\n\n[b]Earth[/b] — [i]Terra, Tellus, Sol III, \"the third rock from the Sun\"[/i] — the [[planet]] you are (probably) on right now. \n\nEarth is a terrestrial planet orbiting the [[Sun]] in our [[Solar System]], and currently the only known planet that supports life. This tag is ideally for images and animations where the Earth itself is seen from [[space]], but can be used for miscellaneous visual representations that do not fall under [[map]] or [[globe]]. \n\n[i]For a list of nations and territories on Earth, see [[tag group:countries]].[/i]\n\n[quote]h6. This tag should [u]not[/u] be used for:\n* [[Dirt]]: sometimes referred to as earth\n* [[Globe]]: a spherical representation of the Earth (or another planet), usually with printed labels\n* Fictional Earth-like planets - to be tagged as \"Earth\" the continents should at least vaguely resemble the shape of those found in reality\n* [[Earth Pony|Earth ponies]] from [[My Little Pony]][/quote]\n\nh4. [i]The [[Solar System]][/i]\n* [[Sun]]\n* [[Mercury (Planet)|Mercury]]\n* [[Venus (Planet)|Venus]]\n* [b]Earth[/b]\n** [i][[Moon]][/i]\n* [[Mars (Planet)|Mars]]\n* [[Jupiter (Planet)|Jupiter]]\n* [[Saturn (Planet)|Saturn]]\n* [[Uranus (Planet)|Uranus]]\n* [[Neptune (Planet)|Neptune]]\n* [i][[Pluto (Dwarf Planet)|Pluto]][/i]\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[planet]]\n* [[star]]\n* [[space]]\n** [[spacescape]]\n* [[terra macro]]\n"
