            "tag": "torso_shot",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1028,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2501773 thumb #3729037 thumb #322517 thumb #1145509\r\n \r\n[b]Torso shot[/b] describes a closely cropped image of a character's torso — their chest and abdomen.\r\n\r\nThese shots usually range from the character's neck to their crotch, or mid-thigh. Torso shots should [b]never[/b] include a full view of the character's face, which should either be partially or entirely cropped out. \r\nTorso shots may be more closely focused on specific parts of the character's torso, in these cases, include tags such as [[belly focus]], [[crotch shot]], or [[breast focus]].\r\n\r\n[b]Note:[/b] Avoid using this tag for cropped/disembodied torsos on [[model sheet|model sheets]].\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[abs]]\r\n* [[belly]]\r\n** [[navel]]\r\n* [[breasts]]\r\n* [[close-up]]\r\n* [[faceless character]]\r\n* [[featureless chest]]\r\n* [[featureless crotch]]\r\n* [[pecs]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[breast shot]]\r\n* [[butt shot]]\r\n* [[crotch shot]]\r\n* [[foot shot]]\r\n* [[eye shot]]\r\n* [[mouth shot]]\r\n* [[portrait]]\r\n"
