            "wiki_body": "thumb #1017437 thumb #2070768 thumb #199861 thumb #1658733 thumb #2207135 thumb #4009014\n\nAny background detailed enough to place the scene in a clearly defined location. Note that sparse does not equal [[simple background]]. Scenery such as unfurnished rooms or clear skies with just a couple of clouds count as detailed backgrounds.\n\nBlurry background scenery also usually counts as detailed, but should additionally be tagged as [[blurred background]].\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[amazing_background]] - An additional tag for especially detailed backgrounds.\n* [[simple_background]] - The utter absence of a detailed background.\n\nh4. See also\n* [[detailed]]\n* [[tag group:background]]"
