            "wiki_body": "thumb #3315705 thumb #3320442\r\n[b]Lekku[/b] (singular [b]lek[/b]) are long fleshy appendages that protrude from the head of [[twi'lek|Twi'leks]], [[togruta|Togrutas]] and male [[Ozrelanso]]. The Togrutas sport three of them in tandem with [[montrals (anatomy)|montrals]], while the other species have two (occasionally four, in the case of Twi'leks).\r\n\r\nAt least in the case of Twi'leks (from whom the [[organs]] were named by or after) their lekku are highly sensitive and relatively prehensile; their movement comprises an entire aspect of the species' body language, and in rare cases, individuals may have the motor control to handle objects with their lekku. [[pseudo hair|Somewhat analogous]] to [[hair]], some Twi'leks style their lekku by [[tattoo|tattooing]] them or wrapping them over their shoulders.\r\n\r\nFor the Togruta, the lekku portray an aspect of [[sexual dimorphism]], as they grow longer in [[female|females]] than in [[male|males]]. The [[markings]] on these lekku are natural, varying due to genetics. Additionally, the soft tissue of the lekku transition into the hard hollow [[montrals (anatomy)|montrals]] atop Togrutas' heads.\r\n\r\nTrauma to a lekku is a devastating injury, as should a lekku be [[severed body part|severed]] from a Twi'lek, critical medical aid must be administered within an hour lest they die. Togruta are more resilient from such injuries, but none the less are impacted by disfigurement. Those who survive surgery often wear a [[prosthetic]].\r\n\r\n[b]Note:[/b] \"Lekku\" has also been adopted by some in the [i][[Invader Zim]][/i] fandom to refer to the [[antennae (anatomy)|antennae]] of the [[irken]] species. As they are more [[arthropod|arthropodal]] in appearance, please tag them as `antennae (anatomy)` even if [[text]] refers to them as \"lekku\".\r\n\r\nh4.External links\r\n* Wookieepedia — Lekku (\"Canon\":https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Lekku / \"Legends\":https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Lekku/Legends?wprov=sfti1#)\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[antennae (anatomy)]]\r\n* [[head tail]]\r\n* [i][[Invader Zim]][/i]\r\n** [[irken]]\r\n* [i][[Star Wars]][/i]\r\n** [[haillu (anatomy)]]\r\n** [[montrals (anatomy)]]\r\n* [[tentacles]]\r\n** [[tentacle hair]]\r\n"
