            "kor": "악취 나는 얼굴",
            "count": 940,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3359839 thumb #3448464 thumb #2575726 thumb #3460581 thumb #3229623\r\n\r\n[b]Stinkface[/b] describes when a character shoves their [[butt]] into [[face in ass|another character's face]], usually while pinning them against a wall or other object, and [[grinding|rubs]] their butt on, or thrusts their butt into the \"victim's\" face, as an act of [[humiliation]] and [[dominant|dominance]]. \r\n\r\nIn some cases the \"stinkfacer\" will grab their victims head, and push them face first into their butt crack, or grab their target's wrists, ears, or legs to force them against their butt. While being stinkfaced, a character may willingly, or be forced to perform [[rimming]] on the dominant party.\r\n\r\nStinkface can generally be thought of as a more aggressive, non-sitting counterpart to [[facesitting]].\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\nh5. Notes:\r\n\r\n* While \"[b]stink[/b]face\" implies the character's butt is odorous or unclean, scent doesn't necessarily play a role to be tagged as stinkface; however, [[musk]], [[steam]], [[farting]] or a [[sweaty butt]] may be involved.\r\n\r\n* A character being \"stinkfaced\" is either an unwilling party, or, if willing, clearly [[submissive]]. [b]A character willingly pushing their face into another's butt, without being physically pushed into it by the other character is NOT being stinkfaced[/b], posts featuring a character willingly shoving their face into a butt should be tagged as [[face in ass]], [[head between cheeks]], [[rimming]], and/or [[butt sniffing]] as appropriate.\r\n\r\n* Although \"sitting\" stinkface is possible, it is rarely depicted, to distinguish it from facesitting, it would involve the character rubbing their butt on the character sat on, specifically to humiliate them, rather than idly sitting on the other character's face  \r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n\r\nh5. Common Themes/Elements:\r\n\r\n* [[butt smother]]\r\n* [[butt slam]]\r\n* [[sweaty butt]]\r\n** [[sweaty anus]]\r\n\r\n* [[defeated]]\r\n* [[dominant]]/[[submissive]]\r\n* [[farting]]\r\n** [[farting on face]]\r\n* [[forced]]\r\n** [[forced rimming]]\r\n** [[forced oral]]\r\n* [[humiliation]]\r\n* [[size difference]]\r\n* [[taunting]] \r\n* [[wrestling]] - a defeated opponent being stinkfaced as a \"humiliation move\" \r\n\r\n\r\nh5. Common Poses/Actions:\r\n* [[against surface]]\r\n** [[against wall]]\r\n* [[ass up]]\r\n* [[bent over]]\r\n* [[pinned]]\r\n* [[grinding]]\r\n* [[thrusting]]\r\n\r\n* [[hand on another's head]]\r\n* [[head between cheeks]]\r\n* [[between butts]]\r\n* [[butt in face]]\r\n* [[face in ass]]\r\n* [[nose to anus]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[butt crush]]\r\n* [[butt worship]]\r\n* [[facesitting]]\r\n* [[sitting on another]]\r\n\r\n"
