            "tag": "body_control",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 792,
            "wiki_body": "To put it simply, [b]Body Control[/b] is a term used to describe when someone's actions are being dictated, while they are still awake and aware of what is happening.\n\nIt refers to a form of partial [[possession]] where an external force takes over control of another's body with the exclusion of the host's mind or head, forcing them to experience everything the bodyjacker does to their body. This enables the host to commentate (in thought form or even verbally) at their current predicament as another drives their body around and do as they please with it regardless of the host's consent.\n\nThis tag does not include instances where the controlled character has been hypnotized, or if their perception has been altered to cause such actions.\n\nh4. Methods of body control\n* [[magic]]\n* [[voodoo]]\n* mechanical bondage ([[bound]])\n* [[mind control]]\n* [[possession]]\n* [[telekinesis]] \n* [[conjoined]]\n* [[merging]]"
