            "wiki_body": "When two different color hues exist in a single character's tail. Not to be used when only two shades of one color are used.\r\n\r\nConsider using other tail colors in addition to this tag.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Tail colors:]\r\n\r\n* [[black_tail]]\r\n* [[blue_tail]]\r\n* [[brown_tail]]\r\n* [[cream_tail]]\r\n* [[green_tail]]\r\n* [[grey_tail]]\r\n* [[orange_tail]]\r\n* [[pink_tail]]\r\n* [[purple_tail]]\r\n* [[red_tail]]\r\n* [[tan_tail]]\r\n* [[white_tail]]\r\n* [[yellow_tail]]\r\n\r\n* [[monotone_tail]] - only one distinct color.\r\n* [b]two_tone_tail[/b] - only two distinct colors.\r\n* [[multi_tone_tail]] - more than two distinct colors.\r\n* [[multicolored_tail]] - at least two distinct colors.\r\n** [[rainbow_tail]]\r\n[/section]"
