            "wiki_body": "thumb #3005682 thumb #3362090 thumb #1964488 thumb #2286538 thumb #1996030\n\n[b]Belly Focus[/b] describes images where a character's abdomen ([[midriff]], [[belly]], etc.) takes up most of the frame, or is shown in a cropped closer view in a sequence, comic panel, or in an image where a character is shown from [[multiple angles]]. Belly focus is most common with [[slightly chubby|chubby]], or [[overweight]] characters, as well as [[vore]] and [[pregnant|pregnancy]] content.\n\nOftentimes, the character's face, chest, and thighs may be partially or fully cropped out. Alternatively the character's entire body may be visible, with a [[low-angle view]] bringing the character's belly closer to the viewer's perspective. Lighting or blurring effects may be used to bring more attention towards the belly as well.\n\n\nh4. Useful Tags \n\n* [[faceless character]]\n* [[close-up]]\n* [[cutaway]]\n* [[low-angle view]]\n* [[navel]]\n\nh4. See Also\n[section='Focus' Tags]\n\n* [[solo_focus]]\n* [[duo_focus]]\n* [[trio_focus]]\n\n* [[ambiguous_focus]]\n* [[female_focus]]\n* [[intersex_focus]]\n** [[andromorph_focus]]\n** [[gynomorph_focus]]\n** [[herm_focus]]\n** [[maleherm_focus]]\n* [[male_focus]]\n\n* [[anthro_focus]]\n* [[feral_focus]]\n* [[human_focus]]\n* [[humanoid_focus]]\n* [[not_furry_focus]]\n\n* [[back_focus]]\n* [b]belly_focus[/b]\n* [[breast_focus]]\n* [[butt_focus]]\n* [[face_focus]]\n* [[foot_focus]]\n** [[heel_focus]]\n** [[hoof_focus]]\n* [[genital_focus]]\n** [[balls_focus]]\n** [[penis_focus]]\n** [[pussy_focus]]\n* [[pecs_focus]]\n[/section]"
