            "wiki_body": "thumb #3131112 thumb #2426062 thumb #1847219\r\n\r\n[b]Belly jiggle[/b] describes slight, quick wobbling or rippling motions of a character's belly, often involving a character that is [[slightly chubby]], [[overweight]], or [[obese]], or one with a [[bloated]] belly. Belly jiggling can happen in reaction to the character moving - jumping, walking, bouncing, and so on; indirect contact with a vibrating or shaking surface or object (e.g. a massage chair, or while riding in a car on a bumpy road), it can be frequently seen when a character is having sex, and it is also often seen when a character's belly is grabbed, shaken, lifted or dropped. \r\n\r\nBelly jiggling in still images is usually more subtly drawn than jiggling of the butt or breasts, but is depicted in the same way, with \"echoing\" curved lines around the character's belly. In animated posts, belly jiggling is frequently shown along with the character's belly bouncing, and other parts of the body bouncing and/or jiggling. Belly jiggling [b]should not be confused with [[bouncing belly]][/b], which describes a dramatic up and down shaking motion of the entire belly, rather than subtle wobbling or rippling.\r\n\r\n[section= Animated Examples]\r\nBelly jiggling is easily seen in animation\r\n\r\nthumb #1339497 thumb #2162854 thumb #2868436\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[Belly]]\r\n** [[Bouncing Belly]]\r\n** [[Belly Squish]]\r\n** [[Belly Squeeze]]\r\n** [[Sloshing Belly]]\r\n* [[Motion Lines]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Jiggling]] \r\n** [b]Belly Jiggle[/b]\r\n** [[Breast Jiggle]]\r\n** [[Butt Jiggle]]\r\n** [[Thigh Jiggle]]"
