            "wiki_body": "thumb #1108008 thumb #2817920\r\n\r\n[b]Rumbling Stomach[/b] describes various noises caused by muscular contractions in the [[stomach]] and [[intestines]]. A rumbling stomach may indicate [[hunger]], [[digestion]], or indicate a character suffering indigestion, [[nausea]], or is about to [[burping|burp]], [[farting|fart]], or urgently needs to [[pooping|defecate]]. These abdominal sounds can be often seen in [[stuffing]] and [[inflation]], and very frequently are a part of [[vore]] content.\r\n\r\nh5. Tagging Notes \r\n\r\nThis tag should be used whether the rumbling stomach is represented by visual effects, written onomatopoeia, or audible sound effects in an animation.\r\n\r\n* [[Onomatopoeia]] for a rumbling stomach includes \"growl\" \"grrr\" \"grumble\" \"glorp\" or even just \"rumble\"\r\n** These onomatopoeia are often altered for effect, to imply a difference in sound length and volume (e.g. \"grrrrRRUMBllle\")\r\n\r\n* A rumbling stomach may be represented by iconography such as [[bubble|bubbles]], [[squeans]], [[emanata]], or wiggling [[motion lines]] around the character's abdomen/belly \r\n** These are often paired with onomatopoeia or sound effects, but may be seen alone\r\n\r\n* Another way a rumbling stomach can be show visually is through a common cartoon trope that has the surface of the belly rippling as the stomach growls (see example 2 above).\r\n\r\nh5. Rumbling Stomach Vs. Other Similar Tags\r\n\r\nRumbling stomach, unlike the following tags, can apply to visual-only representations of the phenomenon.\r\n\r\nh6. [[Digestion Noises]]\r\n* digestion noises specifically applies to sound effects/onomatopoeia, which are explicitly intended to represent digestion\r\n* digestion noises can be used for any organ, which applies to exotic forms of [[vore]] (e.g. digestion noises from the balls in [[cock vore]])\r\n\r\nh6. [[Sloshing Belly]]\r\n* sloshing belly specifically applies to sound effects that indicate liquid moving around in the belly (regardless of the organ full of fluids)\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[belly]]\r\n* [[stomach]]\r\n* [[digestion]]\r\n** [[digestion_noises]]\r\n* [[stuffing]]\r\n* [[vore]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[sound_effects]] - For non-word sound effects (i.e. \"grrrgl\") \r\n** [[onomatopoeia]] - For word-based sound effects (i.e. \"gurgle\")"
