                {
                  "tag": "lip_piercing",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 18325,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #1771229 thumb #1658142 thumb #489194\r\n\r\nA lip piercing is a type of body piercing that penetrates the lips or the area surrounding the lips, which can be pierced in a variety of ways.\r\n\r\nLip piercings can be placed anywhere around the mouth, but the surface of the lip is not typically pierced itself, except for horizontal lip piercings and canine bites. Piercings in specific positions have certain names.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples:\r\n* [[facial_piercing]]\r\n** [[lip_piercing]]\r\n*** upper lip piercings\r\n**** [[lip_piercing]] (any)\r\n**** [[monroe_piercing]] (single piercing off to the side)\r\n**** [[medusa_piercing]] (single piercing through the philtrum)\r\n**** [[jestrum_piercing]] (vertical version of the [[medusa_piercing]]\r\n**** [[angelbite_piercing]] (pair of [[monroe_piercing|monroe_piercings]], one on each side)\r\n*** lower lip piercings\r\n**** [[lip_piercing]] (any)\r\n**** [[labret_piercing]] (single piercing below the middle of the bottom lip)\r\n**** [[vertical_labret_piercing]] (vertical version of the [[labret_piercing]])\r\n**** [[dolphinbite_piercing]] (pair of [[labret_piercing|labret_piercings]], side-to-side)\r\n**** [[spiderbite_piercing]] (pair, both off to the same side)\r\n**** [[snakebite_piercing]] (pair, one on each side about 1/4 distance from the corner of the mouth)\r\n**** [[sharkbite_piercing]] (pair of [[snakebite_piercing|snakebite_piercings]], one pair per side)\r\n*** side piercings\r\n**** [[dahlia_piercing]] (pair, each one through the either side of the mouth)\r\n**** [[jokerbite_piercing]] (pair, both through one side of the mouth)\r\n*** combination piercings\r\n**** [[cyberbite_piercing]] ([[medusa_piercing]] + [[labret_piercing]])\r\n**** [[trianglebite_piercing]] ([[angelbite_piercing]] + [[labret_piercing]]) or ([[medusa_piercing]] + [[snakebite_piercing]])\r\n**** [[caninebite_piercing]] ([[angelbite_piercing]] + [[snakebite_piercing]])\r\n**** [[t-rex_bite_piercing]] (double [[angelbite_piercing|angelbite_piercings]] + double [[snakebite_piercing|snakebite_piercings]])\r\n\r\nh4. Related:\r\n* [[piercing]]\r\n** [[ear_piercing]]\r\n** [[nose_piercing]]\r\n** [[eyebrow_piercing]]\r\n** [[tongue_piercing]]\r\n\r\nh4. More information:\r\nhttps://www.piercingmodels.com/lip-piercing-types/"
