            "wiki_body": "thumb #3324253 thumb #2254159\r\n\r\nA character wearing a visibly tight [[skirt]]. \r\n\r\nThe skirt may be intentionally form fitting, to show off the wearer's legs and butt, or be too small for the wearer's body. In some cases, the skirt may show signs of [[torn clothing|tearing]].\r\n\r\nA tight skirt often clearly defines the character's [[butt|buttocks]], and [[pantylines]] may be seen through the fabric of the skirt. The skirt be small and tight enough to ride up on the wearer's butt, exposing some of it. From the front, a tight skirt will cling closely to the wearer's thighs and lower body, particularly high waisted skirts may show an [[navel outline|impression of the navel]] if they cover the wearer's belly.\r\n\r\nh5. Tagging Notes\r\n* Characters wearing tight skirts are frequently depicted from a [[rear view]], sometimes with a [[butt focus]]\r\n* If the skirt partially covers most of the butt, with some \"hanging out\" of the bottom, tag [[underbutt]]\r\n* If the butt is squished against the fabric and squeezing out of the bottom, tag [[bulging butt]] as well as [[underbutt]]\r\n\r\nh3. Related Tags\r\n\r\nh5. Common Skirts That May Be Drawn Tight\r\n* [[miniskirt]]\r\n* [[pencil skirt]]\r\n\r\nh5. Tight Skirts May Show...\r\n* [[panty lines]] - the imprint of the panties under the skirt\r\n* [[bulging butt]] - the buttocks bulging against the panties under the skirt\r\n* [[underbutt]] - a short, tight skirt may expose the bottom of a character's butt \r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[tight clothing]]\r\n** [[tight dress]]\r\n"
