              "wiki_body": "A work uniform worn by a housemaid.  Maids' uniforms, especially the frilly black and white style stereotypically worn by French maids, are often used as fetish wear.\r\n\r\nCommon attributes of a maid uniform:\r\n[section=General]\r\n\r\nh4. [[Frilly_clothing]]: [[frilly_hairband]], [[frilly_dress]], [[frilly_skirt]], [[ frilly_apron]], [[frilly_underwear]], [[ frilly_legwear]], etc.\r\nthumb #3302559 thumb #2966001\r\n\r\nh4. [[Bow]], [[ribbons]], [[bow_ribbon]], [[garter]]\r\nthumb #2840489 thumb #3188089 thumb #2744688 thumb #1474018\r\n\r\nh4. [[Lingerie]], [[lace]]\r\nthumb #663846 thumb #2418252\r\n\r\nh4. [[Feather_duster]]\r\nthumb #3318592 thumb #1249583\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Head]\r\n\r\nh4. [[Maid_headdress]], [[hairband]]\r\nthumb #2538247 thumb #2045051\r\n\r\nh4. [[Neckband]]\r\nthumb #1995267 thumb #2449577\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Body]\r\n\r\nh4. [[Gloves]] ([[elbow_gloves]]), \r\nthumb #1890461 thumb #2593410\r\n\r\nh4. [[Detached_sleeves]], [[arm_warmers]], [[armband]]\r\nthumb #1381178 thumb #1354780\r\n\r\nh4. [[Dress]], [[skirt]]\r\nthumb #3090713 thumb #2927520\r\n\r\nh4. [[Apron]]\r\nthumb #684081 thumb #1937701\r\n\r\nh4. [[Tail_bow]], [[tail_ribbon]], [[tailband]]\r\nthumb #1150910 thumb #810592\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Legs]\r\n\r\nh4. [[Stockings]], [[thigh_highs]], [[pantyhose]]\r\nthumb #2492802 thumb #2069514\r\n\r\nh4. [[Garter_straps]], [[thighband]]\r\nthumb #3185012 thumb #2207702\r\n\r\nh4. [[High_heels]]\r\nthumb #1244008 thumb #1183431"
