            "tag": "undressing_another",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 2239,
            "wiki_body": "A character in the process of removing [[clothing]] worn by another character under any circumstance. The opposite of [[dressing another]]. For [[undressing]] involving sexual or romantic partners, tag [[undressing partner]] as well.\n\nThis can also be a form of [[assisted exposure]].\n\nh4. [[Undressing]] subtags\n\n* [[forced_undressing]]\n** [[forced_to_undress]]\n* [b]undressing_another[/b]\n** [[undressing_partner]]\n* [[undressing_crabs]]\n* [[undressing_self]]\n* [[undressing_spell]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[assisted_exposure]]\n* [[pantsing]]"
