          {
            "tag": "dresser",
            "kor": "옷장",
            "count": 1518,
            "wiki_body": "A [b]dresser[/b] is a piece of [[furniture]] holding multiple drawers in a vertical stack. Dressers are usually used to store [[clothing]], and are often found in [[bedroom|bedrooms]]. Some dressers include other features such as mounted [[mirror|mirrors]] or additional open [[shelf|shelves]].\r\n\r\nOther names in English include [b]chest of drawers[/b], [b]bureau[/b].\r\n\r\nIf the piece of furniture also has compartments with doors, use the [[cabinet]] tag instead."
          },
          {
            "tag": "undressed",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1493,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2775594 thumb #2560258 thumb #273983 thumb #3119064 thumb #2701697 thumb #2358412\r\n\r\n[b]Undressed[/b] refers to any scene in which it is apparent that at least one character has some or all of their clothing removed. This tag is essentially the after scene to an [[undressing]] scenario rather than applying to any character lacking clothing.\r\n\r\nThis tag can be applied to an [[undressing]] image if the undressing process has reached a point where a character is no longer actively undressing.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[bikini_theft]]\r\n* [[clothing_down]]\r\n** [[clothing_around_legs]]\r\n** [[clothing_around_one_leg]]\r\n* [[discarded_clothing]]\r\n* [[holding_clothing]]\r\n* [[nude]] / [[mostly_nude]] / [[partially_clothed]]\r\n* [[strip_poker]]\r\n* [[undressing_between_scenes]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[exposed]]\r\n* [[undressing]]"
          },
          {
            "tag": "backless_dress",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1417,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3111502 thumb #2863481 thumb #3570874\r\nA [[dress]] style, usually on an [[evening_gown]] or a [[cocktail_dress]]. It consists on a one-piece ornament that exposes the back of the user, either most of it or completely, and usually worn on formal occasions or evening wear.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[backless clothing]]\r\n** backless dress\r\n** [[backless gloves]]\r\n** [[backless leotard]]\r\n** [[backless swimsuit]]\r\n** [[backless topwear]]\r\n*** [[backless shirt]]\r\n*** [[backless sweater]]\r\n** [[backless underwear]]\r\n*** [[backless panties]]\r\n\r\n* [[open-butt dress]]\r\n* [[dress]]\r\n* [[cocktail_dress]]\r\n* [[evening_gown]]\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:clothes]]"
