            "wiki_body": "A vault suit is a skintight jumpsuit from the [[Fallout]] franchise, given to the inhabitants of underground fallout shelters known as \"vaults\".\r\n\r\nVault suits are almost always depicted with a color palette of blue/yellow.\r\n\r\nThumb #851783 Thumb #1129942 Thumb #1595847"
