          {
            "tag": "sailor_uniform",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 859,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1869531 thumb #550179 thumb #914801\r\n\r\n[b]Important Note: This tag is specifically for characters wearing naval style uniforms, for the more common Japanese school uniform, see: [[serafuku]][/b]\r\n\r\nA [b]sailor uniform[/b] or sailor suit is an outfit traditionally worn by enlisted seamen in a [[navy]]; it typically consists of a [[sailor_hat|cap]], a shirt with a sailor collar (often in white, blue or black), trousers or shorts, and a neckerchief. This design is largely obsolete, and if used by a modern Navy, is only worn for formal or ceremonial events. \r\n\r\n[[Donald_Duck|Donald Duck]] is the most well known character to wear a sailor uniform in popular culture.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[Uniform]]\r\n* [[Navy]]\r\n* [[Military]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[tag group:clothes|List of Clothing Related Tags]]"
