              "count": 232889,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #422250 thumb #542365 thumb #341439 thumb #485319\n\nA [b]hat[/b] is a shaped covering for the head worn for warmth, as a fashion item, or as part of a [[uniform]]. Usually worn on the head.\n\nh4. Types of Hats\n\nh6. Formal\n\n* [[boater_hat]]\n* [[bowler_hat]]\n* [[fedora]]\n* [[square_academic_cap]]\n* [[top_hat]]\n\nh6. Semi-formal/Traditional/Job-specific\n\n* [[aviator_cap]]\n* [[biker_cap]]\n* [[bucket_cap]] / [[fishing_hat]]\n* [[chef_hat]]\n* [[cowboy_hat]]\n* [[hard_hat]] - Type of helmet, [b]not a hat[/b]\n* [[nurse_hat]]\n* [[peaked_cap]]\n* [[police_hat]]\n* [[santa_hat]]\n* [[military_cap]]\n* [[rice_hat]]\n* [[sombrero]]\n* [[straw_hat]]\n* [[tokin_hat]]\n* [[ushanka]]\n* [[witch_hat]]\n* [[wizard_hat]]\n\nh6. Casual\n\n* [[beanie]]\n* [[beret]]\n* [[baseball_cap]]\n* [[dunce_cap]]\n* [[flat_cap]]\n* [[jester_hat]]\n* [[patrol_cap]] – kind of like a baseball cap with a straight flat top, instead of a round cup.\n* [[party_hat]]\n* [[propeller_hat]] – has a tiny propeller on top. Often a baseball cap.\n* [[sun_hat]]\n\n[b]Other[/b]\n\n* [[awesome_hat]] (subjective)\n* [[boob_hat]]\n* [[penis_hat]]\n\nh4. Hat features\n\n* [[hat_band]]\n* [[hat_bow]]\n* [[hat_buckle]]\n* [[hat_feather]]\n* [[hat_ribbon]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[helmet]]\n* [[tag group:clothes]]"
