              "tag": "gas_mask",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 4435,
              "wiki_body": "A gas mask is a device worn over the mouth and nose (or muzzle, depending on the character) that consists of one or more cylindrical filters and a one-way valve, designed to protect against toxic gasses and particulates. A set of goggles and/or a hood may be included; and more advanced systems connect to a tank of compressed air. However, the devices have found their way into [[BDSM]] play, due to the fact that the face is concealed behind heavy equipment, making the wearer seem intimidating and machine-like, and many a film has shown the villains soldiers wearing the devices, leading to connotations of oppression."
