            "wiki_body": "thumb #350038 thumb #2234192 thumb #121860 \r\n\r\nA tag focused on extremely bizarre mutants and creations (emphasis is on [i]creations[/i]). The character design is implied to be highly impractical or otherwise unlikely to exist outside of a genetic mutation caused by science itself. Frequently used with [[what]].\r\n\r\nNote that despite the connotations, most [[hyper]] should not fall under this tag.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[eldritch abomination]]\r\n* [[nightmare fuel]] - Extremely frightening or otherwise unsettling (likely to cause nightmares).\r\n* [[what]] - as in: \"What is this I don't even.\"\r\n* what has science done - Mutations and bizarre creations.\r\n* [[where is your god now]] - as in: \"Why would god let this happen?\"\r\n* [[why]] - as in: \"Why does this even exist?\""
