            "tag": "skull_mask",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 3262,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1374515 thumb #1124806 thumb #171168\r\n\r\nA skull worn on a character's head or face as if it were a mask or helmet. This is commonly seen on [[tribal]] characters, though may be a sign of a [[necromancer]] or other [[magic_user|magic user.]]\r\n\r\nPlease be careful of characters whose heads are actually skulls, though it's recommended to err on the side of inclusiveness.\r\n\r\n[[Face_paint|Face paint]] in the shape or design of a skull is tagged [[skull_face_paint]].\r\n\r\nThe [[Pokémon]] [[cubone]] is frequently depicted with a skull mask, however its evolution [[Marowak]] is usually, but not always, drawn as if it has a skull for a head instead.  \r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[skull_helmet]] - When the skull is worn on top of the head like a hat or helmet, but is not covering the face.\r\n* [[skull_head]]"
