            "tag": "chat",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1342,
            "wiki_body": "A [b]chat[/b] is a place where users can message each other online via an instance messenger software, or online chatting service.\r\n\r\nh4. Types of chats\r\n\r\n* [[stream_chat]]\r\n\r\nh4. Chat components\r\n\r\n* [[chat_interface]] - User controls for interacting with a chat, or chat room.\r\n* [[chat_message]] - A message that is displaced in a [[chat_box|chat window]].\r\n* [[chat_box|chat_window]] - A place for displaying chat messages.\r\n* [[text_input_box]] - A text box that accepts [[text]] input. Tag with `chat_interface`.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[donation]]\r\n** [[donation_message]]\r\n* [[emoji]] - Any kind of expression, or pictographic icon displayed in a [[chat message]] can be treated as an emoji.\r\n* [[emoticon]] - A text-based representation of an expression.\r\n* [[livestream]]\r\n* [[message]]\r\n** [[chat_message]]\r\n* [[username]] - The name that appears on the left side of a chat message.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[video_call]]"
