              "tag": "socks",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 72388,
              "wiki_body": "[b]Socks[/b] are articles of clothing that cover the [[feet]] ([[footwear]]) and also, typically, some portion of the lower leg ([[legwear]]). The foot is among the heaviest producers of [[sweat]] and [[pheromones]]—chemical signals used for non-verbal communication among/between species to influence a range of behaviors from sexual attraction to alarm responses—in the body, able to produce over a pint of perspiration per day. Socks help to absorb this sweat and draw it to areas where air can evaporate the perspiration and carry the pheromones a greater distance away. They also provide warmth by trapping body heat that would otherwise be radiated away to the local environment and cushioning against other footwear they are worn inside of.\n\nSimilar to feet but less commonly, socks can become sexualized to some as elements of a paraphilia (a/k/a a [[sock fetish]]) or related [[partialism]].\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n[quote]If it doesn't cover part of the feet, it shouldn't be tagged as footwear; socks are a type of footwear.[/quote]\n* [[footless legwear]]\n** [[leg warmers]]\n** [[leggings]] – similar to [[pants]] but skin-tight and made from a thicker material that covers the wearer from the waist to anywhere between the knee and the ankle\n* [[pantyhose]]\n* [[stockings]] – very closely related to socks, though typically constructed from a tightly elastic material that is sheer (transparent, to varying degrees) in appearance\n** [[knee highs]]\n** [[thigh highs]]\n* [[tights]]\n\n[section,expanded=Sock-related tags]\nh5. By length\n[table]\n  [thead]\n    [tr]\n      [th]Style[/th]\n      [th]Description[/th]\n      [th]Sample[/th]\n      [th]Tag search[/th]\n    [/tr]\n  [/thead]\n  [tbody]\n    [tr]\n      [th][[no-show socks]][/th]\n      [td]Designed not to be visible when wearing [[shoes]][/td]\n      [td]thumb #4105387[/td]\n      [td][i]{{no-show_socks}}[/i][/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n      [th][[ankle socks]][/th]\n      [td]Covering only the foot and joint with the lower leg (and sometimes extending slightly beyond)[/td]\n      [td]thumb #2437415[/td]\n      [td][i]{{ankle_socks}}[/i][/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n      [th][[crew socks]][/th]\n      [td]Extending to a point over the calf muscle but stopping short of the knee[/td]\n      [td]thumb #5517015[/td]\n      [td][i]{{crew_socks}}[/i][/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n      [th][[knee socks]][/th]\n      [td]Covering the foot and entire lower leg, sometimes the knee as well[/td]\n      [td]thumb #5283588[/td]\n      [td][i]{{knee_socks}}[/i][/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n      [th][[thigh socks]][/th]\n      [td]Extending to a point clearly beyond the knee but before the hip/groin[/td]\n      [td]thumb #5211289[/td]\n      [td][i]{{thigh_socks}}[/i][/td]\n    [/tr]\n  [/tbody]\n[/table]\n\nh5. By color\n* [[monotone socks]] – having [i]only one[/i] distinct color\n\n** [color=black][b]█[/b][/color] [[black socks]] [sup]({{black_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=blue][b]█[/b][/color] [[blue socks]] [sup]({{blue_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=brown][b]█[/b][/color] [[brown socks]] [sup]({{brown_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=forestgreen][b]█[/b][/color] [[green socks]] [sup]({{green_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=slategray][b]█[/b][/color] [[grey socks]] [sup]({{grey_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=darkorange][b]█[/b][/color] [[orange socks]] [sup]({{orange_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=deeppink][b]█[/b][/color] [[pink socks]] [sup]({{pink_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=darkviolet][b]█[/b][/color] [[purple socks]] [sup]({{purple_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=red][b]█[/b][/color] [[red socks]] [sup]({{red_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=burlywood][b]█[/b][/color] [[tan socks]] [sup]({{tan_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=teal][b]█[/b][/color] [[teal socks]] [sup]({{teal_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n** [color=white][b]█[/b][/color] [[white socks]] [sup]({{white_socks|tag search}})[/sup]\n