              "wiki_body": "thumb #972770 thumb #972788 thumb #972489 thumb #1363360\n\n[b]Clothing[/b] is a broad term that describes a fabric designed to be worn around some part of the body. The function of clothing is to cover some aspect of the body, a trait which is sometimes more of a suggestion than a hard rule. This function differentiates clothing from other items that are worn such as accessories, and jewelry.\n\nA character wearing clothing should be tagged as [[clothed]]. For tagging purposes, [[armor]] is treated as clothing if a character is wearing it, but is not considered clothing otherwise.\n\n\nh5. Clothing Groups\n\n* [[Athletic Wear]]\n* [[Swimwear]]\n* [[Underwear]]\n** [[Lingerie]]\n* [[Sportswear]]\n* [[Businesswear]]\n* [[Uniform]]\n* [[Meme Clothing]]\n\nh4. Clothing Tags\n[i]For a more comprehensive list of clothing tags, see [[tag_group:clothes]].[/i]\n\n[section=Clothing Items By Body Part or Function]\n\nh5. Generic Tags\n\n* [[Headwear]]\n* [[Neckwear]]\n* [[Topwear]]\n* [[Bottomwear]]\n* [[Armwear]]\n* [[Legwear]] \n* [[Footwear]]\n* [[Tail Clothing]]\n\nh5. Head and Neck\n\n* [[Collar]]\n* [[Hat]]\n* [[Headscarf]]\n* [[Helmet]]\n* [[Hood]]\n* Neckwear\n** [[Necktie]]\n** [[Bow Tie]]\n** [[Scarf]]\n** [[Neckerchief]]\n\nh5. Upper body\n\n* [[Apron]]\n* [[Dress]]\n* [[Hoodie]]\n* [[Jacket]]\n* [[Shirt]]\n* [[Suit]]\n* [[Sweater]]\n* [[Vest]]\n* [[Sash]]\n** [[Obi]]\n* [[Tabard]]\n\nh5. Lower body\n\n* [[Panties]]\n* [[Pants]]\n* [[Sarong]]\n* [[Skirt]]\n* [[Shoes]]\n* [[Shorts]]\n* [[Skirt]]\n* [[Socks]]\n* [[Stockings]]\n\nh5. Support\n\n* [[Belt]]\n* [[Garter]]\n* [[Garter Belt]]\n* [[Garter Straps]]\n\nh5. Fasteners \n\n* [[Button (Fastener)]]\n* [[Clothing Cord]]\n** [[Drawstring]]\n** [[Shoelaces]]\n* [[Clothing Ring]]\n* [[Snap Button]]\n* [[Zipper]]\n\n[/section]\n\n\nh5. Clothing Features\n[i]These tags describe clothing and features of clothing items, such as elements of the clothing or decorations[/i]\n\n* [[Cutout]]\n** [[B