                "wiki_body": "thumb #584495 thumb #582448 thumb #1005662\r\n\r\nA [b]polo shirt[/b] (also known as a [b]golf shirt[/b], or [b]tennis shirt[/b]) is a [[shirt]] with buttons fastening the placket, or opening, of the shirt.\r\n\r\nA polo shirt is a versatile garment, and can be worn in many styles depending on the formality needed. It is considered less formal than a [[dress shirt]], though more formal than a [[T-shirt]], and can be worn with a suit and tie for extra formality.\r\n\r\nA polo shirt will look either very good or very nerdy depending on the fit, colour, pattern, and bulk of the wearer.\r\n\r\nh4. Tags About Shirts\r\n\r\n* [[shirt]]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Tags About Shirts]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Shirt Types]\r\n* [[crop_top]]\r\n* [[dress_shirt]]\r\n* [b]polo_shirt[/b]\r\n* [[sleeveless_shirt]]\r\n* [[t-shirt]]\r\n* [[tank_top]]\r\n* [[undershirt]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Shirt Status]\r\n* [[discarded_shirt]]\r\n* [[open_shirt]]\r\n* [[raised_shirt]]\r\n** [[shirt_lift]]\r\n* [[torn_shirt]]\r\n* [[wet_shirt]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Shirt Traits]\r\n[section=Colors]\r\n* [[black_shirt]]\r\n* [[blue_shirt]]\r\n* [[brown_shirt]]\r\n* [[green_shirt]]\r\n* [[grey_shirt]]\r\n* [[orange_shirt]]\r\n* [[pink_shirt]]\r\n* [[purple_shirt]]\r\n* [[red_shirt]]\r\n* [[tan_shirt]]\r\n* [[white_shirt]]\r\n* [[yellow_shirt]]\r\n\r\n* [[multicolored_shirt]]\r\n** [[pride_color_shirt]]\r\n** [[rainbow_shirt]]\r\n** [[two_tone_shirt]]\r\n\r\nSee also: [[tag_group:colors]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Patterns / Designs]\r\n* [[pattern_shirt]]\r\n** [[aloha_shirt]]\r\n** [[camo_shirt]]\r\n** [[checkered_shirt]]\r\n** [[plaid_shirt]]\r\n** [[spotted_shirt]]\r\n** [[striped_shirt]]\r\n* [[rental_mommy_shirt]]\r\n* [[translucent_shirt]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Other]\r\n* [[baggy_shirt]]\r\n* [[oversized_shirt]]\r\n* [[tied_shirt]]\r\n* [[tight_shirt]]\r\n* [[wool_shirt]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[/section]\r\n[/sect