          "wiki_body": "thumb #3014093\r\n\r\n[b]Suffering[/b] is the prolonged exposure to, or the effects caused by an unpleasant, or traumatic event, or activity. The state of suffering typically involves experiencing intense [[pain| physical]] or [[sad| mental]] pain over a period of time. The duration of time necessary for a character to suffer depends on the intensity, and the nature of the traumatic event. Examples include a character on the brink of death from massive trauma, or exposed to highly painful stimulation such as from [[burning alive]].\r\n\r\nActivities that are designed to temporarily cause [[pain]] probably do not qualify towards the suffering tag. Acts of [[genital torture]] should be handled on a case to case basis. Kicking someone in the balls once may not qualify as suffering, but doing so repeatedly may qualify as both a form of suffering, and torture.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[imminent_death]]\r\n* [[gore]]\r\n* [[killing]]\r\n* [[pain]]\r\n* [[torture]]"
