          "kor": "상의",
          "count": 620780,
          "wiki_body": "A garment that covers the upper body.\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Coats and Jackets]\r\n\r\n[[Coats]] and [[Jackets]] are outerwear, intended to be worn on top of other topwear (such as a dress shirt). A coat is a heavier and/or longer garment that is usually intended to protect the wearer's body from the elements. Jackets are lighter outerwear, with only some types of jacket intended to be worn outdoors.\r\n\r\nh6. [[Coat|Coats]]\r\n** [[fur_coat]]\r\n** [[trenchcoat]]\r\n** [[raincoat]]\r\n** [[lab_coat]]\r\n** [[parka]]\r\n\r\nh6. [[Jacket|Jackets]]\r\n** [[blazer]]\r\n** [[cropped jacket]]\r\n** [[haori]]\r\n** [[leather jacket]]\r\n** [[letterman jacket]]\r\n** [[suit_jacket]]\r\n\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Shirts] \r\nA [[shirt]] is a light garment, usually worn as a first layer of clothing on the torso, or worn over an undershirt or bra.\r\n\r\nh6. Style/Specific Types of Shirt\r\n* [[blouse]]\r\n* [[collared_shirt]]\r\n** [[dress_shirt]]\r\n** [[polo_shirt]]\r\n* [[get_along_shirt]]\r\n* [[jersey]]\r\n* [[t-shirt]]\r\n* [[tank_top]]\r\n* [[tube_top]]\r\n* [[undershirt]]\r\n\r\nh6. Attributes (material, length, sleeves, neckline)\r\n* [[crop_top]]\r\n* [[fishnet_shirt]]\r\n** [[mesh_shirt]]\r\n* [[halter top]] \r\n* [[long_sleeve_shirt]]\r\n* [[plunging_neckline]]\r\n* [[shoulderless_shirt]]\r\n* [[sleeveless_shirt]]\r\n* [[v-neck]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Sweaters and Sweatshirts]\r\nA [[sweater]] is a thick loose-fitting knitted garment designed to be worn over a shirt, tank top, or underwear. While similar, a [[sweatshirt]] is a thick loose-fitting garment that may feature a [[hood]], [[drawstring|drawstrings]], and deep [[pockets]]. \r\n\r\n* [[sweater]]\r\n** [[cropped sweater]]\r\n** [[keyhole_sweater]] - a sweater with a window in the chest\r\n** [[shoulderless sweater]]\r\n** [[turtleneck]] - a sweater that features a high collar\r\n*** [[keyhole_turtleneck]]\r\n\r\n* [[cardigan]] - an open front sweater, typically features buttons\r\n* [[sweatshirt]]\r\n\r\n* [[hoodie]] - A hooded sweater or sweatshirt, sometimes features a zipper front, or takes the form of a hooded vest.\r\n** [[cropped hoodie]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Vest]\r\nA [[vest]] is similar to a jacket, but lacks sleeves, and does not need to open in the front.\r\n\r\n* [[sweater_vest]]\r\n* [[safety_vest]]\r\n* [[waist_coat]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related\r\n* [[bottomwear]]\r\n* [[gloves]]\r\n* [[legwear]]\r\n* [[topwear]]\r\n* [[underwear]]\r\n* [[tag_group:clothes]]\r\n"
