          "tag": "legwear",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 340459,
          "wiki_body": "[b]Legwear[/b] are basically garments worn on legs. Clothing like [[tights]] and [[leggings]] are considered legwear.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Identification guide]\r\n\r\nThe different types of legwear are often confused. Use this guide to help tag things correctly.\r\n\r\n* [[leggings]] - A tight garment worn like pants. Leggings are often confused with thinner legwear such as pantyhose, and tights.\r\n* [[leg_warmers]] - Essentially socks for your legs. Leg warmers may reach [[thigh_highs|thighs]], but do not cover the feet.\r\n* [[pantyhose]] - A thin, [[translucent_legwear|sheer]] garment worn like pants. Pantyhose are designed to be worn under clothing.\r\n* [[stockings]] - A garment designed to cover your feet up to the thigh, but not the waist.\r\n* [[tights]] - Tights are thicker pantyhose. Tights are too shear to be worn in place of bottomwear.\r\n\r\nh5. Covers up to the thigh (or any part of the leg), but not the waist\r\n\r\n* [[leg_warmers]] - Tends to be textured like socks. If they cover the feet, tag [[socks]] instead. Leg warmers may partially or fully cover the leg.\r\n\r\nh6. Covers the feet\r\n\r\nIf the legwear visibly covers the feet in an image, the [[footwear]] tag also applies.\r\n\r\n* [[stockings]] - May be distinguished from other forms of thigh highs by appearing more form-fitted, [[translucent_stockings|sheer]], or being held up by [[garter straps]].\r\n* [[thigh_highs]]\r\n** [[thigh_boots]]\r\n** [[thigh_socks]]\r\n\r\nh5. Covers the waist\r\n\r\nThese clothing items tend to be tight fitting, and usually are worn under other clothing.\r\n\r\nh6. Clothing is opaque or only slightly [[translucent_legwear|translucent]].\r\n\r\n* [[leggings]] - May be worn under other clothing or in place of [[bottomwear]].\r\n* [[yoga_pants]] - A type of [[leggings]].\r\n\r\nh6. Clothing is mostly [[translucent]]. A character probably isn't wearing these out in public without [[bottomwear]].\r\n\r\n* [[pantyhose]]\r\n* [[tights]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Commonly applicable tags\r\n\r\n* [[black_legwear]]\r\n* [[glistening_latex]]\r\n* [[striped_legwear]]\r\n* [[thigh_highs]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[footwear]]\r\n** [[boots]]\r\n*** [[cowboy_boots]]\r\n*** [[high_heeled_boots]]\r\n*** [[knee_boots]]\r\n*** [[thigh_boots]]\r\n** [[high_heels]]\r\n** [[shoes]]\r\n** [[socks]]\r\n*** [[knee_socks]]\r\n*** [[thigh_socks]]\r\n*** [[stirrup_socks]]\r\n*** [[toeless_socks]]"
