          "wiki_body": "thumb #983033  thumb #707287 thumb #563079 thumb #476658 thumb #668936 \r\n\r\nArticles of clothing designed to cover a considerable part of the arm (and sometimes the hands), but that don't cover any extension of the torso. Preferentially, use more specific tags instead.\r\n\r\nh4. Types of Armwear\r\n\r\n[section=Arm warmers]\r\n\r\n\"Arm warmers\":/wiki_pages/3808 are \"[[detached_sleeves]]\" worn on the arms. Arm warmers can also describe any glove-like articles of clothing that lack finger coverings. They are often end before reaching the elbow, but can be longer in some cases.\r\n\r\n\r\nh6. Related\r\n* [[monotone_arm_warmers]]\r\n* [[striped_arm_warmers]]\r\n* [[two_tone_arm_warmers]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Bridal gauntlets]\r\n\r\n\"Bridal Gauntlests\":/wiki_pages/6772 are [b]Long[/b], tight-fitting gloves, secured by a ring or loop of cloth around the [b]middle finger[/b], rather than separate finger-holes.\r\n\r\nTraditionally worn with [[wedding_dress]]. \r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Detached sleeves]\r\n\r\nSleeves that are not attached to a main torso garment (if applicable) and do not reach the shoulder, revealing bare skin at the top of the arm.\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Elbow gloves]\r\n\r\n\"Elbow gloves\":/wiki_pages/1977 are a [b]general tag[/b] that can be applied when an image shows [[gloves]] that extend far past the wrist, covering the arm up to, and sometimes past, the elbows. Elbow gloves can often be associated with formalwear.\r\n\r\nh6. Related\r\n* [[fingerless_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[fishnet_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[frilly_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[monotone_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[multicolored_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[pattern_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[rubber_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[striped_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[translucent_elbow_gloves]]\r\n* [[two_tone_elbow gloves]]\r\n\r\n\r\n[section=Shirt cuffs]\r\n\r\nThe cuff(s) of a [[shirt]], but detached from it and worn separately\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n\r\n[section=Wrist Warmers]\r\n\r\n\"Wrist Warmers\":/wiki_pages/32314/ are [[fingerless gloves]] that [i]go no further[/i] than a characters [b]forearm[/b]. However, wrist warmers are not always glove like [ \"see glove magazine article here\":https://www.glovesmag.com/wrist-warmers/ ]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[bottomwear]]\r\n* [[gloves]]\r\n* [[legwear]]\r\n* [[topwear]]\r\n* [[underwear]]\r\n* [[tag_group:clothes]]"
