          "wiki_body": "thumb #463082\r\n\r\nWhen a piece of [[clothing]] contains some form of [[<3|heart]] shape as part of its design. These are often physically [[heart_print|printed]] on the clothing, often in a [[pattern clothing|pattern-like style]]. Some heart designs are [[heart_cutout|cut out]] of the fabric instead of printed on. Less commonly, the fasteners (buttons, rings, decorated parts of the clothing) will be heart themed.\r\n\r\nh6. Heart clothing tag guide\r\n\r\n* [[heart_cutout]] - Use for a heart-shaped hole in clothing or other objects.\r\n* [[heart_pattern]] - A repeatable heart design, usually also a heart print. Clothing featuring this should also be tagged `pattern_<clothing>`\r\n* [[heart_print]] - Use for any number of hearts printed onto the surface. Clothing featuring this should also be tagged `print_<clothing>`\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[heart_button]]\r\n* [[heart_cutout]]\r\n* [[heart_gem]]\r\n* [[heart_pattern]]\r\n* [[heart_print]]\r\n* [[heart_ring_(hardware)]] - This will count as a [[clothing ring]] if present on clothing.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[<3]]\r\n* [[clothing]]\r\n** [[keyhole_clothing]]\r\n** [[pattern_clothing]]\r\n** [[print_clothing]]\r\n* [[symbol]]"
