          "kor": "",
          "count": 7910,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1887254 thumb #1729845 thumb #2845467 thumb #2745158 thumb #3101886 thumb #2550727\r\n\r\n[b]Athletic wear[/b] describes a \"genre\" of [[clothing]], covering a wide range of garments designed for athletic activities such as [[jogging]], [[weightlifting]], [[yoga]], pilates or other [[exercise]]. \r\n\r\nAthletic wear is often worn casually, as this clothing is made for comfort and allows for a range of movement, some athletic wear is [[tight clothing|fairly form fitting]], and tends to be flattering in showing off the wearer's body.\r\n\r\nh5. Important Notes:\r\n\r\n* [b][u]Not to be confused with [[sportswear]][/u][/b], sportswear is used to describe clothing that is worn while playing a [i]specific[/i] sport, while athletic wear can be worn for any kind of physical activity\r\n* As athletic wear clothing is frequently worn casually, individual items are not [i]inherently[/i] athletic wear. The style, form, and context of the item, as well as the character's overall outfit should be considered before tagging an image as \"athletic wear\".\r\n\r\nh5. Athletic Wear Items\r\nh6. Topwear\r\n* [[Sports Bra]]\r\n* [[Tank Top]]\r\n* [[Tube Top]]\r\n* [[Crop Top]]\r\n\r\nh6. Bottomwear/Legwear\r\n* [[Shorts]]\r\n** [[Spandex Shorts]]\r\n** [[Gym Shorts]]\r\n* [[Yoga Pants]]\r\n* [[Sweatpants]]\r\n* [[Sports Panties]]\r\n* [[Tights]]\r\n* [[Leggings]]\r\n* [[Leg Warmers]]\r\n\r\nh6. Full Body/Misc.\r\n* [[Tracksuit]]\r\n** [[Track Pants]]\r\n** [[Track Jacket]]\r\n* [[Leotard]]\r\n* [[Unitard]]\r\n\r\nh6. Headwear\r\n* [[Headband]]\r\n* [[Visor Cap]]\r\n* [[Baseball Cap]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[Clothing]]\r\n** [[Swimwear]]\r\n** [[Dancewear]]\r\n** [[Underwear]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Athletic]]\r\n* [[Exercise]]\r\n** [[Weightlifting]]\r\n** [[Workout]]\r\n** [[Jogging]]\r\n** [[Yoga]]\r\n"
