        "eating": {
          "_Self (eating)": [
            {
              "tag": "eating",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 23773,
              "wiki_body": "The consumption of an edible items, usually in order to obtain sustenance or pleasure.\r\n\r\n[section=Ingestion process]\r\n\r\nIngestion refers to the intake of a substance (food, drink, something else) into the body through the mouth.\r\n\r\nh4. Stage 1: \"Nomming\" stage\r\n\r\n- The food, or prey is shoved partially, or fully into the character's mouth. This may or may not be following by a biting action.\r\n\r\nh4. Stage 2: Chewing stage \r\n\r\n- The food, or prey is broken down into smaller pieces. Alternatively the ingestion could involve the substance being [[slurping|slurped]] down, or [[drinking|drank]] during this stage.\r\n\r\nh4. Stage 3: Swallowing stage\r\n\r\n- The food, or prey being forcibly pushed into, and down the esophagus (throat area) into the stomach.\r\n\r\nh4. Shows the different stages of ingestion (Vore)\r\n\r\nthumb #2226390\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh5.  \"Eating Process\" Tags:\r\n[i]Tags describing actions directly related to eating[/i]\r\n* [[Hungry]]\r\n* [[Licking]]\r\n* [[Chewing]]\r\n** [[Cheeks Puffed]]\r\n* [[Swallowing]]\r\n* [[Food in Mouth]]\r\n* [[Food in Stomach]]\r\n* [[Digestion]]\r\n** [[Rumbling Stomach]]\r\n* [[Feeding]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[cutlery]]\r\n* [[dining]]\r\n** [[dining_room]]\r\n** [[restaurant]]\r\n* [[eaten raw]] - Eating something raw, uncooked.\r\n* [[food]]\r\n** [[looking_at_food]]\r\n** [[holding_food]]\r\n* [[om_nom_nom]] \r\n* [[stuffing]]\r\n** [[bloated]]\r\n* [[weight_gain]]\r\n* [[vore]] - The consumption of living creatures\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[drinking]]\r\n* [[cooking]]\r\n* [[mouth_hold]]\r\n"
            }
