            "wiki_body": "thumb #3231537 thumb #3785746\r\n\r\nThe act of crouching down to lower one's [[balls]] onto someone else (usually onto their face), in a manner comparable to dipping a [[tea bag]] in water. Note, the \"tea bagger\" does not necessarily need to have balls, but the concept should be referenced in the image if they don't, or the character should be shown via [[sequence]] or [[animated|animation]] that they crouching up and down on the other character.\r\n\r\nTraditionally a concept in video gaming, where a victorious player rapidly crouches up and down over a fallen opponent to humiliate them.\r\n\r\nh4. Tagging `tea_bagging`\r\n* a character crouching over another, with their balls above, or resting on, the other character \r\n* a first person tea bagging, where a character is, or has lowered their balls onto the viewer \r\n* a character referencing tea bagging while crouching down over another\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[balls on face]]\r\n* [[balls on head]]\r\n"
