          {
            "tag": "shrug",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1325,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #2856878\r\n\r\nh1.🤷 ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯\r\n\r\nA [b]shrug[/b] is a gesture that is performed by lifting both shoulders up, raised eyebrows, palms turned up and sideways head tilt. Not all components need to be present at all times. It is a representation of an individual either not knowing an answer to a question, or not caring about a result.\r\n\r\nSometimes indicated by a sound effect which may be found under [[shrug_(sound_effect)]]."
