                "wiki_body": "thumb #27643   thumb #960584   thumb #328729   thumb #1199451   \r\n\r\nThis tag should used when a bamboo is visible in the image, regardless of it being planted on the ground or on a plant pot.\r\n\r\nBamboo (subfamily bambusoideae) are plants related to grass, that have a long vertical stem divided in segments by regularly spaced nodes; these segmens are hollow, creating small cavities within each one. \r\n\r\nThese plants are notorious for their stunningly fast growth; this occurs because of their cavities, which reduce the amount of material that the plant needs to produce in order to grow, as well as, the multiples growth areas distributed over the stem.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[bamboo]]\r\n* [[bamboo_object]]\r\n* [[bamboo_pattern]]\r\n* [[bamboo_stick]]\r\n* [[bamboo_structure]]\r\n** [[bamboo_fence]]\r\n* bamboo_tree\r\n\r\n* [[forest]]\r\n* [[plant]]\r\n"
