                "wiki_body": "thumb #2449754 thumb #4701327 thumb #3728703 thumb #2862871 thumb #4229542\r\n\r\n[b]Flowers[/b], also sometimes referred to as [b]blossoms[/b], are the reproductive part of flowering [[plant|plants]]. \r\n\r\nAll flowering plants are part of a group known as Angiosperm. A flower's appearance can change wildly from plant to plant, but generally they consist of a group of colorful, ruffly oval shaped petals radially mounted around the end of a stem.\r\n\r\nThis tag should be used whenever a picture features a flower,  for example, stuck behind one's ear, or on a flowering tree when in bloom. This also applies to characters who have visible flowers on them or are, themselves, a flower such as [[flowey the flower|Flowey]] from [i][[Undertale]][/i].\r\n\r\nNote, however, if the plant has not yet blossomed, use [[bud (flower)]] instead.\r\n\r\nh4. Flower species\r\n\r\n[section=Flower species by family]\r\nThis list is organized by family, however, flowers (and other plants) should only be tagged by genus (and occasionally species, if identifiable).\r\n\r\n* [b]Amaryllidaceae[/b] (Amaryllis family)\r\n** [[allium_(flower)]]\r\n** [[amaryllis_(flower)]]\r\n** [[daffodil_(flower)]]\r\n** [[rain_lily]]\r\n** [[snowdrop_(flower)]]\r\n** [[spider_lily]]\r\n* [b]Apiaceae[/b] (Celery family)\r\n** [[hemlock_(flower)]]\r\n* [b]Apocynaceae[/b] (Dogbane family)\r\n** [[impala_lily]]\r\n** [[periwinkle_(flower)]]\r\n** [[plumeria]]\r\n* [b]Araceae[/b] (Arum family)\r\n** [[calla_lily]]\r\n* [b]Asparagaceae[/b] (Asparagus family)\r\n** [[bluebell_(flower)]]\r\n** [[hyacinth_(flower)]]\r\n** [[lily_of_the_valley]]\r\n* [b]Asphodelaceae[/b]\r\n** [[daylily_(flower)]]\r\n* [b]Asteraceae[/b] (Aster family)\r\n** [[aster_(flower)]]\r\n*** [[tatarian_aster_(flower)]]\r\n** [[black-eyed_susan]]\r\n** [[burdock_(flower)]]\r\n** [[cempasuchil_(flower)]]\r\n** [[chamomile]]\r\n** [[chrysanthemum]]\r\n** [[cornflower_(flower)]]\r\n** [[cosmos_(flower)]]\r\n** [[da