              "count": 138587,
              "wiki_body": "[b]Water[/b] is a compound of hydrogen and oxygen, this tag specifically describes the clear liquid state of water.\r\n\r\nWater covers 70% of the surface of planet Earth and most species require water to survive.\r\nThis tag has very broad applications varying from bodies of water, to creatures made from it. \r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[translucent_water|clear_water]]\r\n* [[cloudy_water]]\r\n** [[dirty_water]] / [[muddy_water]]\r\n\r\nh5. Potential tag concepts\r\n\r\n* contaminated_water\r\n* toilet_water\r\n\r\nh4. Other States of Water\r\n\r\n* [[ice]] - The solid form of water, the result of freezing.\r\n* [[steam]] - The gaseous form of water, the result of boiling or evaporation.\r\n\r\nh4. Movement\r\n\r\n* [[splash]]\r\n* [[water ripple]]\r\n* [[wave]]\r\n\r\nh4. Submerged states\r\n\r\n* [[fully_submerged]]\r\n* [[partially_submerged]]\r\n\r\nh4. Bodies of water\r\n\r\n* [[lagoon]]\r\n* [[lake]]\r\n* [[pond]]\r\n* [[river]]\r\n* [[sea]]\r\n* [[swamp]]\r\n* [[waterfall]]\r\n\r\nh5. Other\r\n\r\n* [[bathtub]]\r\n* [[fountain]]\r\n* [[hot_tub]]\r\n* [[puddle]]\r\n* [[swimming_pool]]\r\n\r\nh4. Actions / Themes\r\n\r\n* [[bathing]] / [[showering]]\r\n* [[diving]]\r\n* [[fishing]]\r\n* [[floating]]\r\n* [[raining]]\r\n* [[swimming]]\r\n* [[wet]]\r\n\r\nh4. Locations\r\n\r\n* [[bath]]\r\n** [[bathhouse]]\r\n* [[hot_spring]]\r\n* [[outside]]\r\n** [[beach]]\r\n** [[seaside]]\r\n* [[shower]]"
