            "tag": "quicksand",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 588,
            "wiki_body": "Thumb #3122313\r\nLike [[mud]], a slurry of [[water]] and dirt. However, [b]quicksand[/b] has a significant quantity of sand and clay in the mixture, increasing its thickness and adhesion, [[stuck|making it difficult to extricate oneself from]]. Quicksand is potentially [[peril|deadly]], not because of the likelihood of drowning—one generally sinks to about center-of-mass and the pool is usually 4-5 feet deep—but because of exposure or starvation/dehydration.\r\nIn fiction, however, there is often an inexplicable suction that swallows the character whole.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[tar_pit]] \r\n "
