            "tag": "ugly_bastard",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 446,
            "wiki_body": "[b]Ugly Bastard[/b] is a term describing a male character in pornographic art drawn to be extremely ugly, and often acting in a disgusting or reprehensible way.\r\n\r\nUgly Bastards are most often seen in hentai, typically as middle-aged human men, and sometimes are drawn as [[faceless_male|faceless males]]; less commonly, ugly bastards are fantasy monsters such as goblins and orcs, or monstrous anthropomorphic creatures - usually boars or pigs. In appearance, Ugly Bastards are some combination of overweight, hairy, and overly sweaty; human ugly bastards are often bald or balding, having a piggish face with beady or empty eyes (if their eyes are drawn at all), and a bulbous or exaggeratedly large nose (sometimes with snot running from the nostrils). \r\n\r\nThe [i]\"bastard\"[/i] part of the term describes the behaviour of these characters, who often are shown humiliating, dominating and usually [[rape|raping]] conventionally attractive female characters. Ugly Bastards are also a common part of [[cuckhold|cuckholding]] scenarios (in the form of a hentai genre called [[netorare]]). Even if they're not doing anything worthy of \"bastard\" in the image, if the character is drawn in the style of an \"Ugly Bastard\", the tag applies.\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Note: An overweight male is not inherently an Ugly Bastard:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Ugly Bastards are drawn specifically to elicit disgust from the viewer, they're exaggeratedly ugly or monstrous\r\n* An Ugly Bastard will almost [i]never[/i] be depicted in a solo image\r\n* Ugly Bastards are rarely given any kind of characterization in a comic featuring them\r\n"
