            "wiki_body": "thumb #775773\r\n\r\nA visual effect intended to imitate Photopsia, a phenomenon in which the retina is stimulated in such a way where an individual may see a flash or flashes of light in their vision. The most common reason for this effect is to portray unconsciousness, or disorientation. Potential causes include head trauma, physical exhaustion, and the [[substance_intoxication|use of drugs, or alcohol]].\r\n\r\nThis visual effect is not limited to just stars. The stars can be swapped out for any shape, or symbol – often various types of [[squean]]s. Traditionally, cuckoo birds have also been used to represent this effect.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[squean]]\r\n* [[star]]\r\n** [[star_polygon]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CirclingBirdies\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[iconography]]\r\n* [[star_eyes]]"
