              "count": 37965,
              "wiki_body": "Depictions of various glyphs and symbols.\r\n\r\n(If some characters below display badly, \"see here\":http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Special_characters#Displaying_Special_Characters.)\r\n\r\nh4. Symbols\r\n\r\nh6. Unsorted\r\n* [[©]] (copyright)\r\n* [[Ω]] (capital omega)\r\n* [[pi]] (π)\r\n* [[fleur-de-lis]] (⚜)\r\n* [[four_leaf_clover]] (🍀) - considered a symbol of good luck\r\n* [[♣]] (club)\r\n* [[♠]] (spade)\r\n* [[♦]] (diamond)\r\n* [[skull_and_crossbones]] (often associated with pirates, poison, or death)\r\n* [[☾]] (crescent moon)\r\n* [[∞]] (lemniscate, represents infinity)\r\n* [[pawprint]]\r\n* [[directional_arrow]] (--> in any direction)\r\n* [[recycling_symbol]] (♲)\r\n* [[no_symbol]] (🚫)\r\n* [[lightning_bolt]] (⚡)\r\n* [[digital_hazard]] - Four triangles and a circle from [[Digimon]]\r\n* [[zero_unit]] - Four triangles symbol from [[Digimon]]\r\n* [[triforce]] - Three triangles symbol from [[Zelda]]\r\n* [[pause]] (⏸)\r\n\r\nh6. Expressions and Sound (See Also: [[Iconography]])\r\n[i]Symbols primarily used to abstractly communicate character's emotions, speech or sounds; can be also used as part of a background, or on objects or garments:[/i]\r\n\r\nThese are provided mainly for informational purposes. Most of these concepts should not use the symbol tag.\r\n\r\n* [[exclamation_point|!]] (exclamation mark, used to indicate surprise, excitement, or shock)\r\n* [[question_mark|?]] (question mark, usually used to indicate confusion)\r\n* [[?!]] (known as an interrobang , indicating a mixed exclamation and question, or surprised confusion)\r\n* [[ellipsis|...]] (ellipses, can indicate hesitation, or a character remaining silent) \r\n* [[emanata]] (lines around an object or character indicating a range of ideas)\r\n* [[grawlixes]] ($#@*!) A mix of semi-random symbols abstractly representing swearing or anger, may contain unsorted symbols from above\r\n* [[sweatdrop]] (indicates nervousness, confusion, exasperation, embarrassment)\r\n** [[flying sweatdrops]] (indicates physical effort, embarrassment or nervousness)\r\n* [[musical_note]] (can indicate music being played, or \r\n* [[<3]] (a stylized representation of a [[heart]], ♥, representing love)\r\n** [[</3]] (broken or cracked heart)\r\n** [[arrow through heart]] (an arrow shot through a heart symbol, often in tattoos)\r\n** [[<3_eyes|heart_eyes]]\r\n** [[heart_tattoo]]\r\n* [[zzz]] (indicates sleeping; only used when there is literally \"zzz\" or equivalent present.)\r\n\r\nh6. Gender/Sexuality:\r\n\r\n* [b][[Gender Symbol]][/b]\r\n** [[female_symbol|♀]] (Venus, female)\r\n** [[male_symbol|♂]] (Mars, male)\r\n** [[intersex_symbol|⚥]] (Male and female sign; transgender/intersex)\r\n** [[mercury_symbol|☿]] (Mercury, intersex/unisex)\r\n** [[intersex_symbol|⚦]] (Magnesium, androgynous/intersex/transgender)\r\n** [[transgender_symbol|⚧]] (Male, female, and nonbinary symbols all in one; transgender)\r\n** [[intersex infinity]]\r\n* [b][[Sexuality Symbol]][/b]\r\n** [[female/female_symbol|⚢]] (female/female, lesbian)\r\n** [[male/male_symbol|⚣]] (male/male, gay)\r\n** [[male/female_symbol|⚤]] (male/female, straight)\r\n** [[rainbow symbol]]\r\n** [[ζ]] (small zeta)\r\n\r\nh6. Political\r\n* [[+]] (plus sign) - often associated with medical services, lifeguards, the Red Cross, etc. \r\n* [[☮]] (peace_symbol)\r\n* [[Ⓐ]] (anarchy symbol) - A pseudo-political symbol referring to disorder, common as graffiti.\r\n\r\nh6. Religious\r\n\r\n* [[cross]], [[inverted cross]]\r\n* [[pentagram]], [[inverted_pentagram]]\r\n* [[pentacle]] - a pentagram within a circle\r\n** [[heartagram]] - looks like an inverted pentacle, except the top two points of the star are rounded to create a heart-shaped top. Best known as the symbol of the band \"HIM\". \r\n* [[✡]] (Star of David / Hexagram) - Six-pointed star, associated with Judaism\r\n* [[ankh]]\r\n* [[eye_of_horus]]\r\n* [[yin_yang]]\r\n* [[swastika]] (卐)\r\n* [[sauwastika]] (卍)\r\n* [[☪]] (Star with crescent) - Associated with Islam\r\n\r\nh6. Safety/Warning\r\n\r\n* [[biohazard_symbol]] (☣)\r\n* [[nuclear]] (☢) - the nuclear symbol\r\n\r\nh6. Currency\r\n\r\n* [[currency_symbol]]\r\n** [[dollar_sign|$]] (dollar)\r\n** [[euro_sign|€]] (euro)\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[emoticons]]\r\n* [[emoji]]\r\n* [[gesture]]\r\n* [[pictographics]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Miscellaneous Symbols\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miscellaneous_Symbols"
