                "count": 568,
                "wiki_body": "The internationally symbol to warn people of the presence of ionizing radiation. The design consists of three triangles in magenta or black arranged in a circular pattern, each 60 degrees apart from the other, and placed on a yellow background.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[hazard_symbol]]\r\n** [[biohazard_symbol]]"
              }
            ]
