            {
              "tag": "drone_(vehicle)",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 243,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #1351345 thumb #4592216 thumb #5075425 thumb #1858847\n\nA [b]drone[/b] is a [[vehicle]] designed to operate without a person on board. Drones can be designed to be guided remotely, and some can operate independently via on-board computers. Drones have been produced as [[aircraft]], ground vehicles or [[boat|boats]], and [[submarine|submersibles]].\n\nIn English, the word [b]drone[/b] is most commonly associated with unmanned aerial vehicles (UAV), which saw widespread and increasing popularity during the early 21st century. UAVs have been adopted for military use, scientific research, commercial delivery, aerial photography, and private recreation, among other uses."
