              "count": 2976,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #3367816 thumb #1749814 thumb #3306987 thumb #3433328 thumb #4797146 thumb #1374509\r\n\r\nA [b]motorcycle[/b] [i](more commonly abbreviated to [b]bike[/b])[/i] is a [[motor|motorized]], two-[[wheel|wheeled]] [[vehicle]] capable of carrying one or two people.\r\n\r\nToday, these vehicles come in several types, depending on their use: for [[sport]], [[road]], \"off-road\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Off-roading or \"sport tourer\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sport_touring_motorcycle.\r\n\r\nThe [[driver]] of this type of vehicle is called a \"[[biker]]\".\r\n\r\nA passenger can [[straddling|straddle]] behind the biker, if the [b]motorcycle[/b] is designed with a passenger [[seat]] and [[footrest|footrests]].\r\n\r\nThe act of operating a [b]motorcycle[/b]:\r\n✔️ Warrants the [[driving]] tag\r\n✖️ Not the [[riding]] tag [i](which is reserved for animals only)[/i]\r\n\r\nh4.Related Tags:\r\n* [[biker]]\r\n* [[driving]]\r\n* [[machine]]\r\n* [[motor_vehicle]]\r\n* [[motorcyle_helmet]]\r\n\r\nh4.See Also:\r\n* [[bicycle]]\r\n* [[dirt_bike]]"
