              "wiki_body": "thumb #2451420 thumb #4168061 thumb #2175293 thumb #3959266 thumb #2961460 thumb #3303446\r\n\r\nUsed when a character is visibly supporting the entire weight of another character, and therefore [[carrying]] him or her.\r\nThis tag is used regardless of how a character is carrying another character: regardless of the supporting limbs (head, arms, hands etc...) and regardless of the position of the character being carried.\r\n\r\nH4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [b]Objects[/b] - For carried objects, use the [[holding_object]] tag instead.\r\n* [b]Holding[/b] - If a smaller character (requires [[size difference]]) is being carried exclusively with hands, use [[holding_character]].\r\n* [b][[Lifting]][/b] - Used for posts where a character is partially supporting the weight of another character.\r\n* [b][[Riding]][/b] - A concept that is distinct from carrying and lifting that involves riding on the backs of animals.\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n\r\n* [[Bridal Carry]]\r\n* [[Cradling]]\r\n* [[Fireman's Carry]]\r\n* [[On Shoulder]]\r\n* [[On Shoulders]]\r\n* [[Piggyback]]\r\n* [[Shoulder Carry]]\r\n* [[torture_rack_(wrestling_move)|Torture Rack]] - The wrestling move, not the object.\r\n* [[Underarm Carry]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:pose]]\r\n* [[lifted]]\r\n* [[riding]]\r\n* [[stand and carry position]]\r\n\r\n[section=\"Carrying\" Tags]\r\n* [b]carrying_another[/b]\r\n* [[carrying_baby]]\r\n* [[carrying_character]]\r\n* [[carrying_child]]\r\n* [[carrying_corpse]]\r\n* [[carrying_multiple_partners]]\r\n* [[carrying_on_head]]\r\n* [[carrying_on_shoulders]]\r\n* [[carrying_over_shoulder]]\r\n* [[carrying_partner]]\r\n* [[carrying_person]]\r\n* [[carrying_position]]\r\n* [[carrying_under_arm]]\r\n* [[carrying_with_mouth]]"
