              "tag": "body_worship",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 12114,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #3037802  thumb #2997292 thumb #1596039 thumb #1749800\n\n[b]Body worship[/b] is a general tag for any image where a character is admiring or appreciating another character's body, typically specific parts of their body. This can involve verbal [[praise]], but is usually expressed and depicted in a physical manner. Sometimes the worship is more literal, with characters praying to the character's body or body parts and, in some cases, treating the character that is the object of worship like royalty or a god.\n\nBody worship often relates to [[dominant|domination]]/[[submissive|submission]] play, as well as kinks like [[foot fetish|foot fetishism]] and [[navel fetish|navel fetishism]].\n\nNot to be confused with regular forms of [[worship]].\n\nh4. Actions Related to Worship:\n* Licking, kissing, sniffing, nuzzling, or sucking parts of the body\n* Rubbing, massaging, or cleaning the character being worshipped\n* Holding and squeezing or playing with the body part in focus\n* Being smothered by the body part or having the body part shoved in the face\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[armpit_worship]]\n* [[ball_worship]]\n* [[belly_worship]]\n* [[breast_worship]]\n* [[butt_worship]]\n* [[muscle_worship]]\n* [[musk_worship]]\n* [[penis_worship]]\n* [[pussy_worship]]\n\nh4. See also\n* [[facesitting]]\n* [[fondling]]\n* [[licking]]\n* [[lipstick_on_body]]\n* [[rimming]]\n* [[smothering]]\n* [[sniffing]]"
