            "count": 608,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3303028 thumb #3390350 thumb #3229816 thumb #3806266 thumb #4026370\r\n\r\nA [b]cardigan[/b] is a type of [[sweater]] with an open front, worn similarly to a jacket. Cardigans typically feature buttons and long sleeves, however, a cardigan may have no fasteners, and rarely, they may lack sleeves. \r\n\r\nSome furry characters who canonically wear cardigans include [[Toriel]] in [[Deltarune]], [[Isabelle_(animal_crossing)|Isabelle]] from [[Animal Crossing]] (who wears both sleeveless and sleeved cardigans), and [[Princess Carolyn]] from [[Bojack Horseman]]. \r\n\r\nNote: a sleeveless cardigan should not be confused with a [[sweater vest]], which is pulled over the wearer's head.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[sweater]]\r\n** [[sweater_vest]]\r\n"
