            "count": 535,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3582737 thumb #2747916 thumb #3692082 thumb #4344425 thumb #172618 thumb #2730627\r\n\r\nA [b]biker[/b] is the name given to the [[rider]] of a [[motorcycle]].\r\n\r\nThe vast majority of [b]bikers[/b] always wear [[leather clothing]], such as: [[leather jacket|jackets]], [[leather gloves|gloves]], [[leather pants|pants]], [[leather chaps|chaps]], [[leather boots|boots]] etc. \r\n\r\n[[Motorcycle helmet|Motorcycle helmets]] are the mandatory protection to be worn to avoid [[injuries]] or even [[death]] in the event of [[falling|fall]] or [[accident]].\r\n\r\n[b]Bikers[/b] can be riders of any sex, but being slightly more associated with [[male|men]], the [[female]] equivalent is [[biker girl|biker girls]].\r\n\r\nh4.Related Tags:\r\n* [[biker_girl]]\r\n* [[leather_clothing]]\r\n** [[leather_boots]]\r\n** [[leather_chaps]]\r\n** [[leather_gloves]]\r\n** [[leather_helmet]]\r\n** [[leather_pants]]\r\n* [[motorbike]]"
