            "count": 470,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #331230 thumb #77407 thumb #2343536 thumb #402413 \r\n\r\nA [b]trading card[/b] is a [[card]] intended to be collectible. Trading cards are often sold in card packs, or booster boxes. Many trading cards are designed with special instructions, icons, and other stats printed on the card. These types of cards are designed to be played in a [[trading card game]]. Other trading cards contain people, or sports players, and are purely collectible.\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[trading_card_template]] - The image is styled after a trading card.\r\n\r\nh4. Trading card games\r\n\r\nUsually the `trading card game` tag is applied when the the game is being played, or some element of the game is present in the image.\r\n\r\n* [[trading_card_game]]\r\n** [[digimon_tcg|digimon_trading_card_game]]/[[digimon_card_game]]\r\n** [[furoticon]]\r\n** [[magic:_the_gathering]]\r\n** [[pokemon_tcg|pokémon_trading_card_game]]\r\n** [[tank_vixens]]\r\n\r\nh4. Trading cards\r\n\r\n* [[baseball_card]]\r\n* [[digimon_card]]\r\n* [[hockey_card]]\r\n* [[magic:_the_gathering_card]]\r\n* [[pokemon_card|pokémon_card]]"
