                  "count": 44358,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #2616737 thumb #2585201 thumb #2538474\r\n\r\nImages or animations which depict a sword.\r\n\r\nA [b]sword[/b] is any [[melee weapon]] used primarily for cutting and/or thrusting which consists of a long [[blade]], a [[hilt]], and, sometimes, a [[crossguard]]; Essentially a long [[knife]] or [[dagger]]. This is an incredibly broad category of weapons that come in many shapes and sizes, so the precise definition of the term varies with the historical epoch or the geographical region under consideration.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Sword Types]\r\n\r\n* [[bastard_sword]]\r\n* [[claymore]]\r\n* [[greatsword]]\r\n* [[gladius]]\r\n* [[rapier]]\r\n* [[saber]] / [[sabre_(weapon)]]\r\n* [[scimitar]]\r\n* [[cutlass]]\r\n* [[khopesh]]\r\n* [[falchion]]\r\n* [[practice_sword]] / [[training_sword]]\r\n* [[toy_sword]]\r\n* [[asian_sword]]\r\n** [[japanese_sword]]\r\n*** [[samurai_sword]]\r\n**** [[katana]]\r\n**** [[wakizashi]]\r\n**** [[nodachi]]\r\n**** [[tachi]]\r\n**** [[tanto]]\r\n*** [[seven-branched_sword]]\r\n** [[chinese_sword]]\r\n*** [[dao_(sword)]]\r\n** [[indian_sword]]\r\n* [[fantasy_sword]]\r\n** [[magic_sword]] / [[enchanted_sword]]\r\n** [[double_sword]]\r\n** [[sword_helm]]\r\n** [[ethereal_sword]] / [[spectral_sword]]\r\n* [[celtic_sword]]\r\n* [[viking_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_hands]]\r\n* [[falcata_(sword)]]\r\n* [[penis_sword]]\r\n* [[katzbalger_(sword)]]\r\n* [[messer_(sword)]]\r\n* [[futuristic_sword]]\r\n** [[lightsaber]] / [[jedi_sword]]\r\n** [[power_sword]]\r\n** [[gantz_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_cane]]\r\n* [[dildo_sword]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Blades Types]\r\n\r\n* [[broadsword]]\r\n* [[curved_sword]]\r\n** [[sickle_sword]]\r\n*** [[african_sickle_sword]]\r\n* [[chainsword]] / [[chainsaw_sword]] / [[chain_sword]]\r\n* [[hook_sword]]\r\n* [[shortsword]] / [[short_sword]]\r\n* [[longsword]]\r\n* [[gunblade]] / [[gun_blade]] / [[swordgun]]\r\n* [[sword_whip]] / [[whip_sword]] / [[chain_sword]]\r\n* [[leaf_bladed_sword]]\r\n* [[big_sword]]\r\n** [[huge_sword]]\r\n* [[paddle_sword]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Materials]\r\n\r\n* [[wooden_sword]]\r\n* [[diamond_sword]] / [[crystal_sword]]\r\n* [[energy_sword]]\r\n* [[golden_sword]] / [[gold_sword]]\r\n* [[bronze_sword]]\r\n* [[ice_sword]]\r\n* [[glass_sword]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Colors]\r\n\r\n* [[red_sword]]\r\n* [[orange_sword]]\r\n* [[yellow_sword]]\r\n* [[green_sword]]\r\n* [[blue_sword]]\r\n* [[purple_sword]]\r\n* [[white_sword]]\r\n* [[grey_sword]]\r\n* [[black_sword]]\r\n* [[multicolored_sword]]\r\n** [[two_tone_sword]]\r\n** [[rainbow_sword]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Conditions]\r\n\r\n* [[broken_sword]]\r\n* [[blood_on_sword]]\r\n* [[cum_on_sword]]\r\n* [[glowing_sword]]\r\n* [[flaming_sword]]\r\n* [[heat_sword]]\r\n* [[electric_sword]]\r\n* [[glistening_sword]]\r\n* [[discarded_sword]]\r\n* [[planted_sword]]\r\n* [[floating_sword]]\r\n* [[sheathed_sword]]\r\n** [[mostly_sheathed_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_in_ground]]\r\n* [[sword_on_ground]]\r\n* [[sword_in_stone]]\r\n* [[rusted_sword]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Interactions]\r\n\r\n* [[holding_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_in_mouth]] / [[holding_sword_in_mouth]]\r\n* [[sword_on_back]]\r\n* [[swordfight]] / [[swordfighting]] / [[swordplay]]\r\n* [[sword_pointing]] / [[swordpoint]]\r\n* [[sword_swing]]\r\n* [[drawing_sword]]\r\n* [[hand_on_sword]]\r\n* [[unsheathing_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_in_pussy]]\r\n* [[sword_on_shoulder]]\r\n* [[dual_swords]]\r\n* [[licking_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_over_shoulder]]\r\n* [[sword_in_ass]]\r\n* [[sword_in_body]]\r\n* [[crossed_swords]] / [[crossing_swords]]\r\n* [[leaning_on_sword]]\r\n* [[looking_at_sword]]\r\n* [[dropping_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_through_heart]]\r\n* [[raised_sword]]\r\n* [[sharpening_sword]]\r\n* [[dragging_sword]]\r\n* [[sword_training]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Professions]\r\n\r\n* [[swordsman]] / [[swordfighter]]\r\n* [[sword_dancer]]\r\n* [[swordmage]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Unique named swords]\r\n\r\n* [[buster_sword]]\r\n* [[fusion_sword]]\r\n* [[master_sword]]\r\n* [[monado]]\r\n* [[scissor_blade]]\r\n* [[sword_of_omens]]\r\n* [[dragon_slayer_(berserk)]]\r\n* [[excalibur_(sword)]]\r\n* [[galaxia_(sword)]]\r\n* [[moonlight_greatsword]]\r\n* [[vorpal_blade]] (sword form)\r\n* [[great_knife_(silent_hill)]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4.See also\r\n* [[scabbard]] - a sheath in which a sword (or other bladed weapon) can be carried in at rest.\r\n* [[tag_group:weapons|Tag Group: Weapons]]\r\n* [[weapon]]"
