              "energy_sword": [
                {
                  "tag": "energy_sword",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 349,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #3377705 thumb #2947222 thumb #3068618 thumb #2330504 thumb #1346754\r\n\r\nA common [[science fiction|sci-fi]]/[[fantasy]] trope, an [b]energy sword[/b] is a [[sword]]-like [[energy weapon]] that is used for [[melee_weapon|melee]] combat. This energy can be [[magic|magical]], [[psychic]], or [[technology|technological]] in nature. Typical features include the ability to easily cut through resistant materials like [[armor]].\r\n\r\nh4.Similar Tags\r\n* [[beam_sword]]\r\n* [[laser_sword]]\r\n* [[plasma_sword]]\r\n\r\nh4.Variants\r\n* A blunt weapon that emits energy from its edges.\r\n* A [[hilt]]-shaped device that projects an energy blade.\r\n* An entire sword made out of pure energy or magic.\r\n\r\nh4.Types\r\n* [[lightsaber]] - probably the best known energy sword\r\n\r\nh4.See Also\r\n* [[flaming_sword]]\r\n* [[heat_sword]]\r\n* [[electric_sword]]"
