                "wiki_body": "thumb #576866\r\n\r\nA sai is a traditional weapon used in the Okinawan martial arts. The basic form of the weapon is that of a pointed, prong shaped metal baton, with two curved prongs projecting from the handle.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[weapon]]\r\n** [[melee weapon]]"
