                "count": 52876,
                "wiki_body": "thumb #740016 thumb #938325 thumb #840392\r\n\r\nAnything between a cannon and a bow counts as a ranged weapon. Adding more specific tags in addition to this will help search accuracy but adding [[overly specific]] tags will only bloat the system.\r\n\r\nh4. Types of ranged weapon\r\n\r\n* [[bow (weapon)]]\r\n** [[crossbow]]\r\n* [[blaster]]\r\n* [[cannon]] \r\n** [[mortar]]\r\n* [[flamethrower]]\r\n* [[grenade]]\r\n** [[grenade launcher]]\r\n* [[gun]]\r\n* [[handgun]]\r\n[section=Handguns]\r\n** [[flintlock_pistol]]\r\n** [[revolver]]\r\n*** [[colt anaconda]]\r\n*** [[colt python]]\r\n*** [[colt single action army]] (also known as the SAA, Model P, Peacemaker, or M1873)\r\n** [[pistol]]\r\n*** [[beretta 92]]\r\n*** [[desert eagle]]\r\n*** [[glock]]\r\n*** [[luger]]\r\n*** [[m1911 pistol]]\r\n*** [[walther_p99]]\r\n[/section]\r\n* [[laser gun]] \r\n* [[light machine gun]]\r\n** [[rpk]]\r\n* [[machine gun]]\r\n** [[gatling gun]]\r\n*** [[minigun]]\r\n** [[m240]]\r\n** [[mg 42]]\r\n* [[missile]]\r\n** [[nuclear missile]]\r\n* [[plasma gun]]\r\n** [[plasma blaster]]\r\n** [[plasma rifle]]\r\n* [[railgun]]\r\n* [[raygun]] \r\n* [[rifle]]\r\n** [[assault rifle]]\r\n[section=Assault Rifles]\r\n*** [[ak-12]]\r\n*** [[ak-47]]\r\n*** [[ak-74]]\r\n*** [[ak-103]] (ak-203)\r\n*** [[ar-10]]\r\n*** [[colt 723]] (an assault carbine, really)\r\n*** [[famas]] (bullpup)\r\n*** [[fn_f2000]] (bullpup)\r\n*** [[g36]] – H&K G36\r\n*** [[hk416]]\r\n*** [[m16]]\r\n*** [[m4]]\r\n*** [[sa80]] (bullpup)\r\n*** [[tavor tar-21]] (bullpup)\r\n*** [[textron ngsw-r]]\r\n[/section]\r\n** [[ar-15]]\r\n** [[laser rifle]]\r\n** [[mosin-nagant]]\r\n** [[revolving rifle]]\r\n** [[sniper rifle]]\r\n[section=Sniper Rifles]\r\n*** [[barrett m82]]\r\n*** [[barrett m82a1]]\r\n*** [[gm6 lynx]]\r\n*** [[l96]]\r\n*** [[m14]]\r\n*** [[qbu-88]]\r\n[/section]\r\n* [[rocket launcher]] \r\n** [[rocket]]\r\n** [[rpg-7]]\r\n* [[shotgun]]\r\n** [[sawed-off shotgun]]\r\n** [[spas-12]]\r\n* [[slingshot]]\r\n* [[submachine gun]]\r\n[section=Submachine Guns]\r\n** [[kriss vector]]\r\n** [[mac-10]]\r\n** [[mac-11]]\r\n** [[mp5]]\r\n** [[mp 40]]\r\n** [[p90]]\r\n** [[ppsh-41]]\r\n** [[thompson gun]]\r\n** [[uzi]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[ammunition]]\r\n** [[ammunition_cartridge]]\r\n** [[arrow]]\r\n** [[bullet]]\r\n* [[holding_weapon]]\r\n** [[dual_wielding]]\r\n* [[holster]]\r\n* [[silencer]]\r\n* [[scope]]\r\n* [[quiver]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[melee weapon]]\r\n* [[tag group:weapons]]\r\n"
