                "wiki_body": "thumb #4689709 thumb #4418002 thumb #3755565\r\n\r\nA projectile [[weapon]] used with a [[bow_(weapon)|bow]] for ranged combat. An arrow typically consists of a long shaft with a pointed tip (known as the \"arrowhead\") and a fin for stabilization.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[arrowed]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[bow_(weapon)]]"
              }
            ],
