        "axe": {
          "_Self (axe)": [
            {
              "tag": "axe",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 7593,
              "wiki_body": "This tag is added when the post contains a distinctive type of [[tool|tools]]/[[melee_weapon]] which is comprised of a (usually wooden) shaft with either a double-edged, curved blade or a single, wedge-shaped blade at the end.\r\n\r\nThese can vary in size considerably from small, single-handed tools to large, oversized two-handed weapons.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples:\r\n\r\nthumb #714433 thumb #706915 thumb #957477 thumb #3578837\r\n\r\nh4.Blade Types\r\n* Blade count\r\n** [b]Single bitted axe[/b] - Single cutting edge.\r\n** [[double_bitted_axe]] - A cutting edge on both sides.\r\n** [[double_axe]] - A handle with an axe head on both ends.\r\n\r\n* Blade orientation\r\n** [b]Vertical axe head[/b] - Vertical cutting edge.\r\n** [[adze]] - Horizontal cutting edge.\r\n** [b]palm axe head[/b] - Upwards-facing cutting edge.\r\n\r\n* Blade shape\r\n** [[bearded_axe]] - Hooked axe head.\r\n** [b]broad axe bit[/b] - Wider cutting edge.\r\n** [b]narrow axe bit[/b] - Narrower cutting edge.\r\n** [b]thick axe head[/b] - Heavier axe head.\r\n** [b]thin axe head[/b] - Lighter but sharper axe head.\r\n\r\nh4. Axe Types\r\n\r\n* Simple:\r\n** [[felling_axe]] - Woodcutting axe.\r\n** [[hatchet]] - Smaller sized axe.\r\n\r\n* [[tools]]\r\n** [[fire_axe]] - Axe + Point\r\n** [[ice_axe]] - Hooked for climbing ice\r\n** [[mattock]] - Axe + Adze\r\n** [[pickaxe]] - Axe/Adze + Point\r\n** [[pulaski]] - Axe + Adze\r\n\r\n* [[weapon|weapons]]\r\n** [[battle_axe]]\r\n** [[greataxe]] Polearm + Larger axe head\r\n** [[halberd]] - Axe + Spear + Hook\r\n** [[shepherd's axe]] - Looks like a walking stick.\r\n** [[tomahawk]] - Smaller sized axe of [[Native American]] design.\r\n** [[palm_axe]] - Polearm + Upward-facing axe.\r\n** [[labrys]] - Shorter handle + Double bitted axe\r\n** [[axe_hand]] - [[Gauntlets_(weapon)]] + Axe head / [[Prosthetic hand]] + Axe head\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Axe\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Axe"
            }
