            "wiki_body": "thumb #1067901 thumb #866078 thumb #227975 \r\n\r\nUse this tag when there is a [[bow_(feature)|bow]] attached to a neck.\r\n\r\nBows of this type are usually worn in a manner similar to a [[scarf]], and do not resemble the [[ribbons]] that are used to create other types of bows.\r\n\r\nAt the moment this tag does not include [[bow tie]], and it probably overlaps with [[bow collar]] to some extent. This tag may end up referring to any type of bow worn around the neck.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[neck_accessory]]\r\n* [[neck_ribbon]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Bow tags]\r\n\r\n* [[bow_(feature)]]\r\n** Category\r\n*** [[bow_accessory]]\r\n*** [[clothing_bow|bow_clothing]]\r\n*** [[bow_ribbon]]\r\n*** [[bow_tie]]\r\n** Location\r\n*** [[arm_bow]]\r\n**** [[wrist_bow]]\r\n*** [[ear_bow]]\r\n*** [[hair_bow]]\r\n*** [[horn_bow]]\r\n*** [[leg_bow]]\r\n**** [[ankle_bow]]\r\n**** [[thigh_bow]]\r\n*** [b]neck_bow[/b]\r\n*** [[nipple_bow]]\r\n*** [[penis_bow]]\r\n*** [[sheath_bow]]\r\n*** [[tail_bow]]\r\n*** [[waist_bow]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Ribbon tags]\r\n\r\n* [[ribbons]]\r\n** [[award_ribbon]]\r\n** [[ear_ribbon]]\r\n** [[hair_ribbon]]\r\n** [[hat_ribbon]]\r\n** [[horn_ribbon]]\r\n*** [[antler_ribbon]]\r\n** [[leg_ribbon]]\r\n** [[neck_ribbon]]\r\n** [[nipple_ribbon]]\r\n** [[penis_ribbon]]\r\n** [[ribbon_bondage]]\r\n** [[ribbonjob]]\r\n*** [[ribbon_insertion]]\r\n** [[sheath_ribbon]]\r\n** [[tail_ribbon]]\r\n** [[waist_ribbon]]\r\n\r\n[/section]"
