            "count": 1078,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1059864 thumb #1175951\r\n\r\nA pose where a character rests a held [[weapon]] on their shoulder. This is often done with [[oversized_weapon|very large weapons]] that are difficult to carry any other way or simply to look cool. Doing this incorrectly may lead to [[dismemberment|arm loss]].\r\n\r\nThis tag also applies to objects with similar form and dimensions to a weapon ([[baseball bat]], [[broom]], [[sledgehammer]], etc.) being held the same way."
