            "tag": "master_sword",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 427,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #831681\r\n\r\nThe [b]Master Sword[/b], also known as the [b]Blade of Evil's Bane[/b], the [b]Sword of Time[/b], and several other names is a recurring [[sword]] in [i][[The Legend of Zelda]][/i] series. It is imbued with the power to vanquish evil.\r\n\r\nThe Master Sword is a double-edged longsword with no fuller and a purple or blue hilt. The sword's crossguard is noticeably large and elaborate in relation to its pommel, and is reminiscent of the seal of Hyrule's Royal Family. The blade possesses a ricasso, although Link is never portrayed using it. The Triforce is engraved on the base of the blade, and embedded in the crossguard is what appears to be a yellow gemstone.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [i][[The Legend of Zelda]][/i]\r\n* [[sword|Sword]]\r\n* [[tag_group:weapons|Tag Group: Weapons]][[tag_group:weapons#named| - Named]]\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Zeldapedia - Master Sword\":http://zelda.wikia.com/wiki/Master_Sword"
