            "tag": "gauntlets_(weapon)",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 107,
            "wiki_body": "A weaponized [[gauntlet]] with an integrated [[melee_weapon]] or [[ranged_weapon]]. It usually includes a [[vambrace]] as part of the assembly to where the weapon systems are usually installed.\r\n\r\nh2.Variants\r\nh4.Melee\r\n* A punching weapon, similar in usage to [[boxing_gloves]].\r\n** armor plating that is thicker than your average gauntlet to withstand repeated use.\r\n** May also include an elbow or wrist-mounted rockets for extra velocity.\r\n** A piston/hydraulic mechanism for more impact.\r\n** Spikes or bumps on the knuckles.\r\n* [[claw_(weapon)|An armored claw]]\r\n** Claw-like blades are attached to each digit of the gauntlet.\r\n** A set of claw-like blades mounted on the backhand side of the gauntlet or vambrace.\r\n* An armored [[katar]]\r\n** A blade mounted on the backhand side of the gauntlet or vambrace.\r\n** A retractable blade under the wrist side of the vambrace often used by [[assassin]]s.\r\nh4.Ranged\r\n* Literal [[finger gun]]s\r\n** A ranged weapon is mounted on one, several or all digits of the gauntlet.\r\n*** The finger guns fire traditional solid projectiles.\r\n*** The fingers guns [[rocket launcher|launch miniaturize rocket propelled explosives]].\r\n*** The finger guns [[energy gun|fire energy beams or projectiles]].\r\n* The fingers detach from the hand and are launched as rocket propelled explosives.\r\n* A palm-mounted ranged weapon.\r\n** A literal hand cannon. A gun hole or extendable gun barrel can be seen on the palm.\r\n** A palm-mount energy emitter that fire beams or projectiles or project energy melee weapons from it.\r\n* A mounted ranged weapon is attached to the gauntlet or vambrace.\r\n* [[rocket_punch|Rocket fists]]; The hand or the entire forearm detaches from the arm and is launched as a rocket propelled projectile\r\n** The rocket fist returns and docks back to the user's arm after punching the target.\r\n** The rocket fists explodes on contact and the arm is reloaded with new rocket fists.\r\n* Magic Gauntlets\r\n** The gauntlets launches spectral fists at the target whenever the wielder does a punching motion.\r\n** The gauntlets aid the wielder on [[casting spell]]s, similar in function to a [[magic staff]] or [[wand]]."
