          "count": 1248,
          "wiki_body": "A [b]gaming chair[/b] is a chair specifically designed for long-term comfort while playing [[video games]]. There are several different types of gaming chairs.\r\n\r\n* PC gaming chairs are usually [[swivel chair|swivel chairs]] design for a computer desk, but they are distinct from [[office chair|office chairs]] with their high headrests, bucket seats, and larger, more colorful designs.\r\n* Platform gaming chairs are made for console gaming from the floor. They are normally [[rocking chair|rocking]] recliners.\r\n* Hybrid gaming chairs, which contain aspects of both PC and platform gaming chairs, are usually mounted on swivel bases, but are based on the shape and style of platform chairs.\r\n* There are also specialized gaming chairs such as cockpit chairs for racing and flying games.\r\n\r\nh4.External link\r\n* \"Gaming chair\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaming_chair on Wikipedia"
