        {
          "tag": "claw_(weapon)",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 382,
          "wiki_body": "A [[claw]]-like [[melee weapon]]. It consists of a row of [[blade|blades]], [[hook|hooks]], or [[hook|spikes]] that are held in place somewhere near or on the wielder's [[hand]] or [[feet|foot]].\r\n\r\nh4.Variants\r\n* As a hand-held weapon\r\n** The claws are attached to a [[handle]].\r\n** [[brass_knuckles]] with integrated claws.\r\n** A weapon (such as a [[sword]] or [[dagger]]) with a clawed [[basket_hilt]].\r\n** [[clawed_shield]] - A [[shield]] with integrated claws.\r\n\r\n* [[Fingerwear]] integration\r\n** A blade, hook, or spike is strapped on each individual finger via a [[finger_strap]].\r\n** A [[ring]] with a blade, hook, or spike on top. Produces a claw-like effect with one on each finger.\r\n** A [[thimble]] with an integrated blade, hook, or spike. Produces a claw-like effect with one on each finger.\r\n\r\n* [[Handwear]] integration\r\n** [[clawed_gloves]] - [[Gloves]] with integrated claws.\r\n** [[clawed_gauntlets]] - [[Gauntlets]] (hand [[armor]]) with integrated claws.\r\n\r\n* [[Armwear]] integration\r\n** The claws are held in place by a [[wristband]].\r\n** The claws are held in place by a fore[[arm_strap]].\r\n** [[clawed_vambrace]] - A [[vambrace]] (forearm armor) with integrated claws.\r\n\r\n* [[Footwear]] integration\r\n** A blade, hook, or spike is strapped on each individual toe via a [[toe_strap]].\r\n** [[clawed_shoes]] - [[Shoes]] with integrated claws.\r\n** [[clawed_boots]] - [[Boots]] with integrated claws.\r\n** [[clawed_sabatons]] - [[Sabatons]] (foot armor) with integrated claws.\r\n\r\nh4. Tags About Claws\r\n\r\n[section=Claw Tags]\r\n* [[claws]]\r\n[section=Colors]\r\n* [[black_claws]]\r\n* [[blue_claws]]\r\n* [[brown_claws]]\r\n* [[gold_claws]]\r\n* [[green_claws]]\r\n* [[grey_claws]]\r\n* [[orange_claws]]\r\n* [[pink_claws]]\r\n* [[purple_claws]]\r\n* [[red_claws]]\r\n* [[silver_claws]]\r\n* [[tan_claws]]\r\n* [[teal_claws]]\r\n* [[white_claws]]\r\n* [[yellow_claws]]\r\n[section,expanded=Color Sc