          "kor": "",
          "count": 1382,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #988690 thumb #887969 thumb #193370\r\n\r\nA popular game in the USA, done by two teams of 5 players in four quarters. The point is to throw the [[basketball_(ball)|ball]] in the opposing team's [[basketball_hoop|hoop]]. Basketball players usually are very tall, because they have to throw the ball high.\r\n\r\nFor images featuring the ball, see [[basketball_(ball)]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n\r\n* [[basketball_(ball)]]\r\n* [[basketball_court]]\r\n* [[basketball_hoop]]\r\n* [[basketball_uniform]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[tag group:sports|Tag Group: Sports]][[tag_group:sports#sport| - Sport]]"
