          "kor": "",
          "count": 730,
          "wiki_body": "\"[b]Cursed object[/b]\" describes any inanimate item with supernatural/magical energy that inflicts an unwanted effect on the character who interacts with that object.\n\nCommon effects of cursed objects involve the unlucky character being bound or trapped, encumbered, corrupted, transformed, or mind controlled. A cursed object, particularly in sexual/fetish contexts may cause parts of the character's body to [[expansion|expand]], or make the cursed character become uncontrollably [[aroused]].\n\nh4. Common Effects/Themes\n\n* [[corruption]]\n* [[intelligence_loss]]\n* [[mind_control]]\n* [[status_effect]]\n* [[transformation]]\n** [[gender_transformation]]\n** [[species_transformation]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[curse]]\n** [[cursed_clothing]]\n* [[magic]]\n** [[magic_item]]\n"
