        {
          "tag": "balloon_support",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 725,
          "wiki_body": "A [[balloon]] that is supporting some, or all of the weight of a character. This tag does not apply to objects.\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\nThere are three primary methods on supporting something with a balloon. Four if you consider [[against_balloon]].\r\n\r\n* [[hanging_from_balloon]] - A character hangs underneath a balloon. This does not include characters supported by platforms, or carriages under a balloon.\r\n\r\n[b]Methods of hanging[/b]\r\n\r\n** [[attached_to_balloon]] - A character is physically tied to the balloon, or the balloon is attached to a harness.\r\n** [[holding_balloon]] - A character is holding the balloon itself, or the string of the balloon.\r\n\r\n* [[on_balloon]] - A character is mostly on top of a balloon.\r\n** [[crouching_on_balloon]]\r\n** [[lying_on_balloon]]\r\n** [[sitting_on_balloon]]\r\n** [[standing_on_balloon]]\r\n\r\n* Hot air ballooning - A character is in a structure underneath the balloon.\r\n** This method only applies if the balloon is off the ground.\r\n\r\nh4. Unusual methods\r\n\r\n* [[in_balloon]] - The character is physically inside of a balloon.\r\n** This method only applies if the balloon is off the ground.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[balloon_fetish]]\r\n* [[hot_air_balloon]]\r\n* [[inflatable_ride]] - A character mostly on top of an inflatable.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[inflatable]]\r\n** [[balloon]]\r\n** [[inflatable_support]]\r\n* [[pool_toy]]\r\n** [[on_pool_toy]]"
