          "wiki_body": "A [b]Strip Game[/b] is a social media drawing game where an artist post an artwork of a character that also includes a some kind of requirement milestone (such as likes or retweets in Twitter's case).\r\nOnce the milestone has been reached the artist draws a sequel to the previous post depicting the same character with an article of clothing now removed from their person.\r\nThis continues until the character is stripped to their underwear or is now completely naked.\r\n\r\nA number of variants has spawned since the original conception of this game such as:\r\n* A reverse strip game where a nude or underweared character is chosen what article of clothing to wear.\r\n* A sex game where the character experiences more and more lewd acts as each milestone is achieved.\r\n* A bait and switch strip game where the expected result is replaced with something else."
