          "wiki_body": "A [b]trash bag[/b], also called a [b]garbage bag[/b], [b]bin bag[/b] or [b]bin liner[/b], is a disposable [[bag]] used to contain [[trash]]. Most bags these days are made out of plastic, and are typically black in color.\r\n\r\nThe insides of trash bags are coated in chemicals that make them hazardous to ingest. Whatever is put in a trash bag should [i]stay[/i] in a trash bag, and should not be used for transportation or storage. For this reason, never eat out [spoiler]of[/spoiler] a trash bag.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[trash]]\r\n* [[trash_can]]\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Bin bag\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bin_bag"
