          "tag": "rhythm_game",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 288,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2420684 thumb #4462249 thumb #2798681 thumb #2481702 thumb #3426128\r\n\r\n[b]Rhythm games[/b] are a genre of video games where gameplay is based on matching your inputs to the timing of a song. The genre was popularized in arcades in Japan and became a global phenomenon with series like [[Dance Dance Revolution]].\r\n\r\nThis tag should [b]only[/b] be applied if a character in an image is playing a rhythm game, gameplay elements from a rhythm game are visible, or a controller/arcade machine from a rhythm game is present. It should not be used on images of characters from rhythm games. Images do not have to reference a specific game, generic rhythm game machines and mechanics are also applicable.\r\n\r\n[section=List of rhythm games]\r\n* [[A Dance of Fire and Ice]]\r\n* [[Audica]]\r\n* [[Audioshield]]\r\n* [[Audiosurf]]\r\n* [[BanG Dream!]]\r\n* [[Beat Banger]]\r\n* [[Beat Saber]]\r\n* [[BEMANI]]\r\n** [[Beatmania]]\r\n** [[Beatmania IIDX]]\r\n** [[BeatStream]]\r\n** [[Dance Dance Revolution]]\r\n** [[Dancerush Stardom]]\r\n** [[jubeat]]\r\n** [[pop'n music]]\r\n** [[SOUND VOLTEX]]\r\n* [[Bit.Trip]]\r\n** [[Bit.Trip Runner]]\r\n* [[Bits and Bops]]\r\n* [[Chunithm]]\r\n* [[Crypt of the NecroDancer]]\r\n** [[Cadence of Hyrule]]\r\n* [[Cytus]]\r\n** [[Cytus 2]]\r\n* [[Deemo]]\r\n* [[DJMax]]\r\n** [[DJMax Technika]]\r\n* [[Elite Beat Agents]]\r\n* [[Everhood]]\r\n* [[Friday Night Funkin']]\r\n* [[Geometry Dash]]\r\n* [[Goodbye Volcano High]]\r\n* [[Guitar Hero]]\r\n** [[DJ Hero]]\r\n* [[Guitaroo Man]]\r\n* [[HarmoKnight]]\r\n* [[Hi-Fi Rush]]\r\n* [[Idolmaster]]\r\n** [[Idolmaster Cinderella Girls]]\r\n* [[In the Groove]]\r\n* [[Just Dance]]\r\n* [[Love Live!]]\r\n* [[Mad Rat Dead]]\r\n* [[maimai]]\r\n* [[Mungyodance]]\r\n* [[Muse Dash]]\r\n* [[Nekomew's Potty Trouble]]\r\n* [[O2Jam]]\r\n* [[osu!]]\r\n* [[PaRappa the Rapper]]\r\n** [[Um Jammer Lammy]]\r\n* [[Project DIVA]]\r\n** [[Project Mirai]]\r\n* [[Pump It Up]]\r\n* [[Rhythm Doctor]]\