          "count": 141,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2667836 thumb #2153322 thumb #3360995 thumb #3270988\r\n\r\n[b]Ball crush[/b] describes when something or someone is crushed by a character's [[balls]]. \r\n\r\n\r\nThis usually involves extreme size differences between the character or object being crushed and character whose balls are doing the crushing, although it could also involve a character crushing with their [[hyper balls]]. Ball crush typically depicts a character being uncomfortably or painfully pinned under the balls; rarely, the crushing causes injury or even death. \r\n\r\n[quote] \r\n\r\nh5. Not to be confused with balls [i]being crushed[/i] - see [[ballbusting]], [[ball squeeze]] and/or [[genital torture]] \r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[under balls]] - a character under the balls of another, who may be crushed or smothered\r\n** [[pinned]] - related when the character is made immobile by being stuck under the balls \r\n* [[ball squish]] - the balls usually \"deform\" as they lay on top of a surface, object or character\r\n* [[destruction]] - when a [[macro]] character uses their balls to crush vehicles, buildings, or entire cities\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[crush]]\r\n* [[size difference]]\r\n** [[extreme size difference]]\r\n* [[macro]]\r\n* [[micro]]"
