            "wiki_body": "thumb #134782\r\n\r\nA [b]broom[/b] is a [[cleaning tool]] consisting of usually stiff fibers (often made of materials such as plastic, hair, or corn husks) attached to, and roughly parallel to, a cylindrical handle, the broomstick. It is thus a variety of brush with a long handle. It is commonly used in combination with a [[dustpan]].\r\n\r\nThe cleaning activity done by broom is usually called [[sweeping]].\r\n\r\nBroom is also the thing [[witch|witches]] and wizards use for flying.\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Broom\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[broom_riding]]\r\n* [[cleaning]]\r\n* [[dustpan]]\r\n* [[mop]]\r\n* [[sweeping]]"
