            "tag": "living_room",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 3607,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #3265900 thumb #2358170 thumb #1430118\r\n\r\nA room in a residence used for relaxing, socializing, and recreation, traditionally located at or near the entrance of a [[house]] or [[apartment]] unit. Modern living rooms are typically centred around a [[television]] set.\r\n\r\nh5. Tagging Notes\r\n* This tag can be used broadly, if an indoor space looks like a living room, it should be tagged `living_room`\r\n* If a character is sitting on a couch with no surrounding furniture or background, don't tag `living_room`\r\n\r\n\r\nh5. Usually Contains...\r\n* [[sofa]]\r\n* [[table]]  (specifically a [[coffee table]])\r\n* [[television]]\r\n* [[video game console]]\r\n* [[fireplace]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[house]]\r\n* [[inside]]\r\n"
