            "wiki_body": "thumb #229901 thumb #1213513 thumb #1376007 thumb #1219709\r\n\r\nAn area of sand or small stones near the sea or another body of water such as a lake.\r\n\r\nIn practice, this is primarily tagged for flat sandy beaches. Use [[rocky shore]], [[seaside]], and/or [[cliff]] for jagged and rough shorelines.\r\n\r\nDo not tag if there is no visible land. If a character is standing in water, [[seaside]] may be applicable. \r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n* [[cloudscape]] - just the sky, no water or land.\r\n* [[seascape]] - water and sky, no visible land.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[tag_group:locations]]\r\n* [[beach_ball]]\r\n* [[detailed_background]]\r\n* [[outside]]\r\n* [[parasol]]\r\n* [[sand]]\r\n** [[sand_castle]]\r\n* [[sea]]\r\n* [[sex_on_the_beach]]\r\n** [[water]]\r\n*** [[partially_submerged]]\r\n*** [[surfing]]\r\n*** [[swimming]]\r\n*** [[wave]]\r\n* [[sky]]\r\n** [[clouds]]\r\n** [[sun]]\r\n* [[skimpy]]\r\n** [[swimsuit]]"
