            "tag": "space",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 13010,
            "wiki_body": "Outer space is the void that exists beyond any celestial body, including the [[Earth]]. Although it consists of almost entirely, well... nothing, there are a great deal of massive objects out there such as [[planet|planets]] and [[galaxy|galaxies]] that are both a fantastical example of overwhelming our ever-evolving laws of physics and quite pretty to look at.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n* [[tag_group:locations]]\r\n* [[alien]]\r\n* [[spacescape]]\r\n* [[spacecraft]]"
          },
