            "wiki_body": "thumb #3235353 thumb #3242013 thumb #3598603\r\n\r\n[b]City destruction[/b] describes widespread devastation or complete destruction of an entire city (or other settlement) actively being done by a character (most often a [[macro|giant]], rampaging character), or some other event such as a [[disaster]] ([[earthquake]], [[tornado]], [[meteor]] strike, etc). \r\n\r\nCity destruction should only be tagged if the damage is clearly widespread — if the character is [[landscape dwarfing|extremely large]] and able to step on, sit on, or lay across large areas of a city, or if there's a cityscape of ruins and burning wreckage behind the macro, city destruction is appropriate —  if there are a small number of damaged buildings in the scene, the post is better tagged as [[building destruction]]. \r\n\r\nNote: If there is no \"active agent\" destroying the city, use [[ruins]] instead\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n\r\n* [[crush]] (the usual method of city destruction by macro characters)\r\n** [[butt crush]]\r\n** [[foot crush]]\r\n* [[macro]]\r\n* [[damaged building]]\r\n* [[burning building]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n\r\n* [[destruction]]\r\n** [[building destruction]]\r\n** [b]city destruction[/b]\r\n** [[planet destruction]]\r\n** [[vehicle destruction]]\r\n\r\n\r\n"
