            "count": 179,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #202993 thumb #1016850 thumb #3603921\r\n\r\nA [b]soccer field[/b] (also known as a [b]football field[/b] or [b]football pitch[/b]) is the playing surface for the game of [[soccer|association football]]. Made of either [[grass]] or artificial turf, its dimensions and markings are defined by Law 1 of the Laws of the Game, \"The Field of Play\".\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[Soccer]]\r\n* [[tag_group:sports|Tag Group: Sports]][[tag_group:sports#area| - Playing Areas]]\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Football pitch\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Football_pitch"
