          "count": 43213,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1095609 thumb #1501680 thumb #556915\n\nDescribes characters with very little range of motion because other characters or other living things are immobilizing them. If the limitation is caused by non-living things, [[bound]] should be used.\n\nGenerally, characters restrained by other characters are [[tag_group:grab|grabbed]] or [[pinned]]. [[Tentacles]] frequently restrain characters, and long appendages such as tentacles and  reptilian (e.g., [[snake]]) or other [[prehensile_tail|prehensile]] tails can restrain characters by [[coiling]].  A [[leash]] being [[holding_leash|held]] or [[leash_pull|pulled]] by another character count as restraining, but if the other end is tied to something, it is considered [[bound]].\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[bdsm]]\n** [[bondage]]\n* [[bound]]\n* [[fully_bound]]\n* [[struggling]]\n\nh4. Forum Discussions\n* topic #280788 Tag Alias: immobilization -> fully_bound"
