          "count": 21375,
          "wiki_body": "[b]Do not confuse with [[scarred]].[/b]\n\nAn intense feeling of dread towards an impending event, or perceived threat. This tag also involves the fear response, which refers to body language indicative of a character exhibiting fear. This may include actions such as running from someone or something, visible [[shaking]], [[crying]], or having a shaky body contour. \n\nScared is a step up from [[nervous]].\n\nFor other emotions, check [[tag_group:facial_expressions#emotions]].\n\nh4. See also\n* [[tag_group:facial_expressions#emotions]]\n* [[alarmed]]\n* [[nervous]]\n* [[cowering]]"
