        {
          "tag": "crossover_ship",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1104,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3152886 thumb #3821063 thumb #3919121 thumb #4251386\n\nA [[crossover]] relationship — when two characters from different pieces of media are \"shipped\" (a fandom term based on \"relationship\") together in a romantic or sexual situation. \n\n\nh5. [i]Why [/i]Crossover Ship?\n\nMany specific crossover ships become popular subjects in fan art that end up drawn by many artists over time. In most cases, even if the pairing seems odd, these popular crossover ships have one or more reasons for why these characters are repeatedly depicted together, such as:\n\n* being of the same species\n* having similar aesthetics or design\n* having similar roles or professions\n* how the characters' personalities could play off one another as a couple\n* \"meta\" reasoning, e.g. the characters sharing a voice actor, the media they originate from releasing around the same time, or the media having similar settings and/or genre\n\nHowever, some crossover ships are considered \"crack ships\" where the characters paired together are intentionally bizarre and humorous, and have few if any of the elements from the list above, a popular example of which would be the [[mordetwi]] meme.\n\nh5. Tagging Notes\n\n* Characters should be interacting in a way that clearly implies infatuation, affection, love and/or lust for one another, this tag should not be used if the characters are simply posed together (even if nude), or interacting in a friendly way \n* If the interaction is unwannted/nonconsensual, `crossover_ship` should not be added to the post\n\n[section=Examples of Popular Crossover Ships]\n\nThis is an incomplete list of popular crossover character pairings, which are featured in many posts by different artists\n\n* [[brandy_harrington|Brandy Harrington (Brandy and Mr. Whiskers)]] X [[kitty_katswell|Kitty Katswell (T.U.F.F. Puppy)]]\n* [[Diane Foxington|Diane Foxington (The Bad Guys)]] X [[Nick Wilde|Nick Wilde (Zootopia)]]\n* [[Eris (tgaobam)|Eris (The Grim Adventures of Billy and Mandy)]] X [[Mirage (Disney)]]\n* [[Isabelle (Animal Crossing)]] X [[Doom Slayer|The Doom Slayer (Doom 2016)]] \n* [[Judy Hopps|Judy Hopps (Zootopia)]] X [[Lola Bunny|Lola Bunny (Looney Tunes)]] \n* [[Katia Managan|Katia Managan (Prequel Adventure)]] X [[Nicole Watterson|Nicole Watterson (The Amazing World of Gumball)]]\n* [[Katia Managan|Katia Managan (Prequel Adventure)]] X [[Gumball Watterson|Gumball Watterson (The Amazing World of Gumball)]]\n* [[Loona (Helluva Boss)]] X [[roxanne_wolf_(fnaf)|Roxanne Wolf (Five Nights at Freddy's: Security Breech)]]\n* [[Loona (Helluva Boss)]] X [[Death (Puss In Boots)]] \n* [[Mordecai (Regular Show)]] X [[twilight_sparkle_(mlp)|Twilight Sparkle (My Little Pony:Friendship is Magic)]]\n\n[/section]\n\nh4. Related Tags\n\n* [[crossover]]\n* [[romantic couple]]\n\nh4. See Also\n* [[canon couple]]\n* [[canon x OC]]\n"
