          "wiki_body": "thumb #3213729 thumb #3485118 thumb #3397535\r\n\r\nA character actively destroying, or having just destroyed a [[vehicle]], or the vehicle being destroyed by something.\r\n\r\nWhile this tag can apply to more pedestrian methods of destruction, such as a bomb exploding, a missile being launched at it or by being crushed in a machine, this typically involves a giant character interacting with a vehicle.\r\n\r\n[[Macro]] sized characters may be shown crushing a vehicle by [[foot crush|stepping or stomping on it]], they may sit on, slam their butt down on or fall on a vehicle butt-first, crushing it with their butt. \r\nWhen used as an [[improvised sex toy]], a vehicle that that has been inserted into an orifice or is being penetrated by a character's penis will end up heavily damaged, if not rendered completely destroyed.\r\n\r\nAn unnaturally large, but [i]not exactly[/i] macro character, who is obese or has [[hyper]] sized assets may be able to cause heavy damage to a vehicle in some way.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[crushed vehicle]]\r\n* [[vehicle insertion]]\r\n* [[vehicle penetrated]] \r\n* [[damaged vehicle]]\r\n* [[destruction]]\r\n* [[rampage]]\r\n\r\n"
