          "count": 37036,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4499263 thumb #5193088 thumb #3068640 thumb #5271497 thumb #3966636 thumb #5091362\n\n[b]Barazoku[/b], often shortened to [i]\"bara\"[/i], is used to describe a post featuring erotic and pornographic imagery of [i]particularly [[manly|masculine]][/i] [[muscular]], [[slightly chubby|chubby]], or [[overweight]] [[male]] characters. [b]Note:[/b] Due to the nature of art, pornography, and the consensus of this site's community, Bara is not exclusive to male characters, but instead to a [i]masculine[/i] phenotype.\n\nThe tag is named for the genre of [[male/male|gay]] [[manga]] that was described as \"By gay men, for gay men\", which features and glorifies masculine, muscular, and frequently [[hairy]] male bodies. Outside of Japan, this term was adapted to more broadly describe any erotic imagery focused on muscular or overweight masculine men. Often synonymous with the \"Bear\" body type in gay culture.\n\nWhen using this tag, it is useful to combine it with more specific terms like [[muscular]], [[slightly chubby]] or even [[overweight]] whenever possible. For a helpful rule of thumb, the tag should only be used if the characters have multiple of the following tags and features. If any of the main characters in focus are explicitly female (not [[andromorph]]) or extremely feminine then this tag does not apply. Think of bear on bear, or bear on muscular.\n\nh5. Features of Barazoku\n\nh6. Physical Traits\n\"Bara\" characters typically display some or all of the following features:\n\n* square jaws or generally squarish head shapes\n* [[facial hair]], especially scruffy [[beard]]\n* [[body hair]], especially excess [[chest hair]]\n* [[big chest]], especially [[big pecs]]\n* [[big muscles]], sometimes to excessive detail\n* [[musclegut]] — a combination of chubby [[belly]] and defined muscles  \n* [[overweight_male]], often can mean outright fat or obese\n* sometimes prominent [[nipple_piercing]] or [[moobs]]\n* Excessive [[steam]] or [[musk