          "wiki_body": "thumb #222283 thumb #3193908\r\n\r\nA [b]barn[/b] is a large agricultural [[building]] found on a [[farm]] which is used for housing [[livestock]], and/or storing crops. Barns are typically constructed of wood, and \"classically\" painted red and white.\r\n\r\nThis tag can apply whether a scene depicts characters inside of a barn, or a barn being shown in an outside shot. \r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[hay]]\r\n** [[hay_bale]]\r\n* [[pitchfork]]\r\n* [[ranch]]\r\n** [[rancher]]\r\n* [[stable]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[tag_group:locations]]\r\n* [[farm]]\r\n** [[grain_silo]]"
