ed with\n\n[[fully_inside]] - When the character is completely in the other one. (It doesn't count as partially_inside.)\n[[imminent_vore]] - When a character will (or probably would) go in another character but isn't partially in it yet.\n\nh4. Related tags\n\nh5. Vore themes\n\n* [[anal_vore]]\n* [[cock_vore]]\n* [[oral_vore]]\n** [[in_mouth]] - a character entirely in another's mouth\n** [[head_in_mouth]] - a character's head in another character's mouth, can also apply to a character's head still in the mouth of the predator while being swallowed feet first\n** [[body_in_mouth]] - a character's upper or lower body within another character's mouth\n** [[foot_in_mouth]] - a character's feet in another's mouth, can also apply to a character being swallowed head first, with their feet sticking out of the throat into the mouth\n* [[tail_vore]]\n* [[unbirthing]]\n\nh5. Way the prey is being swallowed or inserted\n\n* [[butt_first]]\n* [[feet_first]]\n* [[head_first]]\n* [[tail_first]]\n\nh5. Number of prey being swallowed or inserted\n\n* [[two_prey_at_once]]\n* [[three_prey_at_once]]\n* [[many_prey_at_once]]"
