          "wiki_body": "A [b]prisoner[/b] is someone who is being held captive in a [[dungeon]], or a [[prison]], or is performing some duty as a punishment for committing a criminal offense.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[arrested]] - A character doesn't become a prisoner until they have been held captive, or are being punished for a crime.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[bound]]\r\n** [[chained]]\r\n* [[coffle]]\r\n* [[dungeon]]\r\n* [[execution]]\r\n* [[imprisoned]]\r\n* [[iron_bars]]\r\n* [[prison]]\r\n* [[prison_bars]]\r\n* [[prison_uniform]]\r\n* [[restrained]]\r\n* [[restraints]]\r\n** [[shackles]]\r\n*** [[wrist_cuff]]\r\n*** [[handcuffs]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[captive]]\r\n** [[damsel_in_distress]]\r\n* [[kidnapping]]\r\n* [[slave]]"
