        {
          "tag": "pinned",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 12134,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1481544 thumb #1869834 thumb #1461114\r\n\r\nGenerally refers to a character (usually smaller, and [[submissive]] if consensual) being actively pinned down in any of a variety of ways. The character is [[restrained]] by being pressed [[against_surface]] directly from their opposite side. For example, a character with their chest against ground with someone sitting on their back or pushing towards the surface on their back is \"pinned\", but a character with their chest against ground or wall with someone pushing them against it by their butt is not pinned, as they could arch or twist their torso to squirm away.\r\n\r\nDo not use the pinned tag when the character is inside of another, otherwise all [[vore]] art would be tagged with pinned. Similarly, a character being passively fully enclosed does not necessarily get tagged [[pinned]], because that is covered by [[trapped]]. For example, in post #4248596, it's unclear if the paw is pinning them to the shoe or the shoe is pinning them to the paw, so [[trapped_in_shoe]] is more appropriate. Only use pinned when the character is actively being held against a surface and is not [[vore|inside a character]], not [[trapped_in_clothing|inside clothing]], etc.\r\n\r\nThis may often, but not always, coincide with [[rough_sex]] or [[rape]], especially when used in a [[group]].\r\n\r\nMay also refer to the act, in pro [[wrestling]], of pinning the opponent to win the match.\r\n\r\nDue to there being many methods of pinning a person (such as [[against_wall]]), [[pinned_arms]] may be used as a subtag to denote that, specifically, a person's arms are being pinned down.\r\n\r\nh4. Pinned by (what body part the pinner is using to pin):\r\n\r\n* [[pinned_by_ass]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_balls]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_belly]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_breasts]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_butt]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_claw]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_coil]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_crotch]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_finger]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_foot]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_hand]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_leg]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_penis]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_pussy]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_shoe]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_tail]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_toe]]\r\n* [[pinned_by_tongue]]\r\n\r\nh4. Pinned to (what surface the pinned character is being pinned against):\r\n\r\n* [[pinned_to_armpit]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_bed]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_bench]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_chair]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_character]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_desk]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_furniture]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_glass]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_ground]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_penis]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_sandal]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_seat]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_table]]\r\n* [[pinned_to_wall]]\r\n\r\nh4. Pinned parts (what body part of the pinned character is pinned):\r\n\r\n* [[pinned_arms]]\r\n* [[pinned_hair]]\r\n* [[pinned_head]]\r\n* [[pinned_legs]]\r\n* [[pinned_neck]]\r\n* [[pinned_tail]]\r\n* [[pinned_wing]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[against_wall]]\r\n* [[rape]]\r\n* [[restrained]]\r\n* [[rough_sex]]"
