          "count": 4039,
          "wiki_body": "An [[inside|indoor]] location where research and [[scientific experiment|experiments]] are conducted. A place where [[chemistry]] and [[biology]] is often in focus but maybe also [[physics]].\r\n\r\nThese places are often filled with several [[laboratory equipment]] such as [[microscope]]s, [[laboratory glassware]] (such as [[erlenmeyer flask]]s or [[test tube]]s), and other exotic [[machine]]s and devices.\r\n\r\nThis is also where [[scientist]]s and their [[mad scientist|mad counterpart]] do their work. Often times you'll find them in their white [[lab coat]]s or donning [[hazmat suit]]s whenever they're handling hazardous materials.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[tag_group:magic]]\r\n* [[tag_group:locations]]\r\n"
