            "wiki_body": "thumb #4565714 thumb #2684759 thumb #4024616 thumb #4218842\r\n\r\n[b]Shadow face[/b] describes a character whose face is represented as a black void with simplified facial features — often just their eyes and mouth.\r\n\r\nTypically, these characters' faces are shaded by a hood or hat, which obscures the face [i]even when it would be physically impossible[/i]. \r\n\r\nIn other cases, a character's face is covered in perpetual shadow for no apparent reason at all, often to make a character appear [[creepy]]. A character with a shadow face usually has their normal skin, scales or fur colour represented by other parts of their body. \r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[glowing eyes]]\r\n* [[simple face]]\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with...\r\n* [[dark_face]]\r\n* [[featureless_face]]\r\n* [[obscured_face]]"
