          {
            "tag": "hitachi_magic_wand",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 1988,
            "wiki_body": "A [b]Hitachi Magic Wand[/b] is a [[massage|massager]] consisting of a rounded, motorized head attached to a long handle, and is powered from an electrical outlet using a cord. Originally introduced by Hitachi in 1968 for relieving muscle tension, it has since developed a reputation in popular culture as a powerful [[vibrator]].\r\n\r\nThe popularity of the Magic Wand as a [[sex toy]] has led to a proliferation of similar products, and inspired the general term [[wand vibrator]]. Today, wand vibrators are produced in a wide range of sizes, and may be powered using either internal batteries or a power cord.\r\n\r\nUnofficial modifications to the Magic Wand can sometimes be found, such as replacement of the rounded head with a [[ring_vibrator|ring]], sleeve, or cuff that fits around the shaft of a [[penis]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[wand_vibrator]]\r\n* [[sex_toy]]\r\n* [[vibrator]]\r\n* [[penetrable_sex_toy]]"
