            "wiki_body": "A [b]flashlight[/b] is a portable hand-held electric light. There are many types of flashlights, one of the most common has a cylindrical shape with a cone on one end which contains the light bulb.\r\n\r\nh4.Not to be confused with\r\n* [[penetrable_sex_toy|fleshlight]], which is a penetrable [[sex toy]].\r\n* [[torch]], which is what flashlights are called in British English.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[light]] - For general presence of a light source in the image\r\n* [[light_beam]]\r\n* [[lighting]] - For images that specifically render out lighting for added three-dimensionality, as opposed to [[line_art]] and [[flat_colors]] images for example, that can have a stylized light source present "
