            "count": 528,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #5054152 thumb #2646815 thumb #2753467 thumb #400648 thumb #2661823 thumb #2128559\r\n\r\nA [b]firefighter[/b] [i](sometimes written [b]fire fighter[/b])[/i] is the profession for a person whose main vocation is \"firefighting\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefighting, but who is also able to offer a range of different types of assistance, such as: [[flood|floods]], [[accident|accidents]], [[rescue|rescues]], helping [[kitty|kittens]] stuck in a [[tree]], etc...\r\n\r\nTheir primary mission is: to [[protect]] people, [[property]] and the [[environment]], and to extinguish [[fire]]. \r\n\r\nThe term for [[male|men]] is \"[b]fireman[/b]\" and for [[female|women]] is \"[b]firewoman[/b]\".\r\n[i](Although the name of the female equivalent is very rarely used, as a general rule: the most commonly used term is just \"[b]firefighter[/b]\").[/i]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[fire]]\r\n* [[fire_axe]]\r\n* [[turnout_gear]]\r\n\r\nh6. firefighter_*\r\n* [[firefighter_boots]]\r\n* [[firefighter_dog]]\r\n* [[firefighter_gloves]]\r\n* [[firefighter_helmet]]\r\n* [[firefighter_outfit]]\r\n* [[firefighter_uniform]]\r\n\r\nh6. Characters\r\n* [[Firefighter Connor]]\r\n* [[Firefighter Style Blastoise]]\r\n* [[Marshall (Paw Patrol)]]"
