          "count": 384,
          "wiki_body": "An umbrella tag group for [[sound effects]] associated with [[rubbing]] terms.\r\n\r\nh4. Tagging notes\r\n\r\nThis is a [[contact onomatopoeia]] group, but only if the sound effect form is compatible with an onomatopoeia form. It shouldn't be a [[vowelless_sound_effect|vowelless form]].\r\n\r\n\"Rub\" - Treat as an onomatopoeia.\r\n\"Rb\" - Do not treat as an onomatopoeia.\r\n\r\nh4. Sound effect forms\r\n\r\n* \"Grind\"\r\n* \"Rub\"\r\n* \"Stroke\"\r\n* \"Wipe\"\r\n\r\nh5. Exclusions\r\n\r\nFor tagging purposes these forms should not be considered rubbing terms.\r\n\r\n* \"Pet\" should only be tagged as [[contact_onomatopoeia]].\r\n* \"Scrape\" should only be tagged as [[contact_onomatopoeia]], and possibly also as [[scrape_(sound_effect)]].\r\n* \"Scratch\", and its variants should be tagged as [[contact_onomatopoeia]], as well as [[scratching_sound_effect]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:sound_effects]]\r\n\r\n* [[sound_effects]]\r\n** [[gripping_sound_effect]]"
