          "wiki_body": "thumb #431305 thumb #1749502 thumb #2021802 thumb #3259992 thumb #5441577\n\nWhen a character who is being penetrated (the \"bottom\", which is not to be confused with submission) is the one taking control of the situation. This is commonly expressed in gay [[dominance]] activities where the \"bottom\" is physically on top of their partner and showing dominance, or in [[dominant_female|femdom]] situations where the [[submissive]] character, usually [[submissive_male|male]], is penetrating the dominant female (contrasted with [[pegging]], where the dominant female is penetrating the submissive male). Power bottoms are frequently seen in the [[cowgirl position]].\n\nThe term \"power bottom\" is related to [[BDSM]], particularly in the D/S aspect.\n\nh4. Not to be confused with \n* the concept of [[on_top]]/[[on_bottom|bottom]]; these tags are concerned with position rather than dominance and penetration.\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[big_dom_small_sub]]\n* [[big_power_bottom]]\n* [[bound_top]]\n* [[leashed_top]]\n* [[service_top]], [[submissive_top]]\n* [[small_dom_big_sub]]"
