          "tag": "compression_sound_effect",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 467,
          "wiki_body": "An umbrella group for [[sound effects]] associated with compression.\r\n\r\nh4. Sound effect forms\r\n\r\nDo not use this tag for pressing / prodding / rubbing sound effects unless the action uses one of the sound effect forms below.\r\n\r\nMany of these forms may qualify as [[contact_onomatopoeia]].\r\n\r\n* [[coiling]] - \"Bind\", \"Coil\", \"Wrap\"\r\n* [[crushing_sound_effect]] - \"[[Crunch]]\", \"[[Crush]]\", \"Mangle\" specifically\r\n* [[smoosh_(sound_effect)]] - \"Smoosh\", \"Smush\"\r\n* [[squeeze_(sound_effect)]] - Always applies\r\n* [[squish_(sound_effect)]] - Only some of these may qualify as a compression sound effect.\r\n\r\nh4. Related themes\r\n\r\n* [[chewing]]\r\n* [[clenching]] - \"Clench\" may be a valid compression sound effect.\r\n* [[coiling]]\r\n* [[crush]]\r\n* [[grabbing]] - Although most grabbing sound effects do not qualify.\r\n* [[slam]]\r\n* [[squeezing]]\r\n* [[squish]]\r\n* [[stomping]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:sound_effects]]\r\n\r\n* [[sound_effects]]\r\n** [[biting_sound_effect]]\r\n** [[onomatopoeia]]\r\n*** [[impact_onomatopoeia]]\r\n** [[nom_(sound_effect)]]\r\n** [[stomp_(sound_effect)]]"
