          "wiki_body": "[[Transformation]] induced by the effects of exposure to a foreign substance. \r\n\r\nh4. Valid usages\r\n\r\nHolding something that is considered a substance may count as exposure.\r\n\r\n- Exposure to gases, poisons, and other substances a character breathes in ([[smoking]] / [[cigarette_smoke]])\r\n- Food or beverage consumption or exposure.\r\n- Injections of any kind\r\n- Potion and/or drug use\r\n\r\nh4. Usages not yet established\r\n\r\n- Exposure to [[cum]] or other bodily fluids. Most of the time it would be ambiguous with [[transformation_through_sex]], which should not be used along with this tag.\r\n- Exposure through [[magic]] (Use [[transformation_through_magic]])\r\n- [[Goo transformation]] is a grey area, and still being worked out. It probably counts.\r\n- Transformation by being shocked, zapped (Use [[transformation_ray]])\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[transformation_potion]]\r\n* [[transformation_through_food]]\r\n* [[transformation_through_injection]]\r\n* [[transformation_through_smoking]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[transformation]]"
