          "tag": "crushing_sound_effect",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 295,
          "wiki_body": "An umbrella group for [[sound effects]] associated with [[crush|crushing]].\r\n\r\nh4. Sound effect forms\r\n\r\n[i]The primary sound effect forms should also get tagged as [[compression_sound_effect]]. It is unclear whether the auxiliary sound effects should though.[/i]\r\n\r\n* \"[[Crunch]]\"\r\n* \"Crush\"\r\n* \"Mangle\"\r\n* \"Squish\" (rarely)\r\n\r\nh5. Auxiliary sounds\r\n\r\n[i]These sounds do not directly refer to the act of crushing itself, but may be the direct cause of a crushing force. Not all examples of these sound effects will apply.[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[cracking]]\r\n* [[pop_(sound_effect)]]\r\n* [[snap]]\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Editor's notes]\r\n[[Crunch]] is defined as a crushing noise, but some of its usages are underwhelming like walking through snow. All cases are currently treated as part of this tag, but some of the less relevant examples could be stored in [[compression_sound_effect]] instead if the need arises.\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:sound_effects]]\r\n\r\n* [[sound_effects]]"
