          "count": 254,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3684719 thumb #1681088 thumb #2653029 thumb #1888116\n\nCharacters who are in the process of [[transformation|transforming]] upside down. Typically, the character's arms become their legs and vice versa, and the same happens with their head and genitals.\n\nh5. Related tags\n* [[mid_transformation]]\n* [[crotch_head]]\n* [[penis_tongue]]\n* [[breast_balls]]\n* [[pushmi-pullyu]]"
