            "wiki_body": "thumb #1867484 thumb #2317192 thumb #2372719 thumb #767217 thumb #2216292\r\n\r\n[b]Female/female[/b] (also known as [b]gay[/b], [b]homo[/b], [b]female homosexuality[/b], [b]yuri[/b] and many other terms) describes homosexual, homoerotic, or homoromantic activities or behaviour between [[female]] characters.\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\n\r\nh5. Examples of Female/female Content\r\n* Female characters engaging in, or about to engage in sexual activities with each other\r\n* Female characters hugging in a romantic context (not familial or platonic)\r\n* Female characters kissing, licking each other, massaging one another, cuddling, handholding or dating\r\n* Fetish imagery featuring female characters interacting with each other - (e.g. a female hypnotizing another female, a female dominating another female)\r\n* A female character presenting, grabbing or groping the body of another female character\r\n\r\nThis tag also applies to [[solo focus]] images where a female character is sexually interacting with other female character who is mostly off screen, this also includes [[female pov]] images where the viewer is interacting with a female character.\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4.Related tags\r\n* [[female]]\r\n* [[bisexual]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also\r\n* [b]Sex Pairing Tags Involving Females[/b]\r\n** [b]female/female[/b]\r\n** [[male/female]]\r\n** [[female/ambiguous]]\r\n** [[andromorph/female]]\r\n** [[gynomorph/female]]\r\n** [[herm/female]]\r\n** [[maleherm/female]]\r\n\r\n* [[lesbian pride colors]]\r\n* [[stated homosexuality]]"
