r than strict definitions of chronological age. If a mature character is in an image with a younger character, the post should also be tagged with the appropriate older_* and younger_* tags above.\r\n\r\n* [[mature ambiguous]]\r\n* [[mature female]]\r\n* [[mature male]]\r\n* [[mature intersex]]\r\n** [[mature andromorph]]\r\n** [[mature gynomorph]]\r\n** [[mature herm]]\r\n** [[mature maleherm]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also: \r\n\r\n* [[age difference]]\r\n* [[young]]\r\n* [[old]]\r\n* [[aged down]]\r\n* [[aged up]]"
