            "wiki_body": "Posts depicting a female character wearing clothing over the upper half of their body, but not over the lower half. The complement to [[topless]].\r\n\r\nNote that this specifically refers to the lack of both [[bottomwear]] and (lower) [[underwear]]. The female character can be wearing [[footwear]] or [[legwear]], and still be considered 'bottomless', as long as the pelvic area is unclothed.\r\n\r\nIf the female character is wearing [[underwear]] over their pelvic area but is not otherwise wearing [[bottomwear]], use [[pantsless]] instead.  Conversely, if the female character is wearing a skirt, dress, or similar clothing, but does not have underwear on underneath, use [[no_underwear]].\r\n\r\nThis should be obvious, but there have been mistakes in the past, so to be clear: do not apply both the \"bottomless\" and \"topless\" tags to an image in which the character is [[nude]].\r\n\r\n[section=Missing Clothes Cheat Sheet]\r\n(Remember to exercise [[tag_what_you_see]]: if you can't tell whether a character is wearing underwear, ignore it.)\r\n[table][thead][tr][th][[topwear]][/th][th][[underwear]][/th][th][[bottomwear]][/th][th]Tag(s) to use[/th][/tr][/thead]\r\n[tbody][tr][td]No[/td][td]No[/td][td]No[/td][td][[nude]] or [[mostly_nude]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]No[/td][td]No[/td][td]Yes[/td][td][[topless]] + [[no_underwear]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]No[/td][td]Yes[/td][td]No[/td][td][[underwear_only]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]No[/td][td]Yes[/td][td]Yes[/td][td][[topless]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Yes[/td][td]No[/td][td]No[/td][td][[bottomless]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Yes[/td][td]No[/td][td]Yes[/td][td][[no_underwear]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Yes[/td][td]Yes[/td][td]No[/td][td][[pantsless]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Yes[/td][td]Yes[/td][td]Yes[/td][td][[fully_clothed]][/td][/tr][/tbody][/table]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[clothed]]\r\n* [[clothing]]\r\n* [[no_underwear]]\r\n* [[nude]]\r\n* [[partially_clothed]]\r\n* [[Tag Group:Clothes]]\r\n* [[tople