          "kor": "",
          "count": 1387700,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #968479 thumb #684002 thumb #964498\r\n\r\nPosts where the background is simplistic. Generally just a single color or shape, e.g. labeling characters surrounded by plain white as [[white_background]].\r\n\r\nIf there's enough scenery that you can discern the location, it should be tagged as [[detailed_background]] instead.\r\n\r\nh4. Categories:\r\n* [[abstract_background]] - Most examples qualify as simple\r\n** [[spiral_background]]\r\n* [[geometric_background]] - Triangles, squares, circles etc\r\n** [[heart_background]]\r\n* [[gradient_background]]\r\n* [[monotone_background]]\r\n* [[pattern_background]]\r\n** [[dotted_background]]\r\n** [[striped_background]]\r\n* [[textured_background]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[tag group:background]]"
