          "count": 1162,
          "wiki_body": "[[Text]] that appears on an object, or surface as if it was part of its design. If the text looks like it was written on, the tag format `writing_on_[x]`, or `text_on_[x]` tend to be used instead. The format `text_on_[x]` is the base format to use for many objects that feature text.\r\n\r\nLanguage tags do apply to objects containing text.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[text_on_clothing]]\r\n* [[text_on_container]]\r\n* [[text_on_pillow]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[heart_print]]\r\n* [[number_print]]"
