          "tag": "text_message",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1061,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3002409 thumb #997130\n\nA [b]text message[/b] is [[text]], or other data sent, or received through a [[smartphone]], or instant messenger application.\n\nh4. General guidelines\n\n* Messages do not count as [[dialogue]].\n* Text message containers should be tagged as [[message box]] instead of [[speech bubble]].\n* Try not to confuse text messages with messages posted on social media ([[user message]]), or those posted in a streaming chat, or other public messenger ([[chat box]], [[discord_(app)|Discord]]).\n* Text messages may be associated with a profile icon. These may be tagged as [[user avatar]].\n* Text messages may contain [[emoji]], or [[emoticon|emoticons]].\n* Text messages may have a [[timestamp]] ([[number]], [[time]]).\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[texting]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[message]]\n** [b]text_message[/b]\n** [[user_message]]\n* [[text]]\n** [[dialogue]]\n** [[inner_monologue]]\n* [[video_call]]"
