          "wiki_body": "[[Pupils]] which are some sort of [[symbol]] or shape, as opposed to regular pupils.\n\n[b]Tagging Note:[/b] This tag only applies to pupils. For posts in which the entire eye is a symbol or shape, use [[symbol-shaped eyes]].\n\nh4. Types of symbol-shaped pupils\n\n* [[cross_pupils]]\n* [[currency_sign_pupils]]\n* [[diamond_pupils]]\n* [[heart_pupils]]\n* [[spiral_pupils]]\n* [[star_pupils]]\n* [[x_pupils]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[pupils]]\n** [[unusual_pupils]]\n* [[unusual_eyes]]\n** [[symbol-shaped_eyes]]"
