          "wiki_body": "∅, a slashed O. A symbol representing the empty set, or nothing.\r\nThe reversed symbol, [[no symbol|🚫]], carries meanings of negation or forbiddance, as in \"No Smoking\" (🚭).\r\nExamples:\r\nThumb #3144998  Forwards (T-shirt with this is a signature for this character)\r\nThumb #4536778  Backwards (She is forbidding it)\r\n\r\n\r\nFor [[null_bulge|null bulges]] with padlock icons, use [[padlock_symbol]]. \r\nThumb #4393314  Similar meaning so often tagged on other symbols like this one, that means [[nullo]] or nullified (as in gender tag).  Not to be confused with [[null]]."
