          "count": 1637,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4274032 thumb #4650235 thumb #4647829 thumb #3951385 thumb #169250\r\n\r\nThe use of graphic design techniques associated with the cusp of the new millennium and the early 2000s. Y2K graphic design is largely non-minimalistic and based in [[futuristic|futurism]]. Colors are bold and bright and paired with high-contrast counterparts, everything seems to have a glossy finish, and text is arranged in unusual ways with blocky or bubble fonts.\r\n\r\n[[Frutiger Metro]] is a specific subcategory, and [[Frutiger Aero]] is a closely related aesthetic.\r\n\r\n[quote]h5. Common elements\r\n* Square \"[[science_fiction|sci-fi]]\" fonts and chunky text\r\n* Rounded bubble fonts\r\n* Bright colors\r\n* The use of texture and 3D\r\n* \"Cyber\" aesthetics\r\n* Patterns such as [[checkered]] patterns\r\n* Geometric shapes, such as [[star]]s, circles, and rounded rectangles\r\n* Gradients\r\n* [[Abstract background]]s\r\n* [[Zoom layer]]s\r\n* [[Bokeh]] and [[lens flare]]s\r\n* Metallic, [[sparkles|glittery]] and [[glistening|glossy]] effects\r\n* [[Skeuomorphism]]\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n* [[1990s]]\r\n* [[2000s_theme]]\r\n* [[frutiger_aero]]\r\n* [[frutiger_metro]]\r\n* [[memphis_design]]\r\n* [[y2k_(fashion)]]"
