          "wiki_body": "Images with this tag feature a character who is [[creating art]]. The image may be slightly post or pre-creation, but in general, the character is very clearly the creator.\r\n\r\nIn general, this should not be used for the personal \"fursona\" or the artist, unless they are clearly preparing to \"do\" art.\r\n\r\nImages with this tag will very likely feature at least one, and often several other tags from [[tag group:art]].\r\n\r\nNot to be confused with the [color=artist]artist[/color] tag type used for the person(s) who made the art proper.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[creating_art]]\r\n[[pen]]\r\n[[pencil_(object)]]\r\n[[paintbrush]]\r\n[[paper]]\r\n\r\n-----This page is part of [[Tag Group:Art]]-----"
