                  "tag": "hand_on_penis",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 25218,
                  "wiki_body": "[Back: [[tag_group:touching]]]\r\n\r\nthumb #2046255 thumb #2032331 thumb #2019710\r\n\r\nA hand touching a [[penis]] for any reason. \r\n\r\nThis tag is especially helpful for hand-penis interaction that falls outside of, or cannot cleanly be described as [[holding penis|holding]] or [[penis grab|grabbing]] of the penis\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[hand on own penis]]\r\n* [[hand on another's penis]]\r\n\r\nh4. May involve this tag\r\n\r\nIn most cases, these themes will involve this tag, but exceptions do exist.\r\n\r\n* [[holding penis]] - A character lifting, supporting, or gripping a penis.\r\n* [[penis grab]] - A character lifting, supporting, or gripping another character's penis.\r\n* [[touching penis]] - Any touching that doesn't resemble grabbing or holding the penis. This usually involves minor or gentle contact such as putting a finger on the penis, poking the penis, or [[rubbing]]/[[stroking]] of the penis\r\n\r\n* [b]Sexual Acts[/b]\r\n** [[handjob]] - A character stimulating another character's penis with one or both hands, usually holding the penis and moving their hand(s) up and down the shaft, rubbing the glans of the penis\r\n** [[penile masturbation]] - A character stimulating their own penis in any way, when tagged with `hand_on_penis` this indicates the character is giving a \"self handjob\"\r\n** [[guided penetration]] - A character holding the penis and aiming it towards an orifice, typically the one guiding the penis is the owner of the orifice, holding onto their partner's penis\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[tag_group:touching]]\r\n* [[hand_on_crotch]]"
