                "wiki_body": "thumb #3550339 thumb #4288584 thumb #2374326 thumb #4224851\n\nA character holding a [[penis]] for any reason, whether it is their own penis, or another character's penis. \n\n\"Holding\" refers to gripping around the penis with a hand without applying too much force (not squeezing or tugging the penis), holding the penis in both hands, or supporting it in one's hands (allowing the penis to rest on the palms). Other appendages can also \"hold\" a penis, such as feet, or a prehensile tail.\n\n\n[quote]\nh5. [i]Not to be confused with...[/i]\n\n* [[penis grab]]: A penis grab is a more forceful clutching, tugging or squeezing of the penis, usually with a single hand.\n* [[touching penis]]: touching penis is used for any contact with the penis that doesn't involve holding or grabbing.\n* [[holding_with_penis]]: When a [[prehensile penis]] is doing the holding.\n\n[/quote]\nh5. Subtags\n\n* [[holding own penis]]\n* [[holding another's penis]]\n\nh5. Acts That Involve Holding A Penis\n* [[guided penetration]]\n* [[handjob]]\n* [[masturbation]]\n** [[penile masturbation]]\n* [[presenting penis]]\n* [[peeing|urination]]\n\nh4. Related Tags\n\n* [[hand on penis]]\n** [[hand on own penis]]\n** [[hand on another's penis]]\n* [[foot on penis]]\n** [[foot on own penis]]\n** [[foot on another's penis]]\n\nh4. See Also\n* [[touching penis]]\n* [[penis grab]]\n* [[holding balls]]\n\n\n\n"
