                "tag": "humanoid_penis",
                "kor": "",
                "count": 513667,
                "wiki_body": "thumb #1365786 thumb #1354825 thumb #3156120\n\nA [[penis]] that has the appearance of a standard [[human]] phallus. \n\nHumanoid penises are cylindrically shaped and have a bulbous structure at the end of them called a [[glans|\"glans\"]]; they are sometimes referred to as having a \"mushroom\" shape. Humanoid penises on anthropomorphic characters may have unusual colorings like red, blue, or purple, or have a color that matches the character's body. Occasionally some of them may strangely have scale or even fur patterns.\n\nHuman penises naturally have a [[foreskin]] that covers the glans when flaccid, though many penises have had this completely or partially removed ([[circumcised]]). [[hybrid|Hybrid]] humanoid penises are often drawn in a way were a foreskin doesn't make sense ([[uncut_with_sheath|though one may still be present anyways]]) or with insufficient detail to tell how much if any has been removed, and should be tagged with neither tag.\n\n\nh6. Ideally, this tag should be used for:\n* [[Human]], [[anthro]], and [[feral]] characters with humanoid penises.\n* Posts with a [[disembodied penis]] (or multiple disembodied penises) that are humanoid in form, but not necessarily belonging to a human or humanoid.\n* [[hybrid penis|Hybrid penises]] that are based on a humanoid penis, including those emerging from a [[sheath]] or [[genital_slit|slit]].\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [b]Anatomy of a Humanoid Penis[/b]\n** [[glans]]\n** [[foreskin]] ([[retracted_foreskin]] / [[partially_retracted_foreskin]] / [[unretracted_foreskin]])\n** [[frenulum]] (elastic band connecting the foreskin to the underside of the glans)\n** [[urethra]] (the hole at the tip)\n* [[circumcised]] / [[circumcision_scar]]\n* [[knotted_humanoid_penis]] (when the penis has a canine [[knot]] at the base)\n* [[barbed_corona_glans]] (when the glans has spikes/barbs around the edge)\n\nh4. See also\n* [[animal penis]]\n* [[humanoid_genitalia]]\n* [[hybrid penis]]"
