                "wiki_body": "Part of the [[pussy]] or [[cloaca]], [[female]] homologue of the [[penis]]. All mammals and many non-mammals (such as crocodilians, turtles, and some birds) have a clitoris, while many squamata (lizards and snakes) have a [[hemipenes|hemipenis]] equivalent, a [[hemiclitores|hemiclitoris]].\r\n\r\nThe actual clitoris is mostly internal and surrounds the vagina, but the clitoral glans is visible when not covered by the [[clitoral hood]] or labia. The clitoris serves as a female's primary stimulation in an [[orgasm]]. \r\n\r\nh4. Clitoris Colors:\r\n\r\n[section=Clitoris Colors]\r\n* [[black_clitoris]]\r\n* [[blue_clitoris]]\r\n* [[brown_clitoris]]\r\n* [[cyan_clitoris]]\r\n* [[green_clitoris]]\r\n* [[grey_clitoris]]\r\n* [[orange_clitoris]]\r\n* [[pink_clitoris]]\r\n* [[purple_clitoris]]\r\n* [[red_clitoris]]\r\n* [[tan_clitoris]]\r\n* [[teal_clitoris]]\r\n* [[white_clitoris]]\r\n* [[yellow_clitoris]]\r\n\r\n* [[multicolored_clitoris]]\r\n** [[rainbow_clitoris]]\r\n** [[two_tone_clitoris]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[big_clitoris]] - Big, but still anatomically possible.\r\n** [[huge_clitoris]] - Anything bigger than a big_clitoris that isn't wildly out of proportion to the character's anatomy.\r\n*** [[hyper_clitoris]] - A clitoris that is extremely large or out of proportion compared to the character's body.\r\n* [[enlarged_clitoris]] - A clitoris that appears to have been enlarged via testosterone or [[clitoral_pumping]]\r\n* [[pseudo-penis]] - A specific type of clitoris in certain animals.\r\n* [[clit_dick]] - A clitoris that looks identical to a penis and has the ability to penetrate and/or ejaculate.\r\n* [[clitoral_hood]] - The hood that surrounds the clitoris\r\n* [[clitoral_fossa]] - An internal cavity that houses a clitoris \r\n* [[clitoris_piercing]]\r\n* [[erect_clitoris]]\r\n** [[clitoral_winking]] - Behavior specific to equines.\r\n* [[clitoral]] - Sexual stimulation of the clitoris\r\n"
