                "wiki_body": "thumb #3005005  thumb #2838412 thumb #3137987 thumb #2786799 thumb #2651799\n\n[b]Big Breasts[/b] applies to a wide range of [[breasts]] that are noticeably above \"average\" in size, and more or less completely within the realm of realism. Big breasts will often sag when unsupported by a [[bra]].\n\nh6. [b]For a full list of breast sizes, comparisons, and breast related tags, see [[Breasts]][/b]\n\nh5. Tagging Notes:\n* A good rule of thumb is that \"Big Breasts\" should typically be smaller than the character's head, with the [u]upper[/u] limit being nearly/roughly equal to the size of the character's head, but no larger\n** However, as styles and character proportions vary, using head size comparisons is not always reliable, comparing the size of the breasts to the proportions of the character overall, considering how much of the characters body is obscured by their breast etc. can help\n* Due to tag implications [[huge breasts]] and [[hyper breasts]] imply big breasts, meaning larger sizes of breast will appear in searches for {{big_breasts}}\n* Breast sizes can be fairly subjective, especially between [[medium breasts|medium]]-big and big-[[huge breasts|huge]], there will always be cases that are hard to place, just do your best to fit them into one category or the other\n\n\n[section=Examples with other sizes]\nh5.With [[medium breasts]]\nthumb #5316267 thumb #5360898 thumb #5427411 thumb #4927499 \n\nh5.With [[huge breasts]]\nthumb #5265275 thumb #5159430 thumb #5180299 thumb #5185343 \n\n[/section]\n\n\nh4. Related Tags:\n* [[Breasts]]\n** [[Medium Breasts]]: A step below \"Big Breasts\"\n** [[Huge Breasts]]: A step above \"Big Breasts\"\n* [[Nipples]]\n\nh4. See Also:\n* [[Big Butt]]"
