                  "tag": "huge_breasts",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 372024,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #4984119 thumb #5128111 thumb #2949351 thumb #1828343 thumb #2875933 \n\n[b]Huge breasts[/b] applies to [i]very[/i] large [[breasts]] — ranging from entirely realistic but [i]exceptionally[/i] sized, to being beyond strict realism but \"believable\" and [u]proportional[/u] to the character's body. \n\nA character's breasts should at least be roughly as large as the character's head to be considered \"[i]huge[/i] breasts\".\n\n[[Overweight]] and [[obese]] characters frequently have huge breasts. [[Voluptuous]] figured characters often also have huge breasts, and [[venus figure|venus figured]] characters have [i]at least[/i] huge-sized breasts.\n\nh6. [b][i]For a full list of breast sizes, comparisons, and breast related tags, see [[Breasts]][/i][/b]\n\n\n[quote]\n\nh5. Tagging Notes:\n\n* As [[Hyper Breasts]] automatically implies Huge Breasts, the description above only describes posts tagged as huge breasts, and not hyper breasts.\n* Huge breasts on a [[short stack]], [[chibi]] or [[toony]] character may not be bigger than their head, but can be judged as \"huge\" proportionally to the rest of their body.\n* Huge breasts may reach their owner's navel, or even waistline, particularly with huge [[sagging breasts]]\n* As breast sizing can be relative or subjective, there will always be cases that are hard to place, use your best judgment.\n\n[/quote]\n\n\n[section=Examples with other sizes]\nh5.With [[big breasts]]\nthumb #5265275 thumb #5159430 thumb #5180299 thumb #5185343 \n\nh5. With [[hyper breasts]]\nthumb #5320887 thumb #4407351 thumb #4266789 thumb #3979842 thumb #3592086\n\n[/section]\n\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[Breasts]]\n** [[Big Breasts]]: A step below \"Huge Breasts\"\n** [[Hyper Breasts]]: A step above \"Huge Breasts\", for entirely disproportionately sized breasts\n* [[Sagging Breasts]]\n* [[Natural Breasts]]\n* [[Nipples]]"
