                  "count": 58565,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #5044257 thumb #5036633 thumb #3418400 thumb #3782146  thumb #3149833\n  \n\n[b]Hyper Breasts[/b] are [[breasts]] that are [b][u][i]unrealistically, unbelievably, enormous[/i][/u][/b] — [i]far[/i] beyond mere exaggeration or artistic license that may be found among breasts under [[huge breasts]]. \n\n[quote]h6. Additional emphasis is used as this tag is frequently misused, and extremely over tagged. Unless the breasts fit the criteria below, they are likely better tagged as [[huge breasts]].[/quote]\n\n[b][i][color=yellow]Hyper breasts should be [u]disproportionately[/u] large in comparison to the character's body[/color][/i][/b] — the smallest hyper breasts (see examples above) should cover most or all of their owner's torso, drooping down to the upper thigh. There's no upper limit on hyper breasts, but the most common \"large end\" of the hyper breast size are large enough that they touch the ground, and may immobilize their owner.\n\n\n\nh5. Tagging Notes\n\n[b]What Should Be Tagged As Hyper Breasts[/b]\n* Hyper Breasts is one of the easiest breast sizes to tag, but is frequently over-tagged, here are some criteria for what should be tagged as hyper breasts, rather than [[huge breasts]]:\n** [b]Hyper breasts should be many times larger than their owner's head[/b]\n*** If the breasts are only slightly larger than, or equal to the size of the head, they should not be tagged as hyper breasts\n** [b]Hyper breasts should cover most or all of the character's upper body, possibly sagging to their crotch or thighs[/b]\n*** \"Smaller\" hyper breasts are frequently unrealistically perky and round, allowing the midriff to be visible\n*** Hyper breasts should at least extend down beyond the waist or crotch when naturally hanging.\n\n[u]Avoid tagging[/u] obese or overweight characters with hyper breasts, unless their breasts are disproportionately large compared to [i]their[/i] body.\n\n[section=Examples with other sizes]\nh5. With [[huge breasts]]\nthumb #5320887 thumb #4407351 thumb #4266789 thumb #3979842 thumb #3592086\n\n[/section]\n\n\nh4. Common Themes in Hyper Breasts\n* [[breast expansion]]\n* [[sloshing breasts]]\n* [[excessive lactation]]\n* [[immobile]]\n\nh4. See Also\n* [[breasts]]\n** [[huge breasts]] - very large, exaggerated, but \"believable\" sized breasts\n* [[hyper]]\n\n\n"
