              "wiki_body": "thumb #2488846 thumb #3103448 thumb #2415666 thumb #1441562 thumb #977747\n\n[b]Small Breasts[/b] describes a range of [[breasts]] that are noticeably below \"average\" size. Small breasts are most common on [[skinny]] and [[slim|petite]] body types, and can also be applied to [[young]]/[[teenager|teenaged]] characters with developing breasts. \n\nh6. [b]For a full list of breast sizes, comparisons, and breast related tags, see [[Breasts]][/b]\n\nh5. Tagging notes:\n* When exposed, small breasts are often implied with hatching, curved lines and shading on the chest, rather than drawn as clearly defined breasts. \n** In other cases, small breasts will be drawn as distinct, rounded masses, but widely spaced on the chest. \n** When clothed, the character's bustline is usually only suggested by by shading or the way the shirt clings/hangs off the character's chest, sometimes defined by a curved lines on the chest.\n* Should not be confused with [[flat chested]], these are characters who have still have obvious breasts, if small\n\n[section=Examples with other sizes]\nh5.With [[flat chested]]\nthumb #4271230 thumb #3179605 thumb #4609029 thumb #2071577 \n\nh5.With [[medium breasts]]\nthumb #4915534 thumb #4727063 thumb #5337913 thumb #4259904 \n\n[/section]\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[Breasts]]\n** [[Flat Chested]] A step below \"Small Breasts\"\n** [[Medium Breasts]] A step above \"Small Breasts\"\n* [[Nipples]]\n\nh4. See also:\n* [[Slim]]\n* [[Skinny]]\n* [[Young]]\n** [[Teenager]]\n** [[Cub]]\n** [[Loli]]"
