ut having \"nothing to see\") can be rated [b][color=green]Safe[/color][/b].\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n\n* [[partially_clothed]] - open pants, unbuttoned shirts, and other partially worn clothing.\n* [[mostly_nude]] - when a character is almost fully naked, except for non-covering clothing such as gloves, boots, or a hat.\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[tag_group:nudity]]\n* [[casual_nudity]]\n* [[featureless_breasts]]\n* [[featureless_crotch]]\n* [[forced_nudity]]\n* [[nude_beach]]\n* [[nude_edit]]\n* [[nudist]]\n* [[pinup]]\n* [[public_nudity]]\n* [[skinny_dipping]] - nude swimming in a swimming pool, beach, pond, lake, hot spring, etc.\n* [[sex]] - most times is performed nude\n* [[social_nudity]]\n* [[streaking]]\n* [[permanude]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[tag_group:clothes]]\n\n* [[clothed]]\n** [[bottomless]]\n** [[casual_exposure]]\n** [[clothed/nude]]\n** [[clothed_feral]]\n** [[ineffective_clothing]]\n*** [[ineffective_loincloth]]\n** [[skimpy]]\n** [[topless]]\n** [[undressing]]\n* [[shell-less]]\n\nh4. Tagging Projects\n* {{nude -nude_*}}: Tag forms and genders where possible."
