              "wiki_body": "thumb #4715347 thumb #1319046 thumb #1154707 thumb #2234087 thumb #3991669\r\n\r\n[b]Butt pose[/b] describes a specific pose where a character is seen [[rear view|from behind]], with their [[butt]] toward the viewer, and their upper body is twisted around to face the viewer. \r\n\r\nThis pose is more commonly known as the [i]\"boobs and butt pose\"[/i] or [i]\"tits and ass pose\"[/i] as it shows off the character's chest/breasts and butt at the same time; despite the name, male characters are drawn in this pose as well.\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\nh4. What is, and what isn't a Butt Pose\r\n\r\nButt pose is a frequently misunderstood tag and incorrectly applied to images that don't show a butt pose. \r\n\r\nh5. [color=lime]To be tagged as Butt Pose...[/color]\r\n\r\n* the character must be seen from the rear, either directly from behind, or from a rear [[three-quarters view]]\r\n* their butt must be partially, or entirely facing the viewer\r\n* the character must be turning their upper body towards the viewer\r\n\r\n* a character laying on their front, with their butt facing the viewer, lifting their upper body and twisting it back towards the viewer is also a butt pose\r\n\r\nh5. [color=red]What a Butt Pose [u][i]isn't...[/i][/u][/color]\r\n\r\n* a [[rear view]] with the character merely turning their head to look back over their shoulder [color=yellow][b]is not a butt pose[/b][/color]\r\n* a [[rear view]] where the [[back boob|breasts are visible from behind]] [color=yellow][b]is not a butt pose[/b][/color]\r\n* a character [[bent over]] or [[leaning forward]] in a way that presents or puts focus on their butt [color=yellow][b]is not a butt pose[/b][/color]\r\n* a character seen from a rear three-quarter view - in a way that shows off their breasts and butt [b]without[/b] the character having to turn their upper body [color=yellow][b]is not a butt pose[/b][/color]\r\n[/quote]\r\n[section= Not to be confused with...]\r\n\r\nh6. [[Butt Focus]]\r\n\r\nthumb #1639830 thumb #3373519 thumb #1638394\r\n\r\nButt focus is a shot that uses posing, angles, lighting and other elements to draw attention to a character's buttocks. There is sometimes crossover where an image features [[butt focus]] of a character in a [[butt pose]] (see examples above)\r\n\r\nh6. [[Butt Shot]]\r\n\r\nthumb #3251404\r\n\r\nA butt shot is a close-up cropped view of a character's butt. Butt shots are usually too close cropped to show a butt pose.\r\n\r\nh6. [[Rear View]]\r\n\r\nthumb #1477566\r\n\r\nA rear view is a character viewed from behind in general. Most butt pose images are rear view.\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[butt]]\r\n* [[breasts]]\r\n** [[side boob]]\r\n* [[looking back]]\r\n* [[rear view]] \r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n\r\n* [[tag group:pose]]\r\n* [[butt focus]]\r\n* [[butt shot]]\r\n\r\n* [b]Poses[/b]\r\n** [[action pose]]\r\n*** [[fighting stance]]\r\n** [[begging pose]]\r\n** [[paw pose]]\r\n*** [[cat pose]]\r\n** [[step pose]]\r\n** [[team pose]]"
