ing upright; when bent over, the thigh and butt cheeks will blend together; their anus and genitals will also be fully exposed without need for [[spread butt|spreading the cheeks]]. Especially thin characters' butts will follow the shape/forms of the pelvic and leg bones (see example below).\r\n\r\nthumb #2447405\r\n\r\n* Characters with [[wide hips]] can still have a small butt, however, these rare cases are often mistagged as [[big butt]].\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [b]Butt Sizes[/b]\r\n** butt - used for ambiguous sized butts, and non-descript \"average\" sized butts.\r\n** [[big butt]]\r\n** [[huge butt]]\r\n** [[hyper butt]]\r\n* [[bubble butt]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [b][[Butt]][/b] - for a master list of all butt related tags\r\n* [[Butt Size Difference]]\r\n** [[Comparing Butts]]\r\n** [[Butt Envy]]\r\n* [[Ass to Ass]]\r\n\r\n"
