              "wiki_body": "thumb #2994382 thumb #3107972  thumb #2366539 thumb #2955191 thumb #1620432 thumb #1964488\n   \n\n[b]\"Belly\"[/b] is used to refer to a visually prominent abdominal area on a character — a rounded, bloated, chubby, or otherwise enlarged/fat belly.  \n\nh5. Tagging Notes\n* This tag most commonly applies to characters who are slightly chubby or overweight, carrying excess belly fat, this tag also applies to [[pregnant]], [[bloated]], or [[inflation|inflated]] characters. \n\n* This tag applies regardless of whether the character is clothed or unclothed.\n\n* [b][i]Belly should not be confused with [[stomach]][/i][/b] — the stomach tag specifically refers to the internal [[organs|organ]]\n\n* Characters with flat or toned midsections should not have the belly tag applied — if their midsection is exposed while fully clothed, use [[midriff]]\n\n[quote]\nh3. Belly Size\nthumb #2873267 thumb #3171854\n\nThe above scales more or less depict the four \"levels\" of belly size on e621 (however, the terminology used in them should be ignored)\n\nh5. [[belly]] \n[i](first stage in image one)[/i]\n** when used for size, this tag describes any noticeably protruding belly that is generally smaller than a pregnant belly at last months of pregnancy\n** often seen with [[slightly chubby]], or mildly [[overweight characters]], as well as cases of very light [[stuffing]] and [[bloated|bloating]]\nh5. [[big belly]] \n[i](second stage of both images)[/i]\n\n** A character with an entirely realistically large prominent belly\n** Most often seen with characters who are bloated, pregnant, or overweight\n\nh5. [[huge belly]] \n[i](stage three in both images)[/i]\n** Most often seen in [[vore]], and often with characters who are [[obese]] or [[hyper pregnancy|hyper pregnant]]\n** A belly that ranges from extreme, but at the upper end of realism, to beyond strict realism, but \"physically believable\"\n** Generally, this belly size can be roughly equal to the size of the character with the belly, if they were to squeeze into a fetal position \n\nh5. [[hyper belly]] \n[i](stage four in both images)[/i]\n** Seen with [[morbidly obese|morbid obesity]], most hyper pregnancy, and [[multiple prey]] vore\n** Belly may touch the ground while the character is standing, may be several times larger than the character themselves, and may be large enough to entirely [[immobile|immobilize]] the character with the belly\n\n[/quote]\n\nh3. Belly Related Tags\n\n[section=Belly Appearance]\n\nh6. Physical Attributes of the Belly\n\n* [[belly hair]]\n* [[belly tuft]]\n* [[belly markings]]\n* [[freckles on belly]]\n* [[stretch marks]]\n* [[veiny belly]]\n\nh6. Belly Fat Tags\n\n* [[belly overhang]]: a chubby or overweight character's belly hanging over their waistline\n* [[belly rolls]]: rolls of belly fat\n* [[hanging belly]]: the belly hanging due to size and gravity while a character is bent over or on [[all fours]]\n* [[muffin top]]: when a character's belly spills out of their pants, resembling the top of a muffin\n* [[musclegut]]: a character with body fat around their midsection, but with muscular definition in their limbs, usually male characters\n* [[potbelly]]: a belly that falls under `big_belly` at most, a chubby, but small bit of excess belly fat, rounded and lacking in belly rolls\n\nh6. External/Temporary Appearance Changes\n\n* [[belly blush]]\n* [[belly tattoo]]\n* [[glistening belly]]\n* [[sweaty belly]]\n\nh6. Substances on the Belly\n* [[writing on belly]]\n** [[graded belly]]\n* [[painted belly]]\n** [[easter belly]]\n** [[pumpkin belly]]\n* [[kiss mark on belly]]\n\n* [[cum on belly]]\n** [[cum on own belly]]\n* [[saliva on belly]]\n* [[vaginal fluids on belly]]\n\nh6. Unusual Anatomy\n* [[belly eye]]\n* [[belly mouth]]\n* [[glowing belly]]\n* [[nozzle on belly]]\n* [[translucent belly]]\n[/section]\n\n[section=Miscellaneous Tags]\n\n* [[belly focus]]\n* [[belly size difference]]\n* [[describing belly]]\n* [[presenting belly]]\n\nh6. Belly \"Causes\"/Themes \n[i]Reasons why the character may have a prominent belly, including belly related fetish situations[/i]\n* [[slightly chubby]]\n* [[overweight]]\n** [[obese]]\n* [[bloated]] \n* [[stuffing]]\n* [[belly inflation]]\n* [[pregnant]]\n** [[hyper pregnancy]]\n* [[vore]]\n* [[weight gain]]\n\nh6. Changes in Belly Size\n* [[belly expansion]]\n* [[belly reduction]]\n\nh6. Belly Sounds\n* [[sloshing belly]]\n* [[rumbling stomach]]\n* [[digestion noises]]\n\nh6. Visibility In Clothing\n\n* [[belly peeking out]]\n* [[belly window]]\n** [[navel window]]\n* [[exposed belly]]\n* [[midriff]]\n* [[muffin top]]\n[/section]\n\n[section=Contact with Bellies]\n\nh6. General Tags\n* [[between bellies]]\n* [[pinned by belly]] \n\nh6. Belly Laying On/Making Contact With Body Parts\n\n* [[belly to belly]]\n* [[belly on back]]\n* [[belly on head]]\n* [[belly on penis]]\n\nh6.  Body Parts Touching Belly\n\n* [[face in belly]]\n* [[foot on belly]]\n* [[hand on belly]]\n** [[hand on another's belly]]\n** [[hand on own belly]]\n* [[head on belly]]\n* [[hoof on belly]]\n* [[paw on belly]]\n* [[penis on belly]]\n\nh6. Belly on Objects\n\n* [[belly on glass]]\n* [[belly on ground]]\n* [[belly on table]]\n\n[/section]\n\n[section=Belly Related Actions]\n\nh6. Acts a Character Does to A Belly\n* [[belly drop]]\n* [[belly grab]]\n* [[belly kiss]]\n* [[belly lick]]\n* [[belly pinch]]\n* [[belly poke]]\n* [[belly squeeze]] \n* [[belly hug]]\n* [[belly rub]]\n\n* [[fondling belly]] — can combine acts above\n* [[holding belly]]\n* [[lifting belly]]\n* [[looking at belly]]\n** [[looking at own belly]]\n* [[patting belly]]\n* [[resting on belly]] (not to be confused with belly rest or [[on front]])\n* [[standing on belly]]\n\nh6. Acts Without Physical Contact\n* [[describing belly]]\n* [[looking at belly]]\n* [[listening to belly]]\n* [[pointing at belly]]\n* [[presenting belly]]\n\nh6. Acts a Belly Does By Itself\n* [[belly jiggle]]\n* [[belly squish]]\n* [[belly rest]