                "count": 131701,
                "wiki_body": "thumb #2780029 thumb #2688084 thumb #2799833 thumb #1275996 thumb #3483644\r\n\r\nDescribes images where a character's [[belly]] is larger than normal. \r\n\r\nThe Big Belly tag is frequently applied to [[overweight]] or [[obese]] characters with prominently large bellies, or in images with a [[pregnant]] character. Also commonly tagged in art depicting [[stuffing]], [[inflation]], or [[vore]].\r\n\r\n[i]Big Belly[/i] can be applied alone to a range of different sizes, but stops short of [[huge_belly|huge belly]] and [[hyper_belly|hyper belly]]. Generally, if the belly dominates the character's form then use [[huge_belly|huge belly]], and if the size of a character's belly is larger than the character the image falls under hyper belly.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[belly]]\r\n** [[huge_belly]]\r\n** [[hyper_belly]]\r\n* [[overweight]]\r\n** [[obese]]\r\n* [[pregnant]]\r\n* [[inflation]]\r\n* [[stuffing]]\r\n* [[vore]]"
