            "huge_belly": {
              "_Self (huge_belly)": [
                {
                  "tag": "huge_belly",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 33056,
                  "wiki_body": "thumb #4402755 thumb #4405819 thumb #4581128\r\n\r\nDescribes images where a character's [[belly]] is huge, much larger than normal.\r\n\r\nThe Huge Belly tag is frequently applied to [[obese]] characters where the large bellies dominate the form of the character. Characters with huge bellies may have trouble leaning over or doing other movements, but can still walk unlike [[hyper_belly|hyper belly]]. Also commonly tagged in art depicting [[stuffing]], [[inflation]], or [[vore]].\r\n\r\n[i]Huge Belly[/i] can be applied alone to a range of different sizes, bigger than just [[big_belly|big belly]] and smaller than [[hyper_belly|hyper belly]]. Generally, if the size of a character's belly is larger than the character, the image falls under hyper belly.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[belly]]\r\n** [[big_belly]]\r\n** [[hyper_belly]]\r\n* [[overweight]]\r\n** [[obese]]\r\n* [[pregnant]]\r\n* [[inflation]]\r\n* [[stuffing]]\r\n* [[vore]]"
                }
              ],
              "hyper_belly": [
                {
                  "tag": "hyper_belly",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 19293,
                  "wiki_body": "When a character's [[belly]] is not simply unrealistically and extremely large — but large to the point of being [i]disproportionately sized[/i] to the rest of the character's body. \n\n\nh6. Some common traits of hyper bellies include:\n\n* larger than the character or makes up most of the character's mass \n* touches the ground when the character is standing\n* covers most of the character's body (including legs) when viewed from a front view\n* balloons out from the character's midriff, and may appear to be weightless\n* immobilizes the character or disrupts the character's ability to move easily\n\nNote that not all of the above has to be present in a post to be tagged as `hyper_belly`\n\n[section,expanded=Hyper Belly Variations]\n\nThe shape and attributes of a hyper belly can vary greatly depending on the cause of the belly's massive size.\n\nh5. [[Belly Inflation]]\n\nthumb #3817502 thumb #3513059 thumb #4408626 thumb #3149491\n\n* Commonly [[air inflation]], [[cum inflation]], [[liquid inflation]]\n* May feature a [[balloon belly]] (an unrealistically spherical belly, usually appears to lack weight)\n\nh5. [[Obese|Obesity]]\n\nthumb #4368002 thumb #2565723 thumb #3544704 thumb #3379747\n\n* Usually involving extreme [[morbidly obese|morbid obesity]]\n* Frequently crosses over with [[stuffing]]\n* May involve [[weight gain]]\n\nh5. [[Hyper Pregnancy]]\n\nthumb #3097239 thumb #3348931  thumb #2278752 thumb #3686006 \n\n* Note that not all characters that are tagged \"hyper pregnant\" have hyper bellies\n* Often involves [[unborn kicking]]\n\nh5. [[Stuffing]] and [[Vore]]\n\nthumb #2808387 thumb #2445181 thumb #3388624 thumb #2645599\n\n* Vore, and Stuffing (that doesn't involve obesity) with hyper bellies can look similar\n* Vore with hyper belly usually involves [[same size vore]] with [[multiple prey]], or size difference involving [[larger prey]]\n** Vore hyper bellies frequently show [[imprints]] of the prey\n* Both often involves a character [[resting on belly]]\n\n[/section]\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[belly expansion]] — any scenario where a character's belly is shown growing in size\n* [[hyper]]\n** [[hyper balls]]\n** [[hyper breasts]]\n** [[hyper butt]]\n* [[resting on belly]]\n\nh4. See Also\n\n* [[big belly]]\n* [[huge belly]]\n"
                }
              ]
            }
