.\n\nSome traits (eg [[multi_nipple]]) are arguably more inherently fetishistic than others. This factors into the evaluation.\n\nh4. Re: [[areola]], [[breasts]] and [[pecs]]\n\nIt can be hard to separate [[areola]] and [[nipples]], but that's fine, because most of the time you don't need to. [[Big nipples]] and [[big areola]] tend to go hand-in-hand, as do [[puffy nipples]] and [[puffy areola]], etc. A focus on one usually implies a focus on the other. \n\nThe main exception is if there is no [[nipple play]] being depicted and the [[areola]] are drawn flat and featureless; in that case the nipple_fetish tag should normally not be used even if it seems like the [[areola]] are particularly large or in focus (because there would be no nipples being depicted).\n\nWith [[breasts]] and [[pecs]], it tends to go the other way, as discussed previously. [[Big breasts]] and [[big pecs]] can sometimes take the focus away from the nipples themselves. \n\nh4. Re: [[teats]], [[udders]], [[dicknipples]], and other alternative nipples\n\nFor tagging purposes, [[teats]], [[udders]], and [[dicknipples]] are generally [i]not[/i] tagged as [[breasts]] or [[nipples]], and hence usually should not be tagged with nipple_fetish.\n\nh4. See also:\n\nh5. Body Parts:\n\n* [[areola]] - The circle of pigmented skin around the nipple.\n* [[breasts]] - Soft round fatty growths associated with feminine bodies.\n* [[nipples]] - The sensitive protrusion in the middle of the areola. \n* [[pecs]] - The upper chest muscles on top of which the breasts, areola, and nipples are located.\n\nh5. Traits: \n* [[big_nipples]] - Nipples smaller than a fist.\n** [[huge_nipples]] - Nipples the same size as or larger than a fist.\n*** [[hyper_nipples]] - Extremely unreasonably large nipples.\n* [[inverted_nipples]] - Nipples that are retracted under the surface of the areola.\n* [[multi_nipple]] - More than 2 nipples on one body.\n* [[nipple_piercing]] - Pierced nipples.\n* [[puffy_nipples]] - Particularly soft, p