dly obese\r\n\r\n\"Jabba the Hut fat\", \"Hyper fat\". Has trouble walking, or can't walk.  Rolls in places you didn't even know existed.\r\n\r\nthumb #63431 thumb #499264 thumb #498794\r\n\r\n__________________________________________________ [/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [b]Gender[/b]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_male]]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_female]]\r\n** [b]morbidly_obese_ambiguous[/b]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_intersex]]\r\n*** [[morbidly_obese_andromorph]]\r\n*** [[morbidly_obese_gynomorph]]\r\n*** [[morbidly_obese_herm]]\r\n*** [[morbidly_obese_maleherm]]\r\n* [b]Form[/b]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_human]]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_anthro]]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_feral]]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_humanoid]]\r\n** [[morbidly_obese_taur]]"
