            "wiki_body": "[Table][color=#E45F5F]Explicit Tag|\r\n|[/color][/ltable]\r\n\r\nThis is an umbrella tag for tags implicating this tag, such as [[unusual_penis]] and [[unusual_pussy]]. Please, use one of these more specific tags, when tagging, if possible, and let the implication mechanism add this tag. The main use for this tag is, when searching for tagged images. It is typically very clear, when tagging, if the unusual genitalia is a penis or a pussy, but one might be interested in searching for all types of unusual genitalia. Of course, in case of extremely unusual genitalia, it is possible that one cannot identify the genitalia more specifically.\r\n\r\nAn unusual genitalia means [i]very[/i] unusual looking.\r\n\r\nNote that due to a large variety in the sizes and shapes that genitals are depicted as in furry art, it is recommended before tagging to think about just how unusual the genitalia in question is.\r\n\r\nUsually, this tag only refers to shape, not size (for unusually large genitals, use the tag [[hyper_genitalia]] - or preferably a more specific hyper_* tag). Thus, to be unusual enough, it typically has to hardly looks like something identifiable as genitalia at all."
