            "wiki_body": "thumb #2540659 thumb #3397535  thumb #3200487 thumb #2972329 thumb #2901134\r\n\r\nA character or object being forcefully compressed under another character's [[butt]], or being crushed between a surface and butt. Less commonly, butt crush describes something or someone being crushed [[between cheeks|between a character's buttocks]] or [[between butts|between the butts]] of two or more characters.\r\n\r\nButt crush often involves [[size difference]], with the larger character sitting on and pinning a smaller one, these [[extreme size difference|size differences may be more dramatic]], with [[macro]] or [[micro]] sized characters.\r\n\r\nIn most cases, particularly with smaller differences in size, the butt crushed character is merely pinned by the crushing character's butt, which may be uncomfortable or painful, at most sustaining injuries that are \"played for laughs\". Butt crush involving extreme size differences is often depicted either as merely painful, with little to no visible injuries, or it may cause serious injury or death.\r\n\r\nh4. Butt Crushing, Slamming, Smothering, and Facesitting\r\n\r\n[section=These acts are related, but distinct, they may be easily confused...]\r\n\r\nh6. [[Butt Slam]]\r\n\r\nthumb #1307642\r\n\r\nA butt slam is an intentional physical strike using the buttocks to hit another - this may be done by the attacker thrusting backwards, hip checking, or dropping butt first onto their target. A butt slam often leads into the target character being crushed under their attacker's butt or between the butt and a wall. Cracks or even a crater may be shown to imply an exaggerated amount of force from the butt striking the ground or walls.\r\n\r\nh6. [[Butt Smother]]\r\n\r\nthumb #2888712\r\n\r\nButt smothering involves a character having their face covered by another's butt. Most of, or their entire head, might be buried [[head between cheeks|between the butt cheeks]] of the character smothering them. A character can be smothered [i]and[/i] crushed under a butt at the same time. If a character is being sat on, but their head is not being pushed into the buttocks or between the buttocks, use butt crush instead of butt smother.\r\n\r\nh6. [[Facesitting]]\r\n\r\nthumb #3408110\r\n\r\nFacesitting, unlike smothering, slamming, or crushing, doesn't involve any implied harm or discomfort from the character being sat on, and the character is able to breathe. A character being facesat usually performs [[rimming]], [[cunnilingus]], [[ball lick|ball licking]] or [[fellatio]] on the character sitting on them.\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh5. Actions\r\n[i]Tags that can describe how the characters are positioned and interacting[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[against_surface]]\r\n* [[between_butts]]\r\n* [[between_cheeks]]\r\n** [[head_between_cheeks]]\r\n** [[object_between_cheeks]]\r\n* [[face_in_ass]]\r\n* [[on_top_of]]\r\n* [[pinned]]\r\n* [[sitting]]\r\n* [[size_difference]]\r\n** [[size_play]]\r\n*** [[big_dom_small_sub]]\r\n*** [[larger_on_top]]\r\n\r\nh5. Effects on Characters\r\n\r\n* [[blood]]\r\n* [[death]]\r\n** [[crushed_head]]\r\n* [[flattened]]\r\n* [[gore]]\r\n* [[stuck_to_butt]]\r\n* [[wounded]]\r\n** [[broken_bone]]\r\n** [[bruised]]\r\n** [[crushed_pelvis]]\r\n\r\nh5. Effects on Objects\r\n\r\n* [[building_damage]]\r\n* [[crater]]\r\n* [[cracks]]\r\n* [[crushed_can]]\r\n* [[crushed_vehicle]]\r\n* [[damaged_wall]]\r\n** [[cracked_wall]]\r\n* [[destruction]]\r\n** [[building_destruction]]\r\n** [[city_destruction]]\r\n** [[planet_destruction]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[crush]]\r\n* [[size_difference]]\r\n* [[extreme size difference]]\r\n** [[macro]]\r\n** [[micro]]\r\n"
