              "wiki_body": "A single character being [[penetration|penetrated]] by exactly two penises, tails, objects in any single orifice, or cumulatively involving a combination of orifices.\r\n\r\nh4. Tagging guidelines\r\n\r\n* Anything that counts as [[penetration]] is included. Although characters with multiple penises should use [[multi_penetration]] instead.\r\n* If a character is simultaneously penetrated orally + anally [i]or[/i] vaginally, it's also a [[spitroast]]. \r\n* If a character is in the middle of two penetrating partners which face them, simultaneously penetrating them (both vaginally, both anally [i]or[/i] one in each) then it's also  a [[sandwich position]].\r\n* If one character with two penises is penetrating two other characters simultaneously use [[bilateral penetration]] instead.\r\n\r\nDue to how the implications are established this tag may include images where a character is penetrated by more than two things. A character can be penetrated twice in one orifice, and penetrated a third time in another orifice. In such a case, both `double_penetration`, and `triple_penetration` may be used.\r\n\r\nh4. Tags About Penetration\r\n\r\n* [[penetration]]\r\n\r\n[section=Tags About Penetration]\r\n\r\nh4. Form\r\n[section=Form]\r\n\r\n[section=<Form>_penetrated]\r\n\r\n* [[anthro_penetrated]]\r\n* [[feral_penetrated]]\r\n* [[human_penetrated]]\r\n* [[humanoid_penetrated]]\r\n* [[taur_penetrated]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=<Form>_penetrating]\r\n\r\n* [[anthro_penetrating]]\r\n* [[feral_penetrating]]\r\n* [[human_penetrating]]\r\n* [[humanoid_penetrating]]\r\n* [[taur_penetrating]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=<Form>_penetrating_<Form>]\r\n\r\n* [[anthro_penetrating_anthro]]\r\n* [[anthro_penetrating_feral]]\r\n* [[anthro_penetrating_human]]\r\n* [[anthro_penetrating_humanoid]]\r\n* [[anthro_penetrating_taur]]\r\n* [[feral_penetrating_anthro]]\r\n* [[feral_penetrating_feral]]\r\n* [[feral_penetrating_human]]\r\n* [[feral_penetratin