rds him\r\n** in a less common FFM bisexual sandwich, this may involve the middle female character being penetrated by the male, while the other female character fingers her, fondles her or kisses her, alternatively, the outer female may penetrate the middle female using a [[strapon]] \r\n* [b] [[bisexual train]][/b]: similar to a bisexual sandwich, with all three participants facing the same direction, rather than both facing inwards towards the middle participant\r\n* a bisexual [b][[oral sandwich]][/b] involves a middle character of either sex, receiving [[fellatio]] or [[cunnilingus]] as well as [[rimming|analingus]] from two characters of both sexes\r\n* [[169 position]] - Usually an FFM threesome, with two female characters perform cunnilingus on each other in a [[69 position]], while one of them is being penetrated by a male character\r\n* [[double penetration]] - an MMF threesome might involve two males penetrating one female, while embracing, kissing or otherwise interacting with one another\r\n* [[collaborative cunnilingus]]/[[collaborative fellatio]] - two characters of both sexes performing fellatio or cunnilingus together on one character\r\n* [[collaborative hotdogging]] - two characters of both sexes using their buttocks to rub against the penis of a male character\r\n* [[parallel sex]] - two characters engaging in simultaneous, separate sexual acts, e.g. two characters both being penetrated at the same time, in a bisexual context, this may involve two characters being penetrated while kissing their \"parallel counterpart\" of the same or opposite sex (e.g. if one participant is a male being penetrated by a male, while kissing a female, or penetrated via strapon by a female, and kissing a male)\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[female/female]]\r\n* [[male/male]]\r\n* [[male/female]]\r\n* [[trio]] \r\n* [[threesome]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[bisexual pride colors]]\r\n* [[stated bisexuality]]"
