          "count": 43029,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #328637\n\nA [[vulva]] similar to that of a [[human]].\n\n[section,expanded=Tagging guidelines]\n\nA good way to look about vulva identification is that a form will either be an [i][[animal vulva]][/i], a [i]humanoid vulva[/i], or [i][[unusual vulva]][/i]. The latter category might overlap with the other categories.\n\nh5. Animal anatomy\n\n* The anatomy should not match the criteria for a [[cloaca]], or [[genital slit]].\n** Be suspicious of orifices that look like flat slits on non-mammal species.\n* If the anatomy is consistent with another species, use the [[animal vulva]] tag for that species instead. Certain species have vulva with humanoid traits.\n* A vulva that appears like a coin-slot is more likely (but not always) to be an animal vulva, than a humanoid one. \n\nh5. Defining traits\n\n* Obviously if the body is that of a [[human]], or [[humanoid]], the genitalia (not always) is likely to be humanoid as well. \n* Look for a visible humanoid labia majora (outer labia), or labia minora (inner labia). The labia minora doesn't need to be visible. See [[innie_vulva]]\n** Without reason to conclude otherwise, the base assertion is that humanoid labia belongs to a humanoid vulva, especially if it has a plump appearance.\n*** Cloaca and genital slits sometimes appear plump, but should not be tagged as [[plump_labia]].\n* Do not expect the anatomy to look completely accurate. Artistic liberty can change the form in a way that differs from what the anatomy [i]should[/i] look like, and that is fine.\n\nh5. Vulva anatomy\n\n* [[clitoral_hood]]\n* [[clitoris]]\n* labia majora/minora\n* [[urethra]] (inside)\n\nh6. General appearance\n\n* [[innie vulva]] - This concept is usually humanoid, with very rare exceptions.\n* [[long labia]]\n* [[plump labia]]\n\nThe appearance of a [[pubic mound]] is also highly associative with a character that has a humanoid vulva.\n\n[/section]\n\nh4. Posing examples\n\nthumb #1286986 thumb #2360418 thumb #1573670 thumb #2451375 \n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[human]]\n* [[humanoid]]\n* [[humanoid penis]]\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n\n* [[bovine pussy]]\n* [[equine vulva]]\n* [[feline vulva]]\n* [[genital slit]]"
