          "wiki_body": "[[Transformation]] caused by [[vore]] — whether the prey character is transformed as a result of being consumed, or the pred character is transformed as a result of consuming another. In most cases of transformation through vore, the post should be tagged as [[after vore]], as the transformation is the end result of the vore scenario.\r\n\r\n\r\nh6. Common Types of Transformations In Vore\r\n* [[size transformation]] — a character consumes another and grows in size as a result\r\n* [[species transformation]] — a character's species changes, often the prey adopting the pred's species, or the pred adopting the prey's species\r\n* [[gender transformation]] — a character's sex changes from consuming another character, or being consumed by another character\r\n* [[feces transformation]] — a character is turned into a [i]living[/i] [[poop creature]], rather than being digested and turned into feces\r\n\r\n\r\nh6. Prey Transformations\r\n* Especially common in [[unbirthing]], with prey experiencing a [[species transformation]] (or sometimes [[gender transformation]]) in the womb, and is reborn as the same species as the character that unbirthed them\r\n* [[absorption vore]] also often shows the prey engulfed and transformed or merging with the pred\r\n* Transformed prey may be regurgitated, [[rebirth|rebirthed]], ejaculated, or excreted, depending on the orifice of entry, or the process of their transformation\r\n* Transformation may be indirect, such as a [[cock vore]] scenario, where a character is melted into [[cum]], ejaculated into another character's womb, who is impregnated, and then reborn, or a character [[oral vore|orally ingested]], [[digestion|digested]], and then being turned into a sperm cell or ovum inside of the pred's body.\r\n\r\nh6. Pred Transformations\r\n* Preds may take on traits of the prey they have consumed and digested/absorbed, such as specific traits, their gender, or species, sometimes becoming a [[hybrid]] species or [[intersex]] character, if the transformation is only partial\r\n* [[size transformation]] — specifically [[body size growth]] frequently occurs in transformation through vore:\r\n** This may be a small amount of growth, as the result of the pred consuming 1 or a small number of prey, often in tandem with [[weight gain]] and/or [[expansion]] of specific body parts\r\n** A recurring trope in [[macro]] scenarios are characters growing by [[mass vore|eating masses of smaller individuals]], and growing taller by digesting them\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[after vore]]\r\n* [[egg transformation]]\r\n* [[expansion]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[transformation]]\r\n** [[transformation sequence]]\r\n* [[vore]]\r\n"
