          "kor": "",
          "count": 4566,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2411473 thumb #2517601 thumb #3884612\n\nA statement, remark, or [[pictographics|pictograph]] that indicates a character's desire to impregnate, be impregnated by, or produce eggs / children with another character, or the viewer.\n\nSome concepts do not exactly fit the idea of a request, but this tag encompasses most communicated desires for pregnancy.\n\nIt should be noted that not really knowing whether or not [[impregnation]] is literally possible (such as when this is communicated by one cisgender [[Male|man]] to another one) or even logically understandable at all in the first place (such as when [[animate_inanimate|animated household objects]], [[ghost|ghosts]], [[zombie|zombies]], or the like to ask for this from regular [[anthro]] characters) is irrelevant here, with all that matters being somebody making the request.\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n\n* [[insemination_request]] - Impregnation requests should directly mention the idea of impregnation, or the results of impregnation; the intent must be present in the statement. The `insemination request` tag serves as a general purpose tag for filling a character with seminal fluid (semen, [[cum]]). Usually a statement will focus on impregnation, or filling, rarely both, and the focus should determine which tag should be used. \n\nh4. Dialogue examples\n\n* \"Give mommy another litter!\"\n* \"I'll make you a brother/sister to play with!\"\n* \"Please let me bear your pups!\"\n\n[[Avian|Avians]] and [[Scalie|Scalies]] alongside certain [[Pokémon (species)|Pokémon]] and [[hybrid]] entities of a complex background sometimes omit dialogue and just display an [[egg]] inside a [[speech bubble]] or similar things.\n\nh4. Categories\n\n* [[breeding_request]] - To ask someone to breed is the same as asking to have sex with the intent to produce children.\n\nh4. Related Tags\n\n* [[inviting]] / [[inviting_to_sex]]\n* [[impregnation_risk]]"
