            "wiki_body": "thumb #693240 thumb #2095246 thumb #2274286\r\n\r\n[b]Freckles[/b] are clusters of concentrated melanin that appear as dark speckling or spots on the surface of the skin. \r\n\r\nFreckles on [[anthro]], [[semi-anthro]] or [[feral]] characters are done with artistic license, and would actually be dark patches of fur, scales, or feathers that merely [i]resemble[/i] freckles. \r\n\r\nFreckles can appear anywhere on the body, and are very commonly depicted on character's shoulders, breasts, and buttocks; however, the most common location for freckles is the face, where they usually cluster across the nose, upper cheeks, and/or under the eyes.\r\n\r\nh4. Freckles By Location\r\n\r\nWhile not necessary, if a character has freckles only in a specific location, or has prominent freckles in a notable area, specific freckles on body part tags should be used.\r\n\r\nh6. Head\r\n* [[freckled face]]\r\n* [[freckled ears]]\r\n\r\nh6. Body\r\n* [[freckled back]]\r\n* [[freckled belly]]\r\n* [[freckled breasts]]\r\n* [[freckled butt]]\r\n* [[freckled chest]]\r\n* [[freckled hips]]\r\n\r\nh6. Appendages\r\n* [[freckled arms]]\r\n* [[freckled leg]]\r\n* [[freckled thighs]]\r\n\r\nh6. Genitalia\r\n* [[freckled balls]]\r\n* [[freckled penis]]\r\n* [[freckled pussy]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
