            "wiki_body": "A character who has lost all of their sex organs, leaving behind only their [[urethra]] and/or a [[scar]] where their [[genital|genitals]] would be.\r\n\r\nThis implies that it was either [[surgical operation|surgically removed]] or was destroyed due to [[genital_mutilation|physical trauma]].\r\n\r\nh4.Tagging Notes\r\n* In cases such as characters with [[multi genitalia|multiple genitalia]] (such as [[herm]]s and [[maleherm]]s), they should no longer have any remaining to be considered a nullo.\r\n* Be mindful of characters with [[unusual genitalia placement]] as they still have genitals even if they have a [[featureless crotch]].\r\n* A nullo can't be tagged with [[ambiguous gender]] or vice-versa due to the [[Tag What You See]] policy.\r\n\r\nh4.Not to be confused \r\n* [[null]] - These characters have a natural-looking [[featureless crotch]]. Not even a urethral hole nor scars to speak of.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [b]Nullo[/b] - A character that had their sex organs removed.\r\n** [[Nullo transformation]] - The process of becoming a nullo through [[transformation]].\r\n** [[Nullification]] - Removal of all sex organs.\r\n*** [[Emasculation]] - Removal of the entire male sex organ.\r\n**** [[Castration]] - Removal  of the testicles. (\"neutering\")\r\n***** [[Eunuch]] - A character that has had their testicles removed (\"neutered\").\r\n**** [[Penectomy]] - Removal of the penis.\r\n***** [[Penectomized]] - A character that has had their penis removed.\r\n*** [[Vaginectomy]] - Removal of the entire female sex organ.\r\n**** [[Oophorectomy]] - Removal of the ovaries.\r\n***** [[Spayed]] - A character that has had their ovaries removed.\r\n**** [[Hysterectomy]] - Removal of the [[uterus]], leaving only the cervix and vaginal canal intact. \r\n* [[Featureless crotch]] - A character with no genitals on their crotch area. Either the artist didn't rendered/drew them, the character's a null or their [[unusual genitalia placement|genitals are loc