            "wiki_body": "thumb #2180369 thumb #3025272 thumb #2582000 thumb #2730190\r\n\r\nA [[penis]] with [[writing on penis|written labels]], along with lines or rings on it to represent different grades. These grades rank a character's skill in performing [[fellatio]] (how deep they can throat the penis), or how deeply they can take [[penetration]] of the penis vaginally or anally (or rarely, ranks the skill of the penis' owner in penetrating). \r\n\r\nTypically, a graded penis features low grades close to the tip and higher grades close to the base, A-F grades are frequently seen. Alternatively, or in addition to letter (or number) grades, text describing the skill of another character's ability to perform acts with the penis are writing on it. While the grades are usually just for fun, they may be depicted as part of an actual graded evaluation in a sexual [[school]] scenario or as part of school related roleplaying. \r\n\r\n[i]For similar grading written or printed onto a [[condom]], use [b][[graded_condom]][/b].[/i]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[Body Writing]]\r\n** [[Writing on Penis]]\r\n* [[Graded Condom]]\r\n* [[Lipstick Ring]] - may be seen alongside a graded penis\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Grade]]\r\n** [[Graded Belly]]\r\n** [[Graded Dildo]]\r\n** [b]Graded Penis[/b]\r\n** [[Graded Throat]]\r\n** [[Graded Tail]]\r\n* [[Marker]]\r\n* [[Penis]]\r\n"
