              "wiki_body": "A [[vore]] scenario where both the predator and prey characters are of equal, or similar, size. \r\n\r\nThis results in the predator's body stretching as they consume the prey, and their [[belly]] distending to accommodate the prey's body (this applies to [[oral vore|oral]], [[anal vore|anal]], and [[unbirthing|vaginal]] vore). \r\n\r\nh5. Tagging Notes:\r\n* If there is [b]significant [/b]difference in height between the two characters, even if both are within real-life human height range, use [[size difference]] instead.\r\n* If the prey's mass \"disappears\" as they're swallowed or inserted into the pred, rather than causing the pred's body to stretch and bloat, use [[hammerspace vore]]\r\n* In same size [[cock vore]], one or both of the predator's balls swell instead, which should always be tagged as [[hyper balls]]\r\n\r\nh3. Related Tags\r\n\r\nh5. Belly Sizes\r\n[i]Depending on the artist, or number of prey consumed, the character's belly may swell to varying sizes[/i]\r\n* [[big belly]] — when the belly is on the \"smaller side\" of same size vore\r\n* [[huge belly]] — this size applies to the majority of same size vore\r\n* [[hyper belly]] — when there are multiple prey, or the belly is drawn larger than a single character\r\n* [[bloated]] — this tag technically applies to all sizes above, but is often tagged on scenes where digestion has caused the predator's belly to shrink to a smaller size\r\n\r\nh5. Imprints and Bulges\r\n* [[abdominal bulge]] — best used for indistinct bulges in the belly, or a smaller bulge caused by a prey being only partially inside of the stomach/uterus/rectum etc.\r\n* [[neck bulge]] — when swallowing in [[oral vore]]\r\n* [[struggling prey]] — when the bulges or imprints appear to be stretching or moving, rather than static impressions on the predator's body, often a sign of [[unwilling prey]]\r\n\r\n* [[body outline]]\r\n* [[imprint]]\r\n** [[breast imprints]]\r\n** [[butt imprint]]\r\n** [[face imprint]]\r\n** [[foot imprint]]\r\n** [[hand imprint]]\r\n** [[penis imprint]]\r\n** [[pussy imprint]] \r\nh6. [[After Vore]] Imprints\r\n** [[bone imprints]]\r\n*** [[skull imprint]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[size difference]]\r\n** [[larger pred]]\r\n** [[larger prey]]\r\n** [[smaller pred]]\r\n** [[smaller prey]]\r\n* [[vore]]\r\n"
