              "wiki_body": "[b]Unusual Vore[/b] describes any kind of [[vore]] content that is [i]especially[/i] \"out of the ordinary\".\r\n\r\nThis applies to vore featuring a consuming orifice or body part other than a typically located mouth, anus, penis, or vagina, and this tag is especially useful for posts depicting \"typical\" types of vore with especially odd \"twists\", and for posts depicting the consumption/absorption/digestion of one character/creature by another that defies a singular or specific tag.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples of Unusual Vore\r\n\r\n[section,expanded= Unusual Twists in \"Usual Vore\"]\r\n\r\nThese are some examples of how vore with a usual orifice can be counted as \"unusual\":\r\n\r\n* [[Oral vore]] where the prey is digested into computer data (the prey character may be increasingly pixelized or have pixel particles emit from their body) \r\n* [[Unbirthing]] where the prey is transformed into a stuffed toy (this should also be tagged as [[inanimate transformation]])\r\n* [[Cock vore]] where a character is \"vacuumed\" into the urethra\r\n* [[Anal vore]] where the character is inserted into the anus, digested and then excreted as ice cream (this would also be tagged as [[unusual feces]] and [[food transformation]])\r\n* Any kind of vore where the prey is ingested through a \"typical\" orifice, but the predator's entire body is treated as hollow, and [[imprint|imprints]] of the prey can be seen all around the predator's body\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section= Unusual Vore That Defy Tagging]\r\n\r\nThese types of scenarios involve vore \"methods\" that are extremely difficult to accurately convey with a single tag.\r\n\r\n* A character being consumed by putting on a full body costume (e.g. a fur suit) that becomes a [[living clothing|living suit]], the living costume character is usually implied to absorb the wearer-turned-prey, in some rare cases, the costume also forms a typical digestive tract, and swallows the wearer into a newly formed stomach, their head may be shown in the mouth, and then swallowed down as in [[oral vore]]\r\n* A character being consumed by a mouth growing out of an usual location, such as the torso, hands or feet, images featuring these should include a tag describing the location of the mouth, such as [[stomach mouth]]\r\n* Vore scenarios involving portals or [[voodoo doll|voodoo dolls]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section= Unusual types of vore that have their own tag]\r\n[i]Note: While these variations of vore are considered \"unusual\", they are easily explained and/or common enough that they have their own tags[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[abdomen vore]]\r\n* [[breast vore]]\r\n* [[cloacal vore]]\r\n* [[foreskin vore]]\r\n* [[horn vore]]\r\n* [[nasal vore]] (includes \"trunk vore\")\r\n* [[navel vore]]\r\n* [[nipple vore]]\r\n* [[pectoral vore]]\r\n* [[pouch vore]]\r\n* [[tail vore]] \r\n* [[sheath vore]]\r\n* [[slit vore]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n\r\n* [[vacuum penis]] — a \"common\" unusual vore twist on cock vore\r\n\r\n* Unusual vore and [[unusual anatomy]] often go hand-in-hand\r\n** [[hand mouth]]\r\n** [[nipple mouth]]\r\n** [[chest mouth]]\r\n** [[penis mouth]]\r\n** [[pussy mouth]]\r\n** [[tail mouth]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[vore]]"
