              "wiki_body": "thumb #2740546 thumb #4135301 thumb #4470561 thumb #5517756\n\n[b]Recursive vore[/b] describes when a character eats or inserts a character, who in turn has already consumed someone else, or eating a character who is in the process of eating someone else. The predator becomes prey, a predator within a predator.\n\nRecursive vore can repeat (or [i]recur[/i]) over and over again, with preds inside preds inside preds... however, most recursive vore only goes \"one layer\" deep, with two characters, a predator and their prey, both being ingested by or inserted into the body of a third character. \n\nThis is sometimes informally called \"[i]voreception[/i]\" in vorarephile circles, referencing the 2010 film [i]Inception[/i], which had a premise of recursive dreams (\"dream within a dream\") and which spawned a meme of \"(x) within an (x) - (x)ception\".\n\n[quote]\n\nh6. Recursive vore is usually depicted in these three ways, all three may be shown within a single comic or sequence:\n\n* An [[internal]], showing a character within a character (and so on), all within the \"top predator\" who consumed all of the others\n* A character shoved into an orifice of, or being swallowed by, a character who is in turn, in the same orifice of another, or being swallowed as they swallow their prey\n* A character consumes someone, or has consumed someone, and then is consumed themselves by a third character\n* A character is consumed by a predator, who has consumed, or goes on to consume, a third character, one of the two \"prey\" consume the other while inside of the predator's body\n\n[/quote]\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[multiple pred]] / [[multiple prey]] - inherently invoked by this tag\n* [[sex inside body]] - characters having sex inside of another character\n* [[recursive penetration]] - a character penetrating a character that is penetrating a third, and so on, in vore scenarios this may involve a character being penetrated as their whole body is penetrating the orifice of a third character\n** [[in utero penetration]] - a character being penetrated by an outside character, while inside of a third character (in their rectum, uterus, etc)\n* [[vore]]\n\n\n"
