            "wiki_body": "thumb #2037224 thumb #2399228 thumb #2503323 thumb #3101553 thumb #3779658\n\n[b]Size play[/b] is when [[size difference]] is the main focus of an image or animation, often in a sexual manner. This tag is mainly used for the kind of scenario or sexual position that's only possible because of the size difference. For example, [[macro]] and [[micro]] for the former or [[swinging_(sex)|swinging]] and [[cable_car_position|cable car]] for the latter.\n\nJust having a size difference does not inherently make an image size play - the size difference must be the focus of the image for this tag to count. Typically this is shown through a clear difference in size between a pair/group of characters, characters commenting on size, or a prominent stomach bulge or other visual indicators of a large size difference.\n\nh4. Tags that commonly feature size play\n* [[bodyjob]]\n* [[cable_car_position]]\n* [[living_condom]]\n* [[micro_on_macro]]\n* [[penis_riding]]\n* [[swinging_(sex)]]\n\nh4. See also\n* [[big_dom_small_sub]]\n* [[big_power_bottom]]\n* [[extreme_size_difference]]\n* [[hyper]]\n* [[macro]]\n* [[micro]]\n* [[size_difference]]\n** [[larger_anthro]]\n** [[larger_female]]\n** [[larger_feral]]\n** [[larger_herm]]\n** [[larger_human]]\n** [[larger_intersex]]\n** [[larger_male]]\n** [[micro_on_macro]]\n** [[smaller_anthro]]\n** [[smaller_female]]\n** [[smaller_feral]]\n** [[smaller_herm]]\n** [[smaller_human]]\n** [[smaller_intersex]]\n** [[smaller_male]]\n* [[small_dom_big_sub]]\n* [[small_top_big_bottom]]"
