          {
            "tag": "bound",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 184703,
            "wiki_body": "This tag is used in all cases where a character is tied up, chained, cuffed, or otherwise limited in motion by non-living things, such as rope and shackles. The tag [[restrained]] is used when motion is limited by a hold of living things. This is regardless of consent or implied fetishism.\r\n\r\nSome common restraining devices are [[rope|ropes]], [[arthropod webbing]], [[handcuffs]], [[harness|harnesses]], and [[spreader bar|spreader bars]].\r\n\r\nRemember that [[tentacles]] are living things, and thus they typically do not bind (unless a piece of dead tentacle has been wrapped around a thing and bound to a knot) but rather they [[restrained|restrain]]. A [[leash]] by itself doesn't [[bound|bind]] or [[restrained|restrain]], but if the other end is tied to something (even to another character – [[bound together]]) it does the former, and if it's [[holding_leash|held]] or even [[leash_pull|pulled]] it does the latter.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[bondage]] - The fetishized act of binding someone.\r\n* [[bondage_gear]] - Objects pertaining to bondage scenes.\r\n* [[restraints]] - The general purpose tag for all types of restraining devices and tools.\r\n\r\nh4. Binding methods\r\n\r\n* [[chained]] – The use of [[chain|chains]] to bind a character. Often overlaps with shackled.\r\n* [[rope_bondage]] – The use of [[rope]] to bind a character.\r\n* [[shackled]] – The use of [[shackles]] to bind a character.\r\n* [[tape_bondage]] – The use of [[tape]] to bind a character.\r\n* [[nailed]] – the use of [[nail]]s to bind a character.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [b]bound[/b]\r\n** [[bondage]]\r\n*** [[light_bondage]]\r\n*** [[ribbon_bondage]]\r\n** [[bound_genitalia]]\r\n*** [[ball_bondage]]\r\n*** [[penis_bondage]]\r\n** bound_limbs\r\n*** [[arms_tied]] - Binding of the arm, elbow, or forearm area \r\n**** [[hands_tied]] - Binding of the hands or fingers\r\n**** [[wrists_tied]] - Binding of the wrists\r\n*** [[legs_tied]] - Binding of the leg, knee, or thigh area \r\n**** [[ankles_tied]] - Binding of the ankle\r\n**** [[feet_tied]] - Binding of the foot or toes\r\n**** [[frogtied]] - Binding the legs in deep crouch position\r\n*** [[hogtied]] - Binding all of a character's limbs together\r\n** [[breast_bondage]]\r\n** [[bound_midriff]] - Binding of the midriff, between the navel and chest\r\n** Furry specific anatomy\r\n*** Bound tags\r\n**** [[antennae_tied]]\r\n**** [[horn_tied]]\r\n**** [[muzzled]]  Usually applies to canines or others with long protruding jaws.\r\n**** [[tied_tail|tail_tied]]\r\n**** [[tentacles_tied]]\r\n**** [[wings_tied]]\r\n*** Bondage tags\r\n**** [[antenna_bondage]]\r\n**** [[horn_bondage]]\r\n**** [[tail_bondage]]\r\n**** [[tentacle_bondage]]\r\n**** [[wing_bondage]]\r\n** [[fully_bound]]\r\n* [[restrained]]\r\n* [[stuck]]\r\n\r\n* [[bondage_gear]]\r\n* [[tag_group:bondage]]\r\n\r\nh4. Forum Discussions\r\n\r\n* topic #25400 - Tag Alias: immobilization -> fully_bound"
