            "wiki_body": "thumb #1450295 thumb #3371263\r\n\r\nThis tag is used when a character walks or stands only on [[hooves]]. Unguligrade animals include horses, deer, bovine, llamas, and others. Compare with [[digitigrade]] and [[plantigrade]].\r\n\r\n[section=List of unguligrade animals]\r\nNote: Wiki added from [[hooves]] tag. It probably needs to be cleaned up.\r\n\r\nOnly animals of Antilopinae family should receive the tag \"Antelope\" but for reasons of convenience, Antelopinae, Hippotraginae, Antilocapra and Spiral-Horned are being tagged Antelope.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. [[Antelope]]\r\n\r\n* [[gazelle]]\r\n** [[thomson_gazelle]]\r\n* [[impala]]\r\n* [[addax]]\r\n* [[oryx]]\r\n** [[gemsbok]]\r\n** [[arabian_oryx]]\r\n* [[sable_antelope]]\r\n\r\nh4. Antilocapra americana\r\n\r\n* [[pronghorn]]\r\n\r\nh4. [[Spiral-Horned_Antelope]]\r\n\r\n(belonging to the family Bovinae)\r\n\r\n* [[bongo]]\r\n* [[kudu]]\r\n* [[eland]]\r\n\r\nh4. Bovinae ([[Bovine]])\r\n\r\n* [[bison]]\r\n* [[buffalo]]\r\n* [[cattle]] \r\n* [[muskox]]\r\n* [[tauren]]\r\n* [[gnu]] (wildebeest)\r\n* [[yak]]\r\n\r\nh4. Camelidae (Camelid)\r\n\r\n* [[alpaca]]\r\n* [[camel]]\r\n* [[guanaco]]\r\n* [[llama]]\r\n* [[stenomylus]]\r\n\r\nh4. Caprinae ([[Caprine]])\r\n\r\n* [[bighorn_sheep]]\r\n* [[chamois]]\r\n* [[goat]]\r\n* [[markhor]]\r\n* [[mouflon]]\r\n* [[sheep]]\r\n** [[ram]]\r\n\r\nh4. Cervidae ([[Cervine]])\r\n\r\n* [[deer]]\r\n* [[elk]] (Wapiti)\r\n* [[moose]]\r\n* [[reindeer]] (Caribou)\r\n* [[white-tailed_deer]]\r\n* [[mule_deer]]\r\n* [[roe_deer]]\r\n* [[red_deer]]\r\n* [[musk_deer]]\r\n* [[water_deer]]\r\n\r\nh4. Divers\r\n\r\n* [[hippopotamus]] \r\n* [[elephant]] \r\n* [[rhinoceros]]\r\n\r\nh4. Equidae ([[Equine]])\r\n\r\n* [[donkey]]\r\n* [[gypsy_vanner]]\r\n* [[horse]]\r\n** [[pony]]\r\n*** [[earth_pony]]\r\n* [[kirin]]\r\n* [[pegasus]]\r\n* [[unicorn]]\r\n* [[winged_unicorn]]\r\n* [[zebra]]\r\n** [[quagga]]\r\n** [[zebroid]]\r\n\r\nh4. Giraffidae\r\n\r\n* [[giraffe]]\r\n* [[okapi]]\r\n\