          {
            "tag": "container",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 102998,
            "wiki_body": "A container is a basic tool, consisting of any device creating a partially or fully enclosed space that can be used to contain, store, and transport objects or materials.\r\n\r\nThere are many types of containers. Unless the container is indescribable, a more specific tag should also be used.\r\n\r\nh4. Types: (Incomplete)\r\n\r\n* [[bag]]\r\n** [[backpack]]\r\n** [[gym bag]]\r\n** [[handbag]]\r\n** [[messenger bag]]\r\n** [[paper bag]]\r\n** [[plastic bag]]\r\n** [[saddle bag]]\r\n** [[shopping bag]]\r\n** [[trash bag]]\r\n* [[barrel]]\r\n* [[basket]]\r\n** [[flower basket]]\r\n** [[fruit basket]]\r\n** [[laundry basket]]\r\n** [[picnic basket]] - Usually a type of wicker basket.\r\n** [[wicker basket]]\r\n* [[bin]] - A type of storage container. It is commonly associated with storing waste, or recyclables. Some bins are basket-like, featuring a top that is wider than the base.\r\n* [[bottle]]\r\n* [[bowl]]\r\n* [[box]]\r\n** [[jewelry box]]\r\n** [[toolbox]]\r\n* [[bucket]]\r\n* [[cabinet]]\r\n** [[locker]]\r\n* [[carton]]\r\n* [[can]] - Sealed container for storing [[food]], [[drinks]], or other substances (e.g [[paint can]]).\r\n** [[beverage can]] - Used for storing [[soda]], [[beer]], and other drinks.\r\n** [[paint can]]\r\n* [[canister]]\r\n* [[canteen]]\r\n* [[case]]\r\n** [[briefcase]]\r\n** [[cd case]]\r\n** [[display case]]\r\n*** [[trophy case]]\r\n** [[gig bag|musical instrument case]]\r\n*** [[guitar case]]\r\n*** [[violin case]]\r\n** [[weapon case]]\r\n*** [[scabbard]]\r\n* [[chest (container)]]\r\n** [[treasure chest]]\r\n* [[cooking pot]]\r\n** [[cauldron]]\r\n* [[crate]]\r\n* [[cup]]\r\n** [[coffee mug]]\r\n** [[shot glass]]\r\n** [[stein]]\r\n** [[tankard]]\r\n** [[tea cup]]\r\n** [[wine glass]]\r\n* decorative container\r\n** [[urn]]\r\n** [[vase]]\r\n* [[flask]]\r\n** [[erlenmeyer flask]]\r\n** [[florence flask]]\r\n** [[hip flask]]\r\n** [[volumetric flask]]\r\n* [[jar]]\r\n* [[jug]]\r\n* plant container\r\n** [[flower pot]]\r\n*** [[potted plant]]\r\n** [[planter]]\r\n* [[storage tank]]\r\n** [[air tank]]\r\n** [[gas tank]]\r\n** [[milk tank]]\r\n** [[vat]]\r\n** [[water tank]]\r\n* [[thermos]]\r\n* [[squeeze tube]] - A squeezable tube used for storing substances such as paint, and toothpaste.\r\n** [[lube tube]]\r\n** [[paint tube]]\r\n** [[toothpaste tube]]\r\n* travel container\r\n** [[luggage]]\r\n*** [[trunk (container)]]\r\n** [[suitcase]]\r\n* waste container\r\n** [[dumpster]]\r\n** [[trash bag]]\r\n** [[trash can]] - This tag could refer to a can, bin, or a basket.\r\n* [[wrapper]]\r\n** [[candy wrapper]]\r\n** [[wrapped condom]] - A condom wrapper still containing a condom.\r\n** [[condom wrapper]] - The condom wrapper itself.\r\n\r\nh6. Materials\r\n\r\n* [[cardboard container]]\r\n* [[glass container]]\r\n* [[metal container]]\r\n* [[plastic container]]\r\n* [[wood container]]\r\n\r\nh6. Specialty Containers\r\n\r\n* [[food container]] - Pizza boxes, cans of food, [[candy_wrapper|candy wrappers]] etc.\r\n* [[package]]\r\n* [[stasis chamber]]"
