              "wiki_body": "thumb #830700 thumb #671591 thumb #662475\r\n\r\nA [b]cup[/b] is a [[container]] primarily used for drinking [[liquid]] [[beverage|beverages]] such as [[tea]], [[beer]], [[soda]] and [[water]].\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n\r\n* [[disposable_cup]]\r\n* [[drinking_glass]]\r\n** [[champagne_glass]]\r\n** [[cocktail_glass]]\r\n** [[shot_glass]]\r\n** [[whiskey_glass]]\r\n** [[wine_glass]]\r\n* [[measuring_cup]]\r\n* [[mug]]\r\n** [[coffee_mug]]\r\n** [[stein]]\r\n** [[tankard]]\r\n* [[tea_cup]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[holding_cup]]\r\n* [[in_cup]]\r\n* [[drinking_straw]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[beverage]]\r\n* [[liquid]]\r\n"
