              "tag": "mug",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 5135,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #3067123 thumb #80784 thumb #3012158 thumb #3686846 thumb #2889429 thumb #3364409\r\n\r\n\r\nA mug is a special type of [[cup]]. Large, cylinder-shaped cups with one or more handles are frequently mugs. They are often used to carry very hot liquid, such as [[coffee]], but are also frequently used for [[beer]].\r\n\r\nMugs which visibly contain a liquid may have a specialized tag:\r\n* [[beer_mug]]\r\n* [[coffee_mug]]\r\n* [[mug_of_cum]]\r\n\r\nSome mugs with special decorations have their own tags too:\r\n* [[daddy_mug]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[beverage]]\r\n* [[cup]]\r\n* [[drinking_glass]]\r\n* [[tankard]]"
