              "count": 578,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #628474 thumb #330447\r\n\r\nA [b]disposable cup[/b] is a cheap and flimsy type of [[cup]] not designed for repeated use. They are usually made of paper, plastic or foam, and are commonly used in places like take-away shops and cinemas.\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n\r\n* [[coffee_cup]] - Only the disposable ones qualify.\r\n* [[solo_cup]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Disposable cup\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disposable_cup"
