            "count": 88865,
            "wiki_body": "When a character transforms from one form to another.\n\n[section,expanded=Transformation tables]\n\nRows represent initial forms (\"before\") and columns represent the end result (\"after\").\n[section=Symbols]\n* ! – Less than twenty (20) posts\n* X – No posts/unused tag\n* W – No wiki page\n* A – Missing alias(es) or implication(s)\n[/section]\n\nh4.Form transformation table\n\nTransformations to the same relative body type (e.g. \"feral to feral\") are not tagged.\n\n[ltable]\n |[[feral_transformation]]|[[anthro_transformation]]|[[humanoid_transformation]]|[[human_transformation]]|[[inanimate_transformation]]|[[taur_transformation]]\n [b][[feral]][/b] | [b]X[/b] | [[feral_to_anthro]] | [[feral_to_humanoid]][sup](A)[/sup] | [[feral_to_human]] | [[feral_to_inanimate]][sup](!A)[/sup] | [[feral_to_taur]][sup](WA)[/sup]\n[b][[anthro]][/b] | [[anthro_to_feral]] | [b]X[/b] | [[anthro_to_humanoid]][sup](A)[/sup] | [[anthro_to_human]] | [[anthro_to_inanimate]][sup](A)[/sup] | [[anthro_to_taur]][sup](A)[/sup]\n[b][[humanoid]][/b] | [[humanoid_to_feral]][sup](A)[/sup] | [[humanoid_to_anthro]][sup](A)[/sup] | [b]X[/b] | [[humanoid_to_human]][sup](!WA)[/sup] | [[humanoid_to_inanimate]][sup](A)[/sup] | [[humanoid_to_taur]][sup](A)[/sup]\n[b][[human]][/b] | [[human_to_feral]] | [[human_to_anthro]] | [[human_to_humanoid]][sup](A)[/sup] | [b]X[/b] | [[human_to_inanimate]][sup](A)[/sup] | [[human_to_taur]][sup](A)[/sup]\n[b][[inanimate]][/b] | [[inanimate_to_feral]] [sup](!WA)[/sup] | [[inanimate_to_anthro]] [sup](!WA)[/sup] | [[inanimate_to_humanoid]][sup](XWA)[/sup] | [[inanimate_to_human]][sup](!WA)[/sup] | [b]X[/b] | [[inanimate_to_taur]] [sup](XWA)[/sup]\n[b][[taur]][/b] | [[taur_to_feral]][sup](!WA)[/sup] | [[taur_to_anthro]][sup](!WA)[/sup] | [[taur_to_humanoid]][sup](WA)[/sup] | [[taur_to_human]][sup](XWA)[/sup] | [[taur_to_inanimate]][sup](WA)[/sup] | [b]X[/b]\n[/ltable]\n\nh4.Gender transformation table\n\nTransformations to the same gender (e.g. \"female to female\") are not tagged.\n\n[ltable]\n | [[Female]] | [[Intersex]] | [[Male]] | [[Gynomorph]] | [[Andromorph]] | [[Herm]] | [[Maleherm]]\n [b][[Female]][/b] | [b]X[/b] | [[fti_transformation]] | [[ftm_transformation]]  | [[ftg_transformation]] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [[fth_transformation]] |[sup](XW)[/sup]\n[b][[Intersex]][/b] | [[itf_transformation]] | [[iti_transformation]] | [[itm_transformation]] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup]\n[b][[Male]][/b] | [[mtf_transformation]] | [[mti_transformation]] | [b]X[/b] | [[mtg_transformation]] | [[mta_transformation]] | [[mth_transformation]] | [[mtmh_transformation]]\n[b][[Gynomorph]][/b] | [[gtf_transformation]] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup]\n[b][[Andromorph]][/b] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [[atm_transformation]] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup]\n[b][[Herm]][/b] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [[htm_transformation]] |[sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] \n[b][[Maleherm]][/b] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [[mhtm_transformation]] |[sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] | [sup](XW)[/sup] \n[/ltable]\n\n[/section]\nh3.  Transformation results\nTags about the results of a transformation\n[section,expanded=Transformation results]\n\nh4. Trait changes\nTags that describe what trait of a character changes, but not what it changes into\n\n* [[species_transformation]] – When a character is transforming from one species to another.\n* [[form_transformation]] - See table\n* [[gender_transformation]] - See table\n* [[body_part_transformation]] - When a character transforms into a body part.\n\nh4. Specific\n\n* [[species_transformation]]\n** [[robotization]]\n** [[plant_transformation]]\n** [[goo_transformation]] – When a character is transformed by goo [b]or[/b] into goo.\n\n* [[body_part_transformation]]\n** [[breast_transformation]]  - When a character transforms into a [[breast]].\n** [[genital_transformation]] - When a character's genitals transform.\n** [[cock_transformation]] - When a character transforms into a [[penis]].\n** [[pussy_transformation]] - When a character transforms into a [[pussy]].\n** [[butt_transformation]] - When a character transforms into a [[butt]].\n** [[tail_transformation]]\n** [[foot_transformation]]\n\n\n* [[inanimate_transformation]] – When a character transforms into an [[inanimate object]] or [[animate_inanimate]]\n** [[dollification]]\n*** [[sex_toy_transformation]]\n*** [[plushification]]/[[plushie_transformation]]\n** [[petrification]] – When a character is petrified into some material.\n** [[inflatable_transformation]]\n** [[clothing_transformation]]\n*** [[underwear_transformation]]\n*** [[sock_transformation]]\n** [[food_transformation]]\n** [[cum_transformation]] - When a character transforms into cum.\n\n* [[tf_into_fictional_character]] – When a character transforms into a pre-existing (and, more often than not, more famous) character.\n* [[short_stackification]]\n* [[toonification]]\n\nh4. Modifiers\nTags that describe details about the final form\n\n* [[demi_transformation]] - A human turning into an animal or object, with human features left intact\n* [[partial_transformation]] - When transformation leaves part or most of the subject's body unchanged.\n* [[latex_transformation]]\n\n[section=Growth / Expansion related]\n\n* [[expansion]] – When a pre-existing body part of a character is growing in size.\n** [[breast_expansion]] – When a character's pre-existing breasts swell/grow. Some transformations may cause this.\n** [[butt_expansion]] – When a character's buttocks swell/grow.\n** [[genital_expansion]] – When a character's pre-existing genitals swell/grow/expand.\n*** [[balls_expansion]] – When a character's pre-existing testicles swell/grow. Usually accompanies [[penis expansion]].\n*** [[penis_expansion]] – When a character's pre-existing penis grows or expands.\n** [[tail_expansion]] – When a character's pre-existing tail grows or expands.\n** [[tongue_expansion]] – When a character's tongue grows longer, wider, and/or thicker. Some specific transformations may involve this, such as transformations into [[amphibian|amphibians]].\n* [[growth]] – When a character is growing new body parts. Note that this also has been used for [[body size growth|growing in size]], and is additionally often tagged for [[expansion]] and [[inflation]].\n** [[breast_growth]] – When a character grows new breasts. Most often found in gender transformations, but it's also used for [[flat chested]] characters who are growing breasts.\n** [[genital_growth]] – When a character grows new genitals, such as a [[penis growth|penis]] or a [[pussy growth|pussy]].\n** [[muscle_growth]] – When a character's muscles swell/grow. Some transformations may cause this.\n** [[tail_growth]] – When a character grows a new tail. Most posts tagged with this involve species transformations.\n** [[wing_growth]] – When a character grows new wings.\n* [[inflation]] – When a character's body or parts thereof swell by being filled with air, gases, fluids, etc. Some transformations may involve this, such as transformations into [[pool toy|pool toys]].\n* [[size_transformation]] – When a character is changing in size.\n** [[body_size_growth]] – When a character is increasing in body size (enlarging).\n** [[shrinking]] – When a character is decreasing in size.\n\n[/section]\n[/section]\nh3.  Transformation triggers\nTags about the cause of a transformation.\n[section,expanded=Transformation triggers]\n\n* [[transformation_mechanism]] - The tag for when the reason for the TF is provided in the image.\n\nh4. Objects \n\n* [[transformation_by_item]]\n** [[transformation_by_fictional_prop]]\n** [[transformation_by_magical_item]]\n** [[transformation_ring]]\n\n* [[transformation_by_wearable]] (TODO: create)\n** [[suit_transformation]]/[[costume_transformation]] – When a character transforms with the help of a suit, living or otherwise, into what the suit represents.\n** [[transformative_clothing]]\n** [[transformative_mask]]\n** transformative_neckpiece\n*** [[transformative_collar]]\n*** [[transformative_necklace]]\n** [[transformative_piercing]]\n\nh4. Exposure to substances and effects\n\n* [[transformation_by_substance]]\n** [[transformation_through_food]]\n** [[transformation_through_injection]]\n** [[transformation_through_smoking]]\n** [[transformation_potion]]\n* [[transformation_through_cum]]\n* [[goo_transformation]] – When a character is transformed by goo [b]or[/b] into goo.\n* [[transformation_ray]]\n\nh4. Character actions\n\n* [[transformation_through_bite]]\n* [[transformation_through_kiss]]\n* [[transformation_through_possession]]\n\n* [[transformation_through_masturbation]] – When a character transforms during masturbation, or masturbation is the cause of the transformation.\n* [[transformation_through_sex]] – When a character transforms during sexual activity, or sexual activity is the cause of the transformation.\n\n* [[transformation_through_vore]] – When a character is transformed by consuming/absorbing/digesting another character, or a character is consumed, and then released in a transformed state\n\nh4. Other\n\n* [[egg_transformation]]\n\n* [[transformation_through_magic]]\n* [[transformation_through_technology]]\n[/section]\nh3. Transformation Context\nTags that describe the circumstances around a transformation\n[section,expanded=Transformation Context]\n\n* [[imminent_transformation]] – Used when a transformation is about to occur in a comic or sequence. \n* [[mid_transformation]]\n* [[after_transformation]] – Posts showing the aftermath of a transformation. Often found in transformation comics.\n* [[slow_transformation]] - When a transformation takes one or more days\n* [[implied_transformation]] – Posts that [i]suggest[/i] a transformation has happened or is happening, but there's not enough evidence to definitively confirm it.\n* [[duo_transformation]]\n* [[group_transformation]]\n* [[forced_transformation]] – When the transformation isn't voluntary or is being done by an outside force. \n* [[consensual_transformation]] – When the character being transformed intentionally causes or encourages it.\n\n* [[merging]] - When multiple characters become one\n* [[mitosis]] - When one character becomes multiple duplicate characters\n* [[fusion]] - When multiple characters become one new character\n* [[splitting]] - When one character becomes multiple\n* [[twinning]] – When a character transforms into a copy of another character that is shown in the image.\n\n* [[lust_transformation]] – When a character gets increasingly [[lust|lustful]] as part of a transformation.\n* [[permanent_transformation]] - When a transformation is explicitly stated to be irreversible.\n* [[transformed_clothing]] - When a character's outfit changes with their body.\n* [[evolution_(transformation)]] – When a fictional species transforms into a different connected species, like in [[pokemon]] and [[digimon]].\n* [[asymmetrical_transformation]]\n* [[scat_transformation]] – When [[feces|fecal matter]] plays a large role into a transformation.\n[/section]\n\nh4. Artistic choices\n* [[transformation_pov]]\n* [[transformation_sequence]]\n* [[transformation_silhouette]]\n* [[transformation_transition_effect]]\n** [[poof_effect]]\n** [[transformation_transition_frame]]\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[alternate_form]]\n** [[anthro]]\n*** [[anthrofied]]\n** [[feral]]\n*** [[feralized]]\n** [[taur]]\n*** [[taurification]]\n* [[alternate_species]]\n** [[demonification]]\n** [[dragonification]]\n** [[furrification]]\n** [[humanized]]\n** [[humanoidized]]\n** [[mermaidification]]\n** [[ponification]]\n* [[toyification]]\n* [[clothing]]\n** [[clothing_loss]]\n** [[outfit_change]]\n** [[tearing_clothing]]\n** [[torn_clothing]]\n* [[magic]]\n** [[magic_circle]]\n** [[magic_wisp]]\n* [[living_latex]]\n* [[living clothing]]\n* [[sequence]]\n** [[basic_sequence]]\n* [[before_and_after]]\n* [[were]] – A character who can transform into another being. Ambiguous. Use species_transformation for actual transformation.\n** [[werewolf]] – The classic.\n\n* [[bimbofication]]\n* [[daddyfication]]\n* [[dronification]]\n* [[feminization]]\n* [[himbofication]]\n* [[nerdification]]\n* [[robotization]]\n* [[stepfordization]]"
