              "count": 325,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #537086 thumb #1587726 thumb #15088\r\n\r\n[b]Amekaji[/b] (\"American Casual\") is a substyle of [[Gyaru]] that takes inspiration from American fashion and Japan's stereotypical and glamorized view of the country.\r\n\r\nBright colors are common, as well as bold prints and patterns, [[baseball cap]]s, [[sneakers]], and elements of [[streetwear]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[y2k_(fashion)]]\r\n* [[tag group:fashion]]"
            }
