              "wiki_body": "thumb #3607427 thumb #742355 thumb #1116923 thumb #3064854 thumb #4583083\r\n\r\n[b]Tsuyome[/b] is a broad substyle of [[Gyaru]] that focuses on bold makeup, clothing, and jewelry, trying to appear cool and sexy. \r\n\r\n[[Leopard print]] is most common in this style. Other common elements include dramatic makeup, [[leg warmers]], [[miniskirt]]s and [[hotpants]], and a generally flashy appearance.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[tag group:fashion]]"
