            "wiki_body": "thumb #76217 thumb #1038036 thumb #1070360\r\n\r\nA [b]towel[/b] is a piece of absorbent fabric or paper used for drying or wiping. It draws moisture through direct contact, often using a blotting or a rubbing motion. Common household textile towels are made from cotton, rayon, bamboo, nonwoven fibers or a few other materials.\r\n\r\nh4.Related Tags:\r\n\r\n* [[holding_towel]]\r\n* [[on_towel]]\r\n* [[towel_around_neck]]\r\n* [[towel_on_shoulder]]\r\n* [[towel_only]]\r\n* [[towel_whip]]\r\n* [[towel_wrap]]"
