        "pitchfork": [
          {
            "tag": "pitchfork",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 723,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #757208\r\n\r\nA [b]pitchfork[/b] is a [[tools|tool]] that has two, three or four long, thin metal bars on a long handle that is used mostly for lifting [[hay]] and other [[farm]] work.\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[trident]]\r\n* [[melee weapon]]"
          }
        ],
        "ladle": [
          {
            "tag": "ladle",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 447,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #546664\r\n\r\nA [b]ladle[/b] is a type of [[spoon]] used for soup, stew, or other foods. Although designs vary, a typical ladle has a long handle terminating in a deep bowl, frequently with the bowl oriented at an angle to the handle to facilitate lifting liquid out of a pot or other vessel and conveying it to a bowl.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[spoon]]\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Ladle (spoon)\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ladle_%28spoon%29"
          }
        ],
        "saw": [
          {
            "tag": "saw",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 422,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #225637\r\n\r\nA [b]saw[/b] is a [[tools|tool]] consisting of a tough blade, wire, or chain with a hard toothed edge. It is used to cut through material, most often wood. The cut is made by placing the toothed edge against the material and moving it forcefully forth and less forcefully back or continuously forward.\r\n\r\nh4. Types: (incomplete)\r\n\r\n* [[Chainsaw]]\r\n* [[Circular Saw]]\r\n** [[Table Saw]]\r\n* [[Jigsaw]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related:\r\n\r\n* [[Sawblade]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[Tools]]\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Saw\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saw"
          }
        ],
        "razor": {
