              "count": 395,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #2490488 thumb #1896978 thumb #1896430\r\n\r\nIts an instrument with a sharp blade or combination of blades, used to remove unwanted hair from the [[facial_hair|face]] or [[body_hair|body.]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[electric_razor]]\r\n* [[holding_razor]]\r\n* [[shaved]]\r\n** [[shaved_head]]\r\n** [[shaved_pussy]]\r\n* [[shaving]]\r\n* [[shearing]]\r\n* [[sheared]]"
