        "pliers": [
          {
            "tag": "pliers",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 172,
            "wiki_body": "[b]Pliers[/b] are a [[tools|hand tool]] used to hold objects firmly, as well as bending and compressing a wide range of materials. Generally, pliers consist of a pair of metal levers joined at a fulcrum positioned closer to one end of the levers, creating short jaws on one side of the fulcrum, and longer handles on the other side. This arrangement creates a mechanical advantage, allowing the force of the hand's grip to be amplified and focused on an object with precision. The jaws can also be used to manipulate objects too small or unwieldy to be manipulated with the fingers."
          }
        ],
        "rake": [
          {
            "tag": "rake",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 159,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #1086826\r\n\r\nA [b]rake[/b] is a type of [[broom]] designed for outside use; a horticultural implement consisting of a toothed bar fixed transversely to a handle, and used to collect leaves, hay, grass, etc., and, in gardening, for loosening the soil, light weeding and levelling, removing dead grass from lawns, and generally for purposes performed in agriculture by the harrow.\r\n\r\nFor the creepypasta character, see [[the_rake]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[tools]]"
          }
        ],
        "hoe": [
          {
            "tag": "hoe",
            "kor": "",
            "count": 141,
            "wiki_body": "thumb #645790\r\n\r\nA [b]hoe[/b] is an ancient and versatile agricultural hand [[tool]] used to shape the soil, control weeds, clear soil, and harvest root crops. There are several types.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n\r\n* [[prostitution|Prostitute]] - Also called a \"whore\", which is then abbreviated to \"ho\".\r\n* A [[santa_claus|certain fat man's]] iconic [[laugh]], also spelled \"ho\".\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[Tools]]\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Hoe (tool)\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoe_%28tool%29"
          }
        ]
