            "wiki_body": "thumb #14617 thumb #835030 thumb #287230 thumb #658419\r\n\r\nThe male ruler of an independent state, especially one who inherits the position by right of birth.\r\n\r\nh4.See Also:\r\n* [[royalty]]\r\n** [[emperor]]\r\n** king\r\n** [[pharaoh]]\r\n** [[prince]]\r\n** [[princess]]\r\n** [[queen]]"
