            "wiki_body": "thumb #193286 thumb #302102 thumb #785433 thumb #784742\r\n\r\nA female monarch who reigns in her own right having equivalent status to a reigning king.\r\n\r\nh4.See Also:\r\n\r\n* [[royalty]]\r\n** [[emperor]]\r\n** [[king]]\r\n** [[pharaoh]]\r\n** [[prince]]\r\n** [[princess]]\r\n** queen"
