            "wiki_body": "A ball is generally a spherical object that is commonly used in sports or as a fun toy for kids. Balls can come in all colors and a variety of sizes from small [[golf_ball|golf balls]] to large [[exercise_ball|exercise balls]]. Given this fact, please tag specific items whenever possible.\r\n\r\n* Note: Even if there are multiple balls (plural) visible in a piece, you still tag [[ball]] (singular).\r\n* For the [[male]]/[[gynomorph]] genitalia, see [[balls]].\r\n\r\nh4.Ball types:\r\n\r\n* [[Baseball (ball)]]\r\n* [[Basketball (ball)]]\r\n* [[Beach Ball]]\r\n* [[Billiard Ball]][sup]a[/sup]\r\n* [[Cricket Ball]][sup]!a[/sup]\r\n* [[Exercise Ball]][sup]a[/sup]\r\n* [[Football (ball)]]\r\n* [[Golf Ball]][sup]!a[/sup]\r\n* [[Playground Ball]][sup]!a[/sup]\r\n* [[Snowball]][sup]wa[/sup]\r\n* [[Soccer Ball]]\r\n* [[Tennis Ball]]\r\n* [[Volleyball (ball)]]\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[ball_gag]]\r\n"
