            "guitar": {
              "_Self (guitar)": [
                {
                  "tag": "guitar",
                  "kor": "",
                  "count": 6555,
                  "wiki_body": "The guitar is a [[musical instrument]] classified as a string instrument with 4 - 18 strings (usually 6). \r\n\r\nIt is typically played by strumming the strings one hand while pressing against the frets with the fingers of the other hand.\r\n\r\nh4. Also see:\r\n** [[music]]\r\n* [[musical instrument]]\r\n"
