              "kor": "",
              "count": 8662,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #704923 thumb #694309 thumb #676104\r\n\r\nA device that allows users to input commands into video game consoles. They can take many forms, the most common of which is a gamepad.\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n\r\n* [[arcade_controller]]\r\n* [[joystick]]\r\n* [[rhythm_game_controller]]\r\n** [[dance_pad]]\r\n** [[guitar_controller]]\r\n\r\nh5. Brands\r\n\r\n* [[Nintendo]]:\r\n** [[nes_controller]]\r\n** [[nes_zapper]]\r\n** [[snes_controller]]\r\n** [[n64_controller]]\r\n** [[gamecube_controller]]\r\n** [[wii_remote]]\r\n*** [[wii_nunchuk]]\r\n*** [[classic_controller]]\r\n** [[wii_u_pro_controller]]\r\n** [[joycon_controller]] – Nintendo Switch\r\n** [[ringcon_controller]]\r\n* [[Microsoft]] ([[Xbox]] brand):\r\n** [[xbox_original_controller]]\r\n** [[xbox_360_controller]]\r\n** [[xbox_wireless_controller]] – Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S\r\n*** [[xbox_elite_wireless_controller]]\r\n* [[Sony]] ([[PlayStation]] brand):\r\n** [[dualshock]]\r\n*** [[dualshock_1]]\r\n*** [[dualshock_2]]\r\n*** [[dualshock_3]]\r\n*** [[dualshock_4]]\r\n*** [[dualsense]] – PlayStation 5\r\n** [[playstation_move]] – PlayStation 3 onward (including PlayStation VR)\r\n* [[Sega]]:\r\n** [[master_system_controller]]\r\n** [[genesis_controller]]\r\n** [[saturn_controller]]\r\n** [[dreamcast_controller]]\r\n* [[Valve]]:\r\n** [[steam_controller]]\r\n\r\nh5. Peripherals\r\n\r\n* [[guitar_controller]] – music/rhythm games\r\n* [[power_glove]] – NES\r\n* [[wii_balance_board]]\r\n* [[wii_u_gamepad]]\r\n* [[kinect]] – Xbox 360 and Xbox One\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[dropping_controller]]\r\n* [[holding_game_controller]]\r\n** [[playing_videogame]]\r\n* [[throwing_controller]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:video_games]]"
