          "crutch": [
            {
              "tag": "crutch",
              "kor": "",
              "count": 178,
              "wiki_body": "thumb #222723 thumb #342146\r\n\r\nA [b]crutch[/b] is a mobility aid that transfers weight from the legs to the upper body. It is often used for people who cannot use their legs to support their weight, for reasons ranging from short-term injuries to lifelong disabilities.\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Crutch\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crutch"
            }
