          "count": 129480,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #614199 thumb #2334254 thumb #854256\r\n\r\nPictures depicting the biceps, a two-headed muscle that lies on the upper arm between the shoulder and the elbow. This muscles can be strengthened using weight and resistance training\r\n\r\nIts function in humans is mostly to serve as a powerful supinator of the forearm (turns the palm upwards) and to serve as an important flexor of the forearm. In the horse, the biceps' function is to extend the shoulder and flex the elbow.\r\n\r\nThe biceps are usually attributed as representative of masculinity within cultures.\r\n\r\nIf the biceps are well developed and visible in a picture then it should be tagged.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. More info:\r\n\r\nWikipedia: \"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Biceps\":http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Biceps\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Muscular Scale\r\n\r\n[table]\r\n[thead]\r\n[tr][th]Not Muscular[/th][th]|[/th][th][b]Muscular[/b] ➡[/th][th][/th][th][/th][/tr]\r\n[/thead]\r\n[tbody]\r\n[tr][td][[athletic]][/td][td]|[/td][td][[big_muscles]][/td][td][[huge_muscles]][/td][td][[hyper_muscles]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td][/td][td]|[/td][td][[musclegut]][/td][td][/td][td][/td][/tr]\r\n[/tbody]\r\n[/table]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n\r\n* [b][[muscular]][/b]\r\n\r\n* [b]Muscles[/b]\r\n** Torso: [[pecs]] / [[abs]] / [[back_muscles]] / [[serratus]] / [[obliques]]\r\n** Arm: biceps / [[triceps]] / [[deltoids]] / [[forearm_muscles]]\r\n** Leg: [[quads]]\r\n** Butt: [[butt_muscles]]\r\n\r\n* [b]Gender specific[/b]\r\n** [[muscular_ambiguous]]\r\n** [[muscular_male]]\r\n** [[muscular_female]]\r\n** [[muscular_intersex]]\r\n*** [[muscular_andromorph]]\r\n*** [[muscular_gynomorph]]\r\n*** [[muscular_herm]]\r\n*** [[muscular_maleherm]]"
