          "wiki_body": "thumb #832209 thumb #2504748 thumb #1768144 thumb #1382472\n\nThis tag is used for when a character in an image or animation is in good shape, but not covered in muscles. In general, it's meant for characters who are obviously somewhat athletic and in shape, but not chiseled or bulky. Can be described as what is traditionally known as a \"swimmer's body.\" \n\n* Not to be confused with [[muscular]], which is for characters with very well-defined, bulky muscles.\n* Also not to be confused with [[athlete]], who are typically either sports players or [[jock|jocks]] that participate in their school's sport activities such as [[football]].\n\nh4. Muscular Scale\n\n[table]\n[thead]\n[tr][th]Not Muscular[/th][th]|[/th][th][[Muscular]] ➡[/th][th][/th][th][/th][/tr]\n[/thead]\n[tbody]\n[tr][td][[athletic]][/td][td]|[/td][td][[big_muscles]][/td][td][[huge_muscles]][/td][td][[hyper_muscles]][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][/td][td]|[/td][td][[musclegut]][/td][td][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\n\nh4.Related Tags:\n* [b]Gender[/b]\n** [[athletic_female]]\n** [[athletic_male]]\n** [[athletic_ambiguous]]\n** [[athletic_intersex]]\n*** [[athletic_andromorph]]\n*** [[athletic_gynomorph]]\n*** [[athletic_herm]]\n*** [[athletic_maleherm]]\n\n* [b]Form[/b]\n** [[athletic_human]]\n** [[athletic_anthro]]\n** [[athletic_feral]]\n** [[athletic_humanoid]]\n** [[athletic_taur]]\n\n* [b]Muscles[/b]\n** Torso: [[pecs]] / [[abs]] / [[back_muscles]] / [[serratus]] / [[obliques]]\n** Arm: [[biceps]] / [[triceps]] / [[deltoids]] / [[forearm_muscles]]\n** Leg: [[quads]]\n\nh4. See also:\n* [[tag_group:figures]]\n\n* Physique:\n** [[v-cut]]\n** [[soft_abs]]\n** [[thick_thighs]]\n\n* Context:\n** [[gym]]\n** [[locker_room]]\n** [[push-up]]\n** [[sport]]\n** [[sports_venue]]\n** [[stadium]]\n** [[swimming_pool]]\n*** [[olympic-size_swimming_pool]]\n** [[weightlifting]]\n\nh4. Tag Projects\n* Correctly label athletic posts mistagged as [[muscular]] or other figures.\n* {{athletic