          "wiki_body": "thumb #776213 thumb #108132 thumb #107512\r\n\r\nA [b]ribbon[/b] is a thin band of flexible material, typically cloth but also plastic or sometimes metal, used primarily for binding and tying. Cloth ribbons, most commonly silk, are often used in connection with clothing, but are also applied for innumerable useful, ornamental and symbolic purposes. Cultures around the world use this device in their hair, around the body, or even as ornamentation on animals, buildings, and other areas. Ribbon is also sometimes used as a package sealer, on par with twine.\r\n\r\nh4. Colors\r\n\r\n[sup](* tag currently unused)[/sup]\r\n\r\n* [[black_ribbon]]\r\n* [[blue_ribbon]]\r\n* [[brown_ribbon]]\r\n* [[green_ribbon]]\r\n* [[grey_ribbon]]\r\n* [[orange_ribbon]]\r\n* [[pink_ribbon]]\r\n* [[purple_ribbon]]\r\n* [[rainbow_ribbon]]*\r\n* [[red_ribbon]]\r\n* [[tan_ribbon]]\r\n* [[white_ribbon]]\r\n* [[yellow_ribbon]]\r\n\r\nh4. Location\r\n\r\n* [[ear_ribbon]]\r\n* [[hair_ribbon]]\r\n* [[hat_ribbon]]\r\n* [[horn_ribbon]]\r\n** [[antler_ribbon]]\r\n* [[leg_ribbon]]\r\n* [[neck_ribbon]]\r\n* [[nipple_ribbon]]\r\n* [[penis_ribbon]]\r\n* [[ribbon_bondage]]\r\n* [[sheath_ribbon]]\r\n* [[tail_ribbon]]\r\n* [[waist_ribbon]]\r\n\r\nh4. Type\r\n\r\n* [[award_ribbon]]\r\n* [[bow_ribbon]]\r\n* [[hat_ribbon]]\r\n\r\nh4. Other\r\n\r\n* [[ribbon_bondage]]\r\n* [[ribbonjob]]\r\n** [[ribbon_insertion]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n[section=Bow tags]\r\n\r\n* [[bow_(feature)]]\r\n** Category\r\n*** [[bow_accessory]]\r\n*** [[clothing_bow|bow_clothing]]\r\n*** [[bow_ribbon]]\r\n*** [[bow_tie]]\r\n** Location\r\n*** [[arm_bow]]\r\n**** [[wrist_bow]]\r\n*** [[ear_bow]]\r\n*** [[hair_bow]]\r\n*** [[horn_bow]]\r\n*** [[leg_bow]]\r\n**** [[ankle_bow]]\r\n**** [[thigh_bow]]\r\n*** [[neck_bow]]\r\n*** [[nipple_bow]]\r\n*** [[penis_bow]]\r\n*** [[sheath_bow]]\r\n*** [[tail_bow]]\r\n*** [[waist_bow]]\r\n\r\n[/section]"
