          "wiki_body": "thumb #2871764 thumb #2188973 thumb #2573673 thumb #2089512 thumb #2889609\r\n\r\n[b]Short stack[/b], at least tag wise, describes a female character (or female-bodied [[intersex]]), with a short, squat body, [[thick thighs]] and [[wide hips]]. Short stacks will often have [[big breasts]], a [[big butt]], a [[big head]], and may also be [[slightly chubby]] or [[overweight]]. While small in stature, and drawn to look \"cute\", short stacks are intended to be adult characters.\r\n\r\n[b]Note:[/b] Short stacks differ from characters who are merely \"[[short]]\" by their proportions, figure, and generally large assets (being short [i]and[/i] \"stacked\") - [i]short characters [b]should not[/b] be tagged as short stacks.[/i] \r\n\r\n[i]For the male equivalent, see [b][[teapot (body type)]][/b][/i]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[short]]\r\n* [[voluptuous]]\r\n* [[chibi]]\r\n* [[height chart]]\r\n* [[dwarfism]]"
