          "count": 42110,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #5436422 thumb #4694367 thumb #4916439\n\n[b]Musk[/b] refers to a character's body scent, typically in a state of [[arousal]].\n\nMusk as a trigger of arousal is generally associated with [[pheromones]]. Musk may also appear as a by-product of an intense activity, such as [[exercise]] or [[sex]], this is often paired with [[sweat]].\n\nh4. Musk by Location\n\n* [[musky_body]] — General tag when the entire body is musky\n** [[musky_armpit]]\n** [[musky_breasts]]\n** [[musky_butt]]\n*** [[musky_anus]]\n** [[musky_crotch]]\n** [[musky_feet]]\n** [[musky_genitalia]]*\n*** [[musky_balls]]\n*** [[musky_penis]]\n*** [[musky_pussy]]\n** [[musky_knot]]\n** [[musky_paws]]\n** [[musky_perineum]]\n** [[musky_sheath]]\n\n* [b]Clothing[/b] — Typically seen when musk sticks onto it\n** [[musky_shoes]]\n** [[musky_underwear]]\n*** [[musky_jockstrap]]\n*** [[musky_panties]]\n\nh4. Other Musk Tags\n* [[excessive_musk]]\n* [[musk_clouds]] - Common depiction of musk\n* [[musky_cum]]\n* [[musk_drunk]]\n* [[musk_hypnosis]]\n* [[musk_mask]]\n* [[sniffing]]\n** [[musk_sniffing]]\n* [[musk_worship]]\n\nh4. See also\n* [[scentplay]]\n* [[smelly]]\n** [[stink_lines]]\n* [[steam]]\n* [[sweat]]"
