          "tag": "question_mark",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 41395,
          "wiki_body": "Use this tag when there is a \"?\" somewhere in the image, and it is used by itself as a response indicator, part of [[pictographics]], or other decorative purpose. If it is used following a question, consider tagging [[question]] instead.\r\n\r\nIf it is present in the form \"?!\", the [[?!]] tag should be prioritized.\r\n\r\nQuestion mark responses are used to show that a character is trying to understand something in the scene, to indicate that they don't understand something, to indicate that they are confused / disorientated, or as a placeholder for a generic question (\"What is this?\", \"Who are you?\", \"What is happening?\", etc). \r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[?_block]]\r\n* [[questioning_ellipsis]] (...?)\r\n* [[questioning_heart]]\r\n\r\n[section=How to tag: Punctuation]\r\n\r\nPunctuation is tagged differently based on whether it is used by itself, with [[text]], with [[symbol|symbols]], or [[pictographics]].\r\n\r\nh4. Punctuation forms\r\n\r\n[i]Treat interrobangs as distinct from their component punctuation.[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[ellipsis]] (...)\r\n** [[emphatic_ellipsis]] (...!)\r\n** [[interrobang_ellipsis]]] (...?!, ...!?)\r\n** [[questioning_ellipsis]] (...?)\r\n** [[vertical_ellipsis]]\r\n* [[exclamation_point]] (!)\r\n* [[?!|interrobang]] (?!, !?)\r\n* [[question_mark]] (?)\r\n\r\nh4. By itself\r\n\r\n- Use the appropriate punctuation tag.\r\n- Do not tag [[question]], or [[exclamation]].\r\n\r\nh4. With text\r\n\r\n[i]Ellipses forms are tagged both with text, as well as without.[/i]\r\n\r\n[table]\r\n[thead][tr][th]Contains punctuation[/th][th] Tags to use[/th][th]Comments[/th][/tr][/thead]\r\n[tbody]\r\n\r\n[tr][td] ? [/td][td] [[asking]], [[question]],  [[questioning_tone]] (sometimes) [/td][td]Do not tag as [[question_mark]].[/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] ! [/td][td]  [[exclamation]] For [[sound effects]], use [[emphatic_sound_effects]] instead. [/td][td]Do not tag as [[exclamation_point]].[/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] !? (?!) [/td][td]  [[interrobang_exclamation]] [/td][td]Tag the same way as a question mark with text.[/td][/tr]\r\n\r\n[/tbody]\r\n[/table]\r\n\r\nh4. Pictographics\r\n\r\n\r\n[table]\r\n[thead][tr][th]Punctuation form[/th][th] Tags to use[/th][/tr][/thead]\r\n[tbody]\r\n\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + ? [/td][td] [[question_mark]], also [[asking]], [[questioning_tone]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + ! [/td][td] [[exclamation_point]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + !? (?!) [/td][td] [[!?]], [[asking]], [[questioning_tone]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + ... [/td][td] [[ellipsis]] Optional: [[vertical_ellipsis]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + ...? [/td][td] [[questioning_ellipsis]], [[asking]], [[questioning_tone]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + ...! [/td][td] [[emphatic_ellipsis]], [[exclamation_point]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[pictographics]] + ...!? (...?!) [/td][td] [[interrobang_ellipsis]], [[asking]], [[questioning_tone]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + ? [/td][td] [[asking]], [[questioning_heart]], [[question_mark]], [[questioning_tone]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + ! [/td][td] [[emphatic_heart]], [[exclamation_point]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + !? (?!) [/td][td] [[!?]], [[asking]], [[emphatic_heart]], [[questioning_heart]], [[questioning_tone]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + ... [/td][td] [[ellipsis]] Optional: [[vertical_ellipsis]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + ...? [/td][td] [[questioning_ellipsis]], [[asking]], [[questioning_heart]], [[questioning_tone]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + ...! [/td][td] [[emphatic_ellipsis]], [[emphatic_heart]], [[exclamation_point]] [/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td] [[<3]] + ...!? (...?!) [/td][td] [[interrobang_ellipsis]], [[asking]], [[emphatic_heart]], [[questioning_heart]], [[questioning_tone]] [/td][/tr]\r\n\r\n[/tbody]\r\n[/table]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[exclamation_point]] (!)\r\n* [[?!|interrobang]] (?!)"
