          "wiki_body": "A character that has more [[limbs]] than are normal (standards) to its natural species. [[Taurs]] are affected by the assigned species of their lower body and upper body.\n\n[b]Some common leg and arm number standards:[/b]\n[ltable]species group | leg number | arm number\nhuman/humanoid/anthro | 2 | 2\nmost non-primate mammals and amphibians | 4 | -\nreptiles | 2 or 4 depending on species | 2 depending on species\ndragons | 4 | 2 as wings(western cultures, rarely present in eastern cultures)\nwyverns /drakes | 2 | 2 as wings\ninsects | 6 | -\narachnids | 8 | -\nbirds | 2 | 2 as wings\ncentaur | 4 | 2 on upper half\ncentipede/millipede | 30+ | -[/ltable]\n\n[b]* This tag is generally applied automatically by implication, do not tag manually. Use the listed \"Related\" tags below instead.[/b]\n\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[multi_leg]] / [[multi_arm]] / [[multi_wing]] / [[multi_tail]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n[section=General Multi]\n* [[multi_arm]]\n* [[multi_body]]\n* [[multi_breast]]\n* [[multi_ear]]\n* [[multi_eye]]\n* [[multi_face]]\n* [[multi_head]]\n* [[multi_horn]]\n* [[multi_leg]]\n* [b]multi_limb[/b]\n* [[multi_mouth]]\n* [[multi_navel]]\n* [[multi_nostril]]\n* [[multi_pecs]]\n* [[multi_pupil]]\n* [[multi_snout]]\n* [[multi_tail]]\n* [[multi_teeth]]\n* [[multi_tongue]]\n* [[multi_wing]]\n\n[/section]\n\n[section=Explicit Multi]\n* [[multi_anus]]\n* [[multi_balls]]\n* [[multi_cervix]]\n* [[multi_clitoris]]\n* [[multi_knot]]\n* [[multi_medial_ring]]\n* [[multi_nipple]]\n* [[multi_penis]]\n* [[multi_perineum]]\n* [[multi_sheath]]\n* [[multi_teat]]\n* [[multi_udder]]\n* [[multi_urethra]]\n* [[multi_uterus]]\n* [[multi_vulva]]\n\n[/section]\n\n[section=Other Multi related]\n* [[multi_taur]]\n* [[long_taur]]\n* [[forked_tail]]\n* [[forked_penis]]\n* [[forked_arm]]\n\n[/section]"
