          "count": 22432,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3712646 thumb #3594502 thumb #3620560 thumb #3592095 thumb #3435009 thumb #3534700 thumb #3426055\n\nA situation where a character makes it clear that they have a desire for intimacy with another character, or the viewer, either through [[gesture|gesturing]], body language, or other actions. This may involve a friendly [[beckoning]] for a variety of intimate activities, be it having [[sex]], or asking for a hug or cuddle.\n\nIn an inviting situation, a character attempts to appear enticing, but not to the point that they are already engaging in intimate activity. The recipient is thus provided the opportunity to choose whether or not to take advantage of the situation.\n\nOften less blatant than [[presenting]], but can be combined with it.\n\nh4. Common themes\n\n- Provocative poses that provide easy access to a character's genitals. [[Presenting]] is a common support theme.\n- Provocative expressions, and other acts of [[seductive|seduction]].\n- Expressing an interest to have intimate activity with someone, especially [[offering_sex|offers for sex]].\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[inviting_to_sex]]\n* [[inviting_under_covers]]\n* [[another_round]]\n* [[beckoning]]\n* [[begging]]\n* [[coy]]\n* [[dirty_talk]]\n* [[lewd_symbolism]]\n* [[offering_sex]]\n* [[oral_invitation]]\n* [[pinup]]\n* [[presenting]]\n* [[seductive]]\n* [[take_your_pick]]"
