          "kor": "",
          "count": 20260,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1391357 thumb #1391342 thumb #880077 thumb #754579 thumb #1603077 thumb #3299284\r\n\r\n[b]Exhibitionism[/b] is behavior by a person that involves the exposure of private parts of their body to another person in a situation when they would not normally be exposed, with the implication that the person exposing him or herself is being aroused by their actions. \r\n\r\nAs a tag on e621, it refers to images or animations of characters deliberately engaging in sexual activities in view of at least one other character. This can range from a [[male|man]] [[masturbation|masturbating]] in front of a webcam for his girlfriend, to a man who likes to have sex with other men in front of his willing husband, or to a group of people having an impromptu [[orgy]] in a public park, in full view of all the strangers wandering through. \r\n\r\nNote that if the character(s) watching the sexual act are doing so in order to become aroused themselves, the [[voyeur]] tag also applies. If they're watching without being aroused, [[being watched]] applies.\r\n\r\n\"Wikipedia Source\":http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exhibitionism\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n\r\n[section=Exhibitionism Related Tags]\r\n* [[audience]]/[[crowd]]\r\n* [[being_watched]]\r\n* [[cuckold]]/[[cuckquean]]\r\n* [[enhibitionism]]\r\n* [b]exhibitionism[/b]\r\n* [[flashing]]\r\n* [[hiding]]\r\n* [[mooning]]\r\n* [[public]]\r\n** [[public_exposure]]\r\n** [[public_masturbation]]\r\n** [[public_nudity]]\r\n** [[public_sex]]\r\n* [[stealth_masturbation]]\r\n* [[stealth_sex]]\r\n* [[streaking]]\r\n* [[voyeur]]\r\n* [[walk-in]]\r\n[/section]"
