          "count": 16159,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3766177 thumb #2361535 thumb #2933404 thumb #2605427 \r\n\r\n[b]\"Happy trail\"[/b] is an informal name for [[body hair]] that extends up from the [[pubes|pubic hair]] vertically through the middle of the lower abdomen, usually reaching around the bottom of the [[navel]]. If a character has [[chest hair]], the \"happy trail\" may connect it to the pubes.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\n\r\nh6. [i]This tag should [i]only[/i] be used if...[/i]\r\n\r\n* The body hair extends above the pubic area and reaches up to, or comes close to, the navel. \r\n* The hair/fur is distinct in thickness, texture, and/or colour from the character's fur, for a character with a tuft of fur on the lower abdomen use [[belly tuft]]\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\nh5. Tagging Notes\r\n\r\n* For [[anthro]] characters who are covered in fur, body hair (including the happy trail), will be of a darker colour than their fur (it may even be assumed to just be darker, thicker fur)\r\n** Less commonly, it may be represented as an especially thick patch of fur matching the colour of the surrounding fur (see example 2 above)\r\n* Body hair, including the happy trail, may be represented as individually drawn hairs, this is more common for characters without fur (e.g. [[human|humans]], [[humanoid|humanoids]], [[scalie|scalies]]), but may be seen on furries as well (see example 3 above)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n\r\n* [[body hair]]\r\n** [[pubes]]\r\n** [[chest hair]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[tuft]]\r\n** [[belly tuft]]\r\n** [[chest tuft]]\r\n** [[crotch tuft]]"
