          "count": 13457,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1775566 thumb #433873 thumb #457044\n\n[b]Groping[/b] is the sexualized rubbing, feeling, or grabbing of another character's body in a sexually invasive or [[domination|dominating]] way. Unwanted groping is a form of [[sexual assault]].\n\nGroping differs from [[fondling]] in that it applies to more firm actions such as grabbing that involves [[squeezing]] a body part in a sexualized way. These actions commonly show parted or [[spread fingers]] as artists will try to portray the touching across as wide of a surface area as possible. This contrasts with most acts of fondling which will keep the fingers mostly together to instill the feeling of a softer, more tender interaction.\n\nGroping may involve [[fondling]], but usually should not be tagged together unless the scene enters the [[questionable consent]] territory.\n\nGroping commonly involves the crotch, [[balls]], [[breasts]], and [[butt]].\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[grabbing]]\n** [[ball_grab]]\n** [[breast_grab]]\n** [[butt_grab]]\n** [[grabbing_from_behind]]\n** [[pec_grab]]\n* [[groping_from_behind]] (Not always grabbing)\n* [[hand_under_clothing]]\n* [[self_grope]] - For actions done to one's self that resemble groping. For now it should not overlap with or be confused with [[self_fondle]].\n* [[sexual_assault]]\n* [[squeezing]]\n** [[ball_squeeze]]\n** [[breast_squeeze]]\n\n[section=Editor's notes]\nThis tag is likely to undergo further changes as the definition is refined, and further separated from fondling.\n[/section]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[tag_group:touching]]\n\n* [[fondling]]\n** [[ball_fondling]]\n** [[breast_fondling]]"
