on requests[/i]\r\n** [[masturbation request]] - a character requesting another to masturbate for them\r\n** [[rimming request]] - a character requesting to have their anus orally stimulated\r\n\r\n* [b]Insults/Swearing[/b]\r\n** [[insult]] - a character demeaning their partner, usually with words like \"slut\", \"freak\", \"bitch\", \"pervert\", \"pathetic\", or \"loser\"; may be done playfully, to imply the speaker is [[dominant]], or the character is being [[tsundere]]\r\n*** [[insulting viewer]] \r\n** [[taunting]] - usually paired with insults, a character provoking another, while also seducing their target \r\n** [[profanity]] - usually used to underline a dirty statement or describe anatomy, \"fuck\" \"asshole\" \"cunt\" etc.\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[dialogue]]\r\n** [[talking to viewer]]\r\n** [[talking to another]]\r\n* [[porn dialogue]] - especially corny, badly written, or \"over-written\" dirty talk, avoid using this tag unless very obviously warranted or intentionally bad\r\n* [[innuendo]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[suggestive]]\r\n** [[suggestive gesture]]\r\n** [[suggestive shirt]]\r\n\r\n"
