          "wiki_body": "An umbrella tag for sounds produced through natural bodily functions, or from the interaction of fluids inside of the body. This does not include [[breathing]], or [[swallowing]].\r\n\r\nTry to remember to add the [[sound_effects]] tag when it is applicable. This tag could refer to audible content. \r\n\r\nh4. Bodily functions\r\n\r\n* [[Burping]]\r\n* [[Digestion]], and [[rumbling_stomach|stomach noises]]\r\n* [[fart|Farting]]\r\n* [[slosh|Sloshing]] body parts\r\n* [[Vomit]], and [[pooping|defecation]] noises\r\n\r\nh4. Sound effect presentation tags\r\n\r\nSound effects are depicted in a variety of ways. These tags represent some of the ways they get depicted.\r\n\r\n* [[sound_effect_variant]]\r\n** [[extended_sound_effect]]\r\n** [[shortened_sound_effect]]\r\n* [[text]]\r\n** [[distorted_text]]\r\n** [[perspective_text]]\r\n** [[stylized_text]]\r\n** [[text_with_emanata]]\r\n** [[warped_text]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[breathing_noises]] - Huffs and puffs\r\n* [[swallowing_sound_effect]]"
