          "wiki_body": "thumb #3098178 thumb #2236254 thumb #2028838 thumb #3125165\r\n\r\nA fleshy protrusion from the soft palate in the back of the mouth above the opening to the throat. \r\n\r\nUvulas are most prominent in images depicting a [[mouth shot]] (especially if the character's mouth is [[gaping mouth|wide open]]), the [[inside mouth|inside of a character's mouth]], or an [[internal oral|internal shot of a character engaging in oral sex]]. \r\n\r\nUvula may be tagged even if it's not the focus of an image, or particularly prominent, but where the character's mouth is still drawn wide enough to show it. Outside of a character [[presenting mouth|presenting their mouth]], the uvula may be most visible when a character is yawning, yelling, laughing, or burping. \r\n\r\nh4. Uvula Tags\r\n\r\n* [[holding uvula]]\r\n* [[penis pushing uvula]]\r\n* [[swinging uvula]]\r\n* [[uvula on head]]\r\n* [[uvula piercing]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n\r\n* [[detailed mouth]]\r\n* [[mouth shot]]\r\n** [[reverse mouth shot]]\r\n* [[gaping mouth]]\r\n* [[internal oral]]\r\n* [[presenting mouth]]\r\n* [[inside mouth]]"
