          "wiki_body": "thumb #558534\r\n\r\nA hole in a wall or divider (such as in a [[restroom stall]] inside a [[public restroom]]) typically large enough to fit a [[penis]]. Characters on either side of the barrier can engage in [[oral]] and [[penetration|penetrative]] sex through the hole, all while remaining anonymous. However, some characters just prefer to use the hole to take a peek at others.\r\n\r\nThe room behind a glory hole may be very open, while the characters there may or may not be bound in position. When the room is small enough, at some point it (also) becomes a [[sex_box]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[glory_balls]]\r\n* [[through_wall]]\r\n** [[kabeshiri]]\r\n** [[reverse_kabeshiri]]"
