          "wiki_body": "Sounds, or [[sound effects]] related to the [[digestion|digestive]] process. Gurgles, and groans are the most typical sound effects. These are usually localized around the [[belly]], but they sometimes appear in other places.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Examples]\r\n\r\nh4. Stomach digestion\r\n\r\n* [[rumbling_stomach]]\r\n\r\nthumb #3480544 thumb #3371940 thumb #3212562\r\n\r\nh4. Other\r\n\r\nthumb #3046441 thumb #2422566 thumb #1601649\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[digestion]] - These noises typically suggest digestion is happening.\r\n* [[rumbling_stomach]] - The catchall tag for most stomach noises, usually refers to digestion, but may also refer to [[hungry|hunger]], or [[upset_stomach|stomach issues]].\r\n\r\nh4. Sound effects\r\n\r\nThese sound effects are highly associated with digestion. Please do not tag burping, or farting sound effects as `digestion_noises`.\r\n\r\n* \"[[Blorp]]\"\r\n* \"[[Churn]]\"\r\n* \"Digest\" / \"Melt\"\r\n* \"[[Glorp]]\"\r\n* \"Groan\" ([[rumbling_stomach]], [[bodily_groan]]) - This will either refer to digestion, inflation, or [[upset stomach]].  \r\n* \"Gurgle\" ([[gurgling_balls]])\r\n* \"[[sizzling|Sizzle]]\"\r\n* \"[[Slosh]]\"\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:sound_effects]]\r\n\r\n* [[bodily_noises]]\r\n** [[burping]]\r\n** [b]digestion_noises[/b]"
