          "wiki_body": "An [b]Alternate Universe[/b], or [b]AU[/b] for short, is alternate take on an established canon, changing one or more elements in many possible ways to put a new twist on the story. Typically refers to established fan universes rather than one-off ideas, though not always. There are many types of AUs.\n\nFanfiction is not inherently an \"AU\" under the definition commonly used. One-off [[crossover]] images are not necessarily AUs either, nor are [[crossgender]] or [[alternate species]] depictions on their own.\n\n[section,expanded=Common AU Genres]\n\nh5. \"What if\" AUs\nthumb #4782434 thumb #1613944\n\nAUs based around the artist's idea of what would happen if a story event happened differently than in canon.\n\nh5. Fusion AUs\nthumb #783082 thumb #4732262\n\nAUs in which characters from one setting are transplanted into another. May involve a [[alternate_species|species swap]]. Common canons used for these include [[My Little Pony]], [[warriors_(book_series)|Warriors]], and [[Pokemon]], among others. They may also involve characters being placed into the roles of characters from another series.\n\nh5. Animal AUs\nthumb #4224362 thumb #4368053\n\nParticularly relevant to this site - AUs that reimagine characters as animals.\n\nh5. Roleswaps\nthumb #4694345 thumb #3395168\n\nAUs that swap character roles or personalities with each other. Similarly related are \"opposite\" or \"2P\" AUs, which give characters the opposite personality of their usual one.\n\nh5. Setting changes\nthumb #4598286 thumb #1862498\n\nAUs that change the setting of a story, such as putting characters into a fantasy or modern setting.\n\nh5. \"Next gen\" AUs\nthumb #1541175 thumb #2202201\n\nAUs focusing on the children of canon characters, usually characters that the artist ships together.\n\nh5. Canon AUs\nthumb #3398807\n\nSometimes, the source material itself will present potential alternate universe scenarios, which fans expand upon.\n[/section]\n\n\n\n\nThe following are Alternate Universes with their own tags (Most of them are [i][[Undertale]][/i]).\n[section,expanded=Alternate Universe Tags]\n\nh4. [i][[The Amazing Digital Circus]][/i]\n* [[The Amazing Digital Fight Club]] (fusion with [i][[Fight Club]][/i])\n\nh4. [i][[fallout_(series)|Fallout]][/i]\n* [[fallout_equestria|Fallout: Equestria]] (fusion with [i][[Friendship is Magic]][/i])\n\nh4. [i][[Fight Club]][/i]\n* [[The Amazing Digital Fight Club]] (fusion with [i][[The Amazing Digital Circus]][/i])\n\nh4. [i][[Five Nights at Freddy's]][/i]\n* [[Fredbear College]]\n* [[Fredina's Nightclub]]\n\nh4. [i][[My Little Pony]][/i]\nh6. [i][[Friendship is Magic]][/i]\n* [[Cupcakes (MLP fanfic)]]\n* \"The Cutie Re-Mark\" (Season 5 Episodes 25 & 26)\n** [[Chrysalis Resistance Timeline]]\n** [[Crystal War Timeline]]\n** [[Nightmare Takeover Timeline]]\n* [[fallout_equestria|Fallout: Equestria]] (fusion with [i][[fallout_(series)|Fallout]][/i])\n* [[Rainbow Factory (MLP fanfic)]]\n\nh4. [i][[Pizza Tower]][/i]\n* [[Sugary Spire]]\n\nh4. [i][[pokemon|Pokémon]][/i]\n* [[poketale|Pokétale]] (fusion with [i][[Undertale]][/i])\n\nh4. [i][[sonic_the_hedgehog_(series)|Sonic the Hedgehog]][/i]\n* [[AGES AU]]\n* [[Idol Amy! AU]]\n* [[IRSTAS AU]]\n\nh4. [i][[undertale_(series)|Undertale]][/i]\nh6. [i][[Deltarune]][/i]\n* [[Deltafell]]\n* [[Deltaswap]]\nh6. [i][[Undertale]][/i]\n* [[Altertale]]\n* [[Angeltale]]\n* [[Apocalypse AU (Undertale)]]\n* [[Dancetale]]\n* [[Dreemurr Reborn]]\n* [[ERRORtale]]\n* [[Fairytale (Undertale)]]\n* [[Fantasytale]]\n* [[GZtale]]\n* [[Handplates (Undertale)]]\n* [[Heaventale]]\n* [[Horrortale]]\n* [[Humantale]]\n* [[Joseontale]]\n* [[Katanatale]]\n* [[Littletale]]\n* [[Negatale]]\n* [[Oceantale]]\n* [[Outertale]]\n* [[poketale|Pokétale]] (fusion with [i][[pokemon|Pokémon]][/i])\n* [[Reapertale]]\n* [[Storyshift]]\n* [[Under(Her)Tail]]\n* [[Underfell]]\n** [[Swapfell]] (fusion with [[Underswap]])\n* [[Underkeep]]\n* [[Undermafia]]\n* [[Underswap]]\n** [[Swapfell