          "wiki_body": "thumb #2268124 thumb #1955701 thumb #2724848 thumb #1516975\r\n\r\nA character that is shown willingly consumed by another, or expresses willingness to be eaten. \r\n\r\n[quote][b]NOTE: [/b]This should [b]not [/b]be tagged if there is no clear indication through expression, dialogue, or body language, that the prey is willing - \"([i]tag what you see, not what you know)[/i]\":https://e621.net/help/tags [/quote]\r\n\r\n[section=Examples of \"Willing Prey\"]\r\n\r\nh6. A character willingly wanting to be consumed can be shown in many ways, such as...\r\n\r\n* The prey expresses excitement about being eaten, asks to be eaten, offers themselves, or actively encourages the pred to consume them\r\n** This includes [[prey pov]] where the pred is [[talking to viewer]], and reacting to the viewer's explicit or implicit willingness to be eaten by them\r\n\r\n* [b][i]If the prey is visible[/i], either before being consumed or through an [[internal]], they may:[/b]\r\n** Be shown as excited or happy, appear to be comfortable, they may be blushing or smiling\r\n*** Willing prey may have [[<3_eyes|heart shaped eyes or pupils]], or [[<3|hearts emanating from them]]\r\n** Show sexual arousal, [[looking pleasured]], possibly with a [[pussy juice|wet pussy]], or [[erection]]\r\n** Be shown [[masturbation|masturbating]] — see: [[masturbating prey]]\r\n** [[Multiple prey]] may be shown lining up, willingly feeding themselves to a character\r\n** Rarely, willing prey characters may be shown forcing themselves into an [[unwilling pred]]\r\n\r\n* [b][i]If the prey is not visible[/i], willingness can be implied by:[/b]\r\n** Dialogue that implies or explicitly states that the prey was consumed willingly (with no visible struggling or other evidence to imply otherwise)\r\n** [[<3|Hearts]], smiley faces, or other pictographs shown emanating from the predator's body after consuming the prey\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[masturbating prey]]\r\n\r\nh4. See