          "count": 4430,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1901951 thumb #2892089 thumb #2258786  thumb #2423728  thumb #2823054\r\n\r\n[b]Twerking[/b] is a style of sexually provocative [[dancing]] where the dancer [[thrusting|thrusts]], gyrates and jerks their hips to make their butt cheeks jiggle, bounce and collide. The dance often leads to the butt cheeks slapping together, resulting in an [[ass clapping|audible \"clapping\" sound]], and causes the [[butt jiggle|butt to jiggle]].\r\n\r\nThis dance is most often performed while in a [[crouching]] pose, with the butt stuck out; but twerking can also be performed while [[bent over]], on [[all fours]], [[ass up]], doing [[splits]], or even [[upside down]], while braced against a wall. Twerking is typically associated with dance music, strip clubs, and particularly with hip hop/rap culture, where the style originated. Twerking can also be done while performing a [[lapdance]] or as [[foreplay]]. \r\n\r\n[quote]\r\n\r\nh5. Tagging Notes:\r\n\r\n[b]Twerking is often overtagged[/b], a character [[shaking butt|shaking their butt]], or [[bouncing_butt|bouncing their butt]] [b][i]is not necessarily twerking[/i][/b], however, an animation may show a character shaking their butt while twerking, and twerking often involves the butt bouncing.\r\n\r\n* [b][[shaking butt]][/b] - a character moving their hips side to side, and/or wiggling their butt, to taunt or seduce; while twerking can sometimes involve a character shaking their butt (as described by the [i]shaking butt[/i] tag), shaking butt is not inherently twerking\r\n* [b][[bouncing butt]][/b] - can be a part of twerking, but isn't twerking itself\r\n\r\nTry to only tag twerking on characters clearly in a dance context or taking up a \"twerking stance\", with butt cheeks that appear to be wobbling and shaking (or are implied to be doing so) in still images. Do not tag twerking on images of a character whose buttocks are merely [[butt jiggle|jiggling]] with \"twerk\" added as a sound effect.\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\n[section= Animated Examples]\r\nMany twerking images are animated, here are examples of different motions that can fall under this tag\r\n \r\nthumb #2561702 thumb #3150841 thumb #3074424 thumb #795217\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[Ass Clapping]]\r\n* [[Butt Jiggle]] \r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Dancing]]\r\n* [[Butt]]\r\n** [[Shaking Butt]]\r\n** [[Bouncing Butt]]\r\n\r\n"
