          "tag": "crush",
          "kor": "크러쉬",
          "count": 4246,
          "wiki_body": "[b]Crush[/b] describes a scenario where a character or an object has a compressing force acted upon them by a heavy and/or large character or object. A character stepping on an empty can, forcefully sitting on another, or having a falling piano dropped on them are all examples of \"crush\".\r\n\r\nThe results of a character being crushed may vary - in many cases, if being crushed under another, they may be shown in [[pain]], or [[uncomfortable]], or at least [[pinned]] by the weight of that other character, but otherwise fine. Being crushed may cause the character to be [[flattened]] in a [[cartoon_physics|cartoonish manner]], or alternatively, have them sustain realistic [[wounded|injuries]], sometimes [[grotesque_death|graphic, and fatal ones]].\r\n\r\nIn fetish terms, crush involves a character using parts of their body to crush others, or objects. \r\n\r\n[section= Not to be confused with...]\r\n\r\nh6. Also called \"crush\"\r\n\r\n* [[infatuation]], sometimes informally called \"a crush\"\r\n* [[crush_(spyro)]] a character from [[spyro the dragon]]\r\n\r\n___________________________________________________\r\n\r\nh6. Similar concepts\r\n\r\n* [[coiling]] - when a character is tightly wrapped up in a tail, or the body of a snake, naga, or lamia, a character may be crushed while coiled\r\n* [[smothering]] - visually similar to crushing, but focus is on the character being suffocated or engulfed by the body part they're smothered by, rather than being crushed\r\n* [[squish]] - body parts deforming under pressure, such as [[breast squish]] or [[ball squish]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Sound effects\r\n\r\n[b]Forms:[/b] \"Crush\", \"Crunch\" (usually), \"Mangle\"\r\n\r\n[i]Common sound effects that appear during crush themes.[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[compression_sound_effect]]\r\n** [[smoosh_(sound_effect)]]\r\n* [[cracking]]\r\n* [[crushing_sound_effect]] - Use whenever a crushing sound form is present. Sometimes \"Squish\" will qualify, if the crushing theme is well established in the scene.\r\n** [[crunch]]\r\n* [[slam]]\r\n\r\nh4. Tag formats\r\n\r\n* `*_crush` - This format defines what is doing the crushing.\r\n* `crushing_*`, `_crushing` - These formats define the process of crushing something, although using the past tense format is preferred.\r\n* `crushed_*` - This format defines what is being / is crushed.\r\n\r\nh4. Crushing by Body Part\r\n[i]These tags specify what body part is being used to crush something or someone[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[breast_crush]] \r\n* [[belly_crush]]\r\n* [[butt_crush]]\r\n* [[foot_crush]]\r\n* genital crush\r\n** [[ball_crush]]\r\n** [[penis_crush]]\r\n* [[hand_crush]]\r\n* orifice crush\r\n** [[anal_crush]]\r\n** [[oral_crush]]\r\n** [[vaginal_crush]]\r\n* [[thigh_crush]] \r\n\r\nh4. Subject to Crushing\r\n[i]Tags describing specific objects or body parts being crushed[/i]\r\n\r\n* [[crushed_object]]\r\n** [[crushed_can]]\r\n** [[crushed_vehicle]]\r\n* [[crushed_head]]\r\n* [[crushed_pelvis]]\r\n* [[crushed_penis]]\r\n* crushing gourd\r\n** [[pumpkin_crushing]]\r\n** [[watermelon_crushing]]\r\n* [[crushing_object]]\r\n\r\nh4. Results of Crushing\r\n\r\nh6. Effects on Characters\r\n\r\n* [[death]]\r\n** [[killing]]\r\n** [[crushed_head]]\r\n* [[flattened]]\r\n* [[sadism]]\r\n* [[stuck_to_butt]]\r\n* [[wounded]]\r\n** [[bruised]]\r\n** [[broken_bone]]\r\n** [[blood]]\r\n** [[gore]]\r\n** [[crushed_pelvis]]\r\n\r\nh6. Effects on Objects\r\n\r\n* [[crater]]\r\n* [[cracks]]\r\n* [[crushed_can]]\r\n* [[crushed_vehicle]]\r\n* [[damaged_building]]\r\n* [[damaged_wall]]\r\n** [[cracked_wall]]\r\n* [[destruction]]\r\n** [[building_destruction]]\r\n** [[city_destruction]]\r\n** [[planet_destruction]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[crushing_embrace]]\r\n** [[crushing_hug]]\r\n* [[imminent_crush]]\r\n* [[smothering]]\r\n* [[stomping]]\r\n* [[trampling]]\r\n* [[malleable_body]]"
