          "tag": "slosh",
          "kor": "슬로시",
          "count": 3332,
          "wiki_body": "[b]Slosh[/b] describes a sound - audible in animation or written on still images or soundless animations as a [[sound effect]] or [[onomatopoeia]] - to imply a liquid moving (sloshing) within a container, or more often on this site, within the confines of a character's body.\r\n\r\n[section=Sound effect forms]\r\n\r\nh5. Base forms and derivations\r\n\r\n* \"Slosh\", \"Slish\", \"Slush\", \"Shlosh\", \"Sloosh\", \"Slsh\" \r\n\r\nh5. Derived slosh concepts\r\n\r\nSlosh has several taggable derived forms. All of these tags should be used alongside the `slosh` tag.\r\n\r\n* [[blorsh]] - \"Bloorsh\", \"Blursh\", \"Bwrrsh\", \"Blrsh\", \"Blosh\"\r\n* [[glorsh]] - \"Gloorsh\", \"Glursh\", \"Gwrrsh\", \"Glrsh\"\r\n* [[slorsh]] - \"Sloorsh\", \"Slursh\", \"Slrsh\"\r\n\r\nh5. Similar sound effects\r\n\r\n* [[glush]] - \"Glosh\", Gloosh\" (This might be a \"Slosh\" derivation).\r\n* \"Splosh\", \"Sploosh\" belong to \"[[Splash]]\". \"Splosh\" may be a [[portmanteau]] of \"Slosh\", and \"Splash\".\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Body sloshing\r\n\r\nOne of the most common - and the most realistic - bodily sloshing involves a character's belly sloshing, typically caused by a character's [[stomach]] being filled with a large amount of ingested fluids (or fluid semi-solid substances). This can be seen in liquid [[inflation]], [[stuffing]], [[cum inflation]], or [[vore]] (especially [[after vore]]). Belly sloshing can also cover sloshing from an [[excessive cum|excessively filled]] rectum/uterus.\r\n\r\nSloshing of the balls and breasts, while physically impossible, is often used to underline the amount of [[cum]] or [[milk]] contained within them, or simply done to emphasize the size and weight of them. \r\n\r\nSloshing can accompany [[expansion]] in general, regardless of body part, or cause, if any is given. \r\n\r\nh4. Sloshing tags\r\n\r\nh5. Anatomy\r\n\r\n* [[Sloshing Balls]]\r\n* [[Sloshing Belly]]\r\n* [[Sloshing Breasts]]\r\n* [[Sloshing Butt]]\r\n\r\nh5. Other\r\n\r\n* [[Sloshing Condom]]\r\n* [[Sloshing Diaper]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related fetishes\r\n\r\n* [[Inflation]]\r\n** [[Water Inflation]]\r\n** [[Cum Inflation]]\r\n* [[Expansion]]\r\n** [[Belly Expansion]]\r\n** [[Balls Expansion]]\r\n** [[Breast Expansion]]\r\n* [[Stuffing]]\r\n* [[Vore]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[Bloated]]\r\n* [[Sound Effects]]\r\n** [[Onomatopoeia]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:sound_effects]]\r\n\r\n* [[churn]]\r\n* [[splash]]"
