          "tag": "stuffing",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 3320,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4556959 thumb #3009908 thumb #4671296 thumb #4839933\r\n\r\n[b]Stuffing[/b] describes a character [[eating]] a large amount of food, to the point that their [[belly]] is [[bloated|bloating]] and/or the character [[weight_gain|gains weight]]. This is often a part of a fetish for overeating and/or belly expansion.\r\nFor the food mixture often placed inside the cavity of another during food preparation, see [[stuffing_(food)]].\r\n\r\nIf the character looks like they are unable to move, tag [[immobile]], not [[immobilization]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[Belly Expansion]] - The process of the belly getting larger, usually the immediate consequence of stuffing\r\n** [[Bloated]] - The temporary state of the belly being full\r\n* [[Belly]]\r\n** [[Big Belly]]\r\n** [[Huge Belly]]\r\n** [[Hyper Belly]]\r\n* [[Eating]]\r\n* [[Food]]\r\n** [[Holding Food]]\r\n* [i]Sounds Related to Stuffing[/i]\r\n** [[Burping]]\r\n** [[Rumbling Stomach]]\r\n** [[Sloshing Belly]]\r\n* [[Vore]] - Stuffing may coincide with vore, [b]if[/b] a character is ingested alongside large quantities of food, or if a [[macro]] character is [[mass vore|shown eating a large amount of smaller characters]].\r\n* [[Weight Gain]]\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[Penetration]] - Does not refer to \"stuffing\" by [[penis]], [[cum_inflation|cum]], [[sex_toy|sex toys]], etc.\r\n* [[Plush Stuffing]] - The intended tag for the fluff that fills [[plushie|plush toys]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Inflation]] - While similar, that tag should be used for liquid or air expanding the belly, rather than excessive eating\r\n* [[Force Feeding]] - in most cases stuffing should refer to the character [i]willingly[/i] eating something.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
