          "count": 2377,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #936505\r\n\r\nA [i]skateboard[/i] is a type of sports equipment used primarily for the activity of [[skateboarding]]. It usually consists of a specially designed maplewood board combined with a polyurethane coating used for making smoother slides and stronger durability. Most skateboards are made with 7 plies of this wood.\r\n\r\nh4. External Links:\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Skateboard\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skateboard\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[holding skateboard]]\r\n* [[longboard]]\r\n** [[holding longboard]]\r\n* [[skate park]]\r\n** [[half-pipe]]\r\n** [[indoor skate park]]\r\n* [[skateboarding]]\r\n** [[skateboard trick]]\r\n*** [[grind (skateboarding)]]\r\n*** [[kickflip]]\r\n* [[skater]]\r\n** [[skateboader]]\r\n* [[tag_group:sports|Tag Group: Sports]][[tag_group:sports#equip| - Equipment]]"
