          "count": 2341,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4620982 thumb #3675882 thumb #2453732\r\n\r\nA [b]poncho[/b] is a loose-fitting outer garment originating from the Americas. They are typically worn to keep warm or to shield the wearer from the rain.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[raincoat]]"
