          "wiki_body": "Nasal mucus, produced in the nose by mucous membranes. The primary purpose of nasal mucus is to protect the body from harmful agents that might enter and infect a person, and to keep the skin inside the nostrils from drying out.\r\n\r\nSnot typically isn't visible, because it doesn't flow out of the nose unless it is irritated, such as by an [[allergic_reaction]], or if the character is [[ill]]. Snot can also be the result of excessive [[crying]]."
        },
        {
          "tag": "runes",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 2273,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1162614 thumb #1986136 thumb #1189042\n\n[b]Runes[/b] are strange symbols for the purpose of [[magic]].\n\nRunes are often carved into [[metal]] or [[stone]]. They may also be found painted onto [[clothing]], [[armor]], or directly onto the skin or fur. Some runes are seen [[glowing]].\n\nThese symbols are typically a writing system. The most well-known, and oldest type of runes were created by the Norse sometime before 150AD. These runes were called [i]Elder Futhark[/i], but there are many other runic alphabets. However, for art purposes, runes may also be 'random squiggles'. \n\nh4. Related Tags:\n* [[nordic_runes]]\n* [[rune_markings]] - Runes appearing on a character's body\n\nh4. See Also:\n* [[tag_group:magic]]\n\n* [[translation_request]] - If the runes seem translatable, i.e. not 'random squiggles'\n** [[translated]]"
        },
        {
          "tag": "horror_(theme)",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 2273,
          "wiki_body": "Unsettling images that provoke fear, uneasiness and dread from the viewer. If a character seems to feel this way but the image as a whole is not creepy to the viewer, then use [[scared]] instead.\n\nThis tag may include common tropes related to the horror genre particularly those related to creating an atmospheric effect. Depictions of body mutilation may apply towards this tag, but in most cases the [[gore]] tag should be used instead.\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n\n* [[body_horror]] - The tag for body parts where they shouldn't be.\n\nh4. Related tags\n\n* [[halloween]]\n* [[monster]]\n* [[nightmare_fuel]]\n* [[scared]]\n** [[scared_shitless]]\n* [[scary]]\n\nh4. Related copyrights\n\n* [[amnesia:_the_dark_descent]]\n* [[creepypasta]]\n* [[five_nights_at_freddy's]]\n* [[resident_evil]]\n* [[scp_foundation]]\n* [[silent_hill]]"
