          "wiki_body": "thumb #3113074 thumb #3102408 thumb #2643054 thumb #3103612 thumb #3113042\r\n\r\n[b]Looming[/b] usually describes an image with a character shown from a [[low-angle view]], giving the impression the character is standing over, and/or in some cases much larger than the viewer. Alternatively, looming can explicitly involve a character shown standing over another. The tag usually implies that the character doing the looming has menacing or threatening intent. Heavily associated with [[macro]]/[[micro]] and [[size difference]] images.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[looming_over]]"
