          "wiki_body": "thumb #3132934 thumb #3661167 thumb #3615133 thumb #3076626\r\n\r\nA scythe (/ˈsaɪð/ or /ˈsaɪθ/)[1] is an agricultural hand [[tools|tool]] for mowing grass or reaping crops. At other times, during [[war]], it can also be used as a [[weapon]]. This farming tool is also known to be widely associated with the personification of death; The [[Grim Reaper]].\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with:\r\n* [[sickle]] - A shorter agricultural hand tool with a curved blade.\r\n* [[sickle sword]] - A sword with a curved blade similar to a sickle.\r\n\r\n "
