          "wiki_body": "This tag is used when one or more of the characters in the post are thinking about being in a prefered sexual situation.\r\n\r\nThis is usually shown by a [[thought_bubble]] indicating what the character is pretending to be doing, or with [[text]] describing the character's thoughts.\r\n\r\nThis tag is mainly used in posts where:\r\n\r\n* During [[masturbation]] the character is thinking of another character or having [[sex]].\r\n** During sex a character is thinking about having sex with someone other than their current partner.\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\nthumb #664871 thumb #541777 thumb #125617\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[speech_bubble]]\r\n* [[thought_bubble]]"
