          "count": 2012,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #199092 thumb #187434 thumb #97437\r\n\r\nStands for [b]Q[/b]uick [b]R[/b]esponse Code, a two-dimensional [[barcode]] that contains information, such as a [[URL]] for a website or just plain text. There are smartphone apps and websites solely dedicated to read and/or create QR codes.\r\n\r\nIt was first designed in 1994 for the Japanese automotive industry.\r\n\r\n* If possible, add a \"note\":/help/show/notes over the QR code with the decoded information.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[barcode]]\r\n** [[barcode_tattoo]]\r\n* [b]qr_code[/b]"
