        {
          "tag": "free_use",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1926,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1575358\r\n\r\n[b]Free use[/b] has two significant meanings:\r\n\r\n1. A fetish involving sexual encounters of an extremely casual nature, indicated by unrelated conversation during intercourse, multiple partners, and anything else that may indicate the depicted encounter as no-strings-attached or sex as a mere transaction. a good example of this may be a cougar using a pool boy for quick relief.\r\n\r\n2. It is a very common message applies to [[public use]] images, and also in more private sexual scenarios.\r\nthumb #4852007 thumb #4436365\r\n\r\n[b][u]For pictures involving public [[prostitution]] or a character being [[bound]] in public for the sexual gratification of passersby, use [[public_use]] instead.[/u][/b]\r\n\r\nIf there is no \"Free use\" messaging, and the subject is available for sex by anyone, use [[public_use]] instead.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[casual_sex]]"
