          "wiki_body": "A short story is a typically a complete telling of a theme designed to be finished in a single sitting. The bare minimum word count to be counted as a short story is 1000 words, but the average length can often be 1000-7500 words. There is no maximum length and some can reach into 10,000 words.\n\nSee also: \n* [[story]]\n* [[story_in_description]]\n* [[story_at_source]]"
