          "wiki_body": "Used when a character is propped on top of another character, typically without touching the ground.\r\n\r\nthumb #585050 thumb #439291 thumb #758670\r\n\r\nFor tagging purposes, if the character is riding on:\r\n\r\n* The back or shoulders of an [[anthro]]/[[humanoid]], use [[piggyback]]\r\n* The back of a [[feral]], use [[riding]].\r\n\r\nIn situations depicting positions in sexual acts, [[cowgirl_position]], [[reverse_cowgirl_position]] or [[stand_and_carry_position]] may often be more suitable (or in combination).\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[ass_stack]]\r\n* [[on_top]]\r\n* [[on_shoulder]]\r\n* [[standing_on_hock]]\r\n* [[riding]]/[[riding_sidesaddle]]\r\n* [[perching_position]]\r\n* [[piggyback]]\r\n* [[cowgirl_position]]/[[reverse_cowgirl_position]]\r\n* [[straddling]]\r\n* [[stand_and_carry_position]]\r\n* [[totem_pole_position]]"
