        {
          "tag": "bong",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1866,
          "wiki_body": "A bong is a filtration device usually made out of glass and primarily used for smoking [[marijuana]].\r\n\r\n\"A diagram of how a bong works.\":http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/Bong.svg\r\n\r\nh4.See also:\r\n\r\n* [[alcohol]]\r\n* [[drugs]]\r\n** [[cannabis]]\r\n** [[cocaine]]\r\n** [[heroin]]\r\n** [[lsd]]\r\n** [[magic_mushrooms]]\r\n** [[marijuana]]\r\n*** [b]bong[/b] - A device used primarily to smoke marijuana.\r\n*** [[pot_leaf]] - A leaf like one found on a marijuana plant.\r\n*** [[stoned]] - A general tag to describe \"being high\" and usually associated with marijuana high in particular.\r\n** [[methamphetamine]]\r\n** [[opium]]\r\n* [[smoking]]\r\n** [[cigar]]\r\n** [[cigarette]]"
