          "wiki_body": "thumb #4174016 thumb #3833184 thumb #3514339\r\n\r\nA round object made of any substance. Typically not used for [[ball]]s, rather, used for more \"precious\" things rather than everyday spherical objects. They also are more compact and uniform than some balls, which can instead be a loose collection of things such as a hairball or yarn ball.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[ball]]\r\n* [[crystal_ball]]\r\n* [[flame_orb]]\r\n* [[holding_orb]]\r\n* [[tail_orb]]"
