          "kor": "",
          "count": 1736,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #269369\r\n\r\nA [b]speaker[/b] (or [b]loudspeaker[/b]) is an electroacoustic transducer which converts an electrical audio signal into a corresponding sound.\r\n\r\ni.e. The things you hear most of your music from."
