          "tag": "tray",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1734,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4616356\r\n\r\nA tray, more specifically a serving tray, is a flat, shallow receptacle with raised sides, typically used for carrying food and drink. Trays may also be used to hold and carry other small objects, but are most often seen in the context of carrying plates, cups, etc.  \r\n\r\nh4. Tray Tags\r\n* [[holding tray]]\r\n* [[breasts on tray]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[waiter]]\r\n* [[maid]]\r\n* [[restaurant]]"
