        {
          "tag": "hungry",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1731,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3459142 thumb #86039 thumb #3829138\r\n\r\nA character shown expressing a desire for food, this may involve verbally stating that they're hungry, having a [[rumbling stomach]], potentially [[drooling]], [[licking lips|licking their lips]] or thinking about food with other body language/body noises. Wavy emanating lines from the belly, or the belly visibly \"rippling\" are two visual shorthands for hunger. \r\n\r\nExpressions of hunger are particularly common in art featuring overweight characters, stuffing or vore.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[rumbling stomach]]\r\n* [[licking lips]]\r\n* [[drooling]]\r\n* [[emanata]]\r\n* [[rippling belly]]\r\n* [[hand on stomach]]\r\n* [[holding belly]]\r\n"
