        {
          "tag": "stocky",
          "kor": "땅딸막한",
          "count": 1686,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1464065 thumb #4015462 thumb #1964137 thumb #5512486 thumb #5492210 thumb #1659141 thumb #3172163\n \n[b]Stocky[/b] describes characters who have broad, \"solidly built\" frames, a character with a \"wide body\", thick arms and legs, they are often [[short]] in stature. \"Stocky\" can describe a range of varied, but similar figures: a stocky character may be muscular, but usually will not have extremely defined muscles; a stocky character may be chubby or overweight, but most of their body fat will be in their chest, midsection, thighs and butt, they will not have rolls of fat - obese characters should not be tagged as stocky.\n\nWhile it may often cross over with [[musclegut]] this tag should not be used merely as a synonym, a stocky character does not have to have any muscular definition.\n\n[quote]\nh4. Criteria\n[i]A stocky figure will have a combination of bodily attributes below:[/i]\n\n* A key feature is a broad upper body, particularly around the waist/midsection\n** female characters will still have curves, possibly [[wide hips]], but overall \"thick\" abdomen - never a [[small waist]]\n* Fat is often limited to the [[belly]] or torso - characters having a \"beer gut\" or \"[[potbelly]]\n* Oftentimes muscular definition on the torso ([[pecs]], [[abs]]) is frequently less \"defined\", more subtle and/or mixed with fat, more defined on arms\n* Thick arms, if not muscular\n* Sometimes [[Short]], with squat proportions\n* [[Big Chest]] - a naturally large ribcage \n* [[Broad Shoulders]] \n* [[Thick Neck]] \n\n[/quote]\n\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[Musclegut]]\n* [[Muscular]]\n* [[Slightly Chubby]]\n* [[Overweight]]\n* [[Short]]\n* [[Belly]]\n** [[Big Belly]]\n** [[Potbelly]]\n\nh4. See Also\n* [[Tag Group:Figures]]\n"
        },
