          "tag": "live_birth",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 1588,
          "wiki_body": "Used for posts depicting a character giving [[birth]] to a live offspring. Do not use this tag for a character [[oviposition|laying eggs]].\r\n\r\nThis tag should be used when the birthing character is actively giving birth to their offspring, such as having strong [[labor_pains]], actively pushing, or the offspring is [[crowning]]. When the character is in the early stages of birthing, use the [[labor]] and/or [[water_break]] tags. When the character has finished giving birth, use the [[post_birth]] tag.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[baby]]\r\n* [[en_caul]]\r\n* [[amniotic_fluid]]\r\n* [[sex_during_birth]]\r\n* [[blocked_birth]]\r\n* [[multiple_birth]]\r\n* [[hyper_birth]]\r\n* [[crowning]]\r\n* [[labor]]\r\n** [[labor_pains]]\r\n** [[water_break]]\r\n* [[post_birth]]\r\n** [[amniotic_sac]]\r\n** [[placenta]]\r\n** [[umbilical_cord]]\r\n* [[public_birth]]\r\n* [[casual_birthing]]\r\n* [[group_birth]]\r\n* [[clothed_birth]]\r\n** [[panty_birth]]\r\n* [[bondage_birth]]\r\n* [[public_birth]]\r\n* [[vaginal_birth]]\r\n** [[cock_birth]]\r\n** [[anal_birth]]\r\n** [[nipple_birth]]\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[oviposition]] - When a creature is laying an egg.\r\n* [[hatching]] - When a creature emerges from an egg.\r\n* [[hard_labor]] - When a character is forced to do difficult manual work.\r\n* [[littering]] - Dumping trash in public places.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[impregnation]]\r\n** [[male_impregnation]]\r\n** [[self_impregnation]]\r\n** [[unwanted_impregnation]]\r\n* [[pregnant]]\r\n** [[pregnant_female]]\r\n** [[pregnant_male]]\r\n** [[pregnant_loli]]\r\n** [[pregnant_intersex]]\r\n*** [[pregnant_andromorph]]\r\n*** [[pregnant_gynomorph]]\r\n*** [[pregnant_herm]]\r\n*** [[pregnant_maleherm]]\r\n** [[young_pregnancy]]\r\n** [[pregnant_belly]]\r\n** [[hyper_pregnancy]]\r\n* [[pregnant_sex]]\r\n* [[unbirthing]]"
