          "wiki_body": "[quote]\nh4. [b]Tag under debate[/b]\nThe future of this tag is currently under debate - see \"[1]\":/forum_topics/45636 \"[2]\":/forum_topics/23515 \"[3]\":/forum_topics/54501 \"[4]\":/forum_topics/55916. Use of more specific and objective tags such as [[stated virginity]], [[defloration]], and [[cherry popping]] is preferred where possible.\n[/quote]\n\nA character who has never had sex before, usually explained through [[dialogue]].\n\n[u][b]This tag is often misused.[/b][/u] The presence of a [[hymen]] (including a [[blood_from_pussy|hymen rupture]]) is [u]not[/u] considered evidence of virginity - contrary to popular belief, it possible for the hymen to remain intact after sex, and a rupture can be faked with \"hymen reconstruction surgery\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hymenorrhaphy. See \"Wikipedia's article on the hymen\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hymen for more information. Such images should simply be tagged with [[hymen]] instead.\n\nh4. Related tags\n* [[defloration]]\n** [[blood from pussy]]\n** [[mutual defloration]]\n** [[male defloration]] / [[male virginity loss]]\n** [[female defloration]]\n* [[female virgin]] / [[male virgin]]\n* [[stated virginity]]\n* [[virginity fetish]]\n* [[virginity humiliation]]\n* [[virginity symbolism]]\n** [[cherry popping]]\n* [[hymen]]\n\nh4. \"First Time\" tags\nNote that these are [b]not[/b] synonymous with virgin.\n* [[first kiss]]\n* [[first orgasm]]\n* [[first time anal]]\n* [[first time fellatio]]\n* [[first time knotting]]\n* [[first time vaginal]]\n\nh4. See also\n* [[inexperienced]]\n* [[premature ejaculation]] - commonly depicted with male virgins\n* [[innocence]]\n* [[naive]]\n* [[sexual awakening]]\n* [[sexual exploration]]\n\nh4. Tagging projects\n* {{virgin -stated_virginity -stated_virginity_in_description -cherry_popping -virginity_symbolism}} - Posts tagged [[virgin]] should have one of these tags.\n* \"virgin ~hymen ~blood_from_pussy\":/posts?tags=virgin+~hymen+~blood_from