          "wiki_body": "thumb #2649366 thumb #3639311 thumb #3264080 thumb #2905481 thumb #2781395 thumb #2468232\n\n\"[b]Leather Daddy[/b]\" is a \"LGBTQ+ slang\":http://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/LGBT_slang term for a appearance/fashion aesthetic born from the \"leather subculture\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leather_subculture in the late 1940's.\n\n[b]Leather Daddies[/b] are usually [[male]], but may also be [[andromorph|andromorphs]] or [[maleherm|maleherms]]. Most of them are usually [i](but not always)[/i] [[male/male|gay]] and sexually [[dominant]].\nThey are depicted as being relatively [[older male|older]], [[larger male|larger]], more [[muscular male|muscular]] or conversely [[overweight|fatter]], [[hairy|hairer]], and/or more [[big_penis|well endowed]] than most or at the very least the [[submissive]] character in the post.\n\nAs their name suggests, [b]Leather Daddies[/b] are always seen wearing copious and conspicuous amounts of [[leather]], such as [[leather clothing]] like: a [[leather jacket]] or a [[leather vest]], [[leather gloves]], a [[leather underwear]], [[leather boots]] and less represented with a [[leather mask]] like a [[gimp mask|gimp hood]].\n\nThey also use a lot of [[bondage gear]] used in [[BDSM]], like a [[harness]] (often made of [[leather harness|leather]]), [[riding crop|riding crops]] and [[cat o' nine tails]] are [[whip|whips]] used for [[impact play]].\n\nThey also have a lot of [[accessory|accessories]] and [[jewelry|jewelries]] such as [[nipple piercing|nipple piercings]].\nVery often seen [[smoking]] [[cigar|cigars]], they often drink [[beer]] too.\n\nFinally, all [b]Leather Daddies[/b] embody the archetype of virility, playing on the icon of [[manly|masculinity]] and paternal authority, like [[big muscles|big]] or [[huge muscles]], the [[beard]], or playing on the [[Daddy Kink]] by calling themselves \"[i]Daddy[/i]\" or even calling their partner as their [[son (lore)|son]] (with \"[i][[Good boy]][/i]\" or \"[i]Sonny[/i]\" to further play on [[father and son (lore)|father/son]] power dynamics).\n\n[[Biker]] clothing also falls into this category, with [[biker cap|biker caps]] or just [[motorcycle|motorcycles]] also associated with this culture.\n\nh4. Related Tags\n* [[Beer]]\n* [[Cigar]]\n* [[Daddyfication]]\n** [[Daddy Kink]]\n* [[Leather]]\n* [[Manly]]\n* [[Mature male]]\n* [[Musclegut]]\n* [[Muscular]]\n* [[Overweight]]\n* [[Tom of Finland]]"
