          "wiki_body": "thumb #2131740 thumb #3948156 thumb #2983829 thumb #694719 thumb #2389283 thumb #3249764\r\n\r\nVery short, but [b]visibly[/b] adult characters. These characters have a small stature but obviously adult proportions and body development, such as curves or defined [[muscles]], and other signs of aging such as [[facial hair]] or wrinkles.\r\n\r\nThese posts should not be tagged [[young]] - and conversely, adult characters that look young should not be tagged dwarfism.\r\n\r\nMany of these characters, though not all, will also fit under [[short stack]] or [[teapot_(body_type)|teapot]]. Conversly, not all short stacks and teapots will have proportions short enough to qualify for the dwarfism tag.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[short]]\r\n* [[short_stack]]\r\n* [[teapot_(body_type)]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[adult_(lore)]]\r\n* [[aged_down]]\r\n* [[chibi]]\r\n* [[semi-anthro]]\r\n* [[size_difference]]\r\n* [[size_play]]\r\n* [[small_but_hung]]"
