          "count": 1229,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4171337 thumb #205120 thumb #2697370\n\n[b]Versatile[/b] refers a character that can be seen in the same image or animation, in different moments in past tense, through dialogue, and/or noticeable residual fluids, switching between the roles of penetrator and penetrated.\n\nGenerally used in [[anal_penetration]], but can also be considered with [[vaginal_penetration]] if the same dynamic of switching is applied. Note that [[oral_penetration]] and [[threesome]] is not considered when using this tag. \n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [[lucky_pierre]] (when the character is penetrating and penetrated simultaneously) \n* [[top_turned_bottom]]\n* [[role_reversal]]"
