          "wiki_body": "thumb #1160785\r\n\r\nA [b]path[/b] is a narrow lane designed for [[bicycle|bicycles]] or travel on foot. Paths tend to be unpaved, and narrower than most [[road|roads]], which are designed for larger motored [[vehicle|vehicles]]. It is common to see paths depicted in natural areas such as a [[park]], or [[forest]]. Characters may be seen [[walking]] or [[jogging]] along these paths.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [b]path[/b]\r\n* [[road]]\r\n** [[highway]]\r\n** [[street]]"
