          "count": 1124,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3427021 thumb #2673635 thumb #2410341 thumb #3025038 thumb #2142335\r\n\r\n[b]Imagination[/b] is the formation of mental imagery of something not present to the senses or never before wholly perceived in reality.\r\n\r\nThis theme involves conceptual imagery perceived to be a product of mental faculties; a visual portrayal of an image, scene, or activity that a character is thinking about inside their head.\r\n\r\nh4. May involve\r\n\r\n* Scenes depicted through a [[thought bubble]], or [[dream]] sequence.\r\n* Mental imagery related to a [[dream]], [[daydream]], or [[fantasizing]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[picture_in_picture]]\r\n* [[thought_bubble]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[idea]]\r\n* [[inner_monologue]]\r\n* [[mental_pictographics]] - A tag for symbolic representations of one's inner thoughts."
