        {
          "tag": "impalement",
          "kor": "찔림",
          "count": 1112,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2631515 thumb #3393634 thumb #1675288\r\n\r\n[b]Impalement[/b] is the penetration of an organism by an object such as a stake, pole, spear or hook, often through the central body mass. Impalement can be deliberately inflicted on an enemy [[fight| in battle]], or occur by complete accident, but it has also been used as an especially [[cruelty|cruel]] method of [[sexual torture]] and [[execution]]: the victim is impaled through their [[anus]] or [[pussy| vagina]] and [[suspended via penetration| suspended]] in an upright position [[on_display|for public display]]. From there, gravity slowly drags the victim down the stake - seeking any relief from the pain, the desperate victim instinctively [[squirming|squirms]] on the pole, their helpless struggling only forcing the shaft deeper into their body until it inevitably [[all the way through|runs them through]].\r\n\r\nA more [[sadism|sadistic]] executioner might drag out the victim's suffering by choosing a blunt object to slow their descent, or adding a cross bar so they can't ever slide down far enough for the stake to pierce the chest and [[asphyxiation|stop their breathing]]. Either way, the result is a [[suffering|prolonged]], [[humiliation|humiliating]], and exceedingly painful [[death]], with some victims lasting for [i]days[/i] before dying.\r\n\r\nImpalement pictures are usually tagged with [[gore]] and [[blood]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[abdominal_impalement]] - a character is impaled through their [[midriff]].\r\n* [[vaginal_impalement]] - a character is impaled in their [[pussy|vagina]].\r\n* [[mouth_impalement]] - a character is impaled through their [[mouth]].\r\n* [[head_impalement]] - a character is impaled through their [[head]].\r\n* [[neck_impalement]] - a character is impaled through their [[neck]].\r\n* [[anal_impalement]] - a character is impaled in their [[anus]].\r\n* [[impaled_breasts]] - a character is impaled through their [[breasts]].\r\n* [[impaled_feet]] - a character is impaled through their [[feet]].\r\n* [[weapon_penetration]] - a character is [[penetration|penetrated]] with a weapon.\r\n**  [[impaled_with_own_weapon]] - a character is impaled with their own weapon.\r\n* [[fully_impaled]] - The end result of an impalement. The penetrating object has pierced through the victim's entire body.\r\n** [[serial_impalement]] - an object that [[fully impaled|fully impales]] a character also impales another character.\r\n* [[body_on_stake]] - a characters body is impaled on a [[stake]].\r\n* [[head_on_stake]] - a characters head is impaled on a [[stake]].\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[all_the_way_through]] - An object is shown entering a character's body at one end and exiting through the other. This on it's own is not [i]necessarily[/i] lethal, or even injurious.\r\n* [[bamboo_torture]] - impalement via the extremely fast growth of a young bamboo shoot.\r\n* [[cervical_penetration]] - An object penetrates past the cervix and into the [[uterus|womb]].\r\n* [[death_by_penis]] - A penetrating penis causes so much physical trauma that the depicted sex act would [[fatal wound|cause the character's death]].\r\n* [[deep_penetration]] - Penetration that goes deeply inside of a character.\r\n* [[execution]] - The act of deliberately putting someone to death as a penalty for an offense.\r\n* [[genital_mutilation]] - The genitals of a character being damaged, injured, or modified beyond their original state.\r\n* [[gore]] - The artistic depiction of extreme violence performed upon a character.\r\n* [[humiliation]] - A character is forced to participate in an action designed to embarrass or degrade them.\r\n* [[killing]] - A character causes the death of another.\r\n* [[one-bar_prison]] - A character being [[stuck| held in place]] by a [[fixed toy| fixed upright pole]] that [[penetration|penetrates]] them from below.\r\n* [[painal]] - Any action involving the anus that causes pain.\r\n* [[perforating_wound]] - The result of a penetrating object passing through the victim, leaving a wound that has both an entrance and an exit.\r\n* [[roasting_spit]] - Being impaled all the way through in preparation for being fried for food.\r\n* [[sexual_torture]] - A lewd or sexual act is performed on a character in a deliberately painful way.\r\n* [[snuff]] - Depiction of a character deriving pleasure from inflicting torture.\r\n* [[stab]] - Impalement via a sudden thrust with a weapon.\r\n* [[suffering]] - Prolonged exposure to a traumatic or painful situation.\r\n* [[torture]] - Severe physical and/or mental punishment is inflicted on a character.\r\n* [[wounded]] - Any kind of damage to living tissue.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[snake_impalement]] - A living creature - usually a [[snake]] - passes through a character's entire digestive tract.\r\n* [[spitroast]] - [[Group sex]] position that is resembles impalement, but typically doesn't actually involve it."
