          "wiki_body": "A character that has had their testicles removed through [[castration]].\r\n\r\nNote that the word \"eunuch\" in english can be a false friend, as some other languages, such as \"French\":https://fr.wiktionary.org/wiki/eunuque or \"German\":https://de.wiktionary.org/wiki/Eunuch, use the equivalent word to describe a man who had both his penis and testicles removed. The correct translation in those cases would instead be \"castrat\":https://fr.wiktionary.org/wiki/castrat and \"kastrat\":http://de.thefreedictionary.com/Kastrat, respectively, while the preferred term for someone who underwent complete genital ablation in English is instead [[nullo]].\r\n\r\nh4.See Also\r\n[section=Tags About Genital Removal]\r\n* [[Nullo]] - A character that had all of their sex organs removed.\r\n** [[Nullo transformation]] - The process of becoming a nullo through [[transformation]].\r\n** [[Nullification]] - Removal of all sex organs.\r\n*** [[Emasculation]] - Removal of the entire male sex organ.\r\n**** [[Castration]] - Removal  of the [[balls|testicles]]. (\"neutering\")\r\n***** [[severed_balls]] - Testicles that has been separated from its owner\r\n***** [b]Eunuch[/b] - A character that has had their testicles removed (\"neutered\").\r\n**** [[Penectomy]] - Removal of the [[penis]].\r\n***** [[severed_penis]] - A penis that has been separated from its owner.\r\n***** [[Penectomized]] - A character that has had their penis removed.\r\n*** [[Vaginectomy]] - Removal of the entire female sex organ.\r\n**** [[Oophorectomy]] - Removal of the ovaries.\r\n***** [[severed_ovaries]] - Ovaries that has been separated from its owner.\r\n***** [[Spayed]] - A character that has had their [[ovaries]] removed.\r\n**** [[Hysterectomy]] - Removal of the [[uterus]], leaving only the cervix and vaginal canal intact.\r\n***** [[severed_uterus]] - A uterus that has been separated from its owner.\r\n***** [[Hysterectomized]] - A character that has had their uterus removed.\r\n[/section]\r\n* [[sackless]] - A character with no evidence of testicles being present, with no scarring or other evidence to indicate testicle removal.\r\n* [[orchiectomy_scar]] - [[scar|Scarring]] from the surgical procedure(s) involved in removing the character's testicles."
