          "wiki_body": "thumb #3193879 thumb #3701604\r\n\r\nWhen a character is extremely [[sweat|sweaty]], with a large amount of clearly visible droplets of sweat covering specific body parts, or their entire body. Sweat may run in streams down the body, fly off of a character in motion, or drip off of them. Excessive sweat is often paired with [[musk]] (visible [[musk clouds]]); if the character is clothed, their clothing will likely be stained with sweat. \r\n\r\nExcessive sweat is usually depicted in an erotic context, especially in kinks where body smells or heat are the focus, butts and genitals are particularly common focuses of excessive sweat; characters that are intensely aroused or engaging in sexual activity may be shown excessively sweaty.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[sweat]] - see this page for specific body parts\r\n** [[sweatdrop]]\r\n** [[flying sweatdrop]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[musk]]\r\n** [[musk clouds]]\r\n* [[blush]]"
