          "wiki_body": "Thumb #4817623 thumb #749410 thumb #832728 thumb #719420\n\nWhen a person is grabbed by the front of the neck with an apparent intent of strangulation or potential of strangulation. If the grabbing doesn't cover the front of the neck, use [[neck_grab]]. If the grabbing goes all around the neck, use your own judgement if only [[neck_grab]] is appropriate, or if the involvement of throat is warranting [[throat_grab]] too.\n\nThis grab is typically from the front of the victim.\n\nThis is the [[Darth Vader]] thing, with or without the Force.\n\nh4. Related tags\n* [[Asphyxiation]]\n* [[Breath_Play]]\n* [[Choking]]\n\nh4. Not to be confused with\n* [[neck_grab]] - when a character is grabbing a neck from behind\n* [[neck_crank]] - when a character has grabbed a neck by curling the whole arm around it\n* [[arm_around_neck]] - when a character has just placed their arm around a neck\n* [[hand_on_neck]] - when a character has just placed their hand on a neck\n\nh4. See also\n* [[tag_group:grab]]\n* [[tag_group:touching]]\n* [[restrained]]\n"
