          "kor": "망치질",
          "count": 725,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3590281 thumb #2950550 thumb #2268960\r\n\r\nA [b]maul[/b] is a heavy, two-handed [[hammer]]. It consists of a large and/or heavy hammer head that's connected to a long handle or pole. Like the [[hammer]], it's originally a tool though variants of it have been adapted for warfare as well.\r\n\r\nh4.Not to be confused with\r\n* [[sledgehammer]] - The hammer head is typically smaller in size.\r\n* [[warhammer]] - The head is smaller as well as possessing a spike or pick at the back-end.\r\n* [[darth_maul]] - A character from [i][[Star Wars]][/i].\r\n* [[mauling]] - A verb that describes tearing something or someone apart with teeth and claws.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[hammer]]\r\n* [[poleaxe]] - A [[polearm]] featuring both a hammer head and an [[axe]] head.\r\n"
