          "kor": "",
          "count": 659,
          "wiki_body": "An ambiguous tag used to mean when something (usually a character with ropes, vines, etc.) is twisted together in an untidy mess. Note that this isn't necessarily the same as being [[bound]] or [[restrained]] by [[tentacles]], although their usage may overlap.\r\n"
        },
