        {
          "tag": "pip-boy",
          "kor": "핍보이",
          "count": 656,
          "wiki_body": "A [b]Pip-Boy[/b] is a [[wrist computer]] from the [i][[Fallout]][/i] series. These devices are a standard issue equipment for [[vault dwellers (fallout)|vault dwellers]] as much as the [[vault suit]]s that they wear.\r\n\r\nh4.External links\r\n* \"Pip-Boy\":http://fallout.gamepedia.com/Pip-Boy on the Fallout Wiki"
        },
        {
          "tag": "halberd",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 656,
          "wiki_body": "A Halberd is a type of pole arm that has a  long spike on the top of the axe head and the hook on the back of the axe's blade. The Halberd can act as a spear against mounted troops and the axe can be used for close quarters combat (though the spear can also be used for close quarters)."
        },
        {
          "tag": "crumbs",
