        {
          "tag": "gown",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 651,
          "wiki_body": "A [b]gown[/b] is a [[dress]] featuring a long skirt base designed for special or formal occasions. Although most types of gowns are formal, the [[nightgown]] is a dressing gown for more casual occasions.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[dress]]\r\n** [[long_dress]]\r\n*** [b]gown[/b]\r\n** [[wedding_dress]] - Usually a type of gown."
