        {
          "tag": "twunk",
          "kor": "트렁크",
          "count": 651,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2467272 thumb #2905712\r\n\r\nA term used to describe a young man (usually between 18-25) that has the face of a [[twink]], but with the physique of a hunk. Usually a twunk's body is not as \"ripped\" as a \"hunk\", but if they went to the gym, the twunk could have the body of a hunk."
