        {
          "tag": "hookah",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 650,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2707313 thumb #1210166 thumb #2528109\r\n\r\nA hookah is a device used for smoking tobacco or other substances (such as marijuana). It has body with a large base and a slender neck. A hookah is different from a water pipe or a [[bong]] because it has a straw-like tube used to breathe in the vapors.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[smoking]]"
