          "tag": "christmas_stocking",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 648,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1088067\r\n\r\nA [b]Christmas stocking[/b] is an empty [[socks|sock]] or sock-shaped [[bag]] that is hung on [[Christmas]] Eve so that [[Santa Claus]] can fill it with small [[toy|toys]], [[candy]], [[fruit]], coins or other small [[gift|gifts]] when he arrives.\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Christmas stocking\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christmas_stocking"
        },
        {
          "tag": "glitter",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 647,
          "wiki_body": "Glitter describes an assortment of small, colorful, reflective particles that comes in a variety of shapes. Glitter particles reflect light at different angles, causing the surface to sparkle or shimmer. Glitter is similar to confetti, sparkles, or sequins, but somewhat smaller. \r\n\r\nGlitter refers to the substance. For generic sparkle effects and sparkly items, use [[sparkles]]."
        },
        {
          "tag": "mawashi",
          "kor": "",
