          "wiki_body": "Traditional garment worn by [[sumo]] wrestlers, consisting of a long strip of cloth wrapped about their hips and over their crotch so as to cover their genitalia.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[sagari]] - A fabric or cord that supports a mawashi similar to a belt.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[fundoshi]]\r\n* [[loincloth]]\r\n* [[sumo]]\r\n* [[sumo_wrestling]]"
