        {
          "tag": "amputation",
          "kor": "절단",
          "count": 571,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2410729\r\n\r\n[b]Amputation[/b] is the removal of a limb by trauma, medical illness, or surgery. As a surgical measure, it is used to control pain or a disease process in the affected limb, such as malignancy or gangrene. In some cases, it is carried out on individuals as a preventative surgery for such problems.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n\r\n* [[amputee]] - A character that has gone through an amputation. It should not be used during the process.\r\n* [[detachable]] - A character that can remove a body part and reattach it.\r\n* missing - The [i]missing[/i] prefix is used for characters with amputated limbs or appendages.\r\n** [[missing_limb]]\r\n*** [[missing_arm]]\r\n*** [[missing_leg]]\r\n* [[severed]] - The [i]severed[/i] prefix is used for the amputated body parts if they are visible.\r\n** [[severed_limb]]\r\n*** [[severed_arm]]\r\n*** [[severed_limb]]\r\n* [[quadruple_amputee]]\r\n** [[love_pillow]]\r\n* [[portal_amputation]] - harmless procedure done with [[portal|portals]]\r\n** [[portal_prosthetic]]\r\n** [[quadruple_amputee_portal]]\r\n* [[limb_regression]]\r\n* [[dismemberment]]\r\n* [[castration]]\r\n* [[mastectomy]]\r\n* [[docked_tail]]\r\n* [[decapitation]]\r\n** [[severed_head]]"
