          "wiki_body": "thumb #130681\r\n[b]Canterlot[/b] is a setting in [[My Little Pony]]: [[Friendship is Magic]]. It is the capital [[city]] of [[Equestria]], and home to [[princess_Celestia_(mlp)|Princess Celestia]] and [[princess_luna_(mlp)|Princess Luna]]. \r\n\r\nLauren Faust's inspiration for [[Canterlot]], with its [[castle]] carved into the side of the [[mountain]], was \"Minas Tirith\":http://lotr.wikia.com/wiki/Minas_Tirith from \"The Lord of the Rings\":http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lord_of_the_Rings. The city features ivory towers with golden spires, and many waterfalls and rivers running through it. \r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[equestria]]\r\n** [[cloudsdale]]\r\n** [[ponyville]]\r\n** [[manehattan]]\r\n* [[crystal empire]]"
