          "wiki_body": "A lance is a long [[melee_weapon]], typically a [[polearm]] similar to a [[spear]] but longer. It may also have a large metal end that tapers to a sharp point. They are designed for use by cavalry. Unlike spears, they are not intended to be thrown. Their effectiveness while dismounted led to the use of pikes in formations in Europe.\r\n\r\nIf you see what looks like a [[spear]] being carried by a rider, chances are it's actually a lance.\r\n\r\nLances are also a popular weapon of choice in [[jousting]].\r\n\r\nh4. Examples:\r\n\r\nTapering lance: thumb #345709\r\n\r\nPolearm-type lance: thumb #1133034\r\n\r\nh4.See Also\r\n* [[pike]]\r\n* [[javelin]]"
