          "wiki_body": "The term for when someone or something has been forgotten and left behind, from the smallest critters to the biggest cities, this tag can apply to whatever has been left to rot.\r\n\r\nOfficial definitions:\r\n-1: Having been deserted or cast off\r\n-2: Unrestrained; Uninhibited\r\n\r\nFor the sake of simplicity, please ignore the second definition when tagging, as the latter could be subjective to different individuals."
