          "wiki_body": "A business that is involved in making wheat related foods such as bread loafs, bread rolls or croissants. A bakery may also sell sweets such as cakes, pastries, cinnamon rolls, doughnuts, or cookies.\r\n\r\nh4.Related tags\r\n* [[store]]\r\n* [[baking]]\r\n* [[baker]]\r\n* [[bread]]\r\n* [[oven]]\r\n* [[flour]]\r\n* [[dough]]\r\n* [[rolling_pin]]"
