          "wiki_body": "thumb #4213531 thumb #4779590 thumb #2698860 thumb #4509902 thumb #4999758\n\nAn aesthetic style where brush strokes are not blended out, and may be painted in deliberate patterns. Many notable art movements are associated with a painterly look, such as Expressionism, Fauvism, Impressionism, and Post-Impressionism. "
