          "kor": "드라마",
          "count": 343,
          "wiki_body": "[b]Drama[/b] is a genre of fiction that focuses on serious emotions, life struggles and the relationships between characters in a story.\r\n\r\n\"Drama\" on the internet also refers to any content that causes or is the result of arguments and debates.\r\n\r\nAs such this tag has been used to refer to either one of these definitions.\r\n\r\nh4.see also:\r\n* [[lol comments]]\r\n* [[performance]]"
