          "wiki_body": "thumb #197996 thumb #2557659\r\n\r\nAn [b]apocalypse[/b] is a world threatening event, especially if it's still ongoing. This tag is used on posts depicting such events.\r\n\r\n[section=Example scenarios]\r\n* Cosmic cataclysms\r\n** [[Meteor]] strikes.\r\n*** Massive meteor impact.\r\n*** Mass meteor bombardment.\r\n** Solar apocalypse\r\n*** The Sun going supernova.\r\n*** The world being engulfed by an expanding Sun.\r\n*** Interplanetary impact.\r\n*** A black hole entering the solar system.\r\n* An alien invasion.\r\n** An alien army invasion.\r\n** Body snatcher takeover.\r\n** Interdimensional invasion.\r\n* A world-ending war.\r\n** A nuclear war.\r\n** A long and brutal global war.\r\n* A deadly pandemic.\r\n** The return of the black plague.\r\n* A [[monster]] outbreak.\r\n** A [[zombie]] outbreak.\r\n** A [[robot]] uprising/rebellion.\r\n*** A [[grey goo]] scenario.\r\n*** A paperclip maximizer scenario.\r\n** Mass monster [[transformation]] event.\r\n** Global pest swarm infestation.\r\n** Nature fights back.\r\n*** Aggressive plantlife overgrowth.\r\n*** Mass wildlife monsterification.\r\n** [[Dinosaur]] world reclamation.\r\n* Global resource shortage.\r\n** Global famine.\r\n** Water shortage.\r\n** Oil depletion.\r\n* Extreme climate change\r\n** Global desertification\r\n** New ice age\r\n** Water world scenario\r\n* Mythological apocalypse\r\n** [[angel|Angelic]] purge\r\n** [[demon|Demonic]] invasion\r\n** [[Armageddon]]\r\n** [[Ragnarok]]\r\n** The resurgence of fantastical creatures.\r\n** The emergence of [[magic]].\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nIf the post depicts a world or setting in the aftermath of the cataclysm then use the [[post-apocalyptic]] tag instead of this one.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n* [[post-apocalyptic]] - Scenes depicting worlds after the apocalyptic event.\r\n* [[burning building]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[destruction]]\r\n** [[planet_destruction]]"
