          "wiki_body": "thumb #208180 thumb #771798\r\n\r\nThe national [[flag]] of [[Canada]], popularly called [i][b]The Maple Leaf[/b][/i] in English and [i][b]l'Unifolié[/b][/i] (literally 'the one-leafed') in French. The flag consists of a stylized, red 11-pointed [[maple leaf]] centred on a white field, flanked by vertical red bars on either side.\r\n\r\nThis tag should ideally only be applied to images with a depiction of the flag or clothing with a design directly copying that of the flag, if a character is wearing garments with a Canadian styled maple leaf, but no bars, consider tagging [[maple leaf]] instead. \r\n\r\nUse [[Canadian Red Ensign]] for the historic pre-1965 Canadian flag.\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Flag]]\r\n* [[Canada]]\r\n* [[Maple Leaf]]\r\n"
