          "count": 298,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2929546\r\n\r\n[b]Mexico[/b], officially the [b]United Mexican States[/b], is a federation of 32 states located in the southern portion of North America, bordering the [[United States of America]] to the north, and the Central American nations of [[Guatemala]] and [[Belize]] to the south. Mexico City is the capital and largest city in Mexico, it is also the largest city on the North American continent.\r\n\r\nMexico is the most populous Spanish speaking country on [[Earth]], and tenth most populous country overall. It is known for its culture, climate, the [[Day of the Dead]], [[mariachi]], [[sombero|somberos]], [[tequila]], its Pre-Columbian history, and especially its cuisine.\r\n\r\nThis tag should be used for images depicting Mexican characters, the Mexican flag, characters wearing clothing related to Mexico or Mexican culture, or depicting Mexican locations.\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags\r\n* [[independence_day_(mexico)]]\r\n* [[mexican flag]]\r\n** [[mexican_flag_bikini]]\r\n* [[mexican dress]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[tag group:countries]]\r\n"
