          "tag": "navy",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 293,
          "wiki_body": "A [b]navy[/b] (also known as [i]naval force[/i] or [i]maritime force[/i]) is a branch of a [[military]] organization responsible for naval and amphibious warfare. They employ [[marines]], marine animals (such as \"dolphins\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_marine_mammal ), naval mounted [[cavalry]] (in fiction), [[watercraft]] (such as [[warship]]s and [[submarine]]s), amphibious vehicles, and other naval and amphibious weapons systems.\r\n\r\nAs a tag this refers to characters who look like they're part of the navy as well as scenes, settings, and locations that are associated with anything navy related such as shipyards, warship decks, and naval battles.\r\n\r\nh4.Other military branches\r\n* [[army]] - Ground warfare.\r\n* [b]navy[/b] - Naval warfare.\r\n* [[air_force]] - Aerial warfare.\r\n* [[space_force]] - Space warfare."
