          "wiki_body": "The process of transforming into an individual dumb brute or stud, perfectly happy to be fuck anyone and/or workout and perform physical tasks mindlessly.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, the male equivalent of [[bimbofication]] - rather than a male character becoming feminine or a female character becoming stereotypically hyperfeminine, an individual becoming ubermasculine and/or hypersexual in body, outfit, behavior, or all of the above.\r\n\r\nNote: Like bimbofication, this should only be used for images that directly depict or strongly imply a process of himbofication - images of characters that merely look muscular and dressed like a [[jock]] - even to an absurd degree - should NOT be tagged with himbofication! There's a reason why we don't have a bimbo tag anymore.\r\n\r\nFrequently involves an exaggerated, hypersexualized male form - penis growth, an extremely muscular or athletic build, broad shoulders, facial hair, et cetera. However, himbofication may be purely mental and not physical, frequently achieved through brainwashing or mind control. (Mental aspects often include intelligence loss and increase in libido/dick size).\r\n\r\nA degree of corruption is usually also implied.\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n* [[himbo]]\r\n* [[jock]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[bimbofication]]\r\n* [[nerd]]\r\n** [[nerdification]]"
