        {
          "tag": "choice",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 232,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #125713 thumb #3241581\r\n\r\nA [b]choice[/b] results from the decision of an individual or a group faced with a situation or system offering one or more options.\r\n\r\nh5. Examples:\r\n* In this situation, would you rather be hot or cold? [i](2 choices)[/i]\r\n* Trainer, which Pokémon will you choose: [[Bulbasaur]], [[Charmander]], or [[Squirtle]]? [i](3 choices)[/i]\r\n* What's the best time of day for you: morning, noon, afternoon, or evening? [i](4 choices)[/i]\r\n\r\nthumb #3698394\r\n\r\nThe term \"[b]choice[/b]\" can refer to the process by which this operation is carried out and/or the result of said operation...\r\n\r\n[section=Other Usages of this Tag...]\r\n\r\n[quote][b]① In a sexual connotation...[/b]\r\nh4. Examples: \r\n\r\nthumb #4487554 thumb #4265535 thumb #4233885 thumb #4169886\r\n\r\nImages showing a [b]choice[/b] between two or more partners.\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\n[quote][b]② In [[gameplay_mechanics|the context of gameplay]]...[/b]\r\nh4. Examples:\r\nh6. Direction Choice\r\nthumb #3578480\r\nIf a character has to:\r\n▷ Follow an enemy\r\n▷ Or to go away\r\n\r\nh6. Answer Choice\r\nthumb #4428648\r\n* If a character has to say:\r\n▷ [i]\"Oh, you thought you were going to get a reward?\"[/i]\r\n▷ [i]\"I don't know... Why don't you show me how good you can be?\"[/i]\r\n▷ Or... Say nothing and get on their knees\r\n(as in a [[dating_sim|Dating Simulator]] or [[visual_novel|Visual Novel]])\r\n\r\nh6. Button Selection Choice\r\nthumb #4532295\r\n* If a character has to: \r\n▷ Fight a wild [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n▷ Change [[pokemon (species)|Pokémon]]\r\n▷ Take an [[item]] from their [[bag]] [i](like a [[pokeball|Pokéball]])[/i]\r\n▷ Or run away \r\n(as in [i][[Pokemon|Pokémon]][/i])\r\n[/quote]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tag:\r\n* [[take_your_pick]]"
