          "wiki_body": "The [b]XD[/b] expression and emoticon is a stylized expression replacing the eyes with a single X across the face or as separate > and < symbols combined with an [[open smile]]. If you see this expression in text form, also tag [[emoticon]].\r\n\r\nThis usually indicates that a character is [[amused]], or [[laugh|laughing]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [[>_<]]\r\n* [[open_smile]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:facial_expressions#emotes]]\r\n\r\n* [[:D]]\r\n* [[DX]]\r\n* [[x_eyes]]"
