          "wiki_body": "thumb #100202\r\n\r\nThe [b]Wii Remote[/b], also known colloquially as the [b]Wiimote[/b], is the primary [[game_controller|controller]] for Nintendo's [[Wii]] console. A main feature of the Wii Remote is its motion sensing capability, which allows the user to interact with and manipulate items on screen via gesture recognition and pointing through the use of accelerometer and optical sensor technology.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n\r\n* [[Wii]]\r\n* [[Wii Nunchuk]]\r\n* [[tag_group:video_games|Tag Group: Video Games]]\r\n\r\nh4. External:\r\n\r\n* \"Wikipedia - Wii Remote\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wii_Remote"
