          "wiki_body": "thumb #2476067 thumb #1128850 thumb #108808 thumb #2413810\n\nWhen a character has any level of musculature above [[athletic]]. These characters are commonly [[stocky]].\n\nThis tag alone may be useful for blacklisting and searching, but it should probably not be used directly when tagging posts.  Instead, use one of the more specific tags below.\n\nh4. Muscular scale\n[table]\n[thead]\n[tr][th]Not Muscular[/th][th]|[/th][th][b]Muscular[/b] ➡[/th][th][/th][th][/th][/tr]\n[/thead]\n[tbody]\n[tr][td][[athletic]][/td][td]|[/td][td][[big_muscles]][/td][td][[huge_muscles]][/td][td][[hyper_muscles]][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][/td][td]|[/td][td][[musclegut]][/td][td][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[/tbody]\n[/table]\n\nh4. Related tags:\n* [b]Muscles[/b]\n** Torso: [[pecs]] / [[abs]] / [[back_muscles]] / [[serratus]] / [[obliques]] / [[trapezius]]\n** Arm: [[biceps]] / [[triceps]] / [[deltoids]] / [[forearm_muscles]]\n** Leg: [[quads]]\n\n* [b]Gender specific[/b]\n** [[muscular_ambiguous]]\n** [[muscular_male]]\n** [[muscular_female]]\n** [[muscular_intersex]]\n*** [[muscular_andromorph]]\n*** [[muscular_gynomorph]]\n*** [[muscular_herm]]\n*** [[muscular_maleherm]]\n\n* [b]Form[/b]\n** [[muscular_human]]\n** [[muscular_anthro]]\n** [[muscular_feral]]\n** [[muscular_humanoid]]\n** [[muscular_taur]]\n** [[muscular_young]]\n\nh4. See also\n* [[tag_group:figures]]\n* [[v-cut]]\n\nh4. Tagging Projects\n* Correctly label muscular posts mistagged as [[athletic]] or another figure.\n* {{muscular -*_muscles -musclegut}}: Tag scale of musculature.\n* {{muscular -muscular_*}}: Tag forms and genders where possible."
