          "count": 20913,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1144647 thumb #964788 thumb #3677531 thumb #2937243 thumb #3502386\r\n\r\n\"General Muscle Guide\":https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/originals/f3/60/eb/f360eb58e8e56a98167b8d9bf43fe134.jpg\r\n\r\n[b]Big Pecs[/b] is a tag used to describe a wide range of [[pecs|pectoral muscles]] that are visibly above an \"average\" size, which is usually realistic and proportional to the character's body.\r\nFully achievable with sufficient [[exercise]] and [[workout]].\r\n\r\nThis is the level before [b][[Huge Pecs]][/b] and [b][[Hyper Pecs]][/b].\r\n\r\n[section=Pecs Size]\r\nh4. [[Pecs]] Size\r\n\r\n* [[pecs]] [i](\"average\" size)[/i]\r\n** [b]big_pecs[/b] / [[large_pecs]]\r\n*** [[huge_pecs]]\r\n**** [[hyper_pecs]]\r\n\r\n* [[pec_expansion]] / [[pecs_expansion]]\r\n* [[pec_inflation]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Muscular Scale\r\n\r\n[table]\r\n[thead]\r\n[tr][th]Not Muscular[/th][th]|[/th][th][b]Muscular[/b] ➡[/th][th][/th][th][/th][/tr]\r\n[/thead]\r\n[tbody]\r\n[tr][td][[athletic]][/td][td]|[/td][td][[big_muscles]][/td][td][[huge_muscles]][/td][td][[hyper_muscles]][/td][/tr]\r\n[tr][td][/td][td]|[/td][td][[musclegut]][/td][td][/td][td][/td][/tr]\r\n[/tbody]\r\n[/table]\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[big_moobs]] – For \"[b]big pecs[/b]\" who look like big fat [[breasts]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\n* [b][[muscular]][/b]\r\n* [[collarbone]]\r\n\r\n* [b]Muscles[/b]\r\n** Neck: [[sternocleidomastoid]]\r\n** Torso: [[abs]] / [[back_muscles]] / [[pecs]] / [[serratus]] / [[obliques]]\r\n** Arm: [[biceps]] / [[triceps]] / [[deltoids]] / [[forearm_muscles]]\r\n** Leg: [[quads]]\r\n** Butt: [[butt_muscles]]\r\n\r\n* [b]Gender specific[/b]\r\n** [[muscular_ambiguous]]\r\n** [[muscular_male]]\r\n** [[muscular_female]]\r\n** [[muscular_intersex]]\r\n*** [[muscular_andromorph]]\r\n*** [[muscular_gynomorph]]\r\n*** [[muscular_herm]]\r\n*** [[muscular_maleherm]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[big_breasts]]"
