          "tag": "wide_hips",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 362089,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4999241 thumb #4976306 thumb #2952871 thumb #4269190 thumb #4028142\r\n\r\nThis tag describes an individual with noticeably larger-than-average hips relative to their body size or shape.\r\n\r\nDue to the different average proportions between men and women, the guidelines for this tag differ based on the subject's gender. In general, the average male has thinner hips than shoulders and the average female has hips about as wide as their shoulders.\r\n\r\nFor a discussion on how this tag should be used, please see the relevant forum thread at http://e621.net/forum/show/5300.\r\n\r\nh4. See also:\r\n* [[huge hips]]\r\n* [[hyper hips]]\r\n"
        },
        {
          "tag": "huge_hips",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 23770,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2934487 thumb #1359980 thumb #2264023 thumb #1623864\r\n\r\n[b]Huge hips[/b] describes characters with [i]exceptionally[/i] [[wide hips]], [b]but[/b] not [i]disproportionately large[/i] like [[hyper hips]]; huge hips tend to be more or less within the realm of anatomical possibility, or at least, believably (huge hips can exceed [i]strict [/i] realism).\r\n\r\nIn many cases, differentiating huge hips from hyper hips is about proportions, rather than simply the size of the hips. Unlike a character with hyper hips, a character with huge hips will tend to have a fairly proportionate upper body; sometimes the character will be equally huge \"all over\", that is, [[overweight]] or [[obese]].  \r\n\r\nA character with [[huge hips]] will usually have [[thick thighs]] and a [[big butt]]. Often times, they will have an overall [[curvy figure]].\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[curvy figure]]\r\n** [[voluptuous]]\r\n** [[hourglass figure]]\r\n** [[pear-shaped figure]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[wide hips]]\r\n** [b]huge hips[/b]\r\n** [[hyper hips]]\r\n* [[huge thighs]]\r\n* [[huge butt]]\r\n"
