          "tag": "interspecies",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 341825,
          "wiki_body": "Sexual, mating, or romantic activity between different species. They should always be from different family sub-classes (e.g., [[feline]]/[[canine]], [[equine]]/[[cetacean]], but not [[lion]]/[[tiger]]). A good rule of thumb is [b]if they can realistically breed offspring this should NOT be used[/b].\r\n\r\n* Note: Pokémon may also get this tag, but they must be of both separate species and evolutionary line. For example: a Bulbasaur and Charmander a would be valid for interspecies, but a Charmander and a Charizard would not be.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n* [[intraspecies]] - Same species romance/sex.\r\n* [[hybrid]] - The offspring of an interspecies relationship.\r\n\r\nh4.Interspecies table (by [[tag_group:body_types|body type]])\r\n[table]\r\n[thead]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th][/th]\r\n[th]Feral[/th]\r\n[th]Anthro[/th]\r\n[th]Humanoid[/th]\r\n[th]Human[/th]\r\n[th]Taur[/th]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/thead]\r\n[tbody]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th]Feral[/th]\r\n[th]X[/th]\r\n[td][[anthro_on_feral]][/td]\r\n[td][[humanoid_on_feral]][/td]\r\n[td][[human_on_feral]][/td]\r\n[td][[feral_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th]Anthro[/th]\r\n[td][[anthro_on_feral]][/td]\r\n[th]X[/th]\r\n[td][[humanoid_on_anthro]][/td]\r\n[td][[human_on_anthro]][/td]\r\n[td][[anthro_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th]Humanoid[/th]\r\n[td][[humanoid_on_feral]][/td]\r\n[td][[humanoid_on_anthro]][/td]\r\n[th]X[/th]\r\n[td][[human_on_humanoid]][/td]\r\n[td][[humanoid_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th]Human[/th]\r\n[td][[human_on_feral]][/td]\r\n[td][[human_on_anthro]][/td]\r\n[td][[human_on_humanoid]][/td]\r\n[th]X[/th]\r\n[td][[human_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr]\r\n[th]Taur[/th]\r\n[td][[feral_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[td][[anthro_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[td][[humanoid_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[td][[human_on_taur]][/td]\r\n[th]X[/th]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/tbody]\r\n[/table]\r\n\r\nh4.Interspecies-related philias\r\n* [[bestiality]] - X_on_feral\r\n** [[insectophilia]] - X_on_insect\r\n* [[plushophilia]] - X_on