          "kor": "",
          "count": 139122,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3302723 thumb #2178309 thumb #2115512 thumb #2136976\r\n\r\n[b]Makeup[/b] describes substances used to enhance one's appearance, usually applied to the face, and most often seen worn by [[female]] characters. Makeup is usually fairly subtle in art, and as a tag, is usually implicated by more specific makeup tags (see below). Makeup can be tagged alone when a character is wearing makeup that lacks a tag (such as [[blush]] or [[blush stickers]] that are clearly intended to be applied as makeup), or a character wearing clown makeup or other facial makeup that defies existing tags.\r\n\r\nh4. Common Types of Makeup\r\n* [[eyeshadow]]\r\n* [[eyeliner]]\r\n* [[mascara]]\r\n* [[lipstick]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[applying makeup]] - when a character is actively applying makeup to their face\r\n* [[lipstick (object)]] - for the tube that holds lipstick, rather than a character wearing lipstick\r\n* [[compact]] - a small case containing powdered makeup, brush, and a mirror"
