          "kor": "",
          "count": 135541,
          "wiki_body": "[quote] \r\nh5. [sup]Work in Progress, pending full rewrite — September 2022 [/sup]\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\n[b]Curvy figure[/b] is an umbrella tag that can be used to describe notably curvy feminine body types, while this covers a wide variety of shapes and sizes, the common through-line is [[wide hips]]. Unless they have a [[girly|feminine figure]], male or andromorph characters should rarely be tagged as having a curvy figure. \r\n\r\nh6. A curvy figured character will have some combination of the following attributes:\r\n* [[wide hips]] / [[huge hips]] / [[hyper hips]]\r\n* [[thick thighs]] / [[huge thighs]] / [[hyper thighs]]\r\n* [[small waist]] / [[wasp waist]]\r\n* [[big butt]] / [[huge butt]] / [[hyper butt]]\r\n* [[big breasts]] / [[huge breasts]] / [[hyper breasts]]\r\n** note: this excludes pear-shaped figures (see below)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Please remember to add the appropriate tags from the list above.[/b]\r\n\r\n[quote]\r\n\r\nh5. Types of Curvy Figure\r\n[sup]Note: this list may expand in the future.[/sup]\r\n* [[hourglass figure]] - the \"classic\" feminine figure, with a [[big breasts|large bust]], a [[small waist]], and [[wide hips]] with a similar measurement to that of the bust, resembling an [[hourglass (object)|hourglass]]\r\n* [[pear-shaped figure]] - wide hips, thick thighs, often wide midsection and waist, smaller upper body, narrow shoulders, usually small or medium sized breasts (unless overweight), often [[slightly chubby|chubby]]\r\n* [[voluptuous]] - \"thick\", \"mature\", or \"full figured\", a character with wide hips, thick thighs, big or huge breasts, a big or huge butt, and generally a thick waist, sometimes a high waistline, in many cases [[slightly chubby]] or [[overweight]]\r\n* [[venus figure]] - essentially \"hyper-voluptuous\", an exaggeration of the mature, feminine full figured body type\r\n\r\n[b][color=yellow]If a curvy character doesn't fit the three existing tags above, [u]use [[curvy figure]] alone[/u], and include more descriptive tags about the character's body attributes (breasts/belly/butt/hips/waist/thighs etc.)[/color][/b]\r\n\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[tag group:figures]]"
