          "count": 36513,
          "wiki_body": "A set of written, printed, or blank pages fastened along one side (called the \"spine\") and encased between protective covers. \r\n\r\nThese pages may be blank, or contain text, printed photographs or illustrations; it may be fastened with glue to the spine, stapled together, or use metal/plastic spiral rings (spiral-bound) . Books are a used for entertainment, recording or relaying information, or acting as a space for the owner's writings or artwork.\r\n\r\nh5. Book Related Tags\r\n* [[holding book]]\r\n* [[reading book]]\r\n* [[dropping book]]\r\n* [[on book]]\r\n* [[sitting on book]]\r\n* [[standing on books]]\r\n\r\n\r\n* [[book on face]]\r\n* [[book on lap]]\r\n* [[book on head]]\r\n\r\n* [[bookshelf]]\r\n* [[book stack]]\r\n* [[library]]\r\n** [[librarian]]\r\n\r\nh5. Types of Books\r\n* [[comic book]]\r\n* [[cookbook]]\r\n* [[notebook]]\r\n* [[sketchbook]]\r\n* [[spellbook]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[magazine]]"
