          "wiki_body": "A [b]kerchief[/b] is a triangular or square piece of cloth that can be worn or used for cleaning.\n\nh4. Types\n\n* A [[handkerchief]] is used for cleaning and/or personal hygiene. It is usually too small to be worn.\n* When a kerchief is worn on the head, it is called a [[headkerchief]].\n* When a kerchief worn on the neck, it is called a [[neckerchief]].\n* A [[shemagh]] is a traditional Middle Eastern headdress traditionally fashioned from a square scarf.\n\nh4. Tags About Kerchiefs\n\n* [b]kerchief[/b]\n\n[section=Kerchief Colors]\n* [[black_kerchief]]\n* [[blue_kerchief]]\n* [[brown_kerchief]]\n* [[green_kerchief]]\n* [[grey_kerchief]]\n* [[orange_kerchief]]\n* [[pink_kerchief]]\n* [[purple_kerchief]]\n* [[red_kerchief]]\n* [[tan_kerchief]]\n* [[white_kerchief]]\n* [[yellow_kerchief]]\n\n* [[monotone_kerchief]]\n* [[multicolored_kerchief]]\n** [[rainbow_kerchief]]\n** [[two_tone_kerchief]]\n\n* [[dark_kerchief]]\n* [[light_kerchief]]\n\n[/section]\n\n[section=Other]\n* [[kerchief_only]]\n* [[pattern_kerchief]]\n** [[checkered_kerchief]]\n** [[plaid_kerchief]]\n** [[spotted_kerchief]]\n** [[striped_kerchief]]\n\n[/section]\n\n* [[headkerchief]]\n\n[section=Headkerchief Colors]\n* [[black_headkerchief]]\n* [[blue_headkerchief]]\n* [[brown_headkerchief]]\n* [[green_headkerchief]]\n* [[grey_headkerchief]]\n* [[orange_headkerchief]]\n* [[pink_headkerchief]]\n* [[purple_headkerchief]]\n* [[red_headkerchief]]\n* [[tan_headkerchief]]\n* [[white_headkerchief]]\n* [[yellow_headkerchief]]\n\n* [[monotone_headkerchief]]\n* [[multicolored_headkerchief]]\n** [[rainbow_headkerchief]]\n** [[two_tone_headkerchief]]\n\n* [[dark_headkerchief]]\n* [[light_headkerchief]]\n\n[/section]\n\n[section=Other]\n* [[durag]]\n* [[pattern_headkerchief]]\n** [[checkered_headkerchief]]\n** [[plaid_headkerchief]]\n** [[spotted_headkerchief]]\n** [[striped_headkerchief]]\n\n[/section]\n\n* [[neckerchief]]\n\n[section=Neckerchief Colors]\n* [[black_neckerchief]]\n* [[blue_