          "tag": "hypnosis",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 26677,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2036808 thumb #2948594 thumb #3115589\n\n[b]Hypnosis[/b] is the act of [[mind_control|manipulating]] someone's mind to make them more (or completely) willing to follow orders. Normally, this involves the subject viewing a spinning swirl, [[pendulum]], or other focusing object until they're entranced by it. Another common form, often associated with [[snakes]], [[nagas]] and [[lamias]], works through direct [[eye_contact]] instead.\n\nOnce a character has been hypnotized, they sometimes gain a glazy look typically including [[ringed eyes]], [[spiral eyes]], or [[spiral pupils]] (see example above).\n\nh3. Related tags\n\nh5. Eye effect\n* [[ringed eyes]]\n* [[spiral eyes]]\n* [[spiral pupils]]\n\nh5. What is creating hypnosis\n* [[pendulum]]\n* [[hypnotic eyes]]\n** see \"Eye effect\" (related tags above)\n* [[Hypnotic_visor]]\n* [[hypnotic_collar]]\n* [[Hypnotic_clothing]]\n\nh5. Target\n* [[hypnotizing_viewer]]\n* [[hypnotized_prey]]\n* [[hypnotized_pred]]\n\nh5. Effects on target\n* [[mind control]]\n* [[hallucination]]\n* On target eyes : see \"Eye effect\" (related tags above)\n\nh4. Types of [[manipulation]]\n* [[blackmail]]\n** [[failed blackmail]]\n* [[brainwashing]]\n** [[conditioning]]\n** [[reprogramming]]\n* [[bribery]]\n** [[bribery for sex]]\n** [[bribery with sex]]\n** [[failed bribery]]\n* [[deception]]\n** [[impersonation]]\n* [[exploitation]]\n* [[mind control]]\n** [b]hypnosis[/b]\n* [[peer pressure]]\n* [[taunting]]\n* [[threat]]\n** [[coercion]] – using threat to obtain control of another's actions\n** [[extortion]] – using threat to obtain items, money, or status\n\nh4. See also\n* [[tag group:facial expressions]]"
