          "count": 32520,
          "wiki_body": "This tag describes noticeably narrow waists, which is narrower than the hips and shoulders to a greater than \"average\" degree. [[Skinny]] characters, and characters who are described as [[top heavy]] or [[bottom heavy]] will often have small waists; additionally, a character with an [[hourglass figure]] almost inherently will have a small waist.\r\n\r\nAn [i]exceptionally[/i] or cartoonishly narrow waist with dramatic differences in width between the waist, hips and upper body - like that caused by a corset - should be tagged as [[wasp waist]] as well. \r\n\r\nh4. Related Tags:\r\n* [[Wasp Waist]]\r\n* [[Hourglass Figure]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also:\r\n* [[Wide Hips]]\r\n"
