          "tag": "emanata",
          "kor": "유출",
          "count": 22257,
          "wiki_body": "Lines, marks, or other symbols drawn around (that is, [i]emanating[/i] from) a character, usually their head, indicating things such as [[shock]], [[surprise]], or [[anger]]. Emanata can also be found in other places, such as squiggly lines wafting out from a freshly-baked pie, or short lines surrounding a shiny object or character. Commonly found in [[comics]].\r\n\r\nNote that emanata are symbolic for an action or emotion; physical objects that are actually emitted are not emanata (unless the emanata are explicitly reified, usually for comedic effect). For example, small drops of sweat that are shaken off by a character are not emanata, whereas large iconographic drops that seem to spontaneously fly off an otherwise still character probably are.\r\n\r\nFundamentally, emanata are visual indicators for feelings and sensations. They should not be confused with simple [[motion lines]] which purely serve to indicate movements.\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Examples]\r\n\r\nh4. Facial region\r\n\r\nthumb #2820237 thumb #2822071 thumb #140719 thumb #2839731\r\n\r\nh4. Other\r\n\r\nthumb #2929081  thumb #3093127\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. List of emanata (WIP)\r\n\r\nEmanata may be tagged by either their form or meaning in the particular context.\r\n\r\nh6. Forms\r\n\r\n* [[bar_emanata]] - Common\r\n* [[bolt_emanata]] - Shaped like little lightning bolts\r\n* [[bubble_emanata]] - Circles or spheres\r\n* [[cloud_emanata]]\r\n* [[crossbar_emanata]]\r\n* [[flash_emanata]] - Common\r\n* [[swirl_emanata]]\r\n\r\nh6. Other\r\n\r\n* [[body_with_emanata]] (TODO - populate)\r\n* [[heart_with_emanata]]\r\n* [[object_with_emanata]] (TODO - populate)\r\n* [[text_with_emanata]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:narrative_elements]]\r\n\r\n* [[iconography]]\r\n* [[impact_lines]]\r\n* [[motion_lines]]\r\n* [[pictographics]]\r\n* [[speed_lines]]"
