          "wiki_body": "[b]Cybernetics[/b] are electromechanical devices that are designed to be attached to a biological organism's body. Typically they are artificial body parts that are intended to replace or enhance their natural counterparts, but may also include things such as entirely new limbs (e.g. a third arm or a pair of wings) or a microchip implant.\r\n\r\nh4.Not to be Confused with\r\n* [[Bionics]] - Although bionics are a type of cybernetics, cybernetics can appear more mechanical while as bionics are meant to look more like their biological counterpart.\r\n* [[Prosthetic]] - Although cybernetics are a type of prosthetic, prosthetics can also include such things as wooden [[pegleg]]s and [[glass eye]]s.\r\n\r\nh4.Please Note\r\nNot to use these tags with [[robot]] characters as these are meant for [[cyborg]] characters. Instead, make use of the `robot_*` or `robotic_*` tags.\r\n\r\nh4.See Also\r\n* [[Machine]]\r\n** [[Cyborg]] - Living things with mechanical body parts.\r\n*** [[Prosthetic]] - Primitive to non-electric body part replacements.\r\n*** [b]Cybernetics[/b]\r\n**** [[Cybernetic Attachment]] - Cybernetics that are attached to an existing body part.\r\n**** [[Cybernetic Implant]] - Internal cybernetics such as microchips and artificial organs.\r\n**** [[Cybernetic Body]] - Full-body replacement with only the head or brain remaining.\r\n***** [[Cybernetic Head]] - Full Head replacement. Sometimes leading to an [[object head]].\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Horn]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Hair]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Face]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Eye]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Ear]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Tongue]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Jaw]]\r\n***** [[Cybernetic Torso]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Spine]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Chest]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Breast]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Genitalia]]\r\n******* [[Cybernetic Penis]]\r\n******* [[Cybernetic Balls]]\r\n******* [[Cybernetic Pussy]]\r\n***** [[Cybernetic Limb]]\r\n****** [[Cybernetic Arm]]\r\n*