          "tag": "mustache",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 17229,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #4308202 thumb #700484 thumb #1432250 thumb #1582300 thumb #3237363\n\nA \"[b]moustache[/b]\" [i](in [[French]])[/i] or \"[b]mustache[/b]\" [i](in \"American English\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_English) [/i] is the noun given to the growth of [[hair]] on the upper \"lip\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lip and under the [[nose]] of [[human|humans]]... And many [[anthro]] characters!\n\n[i](For example, video game characters like [[Mario]], [[Luigi]], [[Wario]] and [[Waluigi]]...\nAnd [[Pokemon_(species)|Pokémon]] such as [[Samurott]], its [[Hisuian_Samurott|Hisui form]], [[Kadabra]] and even its evolution [[Alakazam]]... All of these characters have this [[facial hair]])[/i]\n\nJust like [[beard|beards]], \"testosterone\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Testosterone and \"puberty\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puberty are factors that trigger the [[growth]] of [[facial hair]]... \n\nSymbol of [[manly|masculinity]], the [b]mustache[/b] [i](or \"[b]moustache[/b]\" if you prefer~)[/i] is very often associated with [[male]] characters, but it's not impossible for other \"genders\":https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gender to have one! [i](Even if this is rather rare)[/i].\n\nBeards and [[goatee|goatees]] are also often associated with [b]m(o)ustaches[/b]... All three are facial hair, and each character can wear either one or the other, or both.\n\nIn any case, [b][u]this tag is used: for any shape of m(o)ustache, and any color.[/u][/b]\n\n\nh4. Tags About Mustache\n[section,expanded=Tags About Mustache]\n[section,expanded=Types of Mustache]\n* [[fu_manchu]]\n* [[sideburns]]\n* [[soul_patch]]\n[/section]\n[section,expanded=Colors of Mustache]\n* [[black_mustache]]\n* [[blonde_mustache]]\n* [[blue_mustache]]\n* [[brown_mustache]]\n* [[green_mustache]]\n* [[grey_mustache]]\n* [[orange_mustache]]\n* [[pink_mustache]]\n* [[purple_mustache]]\n* [[red_mustache]]\n* [[white_mustache]]\n\n* [[monotone_mustache]]\n* [[multicolored_mustache]]\n** [[two_tone_mustache]]\n\n* [[dark_mustache]]\n* [[light_mustache]]\n[/section]\n[/section]\n\nh4. Tags About Facial Hair\n\n* [[facial_hair]]\n\n[section,expanded=Types of Facial Hair]\n\n* [[beard]]\n* [[goatee]]\n* [[mustache]]\n* [[sideburns]]\n* [[soul_patch]]\n\n[/section]\n\nh4. See also:\n* [[Whiskers]] – Not quite the same term"
