          "wiki_body": "A [[sound_effects|sound effect]] or [[vocalization]] that doesn't contain any vowels. This is a common theme for characters that are [[muffled]], and unable to speak correctly.\r\n\r\nh4. Guidelines\r\n\r\nBe careful when identifying vowelless forms. Both concepts may appear in the same image. A vocalization can be formatted to look like a sound effect. Unless the form also doubles as a sound effect form it should not be treated as a sound effect. Use the lookup list on the [[vowelless vocalization]] wiki to know which forms shouldn't be treated as sound effects.\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[vowelless_sound_effect]]\r\n* [[vowelless_vocalization]] - Use for [[muffled]] speech, or vocalization ([[moan|moaning]], [[grunting]]) examples."
