          "wiki_body": "thumb #793091 thumb #523183 thumb #126529\r\n \r\nA school is an institution designed for the teaching of [[student|students]] under the direction of [[teacher|teachers]]. Most countries have systems of formal education, which is commonly compulsory.\r\n\r\nThis tag should be only used on images with clear evidence that there is a school in the picture. People can wear school uniforms and college clothing anywhere, even when they are not students or teachers. Erasers, desks and whiteboards are also used in business offices, so an eraser on a desk doesn't necessarily qualify. Graded exams, and school desks with a chalkboard or a wide whiteboard typically do qualify.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [[tag_group:locations]]\r\n* [[classroom]]"
