          "tag": "flag",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 6533,
          "wiki_body": "A [b]flag[/b] is a form of [[banner]] with a distinctive design that is used as a symbol of a country or organization, as a signaling device, or as a decoration.  Flags are generally rectangular, but can be of any shape.\r\n\r\nWhen a flag is presented in an image as a physical object, use [[flag_(object)]]. For [[clothing]] or other items bearing a known flag design, use [[flag print]] with a more specific flag variant using the format `flag_x`, and the name of the flag (i.e. [[russian_flag]]).\r\n\r\n[section,expanded=Categories]\r\n\r\nPopular flag concepts within this tag include national flags ([[stars_and_stripes|American flag]], [[Japanese flag]], [[Russian flag]] etc.), and [[pride_color_flag|pride flags]]. \r\n\r\nh4. [[Flag (object)]]\r\n\r\nAny flag that someone could pick up and wave around falls into this category.\r\n\r\nthumb #3084996 thumb #2821294 thumb #2557736\r\n\r\nh4. [[Flag background]]\r\n\r\nCharacters standing, or posing in front of flags, or the background is entirely a flag or flag-inspired.  This doesn't include [[pride_color_background|pride color backgrounds]] unless it is in a flag form.\r\n\r\nthumb #2959788 thumb #3007051 thumb #2674855\r\n\r\nh4. [[Flag print]]\r\n\r\nFlag themed outfits, or clothing with flag patches, or designs. Bikinis are a very popular flag print theme. This doesn't include [[pride color clothing]] unless it is in a flag form.\r\n\r\nthumb #1782558 thumb #1345926 thumb #2356799 thumb #2540268 \r\n\r\n* [[flag_clothing]]\r\n* [[flag_patch]]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\nh4. Types\r\n\r\n* [[banderole]]\r\n* [[jolly_roger]]\r\n* [[pennant]]\r\n* [[swallowtail_(flag)]] - Similar to a pennant, but has tapers into two points instead of one.\r\n\r\nh4. Components\r\n\r\n* [[canton]] - A rectangular space designated for an emblem in the top-left area of a flag or shield.\r\n* [[finial]] - A decorative shape seen on top of many flagpoles.\r\n* [[flagpole]]\r\n\r\nh4. Locations\r\n\r\n* [[flag_on_structure]]\r\n** [[flag_on_building]]\r\n* [[flag_on_wall]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related themes\r\n\r\n* [[flag_in_hair]]\r\n* [[holding_flag]]\r\n* [[wearing_flag]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[tag_group:countries]]\r\n\r\n* [[banner]]"
