          "kor": "",
          "count": 5411,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #3873434 thumb #3732360\r\n\r\nA flexible bag that can be inflated with helium or air. Often for decoration for parties. They are commonly made from latex and come in countless colors and many sizes, ranging approximately from small water balloons to huge 96 inch balloons.\r\n\r\nh4. Not to be confused with\r\n\r\n* [[ball]]\r\n** [[beach_ball]]\r\n** [[exercise_ball]]\r\n** [[space_hopper]]\r\n* [[bubble]]\r\n* [[condom_balloon]] - With [[water_balloon|water balloons]] being a thing that exists, perhaps it makes sense to treat these as a type of condom and balloon.\r\n* [[pool_toy]]\r\n\r\nh4. General guidelines\r\n\r\n* The primary difference between a [[balloon]] and, an inflatable [[pool toy]] is one is designed to float in the air, and the other is designed to float in the water. Situations where it is ambiguous tend to default to pool toy over balloon, but perhaps it may make sense to not choose either in the case of living examples.\r\n* Balloons do not typically have nozzles. This distinguishes them from other inflatables.\r\n\r\nh4. Categories\r\n\r\n* [[hot_air_balloon]]\r\n* [[living_balloon]]\r\n* [[modelling_balloon]] - The long ones that you create balloon animals from.\r\n* [[mylar_balloon]]\r\n* [[parade_balloon]] \r\n\r\nh4. Actions\r\n\r\n* [[balloon_support]]\r\n** [[hanging_from_balloon]]\r\n** [[on_balloon]]\r\n* [[holding_balloon]]\r\n\r\nSee also [[inflatable_ride]]\r\n\r\nh4. Inflatable themes\r\n\r\n* [[balloon_fetish]]\r\n* [[imminent_popping]]\r\n* [[inflating]]\r\n** [[inflating_balloon]]\r\n* [[popping]]\r\n\r\nh4. Balloon designs\r\n\r\nBalloons are tagged by their color, general shape, and what is printed on the surface.\r\n\r\nh4. Color tags\r\n\r\n- Todo: Add, color tags should use singular terms.\r\n\r\nh4. Shape/Print tags\r\n\r\n* [[pattern_balloon]]\r\n* [[print_balloon]]\r\n* [[shaped_balloon]] - Use for designs that are shaped differently than the standard generic balloon shape. This tag probably should include living balloons as well.\r\n** [[balloon_animal]]\r\n\r\n* [[animal_balloon]]\r\n* [[heart_balloon]]\r\n* [[lips_balloon]]\r\n* [[number_on_balloon]]\r\n* [[skull_balloon]]\r\n* [[star_balloon]]\r\n* [[text_on_balloon]]\r\n* [[torus_balloon]]\r\n\r\nh4. Configurations\r\n\r\n* [[balloon_arch]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[inflatable]]\r\n* [[inflation]]"
