          "tag": "beads",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 5137,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #1415182 thumb #3760809 thumb #1875468\r\n\r\n[b]Beads[/b] are decorative ornaments in a variety of sizes and shapes, with a hole in the center for stringing together. Beads can be made of any material, but are most commonly made of [[glass]], plastic, [[stone]], [[wood]], [[pearl_(gem)|pearl]], or [[bone]].\r\n\r\nBeads are used in a variety of ways, and creations using beads are commonly known as beadwork. The most common form of beadwork is [[jewelry]].\r\n\r\n[b]Bead sex toys should generally not be tagged as beads.[/b]\r\n\r\nh4. Tags about beads\r\n[section=Bead materials]\r\n* [[bone_beads]]\r\n* [[gem_beads]]\r\n** [[pearl_beads]]\r\n* [[metal_beads]]\r\n* [[shell_beads]]\r\n* [[stone_beads]]\r\n* [[wood_beads]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Bead styles]\r\n* [[chevron_beads]] - A type of glass bead made of multiple types of glass, resulting in layered colors\r\n* [[cloisonne_beads]] - Metal beads decorated with colorful material and wire\r\n* [[dzi_beads]] - Long beads from the Himalayan region made of agate\r\n* [[millefiori_beads]] - Beads with \"mosaic\" patterns\r\n* [[perler_beads]] - Cylindrical plastic beads that are melted together with a hot iron to make artwork\r\n* [[pony_beads]] - Large colorful plastic beads, primarily used by children and in the creation of [[kandi_(jewelry)|kandi]]\r\n* [[seed_beads]] - Extremely small beads, usually made of glass\r\n* [[uv-sensitive_beads]] - Beads that react to ultraviolet light\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Bead shapes]\r\n* [[flower_beads]]\r\n* [[heart_beads]]\r\n* [[letter_beads]]\r\n* [[magatama]] - Comma-shaped beads\r\n* [[star_beads]]\r\n[/section]\r\n\r\n[section=Beaded objects]\r\n* [[beaded_belt]]\r\n* [[beaded_chain]]\r\n* [[beaded_circlet]]\r\n* [[beaded_collar]]\r\n* [[beaded_clothing]]\r\n** [[beaded_swimwear]]\r\n*** [[beaded_bikini]]\r\n** [[beaded_topwear]]\r\n** [[beaded_underwear]]\r\n*** [[beaded_bra]]\r\n*** [[beaded_panties]]\r\n* [[beaded_cord_end]]\r\n*