          "wiki_body": "A material that can suddenly release all of its potential energy in the form of an explosion. Explosives are usually based on chemicals, pressurised gas, or nuclear material.\r\nExplosives can be used commercially, e.g. for mining and quarrying, or as a weapon, e.g. warfare.\r\n\r\nCommon explosive devices include dynamite, hand grenades, missiles, bombs, and nuclear weapons."
