          "tag": "truck",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 2962,
          "wiki_body": "A large [[vehicle]] that is used to transport goods, materials, or some other utility such as a [[fire engine]] that is used for emergency medical services, rescue, and firefighting. Some examples are a [[tow truck]], [[monster truck]], or a truck that carries cargo for a store such as a [[Walmart]]."
