          "kor": "",
          "count": 875,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #534552 thumb #4014307 thumb #2556149\r\n\r\nA road-going [[vehicle]] intended for either primarily transporting cargo or people. All vans are larger than [[car|cars]], cargo vans are typically larger than [[SUV|SUVs]] and often similar in size to a [[pickup truck]], but can be larger. A passenger van will have several rows of seating for passengers, sometimes allowing up to 10-12 people. \r\n\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[car]]\r\n* [[SUV]]\r\n* [[truck_(vehicle)|truck]]\r\n** [[pickup truck]]\r\n\r\n"
