          "tag": "pickup_truck",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 352,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #2500251\r\n\r\nA pickup truck is a type of [[truck_(vehicle)|truck]] that is made to carry cargo in an open area in the back of the vehicle, referred to as the [[truck_bed|truck bed]]. They are usually large vehicles with a boxy shape.\r\n\r\nh5. Truck Models\r\n*  [[cybertruck]]\r\n*  [[f-150]]\r\n\r\nh4. See Also\r\n* [[vehicle]]"
