          "wiki_body": "thumb #221804   thumb #1199451   thumb #366977   thumb #957809   \r\n\r\nBamboo is the material extracted from bamboo plants. It consists of long sticks with distinctive hollow segments delimited by nodes; those nodes are regularly spaced and have small internal barriers, creating a little chamber inside each segment.\r\n\r\nBamboo is versatile, easy to farm, light and resistant.  All this combined with the beauty usually attributed it, make the material relatively popular in construction, craft work, confection of furniture etc. \r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* bamboo\r\n* [[bamboo_object]]\r\n* [[bamboo_pattern]]\r\n* [[bamboo_stick]]\r\n* [[bamboo_structure]]\r\n** [[bamboo_fence]]\r\n* [[bamboo_tree]]"
