          "wiki_body": "thumb #862669   thumb #915618   thumb #528592  thumb #1265270   \r\n\r\nA relatively unmodified bamboo stick that isn't attached to the original plant. \r\n\r\nBamboo sticks may vary in lenght and width, as well as, may be plain or have leaves and twigs; they are sometimes used as staffs for combat.\r\n\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags:\r\n\r\n* [[bamboo]]\r\n* [[bamboo_object]]\r\n* [[bamboo_pattern]]\r\n* bamboo_stick\r\n* [[bamboo_structure]]\r\n** [[bamboo_fence]]\r\n* [[bamboo_tree]]"
