          "wiki_body": "[b]Voodoo[/b] is defined as \"a black religious cult practiced in the Caribbean and the southern US, combining elements of Roman Catholic ritual with traditional African magical and religious rites, and characterized by sorcery and spirit possession.\" \r\n\r\nOn e621, the tag can be applied to [[magic]] that fits the theme, often times with a [[voodoo_doll]] involved.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n* [b]voodoo[/b]\r\n** [[voodoo_cum]]\r\n** [[voodoo_inflation]]\r\n** [[voodoo_masturbation]] - [[Masturbation]] involving voodoo.\r\n** [[voodoo_penetration]] - [[Penetration]] involving voodoo.\r\n** [[voodoo_sex]] - [[Sex]] involving voodoo.\r\n* [[voodoo_doll]]"
