          "tag": "zero_unit",
          "kor": "",
          "count": 914,
          "wiki_body": "thumb #374647 thumb #360521 thumb #32138\n\nThe [b]Zero Unit[/b] is a mysterious symbol that is often identified with \"Keter\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keter of the \"Sephirot\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sefirot. The symbol takes the shape of one large triangle formed from four smaller ones.\n\nSeveral digimon have this symbol on their bodies, clothing, or objects associated with them, one popular example being [[Guilmon]] who has an [[inverted zero unit|upside down zero unit]] on their snout.\n\nh4. Digimon who have the zero unit\n\n* [[calumon]] ([[forehead markings|On forehead]])\n* [[chaosgallantmon_c]] (On [[shield]])\n* [[gallantmon]] (On [[crest_(heraldry)|crest]], [[gorget]], and shield)\n** [[gallantmon_crimson_mode]] (On [[cuirass]] and [[poleyn|poleyns]])\n* [[kuzuhamon]] (On [[gloves]])\n* [[lucemon]] (On right hand)\n** [[lucemon_chaos_mode]] (On right hand)\n* [[megagargomon]] ([[ear markings|On ears]])\n** [[blackmegagargomon]] (On ears)\n* [[sakkakumon]] (On Keter sphere)\n* [[sakuyamon]] (On gloves)\n\nh4. Related\n\n* [[inverted_zero_unit]]\n\nh4. See also\n\n* [[digimon]]\n** [[digimon_crest]]\n** [[digital_hazard]]\n** [[mark_of_evil]]\n* [[markings]]\n* [[symbol]]\n** [[triforce]] - three triangles symbol in [[zelda]]"
